	('78789bc7-3f6a-484d-96de-fe42c3c9c48e', 'vanessa', 'edwards', 'Edmonds School District Career Connected Learning Coordinator - which means I connect middle and high school students to careers (events, speakers, career tours, internships, job shadows and project-based learning). I believe in equity, student centered learning and connections that create a positive outcome in communities and systems. I am former School Board Director, and a Leadership Facilitator with Washington State School Board Association (WSSDA). Currently, launching EDit implementation team to support school districts in improving their outcomes and systems.
 I am a jack of all trades and love to implement and make dreams come to life!', 'CTE Certified - Business Marketing, Career Development, Career Choices, Horticulture
