	('82cd4c7c-474f-4897-8346-53641752de69', '4734e9cf-74b7-4e89-b92c-8dc6f49c5b2a', '539532da-e238-4c53-8533-94fe266e7d01', 'You two, Scott and Tom, should chat! You''re both amazing educators and science/tech geeks that work with high schoolers. ', '2025-04-08 17:42:41.856685+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-04-08 17:42:43.64+00', 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('0a3e57f7-97e2-4079-b8ad-90cf42fd23a6', '50528bde-c1ca-4b6b-b2d3-800259218fc7', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'You two should chat! You’re both amazing leaders in education with rich backgrounds as coordinators with a passion for vulnerable leadership.', '2025-03-28 21:10:42.281625+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-28 21:10:44.117+00', 'completed', 'let''s reconnect you two later!', '2025-04-17 15:31:24.432+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('663dd69b-d634-4f0d-b28f-abf688fd8bd5', 'd8e9db8f-f716-4f11-9fb9-c204d951fd7d', '1da551dd-7a97-4556-a99d-5c3536a61caf', 'Hi Katie and Mike! You’re both incredible high school teachers with rich insights into learning. Use Upduo (in your toolbox) to connect at a time that works for you.', '2025-03-19 15:55:39.412586+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-19 15:55:41.245+00', 'completed', 'In a rich and energizing conversation, educators Katie Stahl and Mike Mendelson connected over their shared passion for leveraging AI to deepen learning and increase equity in their classrooms. They exchanged concrete strategies—ranging from live translation in PowerPoint to adaptive text-leveling and AI-generated escape rooms—that are transforming how they reach multilingual learners and differentiate instruction. Both described how AI tools have helped them bring ambitious ideas to life, scaffold complex content, and maintain academic rigor for all students, particularly those navigating language barriers. Their dialogue revealed a deep commitment to learner agency, choice, and engagement, as well as a mutual appreciation for peer collaboration as professional nourishment. Katie, newly appointed to an AI-focused committee, is seeking ways to lead responsible, future-ready AI integration at the district level. Meanwhile, Mike is using AI to support peer teaching and interdisciplinary innovation. Their conversation reflected curiosity, joy, and a strong sense of purpose—as they explore how AI might not replace teachers, but empower them to reimagine what''s possible.', '2025-03-26 22:52:03.691+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('7b23a8b7-d159-4934-ae18-5f3a136ac36f', '44d8b840-888f-4849-9111-b52ada8f4599', '86f608d8-be4a-47b2-9c8a-b0b3fb52dabb', 'Hi Brittany and Michael! You two should chat. 
You both are amazing educational leaders with a keen disposition to use tech tools strategically. 
 
Use the dialogue box below to find a time to connect. Once it looks like you’ve found a common time, you’ll get a calendar invite from robot@sideby.ai. 

I’m here on the backend to help,
Jeff 
', '2025-03-11 13:12:58.919809+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, 'completed', 'Let''s try another match for you both!', '2025-03-26 22:55:48.697+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('7e3f4e54-778d-4740-858d-5e4666b23a6f', 'ea155ac4-eb3a-4e24-a4be-84f0143f4348', 'f79ffe36-4f02-4ba8-a359-b9bd8963cbd1', 'In order to complete Erica''s first sideby match. ', '2025-03-23 21:37:26.617853+00', 'ea155ac4-eb3a-4e24-a4be-84f0143f4348', NULL, 'completed', 'Erica Crane and Mike Mendelson explore more than AI—they surface rich reflections on embodied learning, trust, identity, and the role of educators in a tech-shifting world. Erica’s metaphor of moving from water to bike captures the transfer of confidence across domains, while Mike’s childhood memories and AI skepticism ground the conversation in lived experience and ethical questioning. Together, they model the kind of honest, relational dialogue that honors uncertainty, treats resistance as reflection, and foregrounds agency—offering a powerful glimpse into the human side of professional growth in the age of AI.', '2025-03-26 23:04:23.116+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('a24ce612-d1f9-4f67-8ee2-2e180a422b57', '43812edc-e7fd-4226-bb9c-cd9bd174e0b0', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Hi Mike and Jeff! You’re both incredible tech leaders with rich insights into learning–especially professional learning. Once you find a time to meet, use Upduo (in your toolbox) to connect. ', '2025-03-26 18:31:37.268421+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-26 18:31:38.744+00', 'completed', 'In this conversation, you both surfaced the powerful ways AI is becoming not just a tool but a co-thinker—supporting reflection, focus, and creative dreaming. From project GPTs and Pomodoro prototypes to voice journaling and building bespoke assistants, you''re each designing workflows that extend your agency and imagination. What emerged most clearly is your shared belief that learners—of any age—need to become dreamers, problem seekers, and project managers in a world where intelligence is abundant and connection is everything.', '2025-04-17 22:22:27.575+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('3d701c57-f2f7-4663-a35a-0977c34d0c7e', 'f79ffe36-4f02-4ba8-a359-b9bd8963cbd1', '4fdb1fea-74c2-4562-8eb0-d12b3608dc7d', 'Match REASON here
', '2025-03-28 19:36:52.428814+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-28 19:56:15.118+00', 'completed', 'testing complete', '2025-04-17 22:23:02.385+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'You two geeks should meet! You''re both amazing community leaders and have a ton to share. ', '2025-03-28 16:09:51.712211+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-28 16:09:55.147+00', 'completed', 'Cass and Jeff explored a draft lesson together while reflecting on learner agency, attention, and the emotional tone of instruction. Cass emphasized that learners need curiosity frameworks, not memorization, and voiced concerns about surveillance-driven teaching. Together, they named a shift in mindset—toward asking better questions, staying open, and designing AI tools that reflect human values.', '2025-04-18 17:42:28.683+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('1d0d67bc-f1a8-47a4-bf8a-de53519392f4', '44d8b840-888f-4849-9111-b52ada8f4599', 'd8e9db8f-f716-4f11-9fb9-c204d951fd7d', 'Let''s get you two connected! You’re both amazing tech wizards at using AI for providing students access. You rock.', '2025-03-28 19:58:40.624692+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-28 19:58:43.086+00', 'completed', 'Let''s connect you two at a later time. Fresh matches coming!', '2025-04-18 22:35:28.22+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
