	('d0e55229-8b44-4a59-9029-a05491ea58a0', '1b798db6-2ac6-42b4-a936-fd03d715b1ba', 'There is no clear evidence of the participants'' teaching stance or educational philosophy in the provided conversation transcript. The conversation appears to be about scheduling a meeting and testing the messaging system, rather than discussing teaching or educational philosophy.

