	('d1251107-fb1c-4079-9ab3-120538477ef8', '062ad53c-8846-4355-9771-3e152ff913f6', 'The provided conversation transcript does not contain any relevant statements about teaching stance or educational philosophy. It appears to be a discussion about scheduling a meeting or activity, rather than a discussion about teaching practices or educational philosophies.

