	('01eadf0c-9e30-4bfd-a1df-158db01b9707', '062ad53c-8846-4355-9771-3e152ff913f6', 'The provided conversation transcript does not contain explicit instances of learning moments or knowledge sharing. However, it does show an exchange where participants are coordinating a schedule, which can be seen as a form of collaborative learning in a practical context.

