	('468aa48e-4c78-4688-b325-2a67f9491286', 'a14d034b-f92e-4ad0-8833-e36781ec7a49', 'cd985910-e971-4907-988f-d311b2adb4d1', 'Sarah, I am not sure if I did the upduo connection correctly. I got in about 2:55 and stayed until 3:10ish on March 25th. It said "searching for partners". If you were in the queue and I didn''t do something correctly, I apologize. I will check with Jeff to see if I need to do something differently. I hope we can meet another time. Have a nice day, Rob', '2025-03-25 22:10:10.012209+00', '2025-03-25 22:10:10.012209+00', 'user', NULL),
