	('1c4eb150-1f5f-4428-9303-1cf0f40a1369', '4f2c17d9-95b8-4de7-8b97-ea6e0874f465', '138234', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"It happens. Oh my God.\",\"startTime\":1745354629,\"endTime\":1745354631},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Hey dude, it feels like we made it through the Caramel Canyon pass and down the Milky Way slide to finally get to the. \",\"startTime\":1745354631,\"endTime\":1745354639},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"To the the goodness pass all the goblins. Oh.\",\"startTime\":1745354639,\"endTime\":1745354643},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1745354644,\"endTime\":1745354648},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I am a matter of fact, I have a Home Office that I work from and I''m like, I need to get away from that space and get outside for a few. So this worked out \",\"startTime\":1745354649,\"endTime\":1745354657},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"perfect. And also, I love doing Abdullah calls when I''m walking. This is a good \",\"startTime\":1745354657,\"endTime\":1745354661},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"space for me, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745354661,\"endTime\":1745354665},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''ve always had a hard time with video calls while I''m walking, but I should probably switch to my phone and go walk. \",\"startTime\":1745354666,\"endTime\":1745354672},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"No, it never works man. Hey, nice to meet you officially.\",\"startTime\":1745354674,\"endTime\":1745354677},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Nice to meet you.\",\"startTime\":1745354677,\"endTime\":1745354677},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So how did you end up in the school leader group?\",\"startTime\":1745354679,\"endTime\":1745354682},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh great question. I was working in Washington state as a regional math coordinator \",\"startTime\":1745354686,\"endTime\":1745354691},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and as a coordinator I specialize in high school math curriculum and professional learning and I ended up doing a bunch of work across the state and connecting with this super cool teacher out of Seattle, WA and we met with some other people. \",\"startTime\":1745354691,\"endTime\":1745354708},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"To solve her problem because my problem or my work was really about serving people in communities and districts and helping them to problem solve and make it happen and bring professional learning or. \",\"startTime\":1745354710,\"endTime\":1745354720},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The resources to their districts help them do what they want to do, and we ended up using Updua with Mike Mendelsohn because he had been doing. \",\"startTime\":1745354721,\"endTime\":1745354731},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The same work that originally as a teacher and he wanted to bring it back to the classroom because his first ten years of using the tool, this tool was with business like AT&T people. So anyways, I got to play with this with him as an \",\"startTime\":1745354731,\"endTime\":1745354743},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"entrepreneur. \",\"startTime\":1745354743,\"endTime\":1745354747},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"With teachers across Washington state and we saw real growth and we had real impact and ended up doing some cool stuff. And so I''m like. \",\"startTime\":1745354748,\"endTime\":1745354755},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, I want to do this more. So I quit my coordinator job last summer and started \",\"startTime\":1745354755,\"endTime\":1745354759},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"focusing on on this kind of work. And we''ve been figuring out what we want to \",\"startTime\":1745354759,\"endTime\":1745354763},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"do and now finally got funding and moving forward. And we''re still doing contracts \",\"startTime\":1745354763,\"endTime\":1745354767},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and lots of consulting. And I get to be in classrooms a lot and it''s just fun. \",\"startTime\":1745354767,\"endTime\":1745354772},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah. It''s like instructional coach, but I get to meet people like you and connect \",\"startTime\":1745354772,\"endTime\":1745354776},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"you with other cool people across the world and. \",\"startTime\":1745354776,\"endTime\":1745354780},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''m just like.\",\"startTime\":1745354783,\"endTime\":1745354784},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So fun, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745354785,\"endTime\":1745354786},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"See, I met Mike through LinkedIn.\",\"startTime\":1745354788,\"endTime\":1745354791},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I went and checked out like side by cause there''s actually some post of his about skiing. I live in a small mountain town. \",\"startTime\":1745354792,\"endTime\":1745354800},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"How cool.\",\"startTime\":1745354801,\"endTime\":1745354802},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"In Colorado, so.\",\"startTime\":1745354801,\"endTime\":1745354804},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh really? Where at?\",\"startTime\":1745354803,\"endTime\":1745354804},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Pagosa Springs.\",\"startTime\":1745354805,\"endTime\":1745354807},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So right by Wolf Creek, just in the southwest corner of the state.\",\"startTime\":1745354808,\"endTime\":1745354812},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Nice. Oh, I love it. I love it. That''s so cool.\",\"startTime\":1745354812,\"endTime\":1745354816},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Umm.\",\"startTime\":1745354817,\"endTime\":1745354817},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"What kind of skis do you have? Just going to geek out with you ''cause like I''m, \",\"startTime\":1745354817,\"endTime\":1745354820},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''m a fellow skier with Mike. \",\"startTime\":1745354820,\"endTime\":1745354822},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I want a snowboard. A snowboard so.\",\"startTime\":1745354822,\"endTime\":1745354825},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, you snowboard? Oh, OK, never mind.\",\"startTime\":1745354824,\"endTime\":1745354826},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I haven''t skied since the 90s early 90s.\",\"startTime\":1745354828,\"endTime\":1745354831},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, dude, that''s cool. We''ll have to chat about that. Oh, cool. I''m glad. Yeah, \",\"startTime\":1745354832,\"endTime\":1745354835},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Mike said that he met you and we should try this thing out. So I know one thing \",\"startTime\":1745354835,\"endTime\":1745354839},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745354835,\"endTime\":1745354835},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"that Mike likes to do is like, hey, you got like a chairlift amount of time. \",\"startTime\":1745354839,\"endTime\":1745354843},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So like 20 minutes. I put on the calendar. I think 20 or 30. I''m not sure what \",\"startTime\":1745354843,\"endTime\":1745354846},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"it went through, but. \",\"startTime\":1745354846,\"endTime\":1745354850},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, let''s dig in when you''re ready. But I want to hear more about snowboarding \",\"startTime\":1745354851,\"endTime\":1745354855},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and everything else for sure. But yeah, what? What? \",\"startTime\":1745354855,\"endTime\":1745354858},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Sure, let''s talk about.\",\"startTime\":1745354857,\"endTime\":1745354859},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You want to know about first, though, and then when you''re ready, let''s dive into the cards because it''s kind of fun and I''ll show you around with the app, but I just want to be mindful of time. But I''m like torn because I want to hear \",\"startTime\":1745354859,\"endTime\":1745354868},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"like tons of your story, but I also want to try out the cards with you and see how it goes. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745354868,\"endTime\":1745354874},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"OK. All right.\",\"startTime\":1745354873,\"endTime\":1745354876},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So what''s the skill besides AI fluency that you''re working to improve?\",\"startTime\":1745354876,\"endTime\":1745354881},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, uh, Rd. biking.\",\"startTime\":1745354884,\"endTime\":1745354886},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''ve mountain biked and stuff but I''ve never Rd. biked. And so my wife is a \",\"startTime\":1745354889,\"endTime\":1745354893},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Rd. biker and uh, we moved to Tucson just a few weeks ago and now I''m Rd. biking \",\"startTime\":1745354893,\"endTime\":1745354897},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and I''m learning all of it. \",\"startTime\":1745354897,\"endTime\":1745354901},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think you''re in the Sonoran Desert. So like, I was like, don''t look like you''re \",\"startTime\":1745354901,\"endTime\":1745354904},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"in Tahoe. \",\"startTime\":1745354904,\"endTime\":1745354907},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no.\",\"startTime\":1745354906,\"endTime\":1745354909},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, this is actually the Saguaro National Park.\",\"startTime\":1745354910,\"endTime\":1745354913},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it takes 75 years for those cactus to grow. Like if they have an art, \",\"startTime\":1745354914,\"endTime\":1745354917},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"they don''t grow an arm until they''re like 70. \",\"startTime\":1745354917,\"endTime\":1745354921},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh wow.\",\"startTime\":1745354918,\"endTime\":1745354919},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"That''s like, so they''re actually pretty old. I mean, like they''re basically \",\"startTime\":1745354924,\"endTime\":1745354928},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"they''re the same lifespan as a Cottonwood tree basically. \",\"startTime\":1745354928,\"endTime\":1745354932},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Cool. So I like to come out and, uh, as one of our tech guys, Diego, he calls \",\"startTime\":1745354931,\"endTime\":1745354936},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"them the grandfathers like the chili. \",\"startTime\":1745354936,\"endTime\":1745354941},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s a good perspective for me to be here.\",\"startTime\":1745354942,\"endTime\":1745354945},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Anyways, my skill is Rd. biking. Yeah, I''m trying to get better at that. How \",\"startTime\":1745354945,\"endTime\":1745354947},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"about you, man? \",\"startTime\":1745354947,\"endTime\":1745354950},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I was trying to get better at typing that. I have been really busy. I mean like \",\"startTime\":1745354950,\"endTime\":1745354954},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I am a horrible typist. It is. \",\"startTime\":1745354954,\"endTime\":1745354957},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And like more than I write the worst that it gets.\",\"startTime\":1745354957,\"endTime\":1745354960},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s funny.\",\"startTime\":1745354962,\"endTime\":1745354962},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Umm, and I just never learned how to type. So like I wrote a dissertation like \",\"startTime\":1745354962,\"endTime\":1745354966},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I can type quickly. I just, I look at the keyboard. \",\"startTime\":1745354966,\"endTime\":1745354970},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"It''s a shit show.\",\"startTime\":1745354971,\"endTime\":1745354972},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"As far as my typing is concerned, so I was doing like basic typing exercises for a few weeks and then work got really busy. But that was that is like the \",\"startTime\":1745354975,\"endTime\":1745354983},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"very like the specific skill I was working on. I probably am also working on \",\"startTime\":1745354983,\"endTime\":1745354987},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"together and sleeping more. \",\"startTime\":1745354987,\"endTime\":1745354990},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"All that looks like it''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745354989,\"endTime\":1745354990},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You know but one thing at a time, right?\",\"startTime\":1745354993,\"endTime\":1745354994},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745354997,\"endTime\":1745354997},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Cool. All right, Just two things I know about navigating and it took me a bit \",\"startTime\":1745354997,\"endTime\":1745355001},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"to figure out is if the cards in the way ''cause I know like I hold mine on my face and my phone puts my whole thing in there where yours is back. If you tap \",\"startTime\":1745355001,\"endTime\":1745355008},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"on the screen anywhere the card goes minimizes and then you tap again and it comes back. \",\"startTime\":1745355008,\"endTime\":1745355015},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think you have to like you have to Click to move us to.\",\"startTime\":1745355015,\"endTime\":1745355019},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"OK. Oh, it''s down on the bottom. Yeah, yeah, I saw you seeing that. But like, \",\"startTime\":1745355018,\"endTime\":1745355020},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"sometimes if you want those cards to go away, that''s that one. And then whenever \",\"startTime\":1745355020,\"endTime\":1745355023},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"we''re ready, we click next. \",\"startTime\":1745355023,\"endTime\":1745355025},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"How has AI changed your work as an educator or leader of educators so far?\",\"startTime\":1745355026,\"endTime\":1745355032},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You go first this time.\",\"startTime\":1745355034,\"endTime\":1745355036},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745355036,\"endTime\":1745355037},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So in working with educators.\",\"startTime\":1745355040,\"endTime\":1745355042},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Especially like.\",\"startTime\":1745355044,\"endTime\":1745355045},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"New teachers.\",\"startTime\":1745355045,\"endTime\":1745355046},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''ve kind of helped them to think about.\",\"startTime\":1745355047,\"endTime\":1745355049},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"How they can structure their entire year in terms of like lesson plans. I knew \",\"startTime\":1745355049,\"endTime\":1745355053},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"that for myself when I started teaching. \",\"startTime\":1745355053,\"endTime\":1745355056},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"The reason it took so long to kind of get on my feet was because I spent so much time trying to like, not just design a lesson, but also like, write it out and format it. And so I''ve leveraged AI, like with newer teachers to be \",\"startTime\":1745355058,\"endTime\":1745355071},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"able to cut that timeline significantly. So, you know, in about an hour and \",\"startTime\":1745355071,\"endTime\":1745355075},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"a half, they can have like. \",\"startTime\":1745355075,\"endTime\":1745355080},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"A detailed Lesson plan for every day of their calendar for the school year. \",\"startTime\":1745355082,\"endTime\":1745355087},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And then they can modify that based on whatever they want to do, but they have a starting point that''s based on their own kind of views about education. \",\"startTime\":1745355087,\"endTime\":1745355095},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So that''s one way. Umm. And then I''ve also encouraged them to use AI as a tool \",\"startTime\":1745355095,\"endTime\":1745355099},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"for reflection. \",\"startTime\":1745355099,\"endTime\":1745355103},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Like what would you, what would you do or encourage me as an educator how to use AI tools for reflection or have you done that? \",\"startTime\":1745355108,\"endTime\":1745355115},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I would say that, you know, reflection requires you to have done something so. \",\"startTime\":1745355116,\"endTime\":1745355120},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''d say that.\",\"startTime\":1745355121,\"endTime\":1745355122},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I assume that I''m using AI for designing instructions, so.\",\"startTime\":1745355123,\"endTime\":1745355127},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah, you''d have to use it. You''d have to give the the chat bot some context \",\"startTime\":1745355127,\"endTime\":1745355132},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"about what you had done. But if you had designed like lesson plans, the AI like. \",\"startTime\":1745355132,\"endTime\":1745355137},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"You know, talking about that day''s less than what were some of the challenges? \",\"startTime\":1745355137,\"endTime\":1745355140},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"What were some of the outcomes like? \",\"startTime\":1745355140,\"endTime\":1745355142},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"How you know? Students seem this way in this class, They seem this way in this \",\"startTime\":1745355142,\"endTime\":1745355144},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"class and just. \",\"startTime\":1745355144,\"endTime\":1745355147},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Having an opportunity to chat in real time, quickly.\",\"startTime\":1745355147,\"endTime\":1745355151},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"With something that can respond back, it doesn''t really need. It''s not about \",\"startTime\":1745355152,\"endTime\":1745355154},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"like, oh, you know, I. \",\"startTime\":1745355154,\"endTime\":1745355157},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And talking to Data from Star Trek, I''m just like. But I am able to process. \",\"startTime\":1745355158,\"endTime\":1745355162},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think one thing I like about AI is it''s the only. \",\"startTime\":1745355162,\"endTime\":1745355165},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Thing I know of in the universe that.\",\"startTime\":1745355166,\"endTime\":1745355167},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Doesn''t get tired of me. So, you know, talking. So like I think that it''s a \",\"startTime\":1745355168,\"endTime\":1745355172},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"useful reflection tool because if you need to reflect, it''ll talk to you for as long as you need to. And so I design, I designed sort of a prototype of AI \",\"startTime\":1745355172,\"endTime\":1745355180},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"as a paraprofessional for classroom teachers. \",\"startTime\":1745355180,\"endTime\":1745355184},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Wow, tell me more about your job then, and your role and what you''re doing now. \",\"startTime\":1745355187,\"endTime\":1745355191},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Besides snowboarding and writing crazy stuff like that, that''s amazing.\",\"startTime\":1745355192,\"endTime\":1745355196},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"OK, so we started a consulting firm a few years back.\",\"startTime\":1745355196,\"endTime\":1745355200},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I have a PhD in curriculum studies.\",\"startTime\":1745355201,\"endTime\":1745355204},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Our consulting firm works the Rochester School District. We did evaluation for \",\"startTime\":1745355206,\"endTime\":1745355209},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"the City and County of Denver for their. \",\"startTime\":1745355209,\"endTime\":1745355212},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Participatory budgeting process because.\",\"startTime\":1745355212,\"endTime\":1745355215},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"My dissertation work was on participatory budgeting in schools.\",\"startTime\":1745355217,\"endTime\":1745355220},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Then I started writing health curricula for a community Health Organization. \",\"startTime\":1745355221,\"endTime\":1745355227},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Then we started an educational nonprofit simultaneously that had a tutoring program that''s facilitated by high school students for middle school and elementary school students. \",\"startTime\":1745355227,\"endTime\":1745355238},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"That was supposed to be a little more sophisticated than it was, but we never got the data we needed to design the interventions. But we run it all year and \",\"startTime\":1745355239,\"endTime\":1745355246},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"proof of concept was, yes, we can get high school students to do it and it works really well. \",\"startTime\":1745355246,\"endTime\":1745355252},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Like it could be better, but it works really well. That comes from my wife and \",\"startTime\":1745355252,\"endTime\":1745355255},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''s experience in the Baha''i community, just like working to do empowerment programs for middle school students. So it''s basically a stripped down version \",\"startTime\":1745355255,\"endTime\":1745355262},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"of that. \",\"startTime\":1745355262,\"endTime\":1745355265},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And then we that organization also has a micro school of about 16 students of differing ages that include my 10 year old twins. \",\"startTime\":1745355266,\"endTime\":1745355273},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"But my wife runs during the day. That is going to end up costing us a lot of \",\"startTime\":1745355274,\"endTime\":1745355276},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"money soon. \",\"startTime\":1745355276,\"endTime\":1745355279},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"You know, like, she didn''t get paid. I paid tuition for my kids to go to a school \",\"startTime\":1745355281,\"endTime\":1745355284},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"that I started. But like, parents are, you know, bickering with us about, like, \",\"startTime\":1745355284,\"endTime\":1745355287},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"paying for an additional week of school. And I''m like, I can''t believe I''m going \",\"startTime\":1745355287,\"endTime\":1745355291},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"to eat like $3000. \",\"startTime\":1745355291,\"endTime\":1745355294},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"But currently my full time job currently is. Actually I work for.\",\"startTime\":1745355296,\"endTime\":1745355299},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Community Health Organization here and because the Springs that is focused on nutrition security and HealthEquity. And I am the director of the Rural Health \",\"startTime\":1745355301,\"endTime\":1745355310},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Network under Hersegram. And so I have been writing some training curricula, \",\"startTime\":1745355310,\"endTime\":1745355315},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"doing work with community health workers and trying to get all the health agencies. \",\"startTime\":1745355315,\"endTime\":1745355320},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And my tiny put on little town to play well with each other.\",\"startTime\":1745355321,\"endTime\":1745355324},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I just got off the phone like 1/2 an hour ago with a friend of mine who.\",\"startTime\":1745355325,\"endTime\":1745355329},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Works at the Gates Foundation doing.\",\"startTime\":1745355329,\"endTime\":1745355332},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Interestingly enough, like an AI powered.\",\"startTime\":1745355332,\"endTime\":1745355335},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Math education tool for.\",\"startTime\":1745355338,\"endTime\":1745355340},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Calc students at the post secondary level and.\",\"startTime\":1745355341,\"endTime\":1745355346},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''m I might interview with his boss to help with AI strategy on that project. \",\"startTime\":1745355347,\"endTime\":1745355352},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Which would be great because my grant runs out in June and we''re going to owe money for this school and I have no job, so that would be really great. \",\"startTime\":1745355352,\"endTime\":1745355360},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, no kidding. Well, I hope that one you get it ''cause I know you''re \",\"startTime\":1745355361,\"endTime\":1745355364},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"amazing and awesome that it works out well. \",\"startTime\":1745355364,\"endTime\":1745355367},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Also you''re doing amazing work, there''s so many ways to connect with other people who are doing like like minded stuff. Wow, what an impact. \",\"startTime\":1745355368,\"endTime\":1745355377},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah, getting paid. That''s the.\",\"startTime\":1745355378,\"endTime\":1745355381},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, getting paid too. Yeah, you should get paid. Every educator should get \",\"startTime\":1745355380,\"endTime\":1745355384},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"paid well and the more that you dedicate your your life to it. \",\"startTime\":1745355384,\"endTime\":1745355387},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I applied to teach again, so I might if nothing else works out. Maybe I''ll be \",\"startTime\":1745355388,\"endTime\":1745355392},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"a classroom teacher again next year. \",\"startTime\":1745355392,\"endTime\":1745355396},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You know what? You you''re, you''re totally gonna own it. You''re gonna be awesome \",\"startTime\":1745355395,\"endTime\":1745355398},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"with it. It''s like writing down, like the terrain. I know it''s the same for \",\"startTime\":1745355398,\"endTime\":1745355402},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"snowboarding and skiing. Like, you look at at the terrain ahead and you''re like, \",\"startTime\":1745355402,\"endTime\":1745355405},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"oh, I got this. It may not feel so cozy, but you got it. I''m sure you''re ready \",\"startTime\":1745355405,\"endTime\":1745355408},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"on it. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745355408,\"endTime\":1745355412},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''m pretty good at getting back up again. So you just moved to Tucson. What \",\"startTime\":1745355412,\"endTime\":1745355415},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"inspired that move? \",\"startTime\":1745355415,\"endTime\":1745355418},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745355418,\"endTime\":1745355418},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Just ready for a new chapter in life and with the the focus now side by. We \",\"startTime\":1745355421,\"endTime\":1745355425},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"just started in February, February 1 was when our launch happened. And for me \",\"startTime\":1745355425,\"endTime\":1745355429},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"that''s a new role and I had previously. \",\"startTime\":1745355429,\"endTime\":1745355433},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Cut connections with the districts I was working with, closed contracts and stuff and just being in that space, Spokane, WA, Eastern Washington, I was like hundreds of school districts I''m working with. And, and really it was just like \",\"startTime\":1745355434,\"endTime\":1745355445},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"the entropy was too high. I couldn''t manage it all because our systems were \",\"startTime\":1745355445,\"endTime\":1745355449},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"behind and the way that we were doing things, I couldn''t grow personally. I \",\"startTime\":1745355449,\"endTime\":1745355453},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"couldn''t do the stuff that was wanting to do and my brain was just fatigued and I wasn''t doing well with that so. \",\"startTime\":1745355453,\"endTime\":1745355460},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Really helpful that my wife wanted to go somewhere warmer and we''ve been thinking about moving and doing a new adventure. \",\"startTime\":1745355461,\"endTime\":1745355466},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh.\",\"startTime\":1745355466,\"endTime\":1745355467},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Tucson one, we''re here. So it''s it''s really fun. It''s kind of like starting \",\"startTime\":1745355469,\"endTime\":1745355472},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and writing new code or. \",\"startTime\":1745355472,\"endTime\":1745355476},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Opening up and like oh I''m gonna make my new GPT blank.\",\"startTime\":1745355476,\"endTime\":1745355479},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''ve got time to build it, so it''s it''s fun and new for that, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745355480,\"endTime\":1745355484},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I just.\",\"startTime\":1745355485,\"endTime\":1745355486},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Experience holding for the first time recently.\",\"startTime\":1745355487,\"endTime\":1745355490},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"OK, OK, take turn sharing with docs. How do you think AI will change the role \",\"startTime\":1745355492,\"endTime\":1745355495},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"of learners? \",\"startTime\":1745355495,\"endTime\":1745355498},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"In the future, press more for ideas. OK? How do you think AD will change the \",\"startTime\":1745355500,\"endTime\":1745355504},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"role of learners in the future? \",\"startTime\":1745355504,\"endTime\":1745355507},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Wow, that''s such a broad big question.\",\"startTime\":1745355512,\"endTime\":1745355515},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So I think that there are ways that AI can be leveraged very positively. I actually \",\"startTime\":1745355517,\"endTime\":1745355521},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"don''t think that AI will be as useful of a tool. \",\"startTime\":1745355521,\"endTime\":1745355526},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"For direct student engagement.\",\"startTime\":1745355528,\"endTime\":1745355531},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"As it will.\",\"startTime\":1745355531,\"endTime\":1745355532},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"For users. So like a student as a user can leverage the tool to learn, but I \",\"startTime\":1745355533,\"endTime\":1745355536},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"don''t. \",\"startTime\":1745355536,\"endTime\":1745355539},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"See AI as being as useful like.\",\"startTime\":1745355539,\"endTime\":1745355542},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Not the way like a smart board was or like a laptop was like more.\",\"startTime\":1745355542,\"endTime\":1745355547},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think the user level is where AI will take shape the most.\",\"startTime\":1745355548,\"endTime\":1745355552},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So whether it be like a teacher working with generative AI or a student you know using it at home. \",\"startTime\":1745355554,\"endTime\":1745355558},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think one thing my knee jerk reaction at this exact moment is that.\",\"startTime\":1745355560,\"endTime\":1745355565},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And it''s gonna go against everybody''s instincts, but we''re gonna have to move to a pedagogy of presence. \",\"startTime\":1745355566,\"endTime\":1745355572},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"We''re gonna, it''s gonna be based on like what you say in real time, what how the connections you make. \",\"startTime\":1745355572,\"endTime\":1745355579},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Because all of your written artifacts can be done by AI now. So like, you can \",\"startTime\":1745355579,\"endTime\":1745355583},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"write the artifacts, you can read them, you can learn, but like, it''s going to be how you show up in that space. \",\"startTime\":1745355583,\"endTime\":1745355590},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And for a long time we thought that that privileges certain groups over others. \",\"startTime\":1745355591,\"endTime\":1745355596},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"But I don''t know that there''s any other way to move forward pedagogically except by like real time behavior. \",\"startTime\":1745355596,\"endTime\":1745355604},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"That''s the one thing.\",\"startTime\":1745355605,\"endTime\":1745355605},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You could both that''s that''s something that we we have to learn as a whole for each of us as learners. Or is that more a teacher? \",\"startTime\":1745355605,\"endTime\":1745355614},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Stance or a student stance, like where they need to be in their role. Where \",\"startTime\":1745355615,\"endTime\":1745355618},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"do you see that? \",\"startTime\":1745355618,\"endTime\":1745355621},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Oh, I see it with like students. The students are not going to like artifacts \",\"startTime\":1745355620,\"endTime\":1745355626},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"are not gonna be as critical for as like assessment tools. \",\"startTime\":1745355626,\"endTime\":1745355630},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Because so I tell you as my student like I would like you to go read 2 treatises on government, right? \",\"startTime\":1745355630,\"endTime\":1745355637},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I know that you''re gonna have AI help you read it, right? So I''m gonna say go \",\"startTime\":1745355637,\"endTime\":1745355641},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"read it, have AI help you read it. But the reason I want you to read it is because \",\"startTime\":1745355641,\"endTime\":1745355644},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I want you to expand your ability to utilize language to describe reality. So \",\"startTime\":1745355644,\"endTime\":1745355648},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"if you''re gonna use the AI to help you read it, you better use it to help you understand the words that are on the page, not just tell you what it means and like your Vernacular English. Because when I asked you a question tomorrow, \",\"startTime\":1745355648,\"endTime\":1745355659},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''ll know which of the two will be true. \",\"startTime\":1745355659,\"endTime\":1745355663},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Right. And so you''ll be responsible for that.\",\"startTime\":1745355663,\"endTime\":1745355665},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And ultimately.\",\"startTime\":1745355667,\"endTime\":1745355668},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think that what we''re going to have to get used to is we''re very cognizant of students that felt shy or that were worried about like. \",\"startTime\":1745355668,\"endTime\":1745355675},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"You know, getting nervous speaking in front of a class.\",\"startTime\":1745355676,\"endTime\":1745355679},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And in some ways, I think that''s supported the cult of the celebrity.\",\"startTime\":1745355679,\"endTime\":1745355684},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Someone that could like talk fluently but said nothing.\",\"startTime\":1745355684,\"endTime\":1745355687},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"You know, people that are competent and shy are able to talk about the things they''re competent about. So I''m not particularly worried that in the long run \",\"startTime\":1745355687,\"endTime\":1745355694},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"that this is a big deal. But initially, I think a big hurdle will be you''re \",\"startTime\":1745355694,\"endTime\":1745355697},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"like, oh, it''s not fair to ask a student to stand up in front of the class and talk. I''m going to say I don''t know what else they can do that AI can''t. So \",\"startTime\":1745355697,\"endTime\":1745355704},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"if they don''t learn how to do this. \",\"startTime\":1745355704,\"endTime\":1745355707},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I don''t know. I don''t know how they''re gonna make themselves known in the workforce. \",\"startTime\":1745355708,\"endTime\":1745355711},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And what did you call it before? It''s like the skill of being present, \",\"startTime\":1745355713,\"endTime\":1745355715},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"is that what you''re saying? \",\"startTime\":1745355715,\"endTime\":1745355718},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Oh, Pedagogy of presence is like the.\",\"startTime\":1745355717,\"endTime\":1745355721},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Pedagogy of Presence. Yeah, I really appreciate that. Yeah. I find myself, uh, \",\"startTime\":1745355720,\"endTime\":1745355723},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"needing to be specifically that way. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1745355723,\"endTime\":1745355726},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Even in my work, because I''m like, whoa, what? What do I really need to do here \",\"startTime\":1745355727,\"endTime\":1745355729},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and how do I do it? And. \",\"startTime\":1745355729,\"endTime\":1745355732},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"My role here at Side By is to cultivate the community.\",\"startTime\":1745355733,\"endTime\":1745355737},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Through curriculum, I help write the cards and we have the limitations of the platform as it is and. \",\"startTime\":1745355737,\"endTime\":1745355745},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So I''m trying to pull the levers on the curriculum machine on the back end to allow pathways for people and then. \",\"startTime\":1745355746,\"endTime\":1745355752},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Have discourse that allows for richness and how it would stimulate the community. \",\"startTime\":1745355752,\"endTime\":1745355756},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And so I''m like, how do I do it? And I really appreciate that because that pedagogy \",\"startTime\":1745355756,\"endTime\":1745355760},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"of presence is what we bring, is that you get to be in the moment with somebody else. And I have to put my robots aside. \",\"startTime\":1745355760,\"endTime\":1745355768},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I need to come out of my office more than once a day.\",\"startTime\":1745355769,\"endTime\":1745355771},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You know how it is here? Like you got 12 robots you''re talking to.\",\"startTime\":1745355773,\"endTime\":1745355776},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I can''t tell you how many tabs I have open.\",\"startTime\":1745355777,\"endTime\":1745355780},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Google.\",\"startTime\":1745355781,\"endTime\":1745355782},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"A little upsetting.\",\"startTime\":1745355783,\"endTime\":1745355784},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah, then I I think that.\",\"startTime\":1745355786,\"endTime\":1745355788},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Also.\",\"startTime\":1745355788,\"endTime\":1745355789},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"This seems to be like a big I mean this this may not be the prompt maybe maybe the next prompt address. \",\"startTime\":1745355790,\"endTime\":1745355796},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"OK, the challenge is under more and choose one. Take turns with docs and look \",\"startTime\":1745355798,\"endTime\":1745355801},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"for common threads. \",\"startTime\":1745355801,\"endTime\":1745355804},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, I like what we we did one.\",\"startTime\":1745355807,\"endTime\":1745355810},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''m game for either your pick first, I''ll let you dealers choice here.\",\"startTime\":1745355813,\"endTime\":1745355818},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1745355820,\"endTime\":1745355820},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I don''t know like ''cause I''m not directly teaching.\",\"startTime\":1745355824,\"endTime\":1745355827},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I mean, the only problem with practice I can think of is how to.\",\"startTime\":1745355828,\"endTime\":1745355830},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Secure an income.\",\"startTime\":1745355831,\"endTime\":1745355833},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Right, it''s the only thing on my mind right now.\",\"startTime\":1745355833,\"endTime\":1745355835},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Even though a few months left, like it''s just the because you know, it takes like a month to like actually start the job. So like. \",\"startTime\":1745355836,\"endTime\":1745355842},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"We''re coming towards the deadline.\",\"startTime\":1745355844,\"endTime\":1745355846},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745355845,\"endTime\":1745355846},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745355846,\"endTime\":1745355846},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Make your story.\",\"startTime\":1745355847,\"endTime\":1745355849},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I mean, I think this is like this might be the first time in history that.\",\"startTime\":1745355850,\"endTime\":1745355853},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Two things are true 1 is that the skills of an educator might actually have like. \",\"startTime\":1745355855,\"endTime\":1745355860},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"High market value, you know, we''re finally like educators like because they understand how people learn that it''s like, hey, we have this really dynamic tool and I can tell you how it will work for people and how it won''t. \",\"startTime\":1745355860,\"endTime\":1745355873},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And so there''s a chance for teachers to really educators to monetize like what they know how to do, what their instincts tell them. And so that''s kind of cool. \",\"startTime\":1745355873,\"endTime\":1745355881},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And they''re also faced with the problem that. \",\"startTime\":1745355881,\"endTime\":1745355884},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I don''t think educators ever had before, you know, like used to have to know things orally because you couldn''t. \",\"startTime\":1745355884,\"endTime\":1745355890},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Hard everything into a piece of stone or you didn''t have papyrus.\",\"startTime\":1745355891,\"endTime\":1745355894},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"You now have like a tool.\",\"startTime\":1745355894,\"endTime\":1745355896},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Really is gonna have to help you help students become learners and the entire discourse on AI and education. \",\"startTime\":1745355898,\"endTime\":1745355905},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Is dominated by like tech zealots that sort of don''t.\",\"startTime\":1745355907,\"endTime\":1745355912},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Recall their education before age 10.\",\"startTime\":1745355912,\"endTime\":1745355915},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And like all of the front loading that went into and that ultimately school may have been boring for them or it may have been socially awkward, but it wasn''t hard. \",\"startTime\":1745355915,\"endTime\":1745355924},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"They don''t actually know what it''s like to struggle to understand something cognitively. And so all of their sort of like chatters. \",\"startTime\":1745355924,\"endTime\":1745355932},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Absence, but we''re gonna have to figure out how. Like, how do I get my student \",\"startTime\":1745355934,\"endTime\":1745355938},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"to interact with AI the way I do? \",\"startTime\":1745355938,\"endTime\":1745355941},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"You know, leverage it as a way to learn how to do something, not as a shortcut. \",\"startTime\":1745355942,\"endTime\":1745355946},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Hmm. Hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745355943,\"endTime\":1745355943},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Because it''s really powerful as a way to learn something. It''s not if you don''t \",\"startTime\":1745355947,\"endTime\":1745355950},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"know how to do it already, if you have no idea what you''re doing, if you have it, read something for you that''s not helpful. \",\"startTime\":1745355950,\"endTime\":1745355956},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"But it''s really good, like walking with you as you want to figure something out and the better you can use language. I mean, that''s that''s where I''m at \",\"startTime\":1745355957,\"endTime\":1745355963},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"my story with AI. \",\"startTime\":1745355963,\"endTime\":1745355966},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1745355967,\"endTime\":1745355968},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Do you have any problems I might be able to help you with?\",\"startTime\":1745355968,\"endTime\":1745355970},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I think my story is really similar as I think about how we really reach teachers to have an effect or an impact. I''ve spent my career around trying to help teachers \",\"startTime\":1745355971,\"endTime\":1745355980},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and leaders. \",\"startTime\":1745355980,\"endTime\":1745355984},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Whatever it was or said organizations or anything where they you''re coaching or learning even from baseball or other sports type of things that I was always minded about the coaches and wanting them to do better. \",\"startTime\":1745355987,\"endTime\":1745355998},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And, umm, I wanted to be better and I wanted to be better at it and I wanted to figure out what it was liked and. \",\"startTime\":1745355999,\"endTime\":1745356004},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I was drawn to like, I need a coach so, or I need a teacher, I need a coach or try this because I gotta figure it out too ''cause I want us all to get better at it. And I really wanna get teachers better. And I feel that our place, that \",\"startTime\":1745356004,\"endTime\":1745356016},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"we are right today with the technology and that human component, they have to bridge the gap. And as you call that out, we as educators are the the best positioned \",\"startTime\":1745356016,\"endTime\":1745356024},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"individuals to help. \",\"startTime\":1745356024,\"endTime\":1745356028},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Kids and the rest of the world figure out what to do with AI and how to really use it. I''m talking from policy stance to law to practical application in the \",\"startTime\":1745356029,\"endTime\":1745356036},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"classroom. In daily life. We can be the ones who can help speak up and teach \",\"startTime\":1745356036,\"endTime\":1745356040},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"parents and grandmas how to use AI to do the stuff that they want to do and help them to get it done. \",\"startTime\":1745356040,\"endTime\":1745356047},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''ve been trying to think about how to create like an agent for my mom.\",\"startTime\":1745356048,\"endTime\":1745356053},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, exactly.\",\"startTime\":1745356055,\"endTime\":1745356056},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"But she wears like, she wears like the aura ring. And so if you could integrate \",\"startTime\":1745356057,\"endTime\":1745356060},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"that agent with like. \",\"startTime\":1745356060,\"endTime\":1745356064},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"For bills or doctor''s appointments and like her ring, she''s 77 and she could start using it now like. \",\"startTime\":1745356064,\"endTime\":1745356071},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And learn how to sort of interface with it effectively.\",\"startTime\":1745356071,\"endTime\":1745356074},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"It can help her like you know.\",\"startTime\":1745356075,\"endTime\":1745356077},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Combat, like cognitive decline, you know, encourage her to do things during the day so that she''s more active, right? Like it can be sort of so that she \",\"startTime\":1745356077,\"endTime\":1745356085},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"can live independently for as long as she wants. Doesn''t have to be like her \",\"startTime\":1745356085,\"endTime\":1745356089},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"friend, but it''s like it''s like a pet that is. \",\"startTime\":1745356089,\"endTime\":1745356093},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Supportive more than just emotionally, you know.\",\"startTime\":1745356094,\"endTime\":1745356097},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"To provide real practical value as a, as a tool, that''s there, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745356099,\"endTime\":1745356105},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I do think AI might be the technology that finally like liberates the neurodiverse. \",\"startTime\":1745356104,\"endTime\":1745356109},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I think so too. So my problem with practice is really that same thing that you''re \",\"startTime\":1745356110,\"endTime\":1745356114},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"working on with curriculum is how do I create curriculum to empower teachers? \",\"startTime\":1745356114,\"endTime\":1745356118},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And for me, it''s not just about writing the curriculum, but it''s helping to network them together. \",\"startTime\":1745356118,\"endTime\":1745356126},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Like how do I connect you with somebody else and how do I help your identity as an individual come to the surface as much as you want to dial it up and down? \",\"startTime\":1745356127,\"endTime\":1745356135},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And also how much is our community identity? What''s our shared knowledge like? \",\"startTime\":1745356135,\"endTime\":1745356140},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Here''s one, Here''s a quote from yesterday. Rob Shaw yesterday and I were chatting \",\"startTime\":1745356140,\"endTime\":1745356144},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"about the same time and he''s like, Hey, Jeff, you know, like the new self driving cars, they don''t even have LIDAR or any sensors anymore. They just take pictures \",\"startTime\":1745356144,\"endTime\":1745356152},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and they, they can process the pictures so fast and. \",\"startTime\":1745356152,\"endTime\":1745356157},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Every time they come through a problem or something that''s not in the database, it''s a shared database now. So they''re like billions of miles driven because \",\"startTime\":1745356157,\"endTime\":1745356164},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"it''s shared knowledge. And he''s like, I just want us to be able to talk about \",\"startTime\":1745356164,\"endTime\":1745356168},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"our practice and what we''re doing and have it like shared knowledge somehow so that we can and like, Oh my God, so that as educators, we can be driving our education car, our curriculum, our teaching, our tutoring or whatever we''re doing and. \",\"startTime\":1745356168,\"endTime\":1745356182},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I have now shared knowledge from and he said it out. He says like that side \",\"startTime\":1745356182,\"endTime\":1745356185},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"by that''d be so cool if we could do it. So my problem of practice is how do \",\"startTime\":1745356185,\"endTime\":1745356188},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I? \",\"startTime\":1745356188,\"endTime\":1745356191},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Doing it and and work on it in a way that builds and grows.\",\"startTime\":1745356191,\"endTime\":1745356194},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So that''s my that''s my current problem of practice, which is pretty fun.\",\"startTime\":1745356195,\"endTime\":1745356199},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah. I think what I would say there is that was sort of my first step into \",\"startTime\":1745356199,\"endTime\":1745356204},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"the conversation about AI was. \",\"startTime\":1745356204,\"endTime\":1745356210},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Looking at how like if you take 100 people and you drop them on an island for 100 years, they''ll develop a dialect. So like the AI tutor is a good idea. \",\"startTime\":1745356207,\"endTime\":1745356215},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"But if you don''t continually reroute students to communicate with each other. \",\"startTime\":1745356215,\"endTime\":1745356219},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"They will develop a dialect and the epistemic drift that we''ve seen.\",\"startTime\":1745356219,\"endTime\":1745356224},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Culturally, like in the form of our political discourse, will be vastly accelerated by AI if we only use it as a technology for individualization. \",\"startTime\":1745356224,\"endTime\":1745356234},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So there has to be a way to leverage AI to create, to like become an epistemic cartographer. So I can say like, hey. \",\"startTime\":1745356234,\"endTime\":1745356243},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"You know, Jeff, you think this and Drew thinks this like, you know, and Mike thinks this and Docs thinks this. And where are you guys in relation to each \",\"startTime\":1745356244,\"endTime\":1745356252},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"other and where might you agree and where might you disagree? And AI can do \",\"startTime\":1745356252,\"endTime\":1745356256},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"that very quickly. And so that encourages people to keep interfacing again with \",\"startTime\":1745356256,\"endTime\":1745356261},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"each other. And that''s the coolest thing, I think. \",\"startTime\":1745356261,\"endTime\":1745356265},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"If I was trying to help someone understand, what makes AI interesting and very conceptual level is that you know. \",\"startTime\":1745356265,\"endTime\":1745356272},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"It is more remarkable and notable that you and I can agree.\",\"startTime\":1745356274,\"endTime\":1745356279},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"That the color of your shirt is black, right?\",\"startTime\":1745356281,\"endTime\":1745356284},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Than anything we have to say about policy or education.\",\"startTime\":1745356286,\"endTime\":1745356288},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Like.\",\"startTime\":1745356288,\"endTime\":1745356289},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Is the most like incredible.\",\"startTime\":1745356290,\"endTime\":1745356293},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Connector of all humanity and it''s a shared endeavor of making meaning and you now have this technology that like generates languages incredibly. \",\"startTime\":1745356293,\"endTime\":1745356302},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"For a test rate, and maybe it will be like inflation, like printing money, so you''re printing language so you lose meaning or maybe it accelerates our ability to construct meaning. \",\"startTime\":1745356304,\"endTime\":1745356314},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So in that sense, like, how do you use AI to help everybody broaden their ability to read the reality that''s around them? Like the fundamental unity of humanity \",\"startTime\":1745356314,\"endTime\":1745356322},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"is inescapable. \",\"startTime\":1745356322,\"endTime\":1745356326},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And a lot of our.\",\"startTime\":1745356327,\"endTime\":1745356328},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"A lot of our fine tuning at the top and in our Western individualism makes us think that like Democrat and Republican shows how different we really are. And \",\"startTime\":1745356328,\"endTime\":1745356336},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"we''re not very different at all. You know, at the end of the day, you know, \",\"startTime\":1745356336,\"endTime\":1745356340},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"we have the same fundamental values and we can all agree on colors and shapes and names of things. And that''s probably more fantastic than anything else. \",\"startTime\":1745356340,\"endTime\":1745356347},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And so how is AIA technology? How do we use AI as a technology that reinforces \",\"startTime\":1745356347,\"endTime\":1745356351},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"that? \",\"startTime\":1745356351,\"endTime\":1745356355},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Collective oneness, you know, because we don''t really have to worry about the diversity at this point. That''s going to keep expressing itself. But how do \",\"startTime\":1745356356,\"endTime\":1745356362},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"we keep coming back to each other? \",\"startTime\":1745356362,\"endTime\":1745356365},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"To be understood rather than to be heard.\",\"startTime\":1745356365,\"endTime\":1745356367},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And for me, I think much of that for the user journeys and for students, \",\"startTime\":1745356372,\"endTime\":1745356375},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"for learners or humans is. \",\"startTime\":1745356375,\"endTime\":1745356378},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Pedagogically, I I''m thinking about we''re not just neurodiverse, a few of us because of XY and Z, because we have a label as a group. \",\"startTime\":1745356380,\"endTime\":1745356389},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"We''re all neuro diverse, even within our strong groupings in different areas, we see the world so freaking differently. And I think there''s power in calling \",\"startTime\":1745356389,\"endTime\":1745356398},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"out those sames and differences between us and challenging those words and. \",\"startTime\":1745356398,\"endTime\":1745356403},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"My hope would be is that we we continue to value multiple perspectives and that we can engage it. So for me. \",\"startTime\":1745356404,\"endTime\":1745356410},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I want them to to have that value of multiple perspectives and see it, like you said, that they''re green. \",\"startTime\":1745356410,\"endTime\":1745356415},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And in my visualization, which by the way is what I hope they can get, is a mental representation almost like a dial on their dashboard that says what kind of mental representation do you want of? \",\"startTime\":1745356416,\"endTime\":1745356428},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Community and our thinking and then they can dial it around and I don''t mean just like I think you should pick Star Trek or Star Wars if you want to and all of that stuff just for fun, but like not just the the interface background, but. \",\"startTime\":1745356429,\"endTime\":1745356441},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You can show what kind of representation like for me I see the community when you talked about that geolocation like AGPS system almost of about thought and ideas. \",\"startTime\":1745356441,\"endTime\":1745356451},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I see us being able to have at the and this is maybe just not only my representation, but do I see could happen like even is that you have like your orb is what I call it just like a sphere. And there''s a central project that a bunch of you \",\"startTime\":1745356452,\"endTime\":1745356464},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"happen to be working on, like Mike and Erica and I and Diego, who''s our tech guy and a couple other people. We''re all like focused on a certain project. \",\"startTime\":1745356464,\"endTime\":1745356472},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I spent, I mean, I''ve spent the last month''s writing a lot and.\",\"startTime\":1745356471,\"endTime\":1745356476},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And so that''s like at the center, it''s the sun and that''s giving us like. \",\"startTime\":1745356472,\"endTime\":1745356477},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Tasks to do and energy because we''re shared in this project or the space.\",\"startTime\":1745356478,\"endTime\":1745356482},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And on the outside, I see all of us like orbs. And I remember this from the \",\"startTime\":1745356483,\"endTime\":1745356486},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"last group I worked with on a different project. But there''s like the, the, \",\"startTime\":1745356486,\"endTime\":1745356490},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"the shadow side of the orb and there''s the sunlit side. And the sunlit side \",\"startTime\":1745356490,\"endTime\":1745356494},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"is the US what we''re doing together. And on the inside, the, the shadow side \",\"startTime\":1745356494,\"endTime\":1745356498},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"is like just me, what''s I''m doing. \",\"startTime\":1745356498,\"endTime\":1745356501},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I can have like reflective thoughts, like you had reflective thoughts to get into up duo. And I think AI as a tool can really help us to reflect. And \",\"startTime\":1745356502,\"endTime\":1745356509},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"so in the orb you like, then you zoom in and then just start showing you representations of your thinking in different ways. And I don''t know if it''s because a metaphor \",\"startTime\":1745356509,\"endTime\":1745356516},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"or what, but like on that planet, you zoom in and you can see it. But on the \",\"startTime\":1745356516,\"endTime\":1745356519},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"on the other side, you start seeing these connecting rods of like how you''re connecting with other people, conversations that that you and I had and the overlap and you can even start. \",\"startTime\":1745356519,\"endTime\":1745356530},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Doing the beep beep on your screen so that you can bring it in or you let AI tools do it. It''s like, hey, here''s a cool connection you and and docs and Dana \",\"startTime\":1745356531,\"endTime\":1745356539},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and. \",\"startTime\":1745356539,\"endTime\":1745356543},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"What was her name?\",\"startTime\":1745356544,\"endTime\":1745356545},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I think it''s Tiana.\",\"startTime\":1745356546,\"endTime\":1745356547},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And Michelle are all doing curriculum commonalities like the tags or you''re in a common group. But then you can zoom in on that and you can dial that up \",\"startTime\":1745356548,\"endTime\":1745356554},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"because you want to grow in that because that''s something that you want to do. \",\"startTime\":1745356554,\"endTime\":1745356557},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And you''re like, I want to explore that. I want to be that more and I want to \",\"startTime\":1745356557,\"endTime\":1745356560},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"go figure it out. \",\"startTime\":1745356560,\"endTime\":1745356563},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And and then I practically on the back end, we''ll pull data from that to be able to drive the system to make connections because you should be able to reach out to more curriculum people. We should match you with more curriculum people. \",\"startTime\":1745356563,\"endTime\":1745356573},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That''s like practically because it and my problem with practice, how do I grow and I''m thinking about structurally. \",\"startTime\":1745356573,\"endTime\":1745356580},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"How at least do I do a mental representation of this idea? And your thinking \",\"startTime\":1745356581,\"endTime\":1745356584},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"really helps clarify that for me. \",\"startTime\":1745356584,\"endTime\":1745356587},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I''m definitely gonna look at the transcript from this.\",\"startTime\":1745356588,\"endTime\":1745356590},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"To pull out some of your thinking because it was really detailed and really good. \",\"startTime\":1745356590,\"endTime\":1745356594},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"That''s been really.\",\"startTime\":1745356600,\"endTime\":1745356601},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Wonderful experience.\",\"startTime\":1745356603,\"endTime\":1745356605},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That''s so cool.\",\"startTime\":1745356605,\"endTime\":1745356606},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So I haven''t written that much in a long time.\",\"startTime\":1745356606,\"endTime\":1745356608},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So I find that AI gets me really rolling intellectually and.\",\"startTime\":1745356609,\"endTime\":1745356615},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Even like I''ll use the dynamic, you know, chat interface like in the morning, just have like a conversation on my way to work and it makes me come to work ready to work. You know, there''s no like warm up. So, you know, I, I found it \",\"startTime\":1745356615,\"endTime\":1745356630},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1745356627,\"endTime\":1745356628},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"to be really useful tool for myself, although sometimes I go, am I crazy, you know, or am I like, is this abuse? I should maybe I need to back off and. \",\"startTime\":1745356630,\"endTime\":1745356640},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"But I think it''s important to always ask yourself this question.\",\"startTime\":1745356642,\"endTime\":1745356644},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. Good call. Hey, thanks so much for your time. One thing that I learned \",\"startTime\":1745356646,\"endTime\":1745356650},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"It''s nice to meet you man.\",\"startTime\":1745356648,\"endTime\":1745356649},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"is pedagogical presence. \",\"startTime\":1745356650,\"endTime\":1745356654},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Or was it the presence of pedagogy?\",\"startTime\":1745356655,\"endTime\":1745356657},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think.\",\"startTime\":1745356657,\"endTime\":1745356657},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Pedagogy of presence, I think is what? Yeah, that''s the work type.\",\"startTime\":1745356658,\"endTime\":1745356661},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK.\",\"startTime\":1745356660,\"endTime\":1745356661},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That''s what I learned about today.\",\"startTime\":1745356661,\"endTime\":1745356663},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think I learned, I really liked your metaphor of like the light side and the dark side, right? That there''s like a part that''s like exposed to everybody \",\"startTime\":1745356663,\"endTime\":1745356671},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"else, right? And that''s something that you all shine and sort of build collectively. \",\"startTime\":1745356671,\"endTime\":1745356675},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And then there''s another side that''s like a private practice that''s your own building. But they''re not separate, they''re interrelated. \",\"startTime\":1745356675,\"endTime\":1745356682},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. Oh, thanks man. Awesome. Hey, when you hit end on these calls, it''s \",\"startTime\":1745356684,\"endTime\":1745356689},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"like you hung up. So just for FYI if you want to give any feedback. \",\"startTime\":1745356689,\"endTime\":1745356694},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''m going to try and get the social studies department at the middle school into the side by so that they can begin thinking about how to leverage AI. Like \",\"startTime\":1745356690,\"endTime\":1745356698},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Later or anytime just feel free to e-mail me or connect. However we should have \",\"startTime\":1745356695,\"endTime\":1745356699},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"we''re an under resourced community and they need all the help they can get. \",\"startTime\":1745356698,\"endTime\":1745356702},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"it working even in the system that you should be able to just hit and send a message in the system to come directly to me or somebody. \",\"startTime\":1745356699,\"endTime\":1745356706},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"But I want to say thanks again. You are an incredible thinker and a powerful \",\"startTime\":1745356707,\"endTime\":1745356712},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"force, and you''re doing cool stuff. And our job and my job is to connect you \",\"startTime\":1745356712,\"endTime\":1745356716},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"with other people. So your problem of practice about finding work. \",\"startTime\":1745356716,\"endTime\":1745356721},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"It''s not mine to find it for you, but I''m gonna connect you with people and I think that''s gonna raise your chances. I think probability is gonna go up. \",\"startTime\":1745356721,\"endTime\":1745356728},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And by the way, we''re looking for growth and if there''s certain things that you want to work with, especially in your specialty of curriculum, I would love Co thinking times like just be able to come in and I can''t promise contracts or anything at this point or stuff like that. But as as we go, especially if \",\"startTime\":1745356741,\"endTime\":1745356755},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"it''s for your community in that part, that''s your community and it''s for them. \",\"startTime\":1745356755,\"endTime\":1745356759},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I would love to figure out and get feedback from you and help even Co craft things like, hey, here are some real practical things that they''re saying that we need. \",\"startTime\":1745356759,\"endTime\":1745356769},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So you could have a large user group space that you would help drive and give input on the curriculum and feedback. That for me would be an initiative well \",\"startTime\":1745356769,\"endTime\":1745356777},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"worth doing as a partnership just to help support your crew and, and really create artifacts and resources and feedback for your teams that that that would be valuable for them. So. \",\"startTime\":1745356777,\"endTime\":1745356789},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Yes, I think I''ve got. I think in two weeks I will have a sense of what''s happening \",\"startTime\":1745356789,\"endTime\":1745356793},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"either with this teaching job or this job with the Gates Foundation. \",\"startTime\":1745356793,\"endTime\":1745356797},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"That point I''ll understand what my positionality is to the school district here, and then I can begin exploring how to build that relationship. \",\"startTime\":1745356800,\"endTime\":1745356807},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"All right, sweet. Well we''re here and this space is for you, so use it as you \",\"startTime\":1745356807,\"endTime\":1745356811},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"want to. And you got any feedback or thoughts? Let me know. Love to chat more. \",\"startTime\":1745356811,\"endTime\":1745356814},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Alright man, you rock. See you. \",\"startTime\":1745356814,\"endTime\":1745356817},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"All right. Thanks, Jeff. Take care.\",\"startTime\":1745356814,\"endTime\":1745356815}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.033789+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.033789+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 2193, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:07.978Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('1f2ce80e-33db-41c3-bce2-3dac2e4f8bfb', '4734e9cf-74b7-4e89-b92c-8dc6f49c5b2a', '117851', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.208583+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.208583+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 251, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:54.143Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('e80d95d4-7729-475c-b985-dc8909fea15c', '1da551dd-7a97-4556-a99d-5c3536a61caf', '137223', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"My name is Mike and I am a Digital Learning Coordinator in North Carolina. The \",\"startTime\":1740151000,\"endTime\":1740151004},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"big part of my role is supporting students and staff K through 12 and integrating technology. This could look like. \",\"startTime\":1740151004,\"endTime\":1740151013},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"My name is Mike and I am a Digital Learning Coordinator in North Carolina. A \",\"startTime\":1740151027,\"endTime\":1740151031},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"big part of my role is supporting staff with integrating technology into their classroom. \",\"startTime\":1740151031,\"endTime\":1740151036},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"So whether it be learning how to post in their LMS, learning more about AI, how to get their kids more involved with technology centered activities. \",\"startTime\":1740151036,\"endTime\":1740151048},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I''m there to support both staff and kids.\",\"startTime\":1740151048,\"endTime\":1740151051},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"My stance on learning and teaching, I would say, is to never stop, always continue learning. \",\"startTime\":1740151167,\"endTime\":1740151172},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"There is.\",\"startTime\":1740151172,\"endTime\":1740151173},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Always a chance to learn something new, whether it be as a.\",\"startTime\":1740151174,\"endTime\":1740151178},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Dance with teaching and learning would always be there''s always something new you can learn. \",\"startTime\":1740151192,\"endTime\":1740151196},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Whether it be as a teacher, when you''re supporting staff and students, or as a learner. \",\"startTime\":1740151196,\"endTime\":1740151203},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Umm, it''s always good to value those opportunities.\",\"startTime\":1740151203,\"endTime\":1740151206},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Stance on teaching and learning would always be don''t stop. There''s always going \",\"startTime\":1740151250,\"endTime\":1740151254},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"to be an opportunity for you to learn something new. \",\"startTime\":1740151254,\"endTime\":1740151258},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Umm, I always enjoy the opportunity to.\",\"startTime\":1740151258,\"endTime\":1740151260},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Learn as a.\",\"startTime\":1740151262,\"endTime\":1740151263},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Learner and to learn as a present.\",\"startTime\":1740151263,\"endTime\":1740151266},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"On teaching and learning.\",\"startTime\":1740151279,\"endTime\":1740151280},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Especially learning would be to never stop and there''s always an opportunity to learn something new from from anyone you''re around. \",\"startTime\":1740151280,\"endTime\":1740151288},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Whether if you are actually the presenter, the teacher, or if you are the learner. \",\"startTime\":1740151288,\"endTime\":1740151293},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"There''s always a chance to learn something new and I would say in my role specifically is to. \",\"startTime\":1740151293,\"endTime\":1740151300},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Creates learning experiences that empower teachers and that they can use quickly in their own practice. \",\"startTime\":1740151301,\"endTime\":1740151310},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Flow activity. A big sports guy. I love all Pittsburgh sports watching.\",\"startTime\":1740151334,\"endTime\":1740151340},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Pirates. Steelers. Penguins.\",\"startTime\":1740151340,\"endTime\":1740151342},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I still love art. I love to paint.\",\"startTime\":1740151342,\"endTime\":1740151344},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I love to be outdoors. I like landscaping.\",\"startTime\":1740151345,\"endTime\":1740151347},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I like plants.\",\"startTime\":1740151349,\"endTime\":1740151350},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Thanks, I''ve entered the stage of in my life where I become like a.\",\"startTime\":1740151350,\"endTime\":1740151354},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"You know, gardener, landscaper, just for fun. I guess that''s that''s what happens \",\"startTime\":1740151355,\"endTime\":1740151358},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"when you. \",\"startTime\":1740151358,\"endTime\":1740151361},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Get a little older, I don''t know.\",\"startTime\":1740151361,\"endTime\":1740151362}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.172863+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.172863+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 97, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.141Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('b97837dc-43dd-4197-9d54-9df237df75cf', 'd8e9db8f-f716-4f11-9fb9-c204d951fd7d', '137821', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Hi my name is Katie Stahl. I am a teacher in Indiana and I teach high school \",\"startTime\":1743016022,\"endTime\":1743016027},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"social studies have a very large population of. \",\"startTime\":1743016027,\"endTime\":1743016032},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Of language learners and.\",\"startTime\":1743016032,\"endTime\":1743016035},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"A fairly large number of other kiddos who need accommodations.\",\"startTime\":1743016036,\"endTime\":1743016040},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I am hoping to help engage kids in the classroom.\",\"startTime\":1743016040,\"endTime\":1743016043},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I want to be a content deliverer but in small pieces because the more I deliver the more they just. \",\"startTime\":1743016144,\"endTime\":1743016151},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And that''s no fun, and they don''t get it as much. So one of the things that \",\"startTime\":1743016151,\"endTime\":1743016155},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I find really exciting about AI is to be able to get kids excited and engaged in a different way. \",\"startTime\":1743016155,\"endTime\":1743016165},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Things I love to do, I love to be creative.\",\"startTime\":1743016184,\"endTime\":1743016187},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Whether it''s like building something or creating something, growing, planting. \",\"startTime\":1743016187,\"endTime\":1743016192},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"My classroom has lots of plants because I can''t have them at home between a toddler and a cat, but I love to have a happy. \",\"startTime\":1743016192,\"endTime\":1743016202},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Vibing space.\",\"startTime\":1743016203,\"endTime\":1743016205}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.184126+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.184126+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 78, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.157Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('f0550e95-240c-4a64-9533-299f7260c21a', '35695ec4-28b8-4afd-877e-566aeda234fe', '137128', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"This time is a minute so.\",\"startTime\":1739894688,\"endTime\":1739894689},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"They''ll give me like.\",\"startTime\":1739894689,\"endTime\":1739894691},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739894698,\"endTime\":1739894698},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"So this all it''ll be like 3 minutes total for all this. In the meantime I can \",\"startTime\":1739894699,\"endTime\":1739894704},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"share my screen and show you where I''m at on the app. It''s on the side by app. \",\"startTime\":1739894704,\"endTime\":1739894709},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"OK, cool.\",\"startTime\":1739894723,\"endTime\":1739894724},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Toggle.\",\"startTime\":1739894778,\"endTime\":1739894778},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s all good. Umm, so for the just so you''re aware, like if I, if you \",\"startTime\":1739894790,\"endTime\":1739894794},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"see me quickly, like go off attention, it''s ''cause I''m doing the recording thing. \",\"startTime\":1739894794,\"endTime\":1739894798},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Umm, professional story, umm.\",\"startTime\":1739894800,\"endTime\":1739894801},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Without going too far back, I think it dates back to when I was in college, which is strangely like 10 years ago. \",\"startTime\":1739894804,\"endTime\":1739894810},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"It''s weird to think about. Yeah. So when I was in college, I started doing like, \",\"startTime\":1739894812,\"endTime\":1739894816},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"mechanical and aerospace engineering. And I was like, I wanted to help out. \",\"startTime\":1739894816,\"endTime\":1739894820},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Like with actually, I didn''t really know too much about any engineering at all. \",\"startTime\":1739894820,\"endTime\":1739894824},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"And I just remember playing certain video games when I was little and trying to make. And I was like, if we have iPhones now, like, we should be able to \",\"startTime\":1739894824,\"endTime\":1739894832},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"have spaceships. So I was like, ah, wanna be someone that helps develop spaceships. \",\"startTime\":1739894832,\"endTime\":1739894836},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"And that was like, my reasoning. \",\"startTime\":1739894836,\"endTime\":1739894840},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Uh, and so then I realized like I the kind of spaceships I want to develop.\",\"startTime\":1739894843,\"endTime\":1739894847},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I can''t really, I, I need more than just mechanical and aerospace engineering. \",\"startTime\":1739894848,\"endTime\":1739894852},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Actually, I need engineering physi like I need to know more physics also like I don''t know, to me, regular engineering was kind of hard and like I thought physics felt better and like easier to me. So I studied that like ''cause I wanted \",\"startTime\":1739894852,\"endTime\":1739894865},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"to make plasma like ion engines. And then I realized like in the process of \",\"startTime\":1739894865,\"endTime\":1739894869},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"just doing all that, that I kind of, I mostly just like solving a silly little math problems that kind of cope that are kind of involved with. \",\"startTime\":1739894869,\"endTime\":1739894878},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I don''t really want to build anything, I just want to solve the math and or do enough math to make sure that it can be built IE simulated. So I got really \",\"startTime\":1739894880,\"endTime\":1739894888},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"into simulation engineering and I was like ah this is actually something I can get into a flow state doing this math umm in a way. \",\"startTime\":1739894888,\"endTime\":1739894897},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Uh, so I studied operations research after college or sorry, after uh, undergrad. \",\"startTime\":1739894900,\"endTime\":1739894903},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"It''s like grad school and then worked as a data scientist with the hopes of doing simulation engineering and or diving into like actually creating models and stuff. \",\"startTime\":1739894903,\"endTime\":1739894913},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"It wasn''t just that that made me move on from that company. It was I realized \",\"startTime\":1739894942,\"endTime\":1739894946},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"like that that role wasn''t the most like data science. And so I was more like \",\"startTime\":1739894946,\"endTime\":1739894950},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"learning. I did some data science on that role, but it was like moving stuff \",\"startTime\":1739894950,\"endTime\":1739894954},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"around in a spreadsheet that like filled some model, but so you had to like know some statistics. But it wasn''t the most, wasn''t as technical as I wanted \",\"startTime\":1739894954,\"endTime\":1739894963},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"to be and tried another data science role. And the more I delved into data science, \",\"startTime\":1739894963,\"endTime\":1739894967},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"the more I realized like it''s not as much math as I. \",\"startTime\":1739894967,\"endTime\":1739894971},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"And if I can''t do that, like create mathematical models, the other thing I wanted to do was either it was to manage people. Like that''s a skill I learned throughout \",\"startTime\":1739894974,\"endTime\":1739894981},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"the, throughout my tenure, just trying new things and being entrepreneurial is that. \",\"startTime\":1739894981,\"endTime\":1739894988},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I feel comfortable being a translation layer between a variety of teams just knowing different like. \",\"startTime\":1739894990,\"endTime\":1739894997},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Not just like technical languages like, you know.\",\"startTime\":1739894998,\"endTime\":1739895000},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Product and Python And sequel and design, but like, you know, the language of marketing is you kind of as an entrepreneur, you have to like know all languages and so being I guess what people call technical and hold on, let me just make this. \",\"startTime\":1739895001,\"endTime\":1739895014}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.22757+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.22757+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 310, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.198Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('f2f710cf-526e-442c-9d20-1d41114194eb', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '138140', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Hi, Jeff. How are you?\",\"startTime\":1744724617,\"endTime\":1744724618},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Good, thanks for being patient with all the fun stuff.\",\"startTime\":1744724617,\"endTime\":1744724621},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"No problem, no problem.\",\"startTime\":1744724619,\"endTime\":1744724621},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"There you go. Can you see me now?\",\"startTime\":1744724622,\"endTime\":1744724623},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I can, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744724624,\"endTime\":1744724625},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, awesome. Hey, are you feeling better? You were saying you were having \",\"startTime\":1744724625,\"endTime\":1744724630},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"fun with the weather last week. Being under the weather, that is. \",\"startTime\":1744724630,\"endTime\":1744724635},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Oh, I mean, I was, I was OK. Yeah, I don''t know. Maybe my son. I don''t know \",\"startTime\":1744724637,\"endTime\":1744724641},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"if I mentioned my son. \",\"startTime\":1744724641,\"endTime\":1744724645},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, got it.\",\"startTime\":1744724644,\"endTime\":1744724644},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"No worries, no worries, Yeah, or maybe I''m mixing it up ''cause I''m sleepy and tech is getting after me. \",\"startTime\":1744724645,\"endTime\":1744724651},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"No problem.\",\"startTime\":1744724653,\"endTime\":1744724654},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744724653,\"endTime\":1744724654},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Hey, where are you located again? I''m trying to remember your East Coast, right? \",\"startTime\":1744724654,\"endTime\":1744724658},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Oh yes, I''m located in Pennsylvania. So like an hour, hour north of Philadelphia \",\"startTime\":1744724659,\"endTime\":1744724663},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"and an hour W like due West of New York City. So we''re kind of in the confluence \",\"startTime\":1744724663,\"endTime\":1744724668},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"of Philly, New York, Boston, DC, all within, you know, 4 hours, 5 hours where we are. \",\"startTime\":1744724668,\"endTime\":1744724677},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s way cool. Nice. My mom, I''m currently in Tucson. We just moved \",\"startTime\":1744724677,\"endTime\":1744724681},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and how about you?\",\"startTime\":1744724679,\"endTime\":1744724681},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"to Tucson and this is my my new morning office right at the Saguaro National Park. There''s this little pavilion here. \",\"startTime\":1744724681,\"endTime\":1744724690},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I found it''s really peaceful to sit and talk to the grandfathers of cacti out here and stuff and. \",\"startTime\":1744724691,\"endTime\":1744724697},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1744724692,\"endTime\":1744724693},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Have some focus time. It is really amazing. Yeah, uh, but I am from Spokane, \",\"startTime\":1744724698,\"endTime\":1744724702},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"It''s amazing.\",\"startTime\":1744724699,\"endTime\":1744724700},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"WA. I''ve been there most of my life and then just moved down like not even 2 \",\"startTime\":1744724702,\"endTime\":1744724705},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"weeks ago my wife and I did. Yeah, yeah, thanks. \",\"startTime\":1744724705,\"endTime\":1744724709},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Nice. Oh, Congrats. Hopefully it''s everything you thought it would be. It looks \",\"startTime\":1744724709,\"endTime\":1744724711},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"beautiful there. \",\"startTime\":1744724711,\"endTime\":1744724714},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Well, it''s already 65 and it''s 6:30 in the morning, so uh yeah, it''ll be 92 today. It''s, it''s different. I''m used to the greenery in the Pacific Northwest \",\"startTime\":1744724715,\"endTime\":1744724723},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and snow and rain and cold and four distinct seasons, much like what you have there and. \",\"startTime\":1744724723,\"endTime\":1744724731},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1744724726,\"endTime\":1744724728},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And all the colors in the blooms. But it''s different. The world is alive here. \",\"startTime\":1744724731,\"endTime\":1744724735},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744724735,\"endTime\":1744724736},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"The park is alive. \",\"startTime\":1744724735,\"endTime\":1744724738},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Animals, birds, right now they''re flowering and all sorts of fun stuff and.\",\"startTime\":1744724739,\"endTime\":1744724743},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"The plants are flowery, not the birds or animals. But it''s amazing. It''s really \",\"startTime\":1744724744,\"endTime\":1744724748},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744724748,\"endTime\":1744724748},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"wonderful out here. Yeah. New adventure for us. Yeah. OK. \",\"startTime\":1744724748,\"endTime\":1744724752},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Super cool. Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744724751,\"endTime\":1744724753},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"On the button down below, the more says for me, Icebreaker, What''s a skill besides AI fluency that you''re working to improve? \",\"startTime\":1744724755,\"endTime\":1744724764},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Either of us can go first. I''m trying to think.\",\"startTime\":1744724770,\"endTime\":1744724772},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I I would say.\",\"startTime\":1744724772,\"endTime\":1744724774},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Guess you probably would lump it under executive functioning but like I''m trying to find I guess I don''t know a good word for it but I''m trying to find the best way to streamline. \",\"startTime\":1744724777,\"endTime\":1744724792},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Workflows, particularly when it comes maybe like project management, maybe that''s where I would place my skill that I''m trying to work on. \",\"startTime\":1744724793,\"endTime\":1744724804},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Because I have a lot of things that are have on my plate here at my school and I also am building my own technology and technology businesses and. \",\"startTime\":1744724805,\"endTime\":1744724818},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And so juggling those things and having a 2 year old and family life and all that kind of stuff is challenging. So I would say yeah. \",\"startTime\":1744724820,\"endTime\":1744724827},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"A2 year old.\",\"startTime\":1744724826,\"endTime\":1744724827},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s so cool project management. You have a lot on your plate it sounds like. \",\"startTime\":1744724829,\"endTime\":1744724834},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Step.\",\"startTime\":1744724833,\"endTime\":1744724833},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I want to hear all about the, the kid and everything, but I know we''re being focused. I''m, I''m being focused. That''s one of my skills. I''m trying to, to \",\"startTime\":1744724834,\"endTime\":1744724841},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744724835,\"endTime\":1744724835},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"stay on, which I think is a subset of project management. \",\"startTime\":1744724841,\"endTime\":1744724845},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744724845,\"endTime\":1744724846},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"There seems to be so many wonderful things to go adventure and get after that. \",\"startTime\":1744724846,\"endTime\":1744724852},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I''m trying to stay focused on completing the things that I want to get done. \",\"startTime\":1744724852,\"endTime\":1744724857},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And if, if my completion means I dabbled with it, like you were talking about tech and I''m, and I, I''m guessing you''ve dabbled in tons of new apps and tech things. You don''t have to play the whole game and complete the game and finish \",\"startTime\":1744724858,\"endTime\":1744724869},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the whole thing Super Mario style to know what the game''s about and say I''m done. \",\"startTime\":1744724869,\"endTime\":1744724876},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And so for me, I think it''s about focusing and having that.\",\"startTime\":1744724877,\"endTime\":1744724881},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Clear expectations about what I''m supposed to do and then get that part done if it''s play for 15 minutes and play for 15 minutes, but then let it go. \",\"startTime\":1744724881,\"endTime\":1744724888},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm yeah, that''s what I''m working on.\",\"startTime\":1744724889,\"endTime\":1744724891},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s a good one.\",\"startTime\":1744724890,\"endTime\":1744724892},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, you must have pressed next because mine said partner''s ready.\",\"startTime\":1744724894,\"endTime\":1744724897},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1744724898,\"endTime\":1744724899},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And does your say ask or does yours say share? Mine says share.\",\"startTime\":1744724899,\"endTime\":1744724902},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Mine says ask how. How has AI changed your work as an educator or leader of \",\"startTime\":1744724902,\"endTime\":1744724907},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, so then you ask.\",\"startTime\":1744724904,\"endTime\":1744724905},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"educators so far? \",\"startTime\":1744724907,\"endTime\":1744724911},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh my. It feels like I now have assistance. I remember when I was in Washington, \",\"startTime\":1744724914,\"endTime\":1744724919},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I was driving all over the state. \",\"startTime\":1744724919,\"endTime\":1744724924},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I love the hour or two hour drives to just reflect and think, but I.\",\"startTime\":1744724924,\"endTime\":1744724928},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Many, many times had wanted.\",\"startTime\":1744724930,\"endTime\":1744724932},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"An assistant. I''m like, where can I get a university or a new graduate?\",\"startTime\":1744724933,\"endTime\":1744724937},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Somebody who like wants to do education, who wants to facilitate learning, who''s hungry to grow, has some knowledge, but they can like take notes and we can dialogue back and forth while we drive. That would be so cool. And then go on \",\"startTime\":1744724937,\"endTime\":1744724953},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1744724938,\"endTime\":1744724938},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"site. And now I, I have that in my pocket. I''m using my phone as my assistant \",\"startTime\":1744724953,\"endTime\":1744724958},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and I''m building AI assistance specifically to help me do different type of. \",\"startTime\":1744724958,\"endTime\":1744724963},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Worker tasks, just like I would have, oh, I want to hire another student, I want to hire another person. I want a different assistant. Hey, you get in the \",\"startTime\":1744724968,\"endTime\":1744724974},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"back now. We just got gas. I want to talk with Mike in the front, ''cause he''s \",\"startTime\":1744724974,\"endTime\":1744724977},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"all about Ed tech stuff. And that''s what it feels like now. It''s really changed \",\"startTime\":1744724977,\"endTime\":1744724981},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that I have. \",\"startTime\":1744724981,\"endTime\":1744724982},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I feel supported, more supported now than I ever have. Yeah. OK. I''m gonna press. \",\"startTime\":1744724982,\"endTime\":1744724985},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I''m gonna press more. I don''t know what I was supposed to look for. OK, Yeah, \",\"startTime\":1744724985,\"endTime\":1744724989},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes, love that.\",\"startTime\":1744724986,\"endTime\":1744724987},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I''m using ChatGPT to to do that. \",\"startTime\":1744724989,\"endTime\":1744724992},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"To build my AI assistance.\",\"startTime\":1744724994,\"endTime\":1744724996},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And it''s been way more efficient. How about you? I''m curious before we hit the \",\"startTime\":1744724997,\"endTime\":1744725000},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"next one, how''s it changed your work? \",\"startTime\":1744725000,\"endTime\":1744725003},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I think much the same. You know, I think when I get into sort of like a state \",\"startTime\":1744725003,\"endTime\":1744725008},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"of flow, you almost feel like superhuman where it''s like you have this, like you, you have something to constantly keep pushing your thinking and augmenting the work that you do. \",\"startTime\":1744725008,\"endTime\":1744725021},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, I use like ChatGPT in much the same way. Umm like I, I have, I don''t have \",\"startTime\":1744725021,\"endTime\":1744725027},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"a long commute, but I have about 30 to 40 minutes. And in those commutes, I \",\"startTime\":1744725027,\"endTime\":1744725033},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"often will just turn on ChatGPT and just talk like reflections like post reflections on the day or something that came up or like if I have ideas, I just brain dump like so I use it quite frequently for the same purposes and especially. \",\"startTime\":1744725033,\"endTime\":1744725051},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Speech first or it can be speech first like that. I just as I''m driving, I just \",\"startTime\":1744725051,\"endTime\":1744725055},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"talked to my phone and just like dump all the notes there and then kind of like process later. \",\"startTime\":1744725055,\"endTime\":1744725062},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I love it. I love it. I I''m doing similarly and that sometimes when I won''t \",\"startTime\":1744725063,\"endTime\":1744725069},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725069,\"endTime\":1744725069},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"have Internet service, I''ll use a recording app. \",\"startTime\":1744725069,\"endTime\":1744725072},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Whether it''s Otter or my phone.\",\"startTime\":1744725072,\"endTime\":1744725074},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I''ll record it straight to there, then take the transcript and then upload to my GPT assistant or general GPT, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1744725074,\"endTime\":1744725081},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yep. Yeah, yes.\",\"startTime\":1744725079,\"endTime\":1744725082},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it. And that way then you can just let your mind wander and just \",\"startTime\":1744725081,\"endTime\":1744725084},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Babble and you''re like, and then you takes this idea and that idea and then it puts them all together for you when you''re done. \",\"startTime\":1744725084,\"endTime\":1744725089},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725089,\"endTime\":1744725091},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I love it.\",\"startTime\":1744725089,\"endTime\":1744725092},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Case.\",\"startTime\":1744725096,\"endTime\":1744725097},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm, take turn sharing.\",\"startTime\":1744725097,\"endTime\":1744725099},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"How do you think AI will change the role of learners in the future? Oh you go \",\"startTime\":1744725099,\"endTime\":1744725103},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"first this time? I''m curious to hear what you''re saying thinking. \",\"startTime\":1744725103,\"endTime\":1744725107},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I, I, I think we need to, So I think what I see around me in other schools is that most people are planning for like AI applications. \",\"startTime\":1744725110,\"endTime\":1744725124},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And sort of like the furthest extent of that planning is like focused on like AI tutors, which I think can be really valuable for our learners in in a variety of like context. \",\"startTime\":1744725124,\"endTime\":1744725136},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm. Though that conversation seems to be pretty emergent.\",\"startTime\":1744725137,\"endTime\":1744725141},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"It''s still not really clear like how schools will implement these tools unless they''re like in a like a conmego type thing where it''s like built into a structured framework. \",\"startTime\":1744725143,\"endTime\":1744725154},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, but I think we need to be thinking about the world of where AI agents are the norm. Where? \",\"startTime\":1744725155,\"endTime\":1744725162},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"We are no longer the smartest.\",\"startTime\":1744725163,\"endTime\":1744725165},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, species on that planet, so to speak.\",\"startTime\":1744725167,\"endTime\":1744725171},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, it sounds like AG is coming within the next, you know, certainly within the next 10 years, probably within the next five years. \",\"startTime\":1744725171,\"endTime\":1744725178},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Maybe even the student is within the next couple of years. Umm, and that''s the \",\"startTime\":1744725178,\"endTime\":1744725183},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"kind of world we have to be sort of planning for is like the post kind of post like knowledge work world. What does it mean when? \",\"startTime\":1744725183,\"endTime\":1744725192},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Intelligence is abundant and accessible and.\",\"startTime\":1744725194,\"endTime\":1744725198},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"You know, a lot of the, you know, traditional knowledge work jobs that we''ve had. \",\"startTime\":1744725199,\"endTime\":1744725202},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Are are no longer the norm and I think, umm, understanding how we can use AI to augment our capabilities as humans, I think is really an important part for us to impart on our learners, even in in high school, like they''re they''re gonna see that too. It says we don''t start at kindergarten necessarily right away, \",\"startTime\":1744725203,\"endTime\":1744725220},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"but we need to start thinking about people who are entering the workforce now. \",\"startTime\":1744725220,\"endTime\":1744725224},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So that''s my that''s. \",\"startTime\":1744725224,\"endTime\":1744725228},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Tell me more about the role like like with all of those things like with the API and I I love your your. \",\"startTime\":1744725228,\"endTime\":1744725234},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Real clear words around augmenting who we are.\",\"startTime\":1744725236,\"endTime\":1744725239},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So what role would the learner have in your in your vision of the future then? \",\"startTime\":1744725240,\"endTime\":1744725246},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1744725258,\"endTime\":1744725259},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1744725295,\"endTime\":1744725295},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think we do a really terrible job of fostering sort of like creativity and dreaming and play in our schools, and I think those are really, really important. \",\"startTime\":1744725307,\"endTime\":1744725307},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Your characteristics or skills that we, we need to like, uh, sort of repatriate for lack of better word and and sort of center education around, I think. \",\"startTime\":1744725307,\"endTime\":1744725308},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, we need learners to adopt the role of problem seeker. Umm, find problems \",\"startTime\":1744725308,\"endTime\":1744725313},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"in your life, in your community, in your world, and use these tools to solve those problems. Dream up new things that don''t exist. \",\"startTime\":1744725313,\"endTime\":1744725320},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And, and not just dream them up, but I think, you know, we, we, we''re going to AI is, is, is rapidly changing our digital world. It''s, I don''t think long \",\"startTime\":1744725320,\"endTime\":1744725329},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"In in terms of the role of the learner, umm, it''s it''s like solving problems both in the digital and physical world, but also then dreaming up new things. \",\"startTime\":1744725321,\"endTime\":1744725329},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"You know, I think and and sort of learning to play with these technologies in a way that. \",\"startTime\":1744725324,\"endTime\":1744725328},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"You know you can. You can build anything bespoke for yourself, like personal \",\"startTime\":1744725325,\"endTime\":1744725328},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Etsy store. \",\"startTime\":1744725328,\"endTime\":1744725329},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"before we can start manifesting those ideas in, in the physical world either through 3D printing and robotics and that kind of stuff. So. \",\"startTime\":1744725329,\"endTime\":1744725339},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh I''m totally with you, I love that focus on dreaming. Umm, we should do some \",\"startTime\":1744725332,\"endTime\":1744725336},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"dream dream camps. Uh, I''m all for doing a dream camp. I got to do one last \",\"startTime\":1744725336,\"endTime\":1744725340},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"year in 2020. \",\"startTime\":1744725340,\"endTime\":1744725344},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What is it? Yeah, 2024. It was last spring, last March.\",\"startTime\":1744725345,\"endTime\":1744725348},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It was amazing and got some grant funding to do that, but it was exactly like what you''re saying. \",\"startTime\":1744725349,\"endTime\":1744725354},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I didn''t know how important that was, but I''ll say the same thing. We have \",\"startTime\":1744725354,\"endTime\":1744725360},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes.\",\"startTime\":1744725357,\"endTime\":1744725361},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"to become dreamers to think more about what''s impossible. And I think also our \",\"startTime\":1744725360,\"endTime\":1744725365},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"role has to change to project managers, like you said. \",\"startTime\":1744725365,\"endTime\":1744725370},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725366,\"endTime\":1744725367},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Because there''s so much to do that we''re inundated with it. I think we have \",\"startTime\":1744725371,\"endTime\":1744725375},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725374,\"endTime\":1744725374},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"to really become more managers of our own learning and with the AI assistance, the API tools, all these different things that we will be getting and students have today or learners. I''m a learner too. \",\"startTime\":1744725375,\"endTime\":1744725387},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"MMM MMM.\",\"startTime\":1744725382,\"endTime\":1744725388},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What we have today as learners, those things, we, we have so many of them. What''s \",\"startTime\":1744725387,\"endTime\":1744725391},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that? What''s the, the path that we''re gonna do? \",\"startTime\":1744725391,\"endTime\":1744725395},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I want, I need to spend time with my 2 year old. I need to spend time with my \",\"startTime\":1744725397,\"endTime\":1744725401},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes.\",\"startTime\":1744725401,\"endTime\":1744725403},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"own self. Jeff, you need to sleep. Jeff, you need to do this, this and this. \",\"startTime\":1744725401,\"endTime\":1744725405},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So I think that role of being a manager of our own learning because I might not be able to dream my cool Etsy store like you were saying. \",\"startTime\":1744725405,\"endTime\":1744725413},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But I might be needing to now manage even my dreams and my my time about my dreams. \",\"startTime\":1744725414,\"endTime\":1744725420},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And how many of those dreams are going to be able to pursue Jeff? What''s realistic? \",\"startTime\":1744725421,\"endTime\":1744725424},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What''s worth your time to do that all? \",\"startTime\":1744725424,\"endTime\":1744725428},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725424,\"endTime\":1744725425},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"All of those kind of things, much like I would say we''ve seen today in the last decade, the management, a learner or a user of technology. \",\"startTime\":1744725428,\"endTime\":1744725438},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Right. MMM.\",\"startTime\":1744725429,\"endTime\":1744725432},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"When do you put your phone down? Because you can be on YouTube all night. You \",\"startTime\":1744725439,\"endTime\":1744725442},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"you''ll never get to the end of the Internet. You have to self manage. So I think \",\"startTime\":1744725442,\"endTime\":1744725444},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725444,\"endTime\":1744725445},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"there''s something about self management. \",\"startTime\":1744725444,\"endTime\":1744725447},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Project management and and that that creativity.\",\"startTime\":1744725448,\"endTime\":1744725452},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Aspect I''m. I''m right with you. Yeah. Oh, this is Rich.\",\"startTime\":1744725452,\"endTime\":1744725456},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725453,\"endTime\":1744725453},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"That''s a good. That''s a really good add on. I think it''s like information overload. \",\"startTime\":1744725456,\"endTime\":1744725461},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I mean, our kids are already there with social media. We need to be thinking \",\"startTime\":1744725461,\"endTime\":1744725464},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"about ways that we can help them manage that for sure. That''s a really important \",\"startTime\":1744725464,\"endTime\":1744725466},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"point. \",\"startTime\":1744725466,\"endTime\":1744725469},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Have you found that to like with your ''cause you and I both have done the AI tool along the way when we''re driving, do you feel like? \",\"startTime\":1744725470,\"endTime\":1744725477},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Information overload. It''s not that it''s we''re finding the end of the Internet \",\"startTime\":1744725477,\"endTime\":1744725480},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"or watching all the YouTube. \",\"startTime\":1744725480,\"endTime\":1744725483},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725481,\"endTime\":1744725481},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Videos. But now it''s I have a new and read all of the responses from my AI assistants. \",\"startTime\":1744725484,\"endTime\":1744725487},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I keep feeding it and there''s too much now to read. I don''t have time even to \",\"startTime\":1744725487,\"endTime\":1744725491},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725491,\"endTime\":1744725492},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"manage that. \",\"startTime\":1744725491,\"endTime\":1744725494},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725492,\"endTime\":1744725493},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I mean, I think there''s there, there are, there are things that I dropped. \",\"startTime\":1744725495,\"endTime\":1744725499},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So I, I mean, I guess like part of what I''ve been trying to do is like organize that that part of my life now, since it''s becoming sort of a central part of my workflow is like organizing it in a way that can work for me. \",\"startTime\":1744725499,\"endTime\":1744725512},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And I''m putting all of my like kind of reflections and notes into like a project, my writing project in chat JPT. So that way it''s kind of there and I set up. \",\"startTime\":1744725514,\"endTime\":1744725525},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"To to kind of like find like find specific things, not necessarily within the project, but things that I''m really focused on. \",\"startTime\":1744725527,\"endTime\":1744725536},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And I actually wanna build, I just, I wanna build an app that''s like I, I love Pomodoro timers. Like I''m a sucker for them. I think they''re really helpful \",\"startTime\":1744725537,\"endTime\":1744725546},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"in like focusing, you know, in 20 to 25 minute increments. So I wanna build \",\"startTime\":1744725546,\"endTime\":1744725550},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"a tool that I can use to like actually focus my work and then manage different projects within using that Pomodoro timer to like check off tasks, like tie them all together is like what I would like, I would love like a life planner. \",\"startTime\":1744725550,\"endTime\":1744725562},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Like none of them are like perfect though, you know? \",\"startTime\":1744725562,\"endTime\":1744725567},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1744725567,\"endTime\":1744725567},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It''s like we''re still in control at the end of the day. And I''m like, I want \",\"startTime\":1744725568,\"endTime\":1744725572},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"you to do it because you can do it. But wait, I haven''t. I haven''t built you \",\"startTime\":1744725572,\"endTime\":1744725575},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, right.\",\"startTime\":1744725574,\"endTime\":1744725575},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"yet. I haven''t invented you yet, and I don''t know how it''s gonna work. \",\"startTime\":1744725575,\"endTime\":1744725579},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725579,\"endTime\":1744725580},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I love it. OK, next one, and then I''m going to add in the word lovable. \",\"startTime\":1744725581,\"endTime\":1744725586},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Have you seen the AI tool called Lovable? It builds apps. It''s like ChatGPT, \",\"startTime\":1744725586,\"endTime\":1744725591},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"but it builds the apps for you. That''s crazy. \",\"startTime\":1744725591,\"endTime\":1744725596},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725592,\"endTime\":1744725594},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725595,\"endTime\":1744725596},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I was talking to Mike before and he said that you guys built.\",\"startTime\":1744725597,\"endTime\":1744725601},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725601,\"endTime\":1744725601},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm side by with umm with lovable umm.\",\"startTime\":1744725602,\"endTime\":1744725605},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And I was like, yeah, it feels familiar because like, I built, I, I built a couple tools there. \",\"startTime\":1744725606,\"endTime\":1744725613},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"One that I''m actually gonna probably take to like market, I think for technology leaders. \",\"startTime\":1744725614,\"endTime\":1744725620},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So, yeah, it''s like it, it''s so. And it comes back to the the the question we \",\"startTime\":1744725622,\"endTime\":1744725626},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"just had, which is like. \",\"startTime\":1744725626,\"endTime\":1744725630},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I found a problem in like my world of tech leadership and I''m now building a bespoke tool for it. And I think for educators, which is part of the reason \",\"startTime\":1744725630,\"endTime\":1744725640},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I, I really like side by for that reason is like that you can share with other people within the network like these, these insights that you''re capturing. \",\"startTime\":1744725640,\"endTime\":1744725650},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And hopefully I think building your own tools is going to be sort of a path forward in our future. Helping educators see that I think is really important. \",\"startTime\":1744725650,\"endTime\":1744725660},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, my brain is on fire with what you''re saying. Umm, I''m gonna stay unfocused. \",\"startTime\":1744725664,\"endTime\":1744725666},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s my skill I''m working on. \",\"startTime\":1744725666,\"endTime\":1744725669},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, all right, read.\",\"startTime\":1744725669,\"endTime\":1744725673},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love. Thanks for sharing all that. OK.\",\"startTime\":1744725672,\"endTime\":1744725674},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Sure, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725674,\"endTime\":1744725674},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Read the challenges under more and choose one all right. I''m also mindful of \",\"startTime\":1744725677,\"endTime\":1744725681},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"time, so I know that you got your stuff happening so. \",\"startTime\":1744725681,\"endTime\":1744725685},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"We''ve really dug in deep to the last couple of questions. So whenever you''re \",\"startTime\":1744725686,\"endTime\":1744725690},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yep, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1744725690,\"endTime\":1744725692},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"good, I''m I''m flexible here too. OK, All right. \",\"startTime\":1744725690,\"endTime\":1744725693},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I got time. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725692,\"endTime\":1744725693},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, challenge one, Share your story. We''re all here for different reasons. In \",\"startTime\":1744725696,\"endTime\":1744725699},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"your words, what series are challenged to? \",\"startTime\":1744725699,\"endTime\":1744725702},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Solve a problem like what''s a problem or practice? Oh.\",\"startTime\":1744725702,\"endTime\":1744725706},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I think if we solved #2A problem of practice, I think we could spend like about 5 minutes because you and I will be like 5 weeks into solving the problem of practice. I think we get that that deep really quickly. That''s my guess from \",\"startTime\":1744725706,\"endTime\":1744725718},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"what you''re talking about. \",\"startTime\":1744725718,\"endTime\":1744725721},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725721,\"endTime\":1744725721},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Your pick. Your pick.\",\"startTime\":1744725723,\"endTime\":1744725724},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725723,\"endTime\":1744725724},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I''ll do.\",\"startTime\":1744725726,\"endTime\":1744725726},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"A challenge while I share a story, I guess.\",\"startTime\":1744725729,\"endTime\":1744725731},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so I.\",\"startTime\":1744725732,\"endTime\":1744725733},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1744725732,\"endTime\":1744725732},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I am very so I''ve been a lifelong educator, I guess. Like I don''t know if it''s \",\"startTime\":1744725737,\"endTime\":1744725742},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"like my my specific story to like how I ended up in sci-fi or like I guess more. \",\"startTime\":1744725742,\"endTime\":1744725747},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I guess just my background like lifelong educator and I think a real pivotal moment for me, like I was, I was probably a very like mid tier educator for like my first couple of years. Honestly, I, I was interested in like all these \",\"startTime\":1744725747,\"endTime\":1744725759},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"different things and like soccer coaching was like my big thing at the time and. \",\"startTime\":1744725759,\"endTime\":1744725767},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And I, I came across, I had the opportunity, I was asked at my school to like lead our. \",\"startTime\":1744725768,\"endTime\":1744725773},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Development of our online program in around 2010 and.\",\"startTime\":1744725774,\"endTime\":1744725778},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, and that sort of like that catalyst, umm, totally changed my career trajectory, like totally umm, because what I started to find is how technology can really change the way that we approach teaching and learning. And from from there I \",\"startTime\":1744725779,\"endTime\":1744725794},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"was asked to. \",\"startTime\":1744725794,\"endTime\":1744725798},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Actually, before that, I was actually asked to lead a pilot for iPads in our district. \",\"startTime\":1744725801,\"endTime\":1744725805},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And, and what I found was that like, umm, learning through exploration, learning \",\"startTime\":1744725805,\"endTime\":1744725809},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"through play was like far more powerful than any slide deck I could ever create or worksheet I could ever ask the kids to do or presentation I could ask them to give. \",\"startTime\":1744725809,\"endTime\":1744725821},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And so I changed my entire classroom. I, I adopted like sort of gamification \",\"startTime\":1744725822,\"endTime\":1744725826},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"principles. I built out Google Classroom kind of using Google Drive because \",\"startTime\":1744725826,\"endTime\":1744725831},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"the classroom wasn''t available then and. \",\"startTime\":1744725831,\"endTime\":1744725836},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"The rest is kind of history. I went down the rabbit hole of project based learning, \",\"startTime\":1744725837,\"endTime\":1744725841},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"exploration, like I said, learning through play, learning through building. \",\"startTime\":1744725841,\"endTime\":1744725845},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And to me that was the start of like, like I said, total trajectory, career change and have kind of followed my passion for technology and how that can enable new teaching and learning. And so that''s what brought me here to where \",\"startTime\":1744725845,\"endTime\":1744725857},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I am. \",\"startTime\":1744725857,\"endTime\":1744725861},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Hmm. Oh, wow. What a great story. That''s pretty transformational. And not just \",\"startTime\":1744725864,\"endTime\":1744725868},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"pretty transformable, That''s incredibly transformational that your experience made you go back to the classroom and just like, no flipping it. We got to do \",\"startTime\":1744725868,\"endTime\":1744725876},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1744725869,\"endTime\":1744725870},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, I had a student teacher and then.\",\"startTime\":1744725876,\"endTime\":1744725879},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"something way different. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1744725876,\"endTime\":1744725880},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Which was kind of like, was helpful for me to like sort of see and you know, like they, you, you sort of teach the way you were taught. And we had like, \",\"startTime\":1744725879,\"endTime\":1744725887},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"there was nothing wrong with him. He was a wonderful person. And like, he, he, \",\"startTime\":1744725887,\"endTime\":1744725890},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I''m sure he would turn out to be a great teacher too, in his own right. But \",\"startTime\":1744725890,\"endTime\":1744725894},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"what I saw was like, I was like, yeah, I don''t want to do this anymore in that way. And it''s just not, it''s not enough. And I''ve never been one to sort of \",\"startTime\":1744725894,\"endTime\":1744725902},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"like. \",\"startTime\":1744725902,\"endTime\":1744725906},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Slow down. I always want to go 1000 miles an hour and keep pushing. And you \",\"startTime\":1744725907,\"endTime\":1744725911},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"know, and this has become my outlet, my technology leadership here. I built \",\"startTime\":1744725911,\"endTime\":1744725915},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"a company. \",\"startTime\":1744725915,\"endTime\":1744725919},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Left, left the company and now I''m on the board of it. I''m on the board of another \",\"startTime\":1744725920,\"endTime\":1744725924},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"company. We''re we''re doing a lot of work with lovable there too, as well, building \",\"startTime\":1744725924,\"endTime\":1744725928},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"my own LLC. So it''s like, you know, just it, it totally changed my life for \",\"startTime\":1744725928,\"endTime\":1744725932},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"sure. \",\"startTime\":1744725932,\"endTime\":1744725936},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Wow, wow.\",\"startTime\":1744725936,\"endTime\":1744725937},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What a wonderful example that you gave to your kids and your students. That \",\"startTime\":1744725937,\"endTime\":1744725942},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"There.\",\"startTime\":1744725941,\"endTime\":1744725942},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"is, I''m thinking and the student teacher of being so transparent similarly on my story, diving in and then having those transformative experiences go. \",\"startTime\":1744725942,\"endTime\":1744725952},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725948,\"endTime\":1744725949},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"One thing that I in my story that''s come through and through and I realized that I was a classic high school math teacher. I did that for 17 years at 1 \",\"startTime\":1744725953,\"endTime\":1744725962},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"high school in Spokane and I did the tech stuff and along the way I was doing TI89, how to use the calculators or this or that because I''m like, hey, we got a tool, why don''t we use it? \",\"startTime\":1744725962,\"endTime\":1744725975},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1744725966,\"endTime\":1744725966},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And computers and computer software and technology and putting in projects into my classroom. \",\"startTime\":1744725976,\"endTime\":1744725981},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1744725977,\"endTime\":1744725977},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But it really wasn''t until.\",\"startTime\":1744725981,\"endTime\":1744725982},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Was 2005 we opened up Spokane virtual learning. It was when in Spokane we wanted \",\"startTime\":1744725985,\"endTime\":1744725990},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"to do online learning and. \",\"startTime\":1744725990,\"endTime\":1744725994},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Hilarious. COVID was at the 15 year anniversary. I had left the district by \",\"startTime\":1744725995,\"endTime\":1744725999},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"then, but it challenged me to think about and really I was kind of bored in the classroom. I had done the classic, taught like I was. \",\"startTime\":1744725999,\"endTime\":1744726007},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Used to teaching because that''s what I had experienced from all these things and would like listen to other people and read a lot, but if you haven''t experienced it yourself it''s really hard to teach that way. \",\"startTime\":1744726008,\"endTime\":1744726018},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726015,\"endTime\":1744726016},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And uh, I was walking home with nothing in my hands at the end of the day with my contract said I could and I was kinda like. \",\"startTime\":1744726018,\"endTime\":1744726026},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726019,\"endTime\":1744726020},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And they gave me the chance to write a course for freshman math like Algebra one or integrated 1. \",\"startTime\":1744726027,\"endTime\":1744726034},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I''m sitting there in 2005 going.\",\"startTime\":1744726034,\"endTime\":1744726037},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Wait a second, may have Google at home. I don''t even get to see these kids. \",\"startTime\":1744726039,\"endTime\":1744726042},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"They have all of these software bits. They have Mathematica, they have this, \",\"startTime\":1744726042,\"endTime\":1744726045},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"they have that. \",\"startTime\":1744726045,\"endTime\":1744726048},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726048,\"endTime\":1744726048},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"They have they have calculator emulators and I know it was only 2005 compared to today, but still like how do you write curriculum and how do you ask or the the main question of how do you facilitate learning? That''s what I realized \",\"startTime\":1744726049,\"endTime\":1744726062},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Bien, bien.\",\"startTime\":1744726055,\"endTime\":1744726056},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it was and then when I hopped into that boat. \",\"startTime\":1744726062,\"endTime\":1744726066},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Realizing, holy crap, how do you facilitate learning? And it became for me that \",\"startTime\":1744726067,\"endTime\":1744726071},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that moment of transparency where I was really authentically growing as a learner and I didn''t know all the answers. That''s when I got the best. That''s when it \",\"startTime\":1744726071,\"endTime\":1744726080},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"changed for me. And it was encouraging to hear you say that for your students \",\"startTime\":1744726080,\"endTime\":1744726084},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and for your student teacher. They saw you in that wobbly phase. They saw you \",\"startTime\":1744726084,\"endTime\":1744726088},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"figuring it out. They still see you figuring out today. And now I know, ''cause \",\"startTime\":1744726088,\"endTime\":1744726093},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I''m just passionate about how we learn and what works and what doesn''t work. \",\"startTime\":1744726093,\"endTime\":1744726097},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Is that that''s a key component? Is that we see each other as learners?\",\"startTime\":1744726097,\"endTime\":1744726101},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And that, as you said, executive functioning, we get out of the back of our head afraid because, oh wait, Mike''s demonstrating that he''s a learner too. \",\"startTime\":1744726101,\"endTime\":1744726109},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I feel safe and I''m a learner too. I feel like I belong. He''s inviting me \",\"startTime\":1744726109,\"endTime\":1744726112},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"in. And then I can get into my executive functioning and I can really engage \",\"startTime\":1744726112,\"endTime\":1744726116},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"as a problem solver. So it helps us. I''ve learned in my practice and not just \",\"startTime\":1744726116,\"endTime\":1744726119},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the research I''ve been reading. \",\"startTime\":1744726119,\"endTime\":1744726123},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That when we''re transparent and putting ourselves at that zone of proximal development and learning and being vulnerable about it to our students, our learners, our colleagues. \",\"startTime\":1744726123,\"endTime\":1744726133},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1744726130,\"endTime\":1744726130},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"We''re all better for it, so it''s fun to hear you say that and just embracing it. Oh. \",\"startTime\":1744726134,\"endTime\":1744726138},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726136,\"endTime\":1744726137},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And it''s funny that I mean, I think there''s like definitely the one of the threads that seems very common there is that there''s there was this sort of a moment where your reflection on like your practice revealed sort of like a. \",\"startTime\":1744726140,\"endTime\":1744726153},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Maybe a flaw in the lodge much like mine did. It was like a flaw in the logic \",\"startTime\":1744726154,\"endTime\":1744726157},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"of like, well, if I if I tell you to do, you will, you will do and therefore you will learn. It was like. \",\"startTime\":1744726157,\"endTime\":1744726163},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"The technology has made, has commoditized, has commoditized information 1st through the Internet, you know, which we both experienced in that 2000, early 2000s there and then, you know, software and now AI are commoditizing. \",\"startTime\":1744726164,\"endTime\":1744726182},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Knowledge and intelligence. And so like, like asking that same question of like, \",\"startTime\":1744726183,\"endTime\":1744726188},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"OK, now what? Because they have all these new tools, like what do we do next? \",\"startTime\":1744726188,\"endTime\":1744726192},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I think that''s really the critical question that we need to be. \",\"startTime\":1744726192,\"endTime\":1744726197},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm answering and attempting to answer. Umm, cause to your point it''s like there''s \",\"startTime\":1744726199,\"endTime\":1744726202},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"no clear right or wrong way to do that yet. \",\"startTime\":1744726202,\"endTime\":1744726206},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And so as, as the history teacher, like there''s, there''s definitely some comfort \",\"startTime\":1744726207,\"endTime\":1744726211},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"in knowing that like these problems in a way have have been seen before and we have to take lessons learned and apply them now because we''re faced with with similar challenges. So I, you know, really resonated with me what you said \",\"startTime\":1744726211,\"endTime\":1744726224},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"about your experience too. \",\"startTime\":1744726224,\"endTime\":1744726229},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Well I really appreciate it. You are an amazing learner and this is \",\"startTime\":1744726231,\"endTime\":1744726234},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"a wonderful way to start my day. \",\"startTime\":1744726234,\"endTime\":1744726237},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, likewise.\",\"startTime\":1744726237,\"endTime\":1744726240},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"All right, partner ready. Thanks.\",\"startTime\":1744726237,\"endTime\":1744726240},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, before we read the the card, I see it says end at the bottom. When we press \",\"startTime\":1744726240,\"endTime\":1744726245},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"end you''re done. It''s hanging up. That''s like hang up the call just for FYI. \",\"startTime\":1744726245,\"endTime\":1744726250},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726246,\"endTime\":1744726246},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"OK, OK, cool.\",\"startTime\":1744726248,\"endTime\":1744726249},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm so, uh, thank your partner and share one thing you''ve learned from them. \",\"startTime\":1744726252,\"endTime\":1744726255},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Mike, I wanna say thanks. And I learned from you that in ChatGPT, the projects, \",\"startTime\":1744726255,\"endTime\":1744726259},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I have like 3 folders now, but I''m not using them at all. I''m like, I, I just \",\"startTime\":1744726259,\"endTime\":1744726263},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"straight up on this. I''m trying a little bit, but like, wait, this isn''t and \",\"startTime\":1744726263,\"endTime\":1744726267},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I try to drag something, put it. \",\"startTime\":1744726267,\"endTime\":1744726270},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726268,\"endTime\":1744726269},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I learned today from you. Thank you so much for the the the bump moving forward. \",\"startTime\":1744726271,\"endTime\":1744726276},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But that you can have your threads in the project folder, but then you can ask for summaries in that project folder. That''s what I was hearing from you. \",\"startTime\":1744726276,\"endTime\":1744726285},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So thanks for sharing that and that you can use project folders to do that kind of stuff like, Oh my God, I gotta do that. \",\"startTime\":1744726285,\"endTime\":1744726291},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726286,\"endTime\":1744726287},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So thank you.\",\"startTime\":1744726291,\"endTime\":1744726292},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, of course.\",\"startTime\":1744726292,\"endTime\":1744726294},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And the one thing that like I, I think you just like really stuck with \",\"startTime\":1744726295,\"endTime\":1744726300},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"me. You were just saying about your experience and your story is like and oftentimes \",\"startTime\":1744726300,\"endTime\":1744726305},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"like in sort of like doing mode and action mode. \",\"startTime\":1744726305,\"endTime\":1744726310},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"You know, like I there are times where checking off boxes is like the first thing that comes to mind. It isn''t necessarily the people and the individual \",\"startTime\":1744726311,\"endTime\":1744726320},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"stories and like sort of the invitation. \",\"startTime\":1744726320,\"endTime\":1744726324},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"To the table for stuff, because we''ve been working a lot on our AI strategy and I''m starting to encounter the first layers of friction there. \",\"startTime\":1744726324,\"endTime\":1744726333},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"It''s, it''s gone beyond like, oh, this is a really nice tool that like, we''re gonna move, we''re moving on this stuff and umm. \",\"startTime\":1744726334,\"endTime\":1744726341},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Giving people the space to to, you know, voice those concerns and to feel vulnerable and to learn and to ask the questions like is am I going to lose my job? Like \",\"startTime\":1744726342,\"endTime\":1744726351},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"the answer is no, but we need to like be moving forward and thinking about these big questions. \",\"startTime\":1744726351,\"endTime\":1744726360},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Which is probably uncomfortable for a lot of people. That''s something that I \",\"startTime\":1744726360,\"endTime\":1744726366},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"learned today or really resonated with me. What you were saying today is sort \",\"startTime\":1744726366,\"endTime\":1744726371},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"of that invitation to the table and, you know, meeting people where they are. \",\"startTime\":1744726371,\"endTime\":1744726376},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Although it can be challenging with some of the.\",\"startTime\":1744726377,\"endTime\":1744726380},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"The stories that people craft to to sort of explain their thinking. But yeah. \",\"startTime\":1744726382,\"endTime\":1744726386},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It''s hilarious. Uh, all I can say now is that if you''re 2 years old, like your \",\"startTime\":1744726387,\"endTime\":1744726390},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"little one, uh, or you''re 200 years old or whatever it is, we''re gonna be able to live too soon. \",\"startTime\":1744726390,\"endTime\":1744726397},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"We''re human and that''s why, like, I have to keep boiling it down to it just like, oh, they''re human. Yep. We''re we''re humans and we''re learners. All right. \",\"startTime\":1744726398,\"endTime\":1744726403},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726400,\"endTime\":1744726400},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So that''s where it is. Oh, you''re going through that one. That''s what we all \",\"startTime\":1744726403,\"endTime\":1744726406},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yep, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1744726404,\"endTime\":1744726406},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"do as learners. Like, I have to keep like stepping back and going more meta \",\"startTime\":1744726406,\"endTime\":1744726409},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1744726408,\"endTime\":1744726408},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and going, oh, yeah, you''re, you''re a learner. Oh, that''s why you''re acting \",\"startTime\":1744726409,\"endTime\":1744726412},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that way. And I like how you called it the best. Or like getting uncomfortable. \",\"startTime\":1744726412,\"endTime\":1744726415},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1744726415,\"endTime\":1744726418},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726415,\"endTime\":1744726419},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Mike, this has been wonderful. I wanted to say a couple things. One, I''m on \",\"startTime\":1744726419,\"endTime\":1744726422},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the back end. My role is to support the community and to facilitate conversations \",\"startTime\":1744726422,\"endTime\":1744726426},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726423,\"endTime\":1744726423},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"like this. \",\"startTime\":1744726426,\"endTime\":1744726429},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"You definitely have a ton of technology and expertise that the community needs. \",\"startTime\":1744726430,\"endTime\":1744726435},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And our hope would be is that you have more conversations with others to stimulate your own growth as you stimulate theirs. And I don''t know what else would happen. \",\"startTime\":1744726435,\"endTime\":1744726443},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726441,\"endTime\":1744726441},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I will say for me, I''m like, I''m gonna put in the e-mail that I''m gonna send you later. Hey, if you wanna meet to do like let''s plan on building out a timer \",\"startTime\":1744726443,\"endTime\":1744726451},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and you wanted to do. \",\"startTime\":1744726451,\"endTime\":1744726455},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Put 20 minutes on a timer to just Co think and I''ll be your partner and I''ll just ask questions or I''ll do the the side work or whatever. I would be game \",\"startTime\":1744726456,\"endTime\":1744726465},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"for that. I would also love something similar to just brainstorm more about. \",\"startTime\":1744726465,\"endTime\":1744726469},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What we''re doing here at side by or just using other tools like.\",\"startTime\":1744726469,\"endTime\":1744726473},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Jeff, how do you use project folders to take and do XY and Z that you''re trying to get done? I would love that. Just specific work time with you at some point. \",\"startTime\":1744726473,\"endTime\":1744726482},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726478,\"endTime\":1744726479},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That was a big flashing red light and I put it on my paper here. So I want to \",\"startTime\":1744726482,\"endTime\":1744726486},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726484,\"endTime\":1744726484},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"say say thanks. And if there''s any questions about any of the stuff that''s happening \",\"startTime\":1744726486,\"endTime\":1744726490},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1744726487,\"endTime\":1744726488},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"at Side By or you just have feedback, We are building the app, Mike, and we have Diego now on team. \",\"startTime\":1744726490,\"endTime\":1744726498},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"They''re building the app and as you know, building apps and tech stuff is always fun and. \",\"startTime\":1744726499,\"endTime\":1744726505},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1744726502,\"endTime\":1744726502},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726505,\"endTime\":1744726505},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I won''t go down that rabbit hole, but we''re building and as we have, as we are doing things, you know, this is beta testing your, your or alpha testing for, for better use of words. \",\"startTime\":1744726507,\"endTime\":1744726518},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And any feedback or ideas or thoughts, feel free to send them my way. I''ll take \",\"startTime\":1744726518,\"endTime\":1744726521},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"care of them and pass them to the team or any of those things like oh wow this is really great. \",\"startTime\":1744726521,\"endTime\":1744726527},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726522,\"endTime\":1744726523},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Our hope would be is that through conversations like this, as you meet and match with other people. \",\"startTime\":1744726527,\"endTime\":1744726532},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That you get time to share about those tools and even what''s happening at side by and we''ll hear more from you like with your reflection and then we can take. \",\"startTime\":1744726533,\"endTime\":1744726542},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I don''t know what the right word is, but I call it creating a digital artifact for you. Hey, Mike, this is this is the summary of your reflection. This is \",\"startTime\":1744726543,\"endTime\":1744726549},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the summary of your and Jeff''s reflection with key points and key ideas and really cool. \",\"startTime\":1744726549,\"endTime\":1744726556},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Quotes that you might want to keep for later and those will go into your dashboard and you''ll be able to search through those later and all of that. \",\"startTime\":1744726557,\"endTime\":1744726564},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But my point would be is that if you have a voice, please raise it. You''re welcome \",\"startTime\":1744726564,\"endTime\":1744726566},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"here to do so. \",\"startTime\":1744726566,\"endTime\":1744726568},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Thank you, Jeff. Now I appreciate all of that and.\",\"startTime\":1744726569,\"endTime\":1744726573},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, happy to kind of be a sounding board, umm, if you guys have questions or things you wanna run by or if, uh, same, same with like the working stuff, like happy to kinda chat about those ideas since, uh, sounds like we both have a lot on our plates. Umm, figuring out project management can be certainly challenging \",\"startTime\":1744726573,\"endTime\":1744726590},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744726578,\"endTime\":1744726579},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"and uh, yeah, happy to further engage in the community. Umm, yeah, I, I love \",\"startTime\":1744726590,\"endTime\":1744726594},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"what you guys are doing. I think it''s really important that we keep human connection \",\"startTime\":1744726594,\"endTime\":1744726598},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"in this time. \",\"startTime\":1744726598,\"endTime\":1744726602},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And and so this is a great way to do it. So thank you.\",\"startTime\":1744726603,\"endTime\":1744726606},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Thank you. Have a wonderful day, Mike. Appreciate you tons. You''re \",\"startTime\":1744726607,\"endTime\":1744726609},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"amazing. Bye. \",\"startTime\":1744726609,\"endTime\":1744726611},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Thank you. Yeah, likewise. Take care.\",\"startTime\":1744726609,\"endTime\":1744726611}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.252025+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.252025+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 2001, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.222Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('2b6bd28f-f9c0-4ca7-9d31-9a99d85f71ce', 'c9d72e87-97e2-4131-bf2e-7298453c0e52', '138223', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Book that help me think about.\",\"startTime\":1745287230,\"endTime\":1745287233},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"The future, most interestingly, is Sapiens by the author Yuval Harari.\",\"startTime\":1745287233,\"endTime\":1745287237},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Sapiens is a historical look. It looks at like how we got to where we are and \",\"startTime\":1745287239,\"endTime\":1745287243},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"then kind of extrapolates where we might be going. \",\"startTime\":1745287243,\"endTime\":1745287247},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"It''s a fun read, so as you read it you''re like, it''s like stories you''ve heard before but told really clearly. \",\"startTime\":1745287250,\"endTime\":1745287255},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And what else?\",\"startTime\":1745287258,\"endTime\":1745287260},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"It''s really well written. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1745287262,\"endTime\":1745287263},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"It''s really odd about some pretty unintuitive but insightful things.\",\"startTime\":1745287266,\"endTime\":1745287271},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"So you''ll learn a lot by reading it.\",\"startTime\":1745287271,\"endTime\":1745287273},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And I suggested.\",\"startTime\":1745287274,\"endTime\":1745287276},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"I specifically this generative AI.\",\"startTime\":1745287291,\"endTime\":1745287293},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Moment is letting me do things in my class.\",\"startTime\":1745287293,\"endTime\":1745287296},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"That I used to do but work my tail off for, do them simply and also enable me to do things that I used to wish I could have done. \",\"startTime\":1745287297,\"endTime\":1745287305},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And by bringing down the bar so that they''re possible.\",\"startTime\":1745287306,\"endTime\":1745287309},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Umm, in my classroom I umm, kind of devised these 4 phases.\",\"startTime\":1745287331,\"endTime\":1745287335},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Where phase one was to try something yourself, just with your brain.\",\"startTime\":1745287335,\"endTime\":1745287339},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Phase two was use a static resource, phase three was talked to a peer, and phase 4 was. \",\"startTime\":1745287340,\"endTime\":1745287346},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And phase one or Phase 2 is the static resource. And the static resource just \",\"startTime\":1745287348,\"endTime\":1745287353},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"got way better, so we should not have to come to our peers as often. \",\"startTime\":1745287353,\"endTime\":1745287358},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"But still, sometimes we do. So I guess the interesting question I''d ask in today''s \",\"startTime\":1745287359,\"endTime\":1745287362},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"day and age is. \",\"startTime\":1745287362,\"endTime\":1745287365},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"At what level?\",\"startTime\":1745287365,\"endTime\":1745287366},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Do people need a peer and for what?\",\"startTime\":1745287366,\"endTime\":1745287368},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"My current problem of practice is how to.\",\"startTime\":1745287392,\"endTime\":1745287394},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Give people a chance to try the most current things.\",\"startTime\":1745287394,\"endTime\":1745287397},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"For less money.\",\"startTime\":1745287399,\"endTime\":1745287400}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.188977+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.188977+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 133, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.162Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('933f2d21-55cf-449c-af7f-449f33e8b0d6', '44d8b840-888f-4849-9111-b52ada8f4599', '137150', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"My name is Brittany Stevens and I am a special education teacher at the elementary school level. I currently am serving students in fourth and 2nd grade from a \",\"startTime\":1739925857,\"endTime\":1739925867},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"range of reading, writing, math, adaptive skills. \",\"startTime\":1739925867,\"endTime\":1739925871},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Social emotional learning and I am so happy to be here to introduce myself and get to know you guys. I am really hoping that Side By can help grow my professional \",\"startTime\":1739925871,\"endTime\":1739925882},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"network of incredible educators and fill my toolbox with awesome tools to help my students and my community around me. Some things that I am passionate about. \",\"startTime\":1739925882,\"endTime\":1739925893},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Is differentiation and special education as well as artificial intelligence and that technology integration to help our students? \",\"startTime\":1739925893,\"endTime\":1739925903},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Umm, I recently went to the AI conference in Seattle. That was earlier in February \",\"startTime\":1739925903,\"endTime\":1739925907},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"of 2025, and let me tell you, I learned so many cool tools. So I''m really excited \",\"startTime\":1739925907,\"endTime\":1739925911},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"to share about those tools with you guys. Another thing I''m really looking forward \",\"startTime\":1739925911,\"endTime\":1739925915},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"to is adopting those systems that are effective, that work in your classrooms or in your spaces and bringing them into my space to make those more effective in serving our students. \",\"startTime\":1739925915,\"endTime\":1739925927},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Another fun thing is that last year I worked down South. I''ve always worked \",\"startTime\":1739925928,\"endTime\":1739925933},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"in Washington, but I''ve been doing this for about four years now. \",\"startTime\":1739925933,\"endTime\":1739925937},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"My current caseload is 15 students.\",\"startTime\":1739925938,\"endTime\":1739925941},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Last year I had 45. At the end of the year I had a 63 IP meeting. So I''m very \",\"startTime\":1739925942,\"endTime\":1739925947},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"grateful to be here and I''m very grateful to learn from those who might be in my experience or in my issues and those who have never been in my shoes. And \",\"startTime\":1739925947,\"endTime\":1739925956},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"so I''m excited to be here and connect with you all. \",\"startTime\":1739925956,\"endTime\":1739925961},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"A question what is my stance on teaching? So currently my on February 18th 2025 \",\"startTime\":1739925989,\"endTime\":1739925995},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"my current stance on teaching I believe the role of teachers. \",\"startTime\":1739925995,\"endTime\":1739926001},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Is tremendous we wear so many hats we are mentors, we are coaches, we are teachers, we are sometimes counselors, we are sometimes parents and friends and. \",\"startTime\":1739926002,\"endTime\":1739926015},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"We wear so many hats in the teaching profession and I truly am just really honored and grateful to be here. I''ve always wanted to be a teacher and really developing \",\"startTime\":1739926017,\"endTime\":1739926025},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"those skills of wearing different hats to help support students. \",\"startTime\":1739926025,\"endTime\":1739926030},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So gratifying. So then when we move on to talking about what is the role of \",\"startTime\":1739926031,\"endTime\":1739926035},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"the learner and I think the answer to that question for me currently is in the question. \",\"startTime\":1739926035,\"endTime\":1739926043},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So I really truly believe that the role of the learner is to show up for their work. \",\"startTime\":1739926044,\"endTime\":1739926049},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And learn and be open to that coaching and be open to that feedback and trying new things and. \",\"startTime\":1739926050,\"endTime\":1739926058},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Upskilling.\",\"startTime\":1739926060,\"endTime\":1739926061},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So I think.\",\"startTime\":1739926062,\"endTime\":1739926063},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Not only are they learning, but I''m learning alongside them and I think that''s a really great opportunity to really view like, what are they going through every day? \",\"startTime\":1739926065,\"endTime\":1739926072},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"What should change?\",\"startTime\":1739926073,\"endTime\":1739926074},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"In education I have, I remember growing up my mom told me education is kind of like a box and I have dyslexia and I have ADHD and I have sensory sensitivity disorder. And so growing up in the public school systems, I noticed that that \",\"startTime\":1739926077,\"endTime\":1739926093},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"box or finding that that school is really built for a typically developing individual. \",\"startTime\":1739926093,\"endTime\":1739926099},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And I think what can change and should change is. \",\"startTime\":1739926099,\"endTime\":1739926104},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"What public school looks like, I do think we can adapt more. I think that those \",\"startTime\":1739926104,\"endTime\":1739926107},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"tools that help students with exceptionalities can be streamlined to help all students. So taking that box. \",\"startTime\":1739926107,\"endTime\":1739926115},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And maybe changing the shape or even letting some of those walls down.\",\"startTime\":1739926115,\"endTime\":1739926119},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And what should stay the same? Oh.\",\"startTime\":1739926121,\"endTime\":1739926123},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"What should stay the same? I just thought another thing I want to change is \",\"startTime\":1739926124,\"endTime\":1739926128},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"standardized testing. OK, So what should stay the same? I really like that there \",\"startTime\":1739926128,\"endTime\":1739926133},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"is opportunity for extracurriculars. There''s opportunity for movement through \",\"startTime\":1739926133,\"endTime\":1739926137},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"PEI. Really like that we are learning a variety of social, emotional and behavior \",\"startTime\":1739926137,\"endTime\":1739926141},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"and adaptive skills at school. I think that should we definitely need to keep \",\"startTime\":1739926141,\"endTime\":1739926145},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"that, especially with our integration of artificial intelligence. \",\"startTime\":1739926145,\"endTime\":1739926149},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Piling on social emotional skills I think is going to be really crucial moving forward. \",\"startTime\":1739926150,\"endTime\":1739926154},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"In my primary flow activity is currently doing yoga. I''m a huge peloton girly \",\"startTime\":1739926174,\"endTime\":1739926179},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"so riding my bike right now. It''s winter so I ride the peloton inside in the \",\"startTime\":1739926179,\"endTime\":1739926184},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"morning. I also really like journaling and reading. \",\"startTime\":1739926184,\"endTime\":1739926189},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Also dancing, yeah, those are my flow activities. Those always put me in a really \",\"startTime\":1739926190,\"endTime\":1739926192},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"good mood. \",\"startTime\":1739926192,\"endTime\":1739926194}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.210663+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.210663+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 308, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.192Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('9693673c-b47c-452d-a8a7-574cd6e54bca', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '137640', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How do you? Can you hear me OK?\",\"startTime\":1741901548,\"endTime\":1741901550},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Howdy, I can. Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1741901550,\"endTime\":1741901553},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I was gonna walk down by the river, but it''s windy today here in Spokane, and I''m like, it''s gonna be too loud, so I''m gonna head to my truck. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1741901552,\"endTime\":1741901561},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Oh, next.\",\"startTime\":1741901561,\"endTime\":1741901561},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"I If the wind doesn''t bother me, I can''t hear any wind, wind noise from you. \",\"startTime\":1741901562,\"endTime\":1741901564},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"So if it doesn''t bother you, it doesn''t bother me. \",\"startTime\":1741901564,\"endTime\":1741901567},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Great, I just happened to be by a brick building so I''m in the little alcove. \",\"startTime\":1741901567,\"endTime\":1741901571},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Maybe this would be a good spot. I hear you guys are getting a couple feet of \",\"startTime\":1741901571,\"endTime\":1741901575},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"snow. At least that''s what the forecast said. \",\"startTime\":1741901575,\"endTime\":1741901578},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we we got a little bit of a snow, snow storm last night. I''m actually \",\"startTime\":1741901577,\"endTime\":1741901580},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"on a snow day today. \",\"startTime\":1741901580,\"endTime\":1741901582},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"So I''m sitting at home on my couch, but, uh, we only got about, we got less than a foot, uh, by school and over in Truckee, up on the, the tippy tops of the mountains, they got. \",\"startTime\":1741901582,\"endTime\":1741901593},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1741901594,\"endTime\":1741901594},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"2 1/2 feet. 2 to 2 1/2 feet.\",\"startTime\":1741901595,\"endTime\":1741901597},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"2 1/2 feet, That''s crazy.\",\"startTime\":1741901598,\"endTime\":1741901600},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Mike posted in Slack yesterday that the forecast, he said three feet, so whatever, he didn''t get it all. \",\"startTime\":1741901601,\"endTime\":1741901608},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK. Hey, it''s nice to meet you. Thanks for joining.\",\"startTime\":1741901609,\"endTime\":1741901611},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"This is cool. OK.\",\"startTime\":1741901613,\"endTime\":1741901614},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ve never done this before so I have no idea how I''m supposed to do this. \",\"startTime\":1741901613,\"endTime\":1741901616},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, we got you. Uh, on my screen it says greet your partner Jeff and \",\"startTime\":1741901617,\"endTime\":1741901620},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"then press more. \",\"startTime\":1741901620,\"endTime\":1741901623},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Icebreaker. OK, is your icebreaker say the same thing? If you could have a superpower \",\"startTime\":1741901624,\"endTime\":1741901628},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"related to AI, what would it be and why? \",\"startTime\":1741901628,\"endTime\":1741901632},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741901632,\"endTime\":1741901632},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, I''ll let you go. First, let me think about a superpower related to \",\"startTime\":1741901634,\"endTime\":1741901636},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1741901635,\"endTime\":1741901635},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"AI. \",\"startTime\":1741901636,\"endTime\":1741901638},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Umm, maybe.\",\"startTime\":1741901648,\"endTime\":1741901649},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"To be a super prompter.\",\"startTime\":1741901652,\"endTime\":1741901654},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Tell me more.\",\"startTime\":1741901655,\"endTime\":1741901656},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Like I, I always read and, and kind of try to keep up with the different ways that you can interact with AI to get better results and being able to not have to trial and error it and just kind of know what the the best outcome, the best input will get the best outcome. \",\"startTime\":1741901658,\"endTime\":1741901674},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"For what I''m trying to have it to.\",\"startTime\":1741901676,\"endTime\":1741901677},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Whoa, I like that. I find that same kind of thing.\",\"startTime\":1741901679,\"endTime\":1741901682},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Now your role. You''re a counselor, right?\",\"startTime\":1741901683,\"endTime\":1741901685},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1741901685,\"endTime\":1741901686},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"As soon as he started talking about that, it made me think about your your work as a counselor and how many years of experience and prompts that you''ve had with students and teachers and. \",\"startTime\":1741901687,\"endTime\":1741901696},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Count other counselors and admin about asking this and that and like you''re you''re probably a super prompter like epic proportions superpower when it comes to knowing the right questions to ask today with kids. \",\"startTime\":1741901697,\"endTime\":1741901708},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Compared to other educators? Probably. Compared to other educators? Probably, \",\"startTime\":1741901709,\"endTime\":1741901712},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"but probably not in the grander scheme of the the AI world. \",\"startTime\":1741901712,\"endTime\":1741901716},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but I just was thinking like the human counterpart. That''s what it made \",\"startTime\":1741901718,\"endTime\":1741901721},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"me think of right away when you were talking like, oh, just a counselor. So \",\"startTime\":1741901721,\"endTime\":1741901724},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"prompting the AI tool. \",\"startTime\":1741901724,\"endTime\":1741901727},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"For me it feels like I just gotta work and spend more time doing it to get better. \",\"startTime\":1741901727,\"endTime\":1741901730},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But I''m with you, I I want that superpower too. Just to know what know what \",\"startTime\":1741901730,\"endTime\":1741901733},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to ask so that I get the the answers or the feedback that I need. \",\"startTime\":1741901733,\"endTime\":1741901737},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I don''t know, I definitely don''t like that frustration when you keep asking and just not figuring out what you''re wanting like. \",\"startTime\":1741901738,\"endTime\":1741901743},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s obvious to me. Why don''t you know me? Because you''re smart. Yeah. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1741901744,\"endTime\":1741901749},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ve been playing with Lovable, with, you know, which MM actually showed me and introduced me to it, and I''ve been. \",\"startTime\":1741901749,\"endTime\":1741901756},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Playing around with that a little bit and that''s been fun. I''ve been for years. \",\"startTime\":1741901756,\"endTime\":1741901759},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"I, I used to have this great. \",\"startTime\":1741901759,\"endTime\":1741901762},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Time tracking tool that I would use but it was an excel based macro based thing that someone else built that no longer is maintained and so I''ve never I''ve never really been able to replicate. \",\"startTime\":1741901764,\"endTime\":1741901774},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"The tool that I, I, I really valued using ''cause it told me how I was spending my time. And so I''m using I, I started couple weeks ago using it to kinda create \",\"startTime\":1741901775,\"endTime\":1741901782},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"a, you know, a lovable app And, but, but on that note, it''s, it''s like, you know. \",\"startTime\":1741901782,\"endTime\":1741901789},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"With that tool.\",\"startTime\":1741901790,\"endTime\":1741901791},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Feels like sometimes you''re, you''re like, oh, this isn''t working the way I want it to. Let''s adjust it. And then you go and fix it and then it adjusts like \",\"startTime\":1741901792,\"endTime\":1741901797},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Nice.\",\"startTime\":1741901792,\"endTime\":1741901793},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"way more than you want it to or breaks another feature that you''re like, Oh no, I didn''t want you to touch that. \",\"startTime\":1741901797,\"endTime\":1741901803},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s funny. Umm, lovable. I have not played with it, but barely.\",\"startTime\":1741901804,\"endTime\":1741901809},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I don''t know all of the details, but I did hear this morning, Diego, he''s helping us out with tech stuff. He said he uses ChatGPT to chat about because \",\"startTime\":1741901810,\"endTime\":1741901819},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"he''ll often just ask a question. Lovable. \",\"startTime\":1741901819,\"endTime\":1741901824},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then it''s doing all these things. He''s like, no, I didn''t want to do all \",\"startTime\":1741901824,\"endTime\":1741901828},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that. So he''s using another GPT to do his thinking and as a thinking partner \",\"startTime\":1741901828,\"endTime\":1741901832},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and then goes back to Lovable to do his prompts in there. I don''t know if that''s \",\"startTime\":1741901832,\"endTime\":1741901835},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"helpful for you or not, but that''s something that. \",\"startTime\":1741901835,\"endTime\":1741901839},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''ve been learning at times with different AI bots or tools that I''m building or working with end up having another window open for another tool to help me know like what kind of prompts or things so that it doesn''t get convoluted in there. \",\"startTime\":1741901839,\"endTime\":1741901852},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Is sometimes, yeah. It just does all these things like, no, no, stop, please \",\"startTime\":1741901854,\"endTime\":1741901857},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741901854,\"endTime\":1741901854},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"stop. Not, not what we wanted you to do. \",\"startTime\":1741901857,\"endTime\":1741901860},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, I want I want my superpower for AI to be hot lava. I was trying to think \",\"startTime\":1741901862,\"endTime\":1741901867},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of stuff. I''ve heard of some other ones from people lately. One was time stopping \",\"startTime\":1741901867,\"endTime\":1741901871},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"like freeze time and their their thing was their AI would freeze time for them so they could do all the things that they normally don''t get to do. I''m like, \",\"startTime\":1741901871,\"endTime\":1741901881},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"oh, I like that, but I''m going to go with hot lava because that sounds fun. \",\"startTime\":1741901881,\"endTime\":1741901885},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1741901884,\"endTime\":1741901885},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And for me, it''s the hot lava to melt through all of the barriers that we had for education. Like just like. \",\"startTime\":1741901887,\"endTime\":1741901894},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, you don''t have this? We can get through there.\",\"startTime\":1741901895,\"endTime\":1741901899},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You have struggles with it, We get through there. Or your kids don''t have access \",\"startTime\":1741901900,\"endTime\":1741901902},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to this. \",\"startTime\":1741901902,\"endTime\":1741901904},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Let''s get through there. This helped breakthrough those barriers that are limiting \",\"startTime\":1741901904,\"endTime\":1741901908},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"access for our kids and for our teachers. \",\"startTime\":1741901908,\"endTime\":1741901911},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"They have, I think every teacher that I''ve talked with has great vision for what education could look like, what their school could look like, what learning could look like. And there''s barrier after barrier after barrier even for them. \",\"startTime\":1741901913,\"endTime\":1741901923},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I wish I could just melt all of those away. So I want hot lava powers with \",\"startTime\":1741901923,\"endTime\":1741901927},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Nice.\",\"startTime\":1741901926,\"endTime\":1741901926},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"AI to help breakthrough all that stuff. \",\"startTime\":1741901927,\"endTime\":1741901930},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK.\",\"startTime\":1741901933,\"endTime\":1741901934},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"We did one more, way more than one minute, but that was fun. OK, the bottom \",\"startTime\":1741901935,\"endTime\":1741901938},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"mine says next. \",\"startTime\":1741901938,\"endTime\":1741901940},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1741901938,\"endTime\":1741901938},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Do we? Do we hit next?\",\"startTime\":1741901939,\"endTime\":1741901940},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and now mine says partner ready.\",\"startTime\":1741901941,\"endTime\":1741901943},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741901942,\"endTime\":1741901942},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And by the way, you can go back. So if we want to go back to something, you \",\"startTime\":1741901945,\"endTime\":1741901947},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741901945,\"endTime\":1741901945},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"can always go back. \",\"startTime\":1741901947,\"endTime\":1741901950},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And if I press next right now, then yours will say partner ready. And I also \",\"startTime\":1741901950,\"endTime\":1741901953},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741901951,\"endTime\":1741901951},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"learned this last week, if you just touch the screen somewhere not on the the words or the buttons. \",\"startTime\":1741901953,\"endTime\":1741901960},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Everything goes small for a minute so you can see the other person.\",\"startTime\":1741901961,\"endTime\":1741901964},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"OK, yeah, I see.\",\"startTime\":1741901964,\"endTime\":1741901965},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Then you touch the screen again, it goes goes big. OK. Oh, what recently announced \",\"startTime\":1741901966,\"endTime\":1741901970},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"AI innovation did you find exciting? \",\"startTime\":1741901970,\"endTime\":1741901974},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then ask Jeff to add to your answer. Oh.\",\"startTime\":1741901977,\"endTime\":1741901980},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I was reading about, I can''t even remember the name of it.\",\"startTime\":1741901983,\"endTime\":1741901987},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Monksa Monster or whatever it is out of China I believe and it has web browsing built into it. At least that''s what I was reading on it. \",\"startTime\":1741901990,\"endTime\":1741901998},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I know that our Gemini''s and ChatGPT can go out and do some searches, but I''m really interested to see more about what the web browsing features are really talking about and how that integrates because. \",\"startTime\":1741901998,\"endTime\":1741902011},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"GPTS in general.\",\"startTime\":1741902012,\"endTime\":1741902013},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Were kind of their own standalone model or their own standalone place?\",\"startTime\":1741902013,\"endTime\":1741902017},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Or or tool, but I''m always like trying to find out and asking it, hey go go research and go to this site and read all this stuff and get it all from there. \",\"startTime\":1741902018,\"endTime\":1741902028},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I''m curious to know more about like this web browser integrability. \",\"startTime\":1741902028,\"endTime\":1741902032},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1741902028,\"endTime\":1741902028},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And wondering what that what''s happening with that?\",\"startTime\":1741902033,\"endTime\":1741902035},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s one thing that popped in my head. I just read that even last night.\",\"startTime\":1741902036,\"endTime\":1741902039},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741902037,\"endTime\":1741902037},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, how about you?\",\"startTime\":1741902041,\"endTime\":1741902042},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"I don''t think it''s, I don''t think it''s new, but.\",\"startTime\":1741902041,\"endTime\":1741902044},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"From like an investing standpoint, so auto, I don''t know if you heard autopilot. \",\"startTime\":1741902045,\"endTime\":1741902049},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"It''s a investing platform that allows you. So basically they have several different \",\"startTime\":1741902050,\"endTime\":1741902054},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"portfolios. Some of them are like. \",\"startTime\":1741902054,\"endTime\":1741902057},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Nancy Pelosi, you''re like whoever, whatever other politician, and it mirrors all their stock moves. \",\"startTime\":1741902058,\"endTime\":1741902063},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"But one of one of them that was cool was, uh, there''s a professor somewhere that basically has. \",\"startTime\":1741902064,\"endTime\":1741902071},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"This this portfolio is based on what that GPT analyzes and predicts.\",\"startTime\":1741902072,\"endTime\":1741902078},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No.\",\"startTime\":1741902076,\"endTime\":1741902076},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"The stock moves are gonna be so so I have a little bit of, you know, I have a little bit of fun money in there to see what it does, but. \",\"startTime\":1741902079,\"endTime\":1741902085},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Right now everyone''s down, so it''s not doing great, but it''s, it''s, it''s just an, it''s just an interesting thing to see if it can like, you know, if it can beat the market or predict the, you know, predict the trends and things like that better than a human potentially could. \",\"startTime\":1741902087,\"endTime\":1741902101},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1741902090,\"endTime\":1741902090},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So now, now''s the time for me to go in.\",\"startTime\":1741902091,\"endTime\":1741902094},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741902100,\"endTime\":1741902101},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s cool. That''s very cool. I''m gonna press next.\",\"startTime\":1741902103,\"endTime\":1741902106},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Take turns with Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1741902116,\"endTime\":1741902118},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah, let''s see he''s Innovent. Innovations change what is possible in your 