ething and. \",\"startTime\":1741902182,\"endTime\":1741902189},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"It might be a fun way to utilize AI to enhance what I do with kind of kids and families. \",\"startTime\":1741902190,\"endTime\":1741902195},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1741902197,\"endTime\":1741902197},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Now that you mentioned Lovable, Mike sent out a blurb about Lovable just giving some updates and upgrades. One of them has a feature that they''re integrating \",\"startTime\":1741902198,\"endTime\":1741902206},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"called Clerk, CLERK, Clerk. \",\"startTime\":1741902206,\"endTime\":1741902210},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I just started barely reading it before our our call started this morning, but it looks like a really cool like administrative panel and work to oversee some of that stuff. It''s like an assistant. I''m just speaking way beyond what \",\"startTime\":1741902212,\"endTime\":1741902226},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I read, but it looked to be something like that. \",\"startTime\":1741902226,\"endTime\":1741902231},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And so you''re talking about using it to help?\",\"startTime\":1741902232,\"endTime\":1741902234},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Do the work for parents and students and they can look the way that it looks. \",\"startTime\":1741902235,\"endTime\":1741902237},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m wondering how lovable is going to continue with that. \",\"startTime\":1741902237,\"endTime\":1741902240},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"For you, helping to integrate the different advantages and perspectives of your your community because you got your students, you''ve got your teachers, you''ve got other staff administrator type of people. \",\"startTime\":1741902241,\"endTime\":1741902252},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Alright.\",\"startTime\":1741902251,\"endTime\":1741902251},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then you''ve got your, your families and how do you take all of that and, and create the, the visualization tools that you want? \",\"startTime\":1741902252,\"endTime\":1741902260},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I''m wondering about.\",\"startTime\":1741902260,\"endTime\":1741902262},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"The other aspects that lovables adding in, whether it''s clerk or whatever other things. \",\"startTime\":1741902262,\"endTime\":1741902267},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But as I envisioned how things would change and that would impact your world. \",\"startTime\":1741902268,\"endTime\":1741902272},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Didn''t even mind. It''s that we have other tools that that connect really well \",\"startTime\":1741902273,\"endTime\":1741902277},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"with the tools that we''re using. Like you''re saying you''re, you''re, you''re figuring \",\"startTime\":1741902277,\"endTime\":1741902282},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"out what is lovable prompt that gets you to your end. Maybe it''s these other \",\"startTime\":1741902282,\"endTime\":1741902286},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"tools that will be integrated with it. That''s like the you got your Sander and \",\"startTime\":1741902286,\"endTime\":1741902290},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"then you got the vacuum that connects to the Sander and sucks dust. You don''t \",\"startTime\":1741902290,\"endTime\":1741902295},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"get the dust in your face and you''re like, oh, now I can do it. \",\"startTime\":1741902295,\"endTime\":1741902299},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741902297,\"endTime\":1741902299},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"I feel like it''s it''s so it''s hard to keep up like with all the changes and developments. Like it seems like even just ChatGPT I''m doing AI. \",\"startTime\":1741902299,\"endTime\":1741902307},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"I''m doing a kind of an AI overview mainly focused on ChatGPT work with like the Vermont School Council Association like next week or something like that on a webinar. \",\"startTime\":1741902309,\"endTime\":1741902319},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Kind of says professional development for them and just like even I did it down in Socal towards the earlier part of this year and like the fall and even between giving that presentation and then the one that I''ll do in a couple weeks. \",\"startTime\":1741902319,\"endTime\":1741902333},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Umm, I mean like 3 different models have come out, there''s a new research preview like so much has developed, and even just the last, you know, eight months or six months. \",\"startTime\":1741902333,\"endTime\":1741902343},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"It''s hard, it''s honestly hard to keep up with and and keep track of where where we''re at. \",\"startTime\":1741902344,\"endTime\":1741902348},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So when I think about.\",\"startTime\":1741902349,\"endTime\":1741902351},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How might these innovations change what is possible in your work or personal projects? When you say that, it makes me think about what''s possible in my work \",\"startTime\":1741902352,\"endTime\":1741902358},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"is that. \",\"startTime\":1741902358,\"endTime\":1741902361},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s possible now for you, Jeff and me, Jeff, to do professional learning without it being cookie cutter or I did it once and then I can repeat it. But what''s \",\"startTime\":1741902362,\"endTime\":1741902370},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"possible now is that we can keep growing and doing professional learning in a different way, in a way that can keep up with things. We have to, we''ll have \",\"startTime\":1741902370,\"endTime\":1741902377},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to adjust to that because if you keep talki