o show them all in front of the class and whoever has the best poster or will vote on it. \",\"startTime\":1745273865,\"endTime\":1745273884},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"So thanks for that.\",\"startTime\":1745273866,\"endTime\":1745273866},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"They they did such an awesome job. I didn''t even really have to do my lesson \",\"startTime\":1745273887,\"endTime\":1745273891},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"because all the kids went and found all the stuff that I was going to teach and they all were paying attention to the posters because they wanted to vote on one of them And the kids got like 50 crypto for it and it was totally worth it. So it it worked good that the competition and and just. \",\"startTime\":1745273891,\"endTime\":1745273907},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"The passive learning is really, really fun.\",\"startTime\":1745273910,\"endTime\":1745273912},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. That''s super cool. Way to position them as capable. Rob, I''m \",\"startTime\":1745273913,\"endTime\":1745273917},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"going to try to connect you with a lady who''s just hopped on even today. She''s \",\"startTime\":1745273917,\"endTime\":1745273921},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"a teacher over in Baltimore. I think you 2 would be awesome for conversation. \",\"startTime\":1745273921,\"endTime\":1745273925},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"She''s working on supporting AI for teachers in her district and a bunch of other cool stuff. And she''s passionate and getting after it, So I''m going to connect \",\"startTime\":1745273925,\"endTime\":1745273933},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"you with her. So yeah, you look on your dashboard. That should be coming soon. \",\"startTime\":1745273933,\"endTime\":1745273937},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"S s Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745273935,\"endTime\":1745273939},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, man. \",\"startTime\":1745273937,\"endTime\":1745273941},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Sounds good.\",\"startTime\":1745273939,\"endTime\":1745273940},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Perfect. Hey, good to see you. Take care, man.\",\"startTime\":1745273941,\"endTime\":1745273942},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You too. See you, Rob. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1745273943,\"endTime\":1745273945}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.754982+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.754982+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1684, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.728Z", "session_title": "#learning_to_human", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "33", "name": "#learning_to_human", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "Inclusion"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('bbc836f5-8e6a-4d2a-bfb9-d85adea86a07', 'bd47a56c-b275-4972-987f-30b0cd993f17', '137152', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Hi, Tom Thorpe, I am the Director.\",\"startTime\":1739981721,\"endTime\":1739981723},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Co founder.\",\"startTime\":1739981723,\"endTime\":1739981724},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Lead faculty of the Reading Lab in Denver, Co.\",\"startTime\":1739981725,\"endTime\":1739981728},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I teach humans.\",\"startTime\":1739981729,\"endTime\":1739981730},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"That''s what I do. Teach humans. Taught them English or taught them history.\",\"startTime\":1739981731,\"endTime\":1739981734},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And I teach them how to think.\",\"startTime\":1739981736,\"endTime\":1739981738},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"About the world around them, how to make sense of it, how to identify what stories they want to tell, what stories they''re told. \",\"startTime\":1739981739,\"endTime\":1739981745},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"That''s, uh, that''s me and we do it at an Independent School, but we also do it in a community with as many. \",\"startTime\":1739981748,\"endTime\":1739981754},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Folks as are free and able to join us.\",\"startTime\":1739981754,\"endTime\":1739981757},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Dance when it.\",\"startTime\":1739981827,\"endTime\":1739981828},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"To teaching and learning is pretty simple educators and students.\",\"startTime\":1739981828,\"endTime\":1739981833},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Need to live side by one another.\",\"startTime\":1739981835,\"endTime\":1739981837},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Alongside each other, the the original sort of understanding of.\",\"startTime\":1739981837,\"endTime\":1739981840},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know what assessments were to to name one thing is.\",\"startTime\":1739981840,\"endTime\":1739981843},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, teachers sitting alongside learners or educators and and learners sitting alongside one another. \",\"startTime\":1739981845,\"endTime\":1739981850},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm coupled with this is when teachers tell students stories what hap which happens incredibly umm. \",\"startTime\":1739981851,\"endTime\":1739981858},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know, at an incredibly high rate, way too often. This needs to stop. Let \",\"startTime\":1739981860,\"endTime\":1739981864},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"students tell their stories. Let them identify a little bit more about. \",\"startTime\":1739981864,\"endTime\":1739981868},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"What they know, what they want to know, what they want to bring to the endeavor. \",\"startTime\":1739981868,\"endTime\":1739981872},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So yeah, it''s, it''s, it''s pretty simple. Teachers, educators and students sitting \",\"startTime\":1739981873,\"endTime\":1739981877},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"alongside one another. Educators, stop telling students stories. \",\"startTime\":1739981877,\"endTime\":1739981881},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Is love cooking? Love cooking for people. I love serving, being in service kind \",\"startTime\":1739981912,\"endTime\":1739981917},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"of for other people, especially when it comes to food and gathering. \",\"startTime\":1739981917,\"endTime\":1739981921},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Love walking?\",\"startTime\":1739981922,\"endTime\":1739981923},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Being both out like in a neighborhood or out in the woods walking and seeing nature. Biking is, is a piece of that too, but kind of like being out and, and \",\"startTime\":1739981926,\"endTime\":1739981934},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"noticing and and listening and, and hearing what''s going on. \",\"startTime\":1739981934,\"endTime\":1739981939},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, those are, those are it.\",\"startTime\":1739981941,\"endTime\":1739981943},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Also anything that has to do with like reading movies, stories.\",\"startTime\":1739981944,\"endTime\":1739981947},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Love collecting stories?\",\"startTime\":1739981947,\"endTime\":1739981949},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"That''s my flow.\",\"startTime\":1739981950,\"endTime\":1739981951}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.880048+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.880048+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 147, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.855Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('48f1439c-5953-4d87-9300-58d70db5aa4e', '44d8b840-888f-4849-9111-b52ada8f4599', '137349', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Happy Friday, good to see you.\",\"startTime\":1740787535,\"endTime\":1740787537},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You too. How are things?\",\"startTime\":1740787535,\"endTime\":1740787537},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Oh my gosh, it''s actually been such a busy week for me. I''ve had so many IEP \",\"startTime\":1740787537,\"endTime\":1740787539},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"meetings and follow up work, but I''m so glad it''s sunny out and it''s Friday again. \",\"startTime\":1740787539,\"endTime\":1740787545},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I am so glad it''s sunny. There''s a little bit of.\",\"startTime\":1740787545,\"endTime\":1740787548},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wispy clouds getting in the way, but it''s been wonderful today, and it''s Friday. \",\"startTime\":1740787549,\"endTime\":1740787554},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. No, not a bit. And nice job making it through the week. It''s been \",\"startTime\":1740787555,\"endTime\":1740787558},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, can''t be upset when it''s Friday.\",\"startTime\":1740787555,\"endTime\":1740787558},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"just crazy. I don''t know what the deal is. We''re all back. January got us awake \",\"startTime\":1740787558,\"endTime\":1740787561},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and then February we''re like, we have to do all the things. I don''t know what, \",\"startTime\":1740787561,\"endTime\":1740787565},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"but it feels like that. \",\"startTime\":1740787565,\"endTime\":1740787568},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"We''re feeling the same thing over here, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787569,\"endTime\":1740787571},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. OK, I''m going to press more and see what this has got. This is your \",\"startTime\":1740787572,\"endTime\":1740787575},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"first, by the way. Welcome to your first one-on-one. This is the magic where \",\"startTime\":1740787575,\"endTime\":1740787579},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it happens, where we hopefully get you in the cadence and matched up with people so that whatever time works for you, you just go, yeah, this works for me this week and you can get regular time with other peeps, so. \",\"startTime\":1740787579,\"endTime\":1740787589},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Beautiful. Yeah, Yeah. Thanks for having me for my first one.\",\"startTime\":1740787590,\"endTime\":1740787593},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no worries.\",\"startTime\":1740787593,\"endTime\":1740787594},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"What''s the skill I hit? I hit the more here. What''s a skill besides AI fluency \",\"startTime\":1740787595,\"endTime\":1740787599},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that you''re working to improve? \",\"startTime\":1740787599,\"endTime\":1740787602},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I think one of the skills that I''m working on as it relates to AI is automation. \",\"startTime\":1740787603,\"endTime\":1740787607},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So really learning to automate some of the processes like sending emails or turning content into different kinds of contact like PDFs into scripture or videos or PowerPoints. So I''m working on my. \",\"startTime\":1740787607,\"endTime\":1740787620},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Automation piece of AI.\",\"startTime\":1740787621,\"endTime\":1740787623},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1740787624,\"endTime\":1740787625},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s funny. 01 That''s really interesting. I''ve got questions about that.\",\"startTime\":1740787625,\"endTime\":1740787630},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787626,\"endTime\":1740787627},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"What tools are you using to help you with your automation? That''s my first question. \",\"startTime\":1740787630,\"endTime\":1740787635},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"One of the tools that I really like right now is called Text Blaze and I learned it at our conference that we recently went to. That has really saved me so much \",\"startTime\":1740787635,\"endTime\":1740787643},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"time and felt like I''m like cheating my way through my task because it''s so quick at inputting lines that I''ve already given it specifically for my Ieps and scheduling needs. \",\"startTime\":1740787643,\"endTime\":1740787655},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787647,\"endTime\":1740787648},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So in this text, Blaze TEXTBLAZE, Yeah, I remember you telling me about that and then I wrote it on some note, but I couldn''t find it. Like, what was that \",\"startTime\":1740787656,\"endTime\":1740787664},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yes, Texbay is one word.\",\"startTime\":1740787660,\"endTime\":1740787662},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"thing? So thank you for telling me again. And that''s again, like it''s like a \",\"startTime\":1740787664,\"endTime\":1740787668},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"macro, like you press a keystroke and then it does an an action. That''s so cool. \",\"startTime\":1740787668,\"endTime\":1740787672},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s really cool. \",\"startTime\":1740787672,\"endTime\":1740787675},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s like a keyboard shortcut for, umm, lengthy text or certain things you send all the time through words. \",\"startTime\":1740787676,\"endTime\":1740787684},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wait, wait. Sweet. That''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1740787684,\"endTime\":1740787686},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah. What is something, what is the skill besides a fluency that you''re working \",\"startTime\":1740787686,\"endTime\":1740787688},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"on to improve right now? \",\"startTime\":1740787688,\"endTime\":1740787690},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Now it''s funny, you went with AI stuff and I went to human things. I was like, \",\"startTime\":1740787691,\"endTime\":1740787697},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m trying to focus and not have so many things on my mind or my plate. \",\"startTime\":1740787697,\"endTime\":1740787702},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Which means saying no to more things and and being present.\",\"startTime\":1740787703,\"endTime\":1740787707},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And so that''s a skill that I was thinking with, which is nothing to do with AI, but it helps me to be better at using AI. And I think it does have a huge \",\"startTime\":1740787707,\"endTime\":1740787715},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"relevancy to my use with AI because. \",\"startTime\":1740787715,\"endTime\":1740787718},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Text please ChatGPT.\",\"startTime\":1740787720,\"endTime\":1740787722},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"There''s like 20 different things I could just list out that are on my oh, I should probably look at that. I should look at that. I should look at that. \",\"startTime\":1740787724,\"endTime\":1740787732},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And from my last chat I had with somebody, they said keep it limit at 5, Jeff, like just work on five things. As a matter of fact, it was Eric out of London. \",\"startTime\":1740787732,\"endTime\":1740787740},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah, OK.\",\"startTime\":1740787740,\"endTime\":1740787744},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"He does a lot of tech stuff. I love to see you 2 get connected. \",\"startTime\":1740787740,\"endTime\":1740787744},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But he''s using AI and he says, Jeff, uh, I''m trying to keep it. Maybe you could \",\"startTime\":1740787744,\"endTime\":1740787747},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"keep it at 5 tools that you''re trying to get good at that work for your thing, like textplays. So, umm. \",\"startTime\":1740787747,\"endTime\":1740787753},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787753,\"endTime\":1740787753},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I guess that''s the skill I''m trying to do. Long roundabout story, OK.\",\"startTime\":1740787754,\"endTime\":1740787757},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So what I heard you say is say no to some things.\",\"startTime\":1740787757,\"endTime\":1740787760},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Umm and focusing.\",\"startTime\":1740787761,\"endTime\":1740787763},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right. OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787764,\"endTime\":1740787766},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. Skill that Jeff needs, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787765,\"endTime\":1740787768},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Me too.\",\"startTime\":1740787768,\"endTime\":1740787769},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK. OK. I found this out. When you press next, mine says partner ready. And \",\"startTime\":1740787768,\"endTime\":1740787773},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"if you press, if I press next before you then it will say partner ready on yours. \",\"startTime\":1740787773,\"endTime\":1740787778},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And somebody showed me the other day that you can click back and we can go back. \",\"startTime\":1740787778,\"endTime\":1740787782},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"If you''re like, oh, what did it say in there more? We didn''t even look at that \",\"startTime\":1740787783,\"endTime\":1740787786},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"or did we answer? We can hit back like I''ll do it right now just for fun. \",\"startTime\":1740787786,\"endTime\":1740787789},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then it will say waiting for partner. So if we were going forward, it looks \",\"startTime\":1740787790,\"endTime\":1740787795},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1740787791,\"endTime\":1740787792},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"like almost the same. But the arrow, I think it helps us. So. All right. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1740787795,\"endTime\":1740787799},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Good to know.\",\"startTime\":1740787799,\"endTime\":1740787800},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh oh.\",\"startTime\":1740787802,\"endTime\":1740787803},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"It says OK.\",\"startTime\":1740787803,\"endTime\":1740787804},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"How has AI changed your work as an educator or leader of educators so far?\",\"startTime\":1740787804,\"endTime\":1740787810},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hmm ''cause mine says share, so does yours say ask? I''m just curious. Oh cool. \",\"startTime\":1740787813,\"endTime\":1740787819},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, mine says Ask Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1740787818,\"endTime\":1740787819},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Nice, how has AI changed my work as an educator?\",\"startTime\":1740787820,\"endTime\":1740787826},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"One, I think I''ve had assistance now like in particular last year in a couple weeks we we did, it was March 13th, 14th Pi Day for those mathletes. We did \",\"startTime\":1740787826,\"endTime\":1740787837},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a dream camp and I was part of the team and actually end up writing it. \",\"startTime\":1740787837,\"endTime\":1740787843},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Uh, ''cause my partner, she got off the team and so I end up being in the lead. \",\"startTime\":1740787844,\"endTime\":1740787849},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Oh wow, nice.\",\"startTime\":1740787849,\"endTime\":1740787851},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m like, I have to write the grant. So I''m writing a grant, but I had notes, \",\"startTime\":1740787849,\"endTime\":1740787853},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"so we had ideas that were already taking. So I created a ChatGPT out of notes \",\"startTime\":1740787853,\"endTime\":1740787857},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and I used another ChatGPT to help. \",\"startTime\":1740787857,\"endTime\":1740787861},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That accumulate our ideas and write through things like, OK, I think this is the grant and I had all of the stuff that notes with Tammy and other people that we had talked about and in particular her ideas and my ideas. \",\"startTime\":1740787862,\"endTime\":1740787875},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But then I built a a GPT assistant called Dreamcamp Helper and the first thing I did is I put in there all of the specifics about what the grant said for the grant page and application. It was really easy too. You just copied and pasted \",\"startTime\":1740787875,\"endTime\":1740787886},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it all in and then or put it in APDF and uploaded it to the knowledge base and then. \",\"startTime\":1740787886,\"endTime\":1740787893},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Took things like Tammy''s ideas and put that in and my ideas and put it in as part of the knowledge base and then put our guiding principles in in the, I call it the the key educational frameworks. \",\"startTime\":1740787894,\"endTime\":1740787905},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, your framework.\",\"startTime\":1740787906,\"endTime\":1740787907},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"There''s four of them, yeah, yeah. So those frameworks like UDL and what are \",\"startTime\":1740787907,\"endTime\":1740787910},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"the effective and equitable teaching practices and. \",\"startTime\":1740787910,\"endTime\":1740787913},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I''m like, OK, so the AI assistant then helped me and I said, let''s write the grant. What could we do? And so let''s write for the grant. And so I used \",\"startTime\":1740787914,\"endTime\":1740787922},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1740787917,\"endTime\":1740787917},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it specifically to help me write the language. \",\"startTime\":1740787922,\"endTime\":1740787927},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"From what we had for our language and then once I''ve finished that and we read through it and I got the OK and we''re good and we sent it off, then we got our approval then the way that we had that, well, this was last year, a year ago. \",\"startTime\":1740787927,\"endTime\":1740787941},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Congrats.\",\"startTime\":1740787937,\"endTime\":1740787938},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"We we pulled it off. So it was 2N''s or October''s ago, I guess. \",\"startTime\":1740787941,\"endTime\":1740787945},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And when we did that, when we got the approval back.\",\"startTime\":1740787945,\"endTime\":1740787949},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"They even send you back your approval package. It says this is what we approved \",\"startTime\":1740787950,\"endTime\":1740787954},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"with all of their language. So then I took those stocks and updated the knowledge \",\"startTime\":1740787954,\"endTime\":1740787958},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"base of the AI assistant, Dreamcamp Helper, got an upgrade. And then I started \",\"startTime\":1740787958,\"endTime\":1740787962},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"using it for all the different things like project management. Like what kind \",\"startTime\":1740787962,\"endTime\":1740787967},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of areas should we have for project management so I can track and have somebody like a Brittany be in charge of marketing or film development or a group like Mike''s group at Upduo. We should do a contract with them and then. \",\"startTime\":1740787967,\"endTime\":1740787979},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"The specifications.\",\"startTime\":1740787980,\"endTime\":1740787981},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And it was really great to have an assistant help me to talk through the things. \",\"startTime\":1740787981,\"endTime\":1740787985},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then as soon as I had what I called, I guess it''s an artifact. \",\"startTime\":1740787985,\"endTime\":1740787989},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Maybe you would know the word like when you bring together something and you have synthesis and you have a piece of of well, yeah. So once I decided on this \",\"startTime\":1740787990,\"endTime\":1740787999},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787990,\"endTime\":1740787992},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"An artifact works well here.\",\"startTime\":1740787996,\"endTime\":1740787997},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"is our project management or we got the the grant language back that it was approved. Whenever I got to a place where it was together and finalized, I could \",\"startTime\":1740787999,\"endTime\":1740788008},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"take that document and put it into the assistant and it''s knowledge base updated. \",\"startTime\":1740788008,\"endTime\":1740788013},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So then every time I talk to about what we''re doing, it knew that project management. \",\"startTime\":1740788013,\"endTime\":1740788017},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Into detail ''cause I had put it into like a a Google doc like 18 pages long or a spreadsheet with all of the language which each role was supposed to be and what it was gonna do for tasks. \",\"startTime\":1740788019,\"endTime\":1740788029},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Then I didn''t have to remember where it was all going and it was just like.\",\"startTime\":1740788029,\"endTime\":1740788032},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It is compacting and getting, it''s like growing and growing. And it was so cool \",\"startTime\":1740788034,\"endTime\":1740788038},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s so phenomenal.\",\"startTime\":1740788038,\"endTime\":1740788041},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that yeah, that was something that''s totally revolutionized my work because it kept record of it. And then was my assistant and remember the stuff that \",\"startTime\":1740788038,\"endTime\":1740788046},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788043,\"endTime\":1740788043},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"we said or I could ask it later, like intentionally I put in there just educators, 20 educators could join, but it didn''t say anything about our our region. But \",\"startTime\":1740788046,\"endTime\":1740788054},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"they had to be out of the region even though I knew the grant. \",\"startTime\":1740788054,\"endTime\":1740788059},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Foundation wanted it out of our region.\",\"startTime\":1740788061,\"endTime\":1740788063},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I was like, I''m not gonna say that yet. Umm. So we had flexibility later and \",\"startTime\":1740788064,\"endTime\":1740788068},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"so, but I could ask the, the the chat bot, what did we decide ''cause it was already in the language. OK, I babbled way too much. Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1740788068,\"endTime\":1740788077},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"That''s not phenomenal. No, that''s really phenomenal.\",\"startTime\":1740788074,\"endTime\":1740788077},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And thank you for sharing that. I love how it became such a like, like you could \",\"startTime\":1740788077,\"endTime\":1740788080},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"have paid someone to do that or even multiple people do that. And the fact that \",\"startTime\":1740788080,\"endTime\":1740788083},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"we can do it now, we''ll do some programming and AI. \",\"startTime\":1740788083,\"endTime\":1740788086},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788088,\"endTime\":1740788089},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, exactly right. All right. Umm, do you get to share or, or what''s your \",\"startTime\":1740788090,\"endTime\":1740788093},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"supposed to say? Does your more say add to it or? \",\"startTime\":1740788093,\"endTime\":1740788096},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I don''t know. Let''s press next.\",\"startTime\":1740788095,\"endTime\":1740788096},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Do you have anything under your? More like add to it or?\",\"startTime\":1740788098,\"endTime\":1740788100},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Under more is just about it says it says considered talking points.\",\"startTime\":1740788101,\"endTime\":1740788105},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, got it, mine says. Then ask Brittany to add to your answer.\",\"startTime\":1740788106,\"endTime\":1740788111},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1740788110,\"endTime\":1740788110},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So just to read, so how has AI changed your work as an educator or leader? I \",\"startTime\":1740788112,\"endTime\":1740788115},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"feel like AI has really enhanced my productivity. It has had, it has enhanced \",\"startTime\":1740788115,\"endTime\":1740788119},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"my ability to reach. \",\"startTime\":1740788119,\"endTime\":1740788123},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Umm, far more students with with exceptionalities. I''ve been able to grow as \",\"startTime\":1740788125,\"endTime\":1740788129},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"a professional, especially as a new new teacher. This is now my 4th year. \",\"startTime\":1740788129,\"endTime\":1740788134},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I started using AI.\",\"startTime\":1740788136,\"endTime\":1740788137},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Around like a year and a half, no, about a year into my teaching. And so I was \",\"startTime\":1740788138,\"endTime\":1740788141},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"my first year, it was really challenging and I was able to just ask it all the questions that I wasn''t able to ask my mentor who wasn''t even on site at the time or even I didn''t have any other special Ed teachers in my building. So \",\"startTime\":1740788141,\"endTime\":1740788153},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"it really became like my partner in my growth and my development. And I just \",\"startTime\":1740788153,\"endTime\":1740788156},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"really like how I''m able to do things a lot quicker and I''m able to reach far more than my students, but also help my community a lot easier too. \",\"startTime\":1740788156,\"endTime\":1740788164},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Awesome way to go.\",\"startTime\":1740788165,\"endTime\":1740788167},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thanks.\",\"startTime\":1740788167,\"endTime\":1740788168},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"There it goes. OK, next one I beat you to it.\",\"startTime\":1740788169,\"endTime\":1740788171},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, you beat me ''cause mine''s a partner maybe, Dang it.\",\"startTime\":1740788171,\"endTime\":1740788173},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Take turns chatting with Brittany. How do you think AI will change the the role \",\"startTime\":1740788175,\"endTime\":1740788178},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of learners in the future? \",\"startTime\":1740788178,\"endTime\":1740788181},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I think learners still have the same job. I do think that there are like really \",\"startTime\":1740788188,\"endTime\":1740788193},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"two big views here. I do think it can be very beneficial in curating individualized \",\"startTime\":1740788193,\"endTime\":1740788199},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"assessments and activities for students to help them grow and it''s really great data collection as well. I do know that there is some research that is showing \",\"startTime\":1740788199,\"endTime\":1740788211},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"that if there is an over reliance on AI to do the work. \",\"startTime\":1740788211,\"endTime\":1740788212},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And do the learning then that can really prevent.\",\"startTime\":1740788212,\"endTime\":1740788215},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Critical thinking skills. I''m sorry. Please come to the office. Nishika. I can''t \",\"startTime\":1740788216,\"endTime\":1740788219},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"mute on here. \",\"startTime\":1740788219,\"endTime\":1740788223},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s OK.\",\"startTime\":1740788222,\"endTime\":1740788222},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, you were saying that if they over rely on AI then it does what?\",\"startTime\":1740788229,\"endTime\":1740788234},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"It does impact their critical thinking skills.\",\"startTime\":1740788234,\"endTime\":1740788238},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Why do you, Yeah, why do you suppose that does that to them? And I''m thinking \",\"startTime\":1740788241,\"endTime\":1740788244},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I like ability to.\",\"startTime\":1740788241,\"endTime\":1740788242},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"about that because we want to build critical thinkers and someone wondering about how we safeguard for that. \",\"startTime\":1740788244,\"endTime\":1740788250},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I think it does that because it does the work for you. And I, I really like \",\"startTime\":1740788251,\"endTime\":1740788256},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"to anchor this back to the research that proves the best way to learn something is if you write it down, because if you write it down versus if you just see it, your brain can absorb that information the best. And so when we are moving \",\"startTime\":1740788256,\"endTime\":1740788271},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"away from writing in our studying or academia or if we''re moving away from doing the work portion that I do think that is not giving our brain. \",\"startTime\":1740788271,\"endTime\":1740788281},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Practice. It needs to help develop those critical thinking skills and remember \",\"startTime\":1740788281,\"endTime\":1740788284},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"these tools and strategies that we are learning in school. \",\"startTime\":1740788284,\"endTime\":1740788288},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah. But at some point though, like what you''re saying, when you''re using the \",\"startTime\":1740788289,\"endTime\":1740788293},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"macros with the text plays, it types it all in for you, which is writing. So \",\"startTime\":1740788293,\"endTime\":1740788297},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"how is that not hurting you in your critical thinking? \",\"startTime\":1740788297,\"endTime\":1740788301},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So I the writing that it inputs for me in seconds is writing that I have written for it. I just I just had a shortcut that I made on my keyboard. \",\"startTime\":1740788303,\"endTime\":1740788313},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You''re like a math, uh, magician and mathematicians like. Just see Theorem 4.2 \",\"startTime\":1740788314,\"endTime\":1740788318},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"or Lemma 1.5. It''s. \",\"startTime\":1740788318,\"endTime\":1740788322},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Y equals MX plus B and then it''s my paragraph.\",\"startTime\":1740788321,\"endTime\":1740788324},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But you''re like, we already proved that Next. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788325,\"endTime\":1740788328},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And yeah, I, I already wrote that. Yeah, that''s interesting. Umm, I think \",\"startTime\":1740788329,\"endTime\":1740788333},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"along those lines, it''s gonna be incredibly important for us. \",\"startTime\":1740788333,\"endTime\":1740788338},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"As learners to have tasks and problems or projects.\",\"startTime\":1740788338,\"endTime\":1740788343},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Whatever they are.\",\"startTime\":1740788343,\"endTime\":1740788345},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Where we''re using AI as a tool and it''s pushing our boundary that zone approximal development. \",\"startTime\":1740788345,\"endTime\":1740788351},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And we as learners are being challenged to think critically and use the tools to help us do so, rather than if it''s, if it''s, and that''s got to be the tasks and the challenges or the problems or the assignments or the projects or whatever it is that we''re given to do or take upon ourselves. But if we''re we''re asking \",\"startTime\":1740788352,\"endTime\":1740788370},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788357,\"endTime\":1740788357},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, absolutely.\",\"startTime\":1740788358,\"endTime\":1740788359},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"kids, just like today, if we''re asking to do square roots of large numbers and we show them the algorithm by hand, nobody uses that anymore. We use a calculator. \",\"startTime\":1740788370,\"endTime\":1740788379},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So there''s no.\",\"startTime\":1740788381,\"endTime\":1740788382},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"There''s no discussion today about that one. So we''re just like of course, and \",\"startTime\":1740788383,\"endTime\":1740788387},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"even along the lines of grammar checking and spell checking, we totally trust the spell checker. We don''t go do it by hand anymore and so. \",\"startTime\":1740788387,\"endTime\":1740788394},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Warning about that notion of what are the projects that we''re doing or the tasks or the problems or the things that we''re asking learners to do. So I think the \",\"startTime\":1740788396,\"endTime\":1740788405},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"role of learners in the future, they will have to even ensure on their own self. \",\"startTime\":1740788405,\"endTime\":1740788410},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That they''re using tools strategically and not.\",\"startTime\":1740788410,\"endTime\":1740788413},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Replacing their tools because.\",\"startTime\":1740788414,\"endTime\":1740788415},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I''m betting when you''re using AI, at times you''re like, uh, it''s doing more than I know what it''s doing and it''s not really helping ''cause it''s just magic and I don''t know what''s going on. Umm, that''s what I feel sometimes with the \",\"startTime\":1740788416,\"endTime\":1740788425},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right, right.\",\"startTime\":1740788423,\"endTime\":1740788425},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"AI, Like, uh, I''m like trying to learn about dark matter or something. I have \",\"startTime\":1740788425,\"endTime\":1740788428},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"no idea what''s really going on, but I''m just like overreaching my, my, my, my knowledge base and critical thinking. I''m like, Oh yeah, that''s right, ''cause \",\"startTime\":1740788428,\"endTime\":1740788434},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it said it. \",\"startTime\":1740788434,\"endTime\":1740788437},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I do agree with you. I do think that learners moving forward are going \",\"startTime\":1740788438,\"endTime\":1740788442},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"to have the opportunity to use these AI tools to then create more than they have been. Like how we are able to create podcasts, we''re able to create faceless \",\"startTime\":1740788442,\"endTime\":1740788450},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"content and AI content and we''re able to just produce so much work instantly. \",\"startTime\":1740788450,\"endTime\":1740788454},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I do think learners are now going to be put in a position where instead of a brochure for a reading assignment, they''re now creating. \",\"startTime\":1740788454,\"endTime\":1740788462},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Like a podcast, a skit, a this, this and that. Like they''re able to expand their \",\"startTime\":1740788463,\"endTime\":1740788467},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"repertoire of what I''m able to do and their skill set of the different buckets they can pick out of. I think that''s pretty cool. \",\"startTime\":1740788467,\"endTime\":1740788475},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I really like how you keyed in on creation that they would be creating and then they would have skills to to to do and even choices. You listed out so many \",\"startTime\":1740788475,\"endTime\":1740788484},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"different ways that they could express their thing that they''re producing now, and then they have choice to do it, and then they have tools to help them get there, but they''re still creating it. Yeah, I, I think that''s got to be a key \",\"startTime\":1740788484,\"endTime\":1740788496},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"too ''cause when you''re creating, then you''re thinking about all sorts of things and you''re driving it. \",\"startTime\":1740788496,\"endTime\":1740788504},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then the problem solving and critical thinking, especially around what tool do I use and how do I get there and why do I do it? And I want to use this tool \",\"startTime\":1740788504,\"endTime\":1740788511},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to do this and I don''t know how to do it yet. So they''ll, they''ll become critical \",\"startTime\":1740788511,\"endTime\":1740788514},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"thinkers through that. Yeah. Oh, I like your ideas. \",\"startTime\":1740788514,\"endTime\":1740788518},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Great. Yeah, that was good.\",\"startTime\":1740788519,\"endTime\":1740788521},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Again, internally I thought I''m gonna get her this time, but no. OK, read the \",\"startTime\":1740788522,\"endTime\":1740788525},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"challenges under more and choose one. Take turns with Brittany and look for \",\"startTime\":1740788525,\"endTime\":1740788528},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"common threads. \",\"startTime\":1740788528,\"endTime\":1740788531},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Share your story. We''re all here for different reasons. In your own word, what''s \",\"startTime\":1740788534,\"endTime\":1740788536},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"yours? \",\"startTime\":1740788536,\"endTime\":1740788538},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Resolve a problem. What''s the problem of practice that Brittany may be able \",\"startTime\":1740788539,\"endTime\":1740788542},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to help you with? Think together and share wisdom, experience. \",\"startTime\":1740788542,\"endTime\":1740788545},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I kind of like challenge one.\",\"startTime\":1740788544,\"endTime\":1740788546},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, go for it. Share your story.\",\"startTime\":1740788548,\"endTime\":1740788550},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK, so why I''m here?\",\"startTime\":1740788551,\"endTime\":1740788553},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK so I''m currently in my classroom. It''s Friday and my fourth year of teaching \",\"startTime\":1740788555,\"endTime\":1740788559},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"and I''m currently here. I''m. I''m gratefully here because this is my dream job. \",\"startTime\":1740788559,\"endTime\":1740788563},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1740788560,\"endTime\":1740788561},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I have been dreaming about this job since I was 15 in high school. So it''s almost \",\"startTime\":1740788563,\"endTime\":1740788567},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"been 10 years and. \",\"startTime\":1740788567,\"endTime\":1740788571},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I just love what I do and I''m really grateful to be here today. I''m healthy, \",\"startTime\":1740788573,\"endTime\":1740788577},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I''m able to get to work because I''m under a good contract. And I''m really here \",\"startTime\":1740788577,\"endTime\":1740788581},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"talking about this conversation with you because we met at a conference. I loved \",\"startTime\":1740788581,\"endTime\":1740788585},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"your energy. I love how you brought people together who should know one another \",\"startTime\":1740788585,\"endTime\":1740788589},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"to just advance in this profession and in our knowledge base and. \",\"startTime\":1740788589,\"endTime\":1740788594},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I''m here because I value your input, I respect you as an individual, and I''m just really excited to continue learning from you and other great individuals and professionals around me. \",\"startTime\":1740788594,\"endTime\":1740788603},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wow, you have such a wonderful stance about learning. It''s magical to be around \",\"startTime\":1740788605,\"endTime\":1740788607},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1740788607,\"endTime\":1740788610},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You bring a great energy to the crew and to the people around you and.\",\"startTime\":1740788610,\"endTime\":1740788614},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s amazing because you''re wanting to learn so much and you engage with the people around you and it''s wonderful. \",\"startTime\":1740788615,\"endTime\":1740788622},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1740788623,\"endTime\":1740788624},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I I''m here in doing the work that I''m doing because I enjoy working with people. \",\"startTime\":1740788623,\"endTime\":1740788628},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And at some point, like 10 years ago, the NCTM published Principles to actions and then they have their effective, effective mathematics teaching practices. \",\"startTime\":1740788628,\"endTime\":1740788637},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And one of them said facilitate meaningful mathematical discourse where we know that facilitating meaningful discourse is just the. \",\"startTime\":1740788637,\"endTime\":1740788646},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Most important thing probably to do at any level for any learner in any content. \",\"startTime\":1740788648,\"endTime\":1740788652},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But it really challenged me and I took it on. I''m like, yeah, I''ll work on that \",\"startTime\":1740788653,\"endTime\":1740788656},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"one for there''s eight of them. I''ll work on that one for a little bit, maybe \",\"startTime\":1740788656,\"endTime\":1740788660},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a year or I don''t know. I was, I had no idea that I would be. \",\"startTime\":1740788660,\"endTime\":1740788664},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Thinking so in depth about how do I facilitate meaningful discourse because the teachers that I work with or the people that I work with? \",\"startTime\":1740788664,\"endTime\":1740788671},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"We don''t get to come together very often. And if you''re doing a Zoom call or \",\"startTime\":1740788672,\"endTime\":1740788676},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"remote classes to help professionals learn more about what they''re doing. \",\"startTime\":1740788676,\"endTime\":1740788680},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You like, how do you facilitate meaningful discourse ''cause that''s, that''s a key. How do I embed that fact? I can do it in the classroom. And I was getting \",\"startTime\":1740788680,\"endTime\":1740788687},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"better at the classroom and I was stoked about that. But over the last 10 years, \",\"startTime\":1740788687,\"endTime\":1740788690},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m like, OK, I''m not in the classroom with kids. I''m in the classroom with \",\"startTime\":1740788690,\"endTime\":1740788694},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"adults. How do you do with adults? How do you use these routines to engage learners \",\"startTime\":1740788694,\"endTime\":1740788697},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and all of this stuff? And OK, how do you really facilitate meaningful discourse? \",\"startTime\":1740788697,\"endTime\":1740788700},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I don''t read and figure this out. And then I''m like, holy crap. \",\"startTime\":1740788700,\"endTime\":1740788703},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Write it.\",\"startTime\":1740788702,\"endTime\":1740788703},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Other tools in mic show me this tool and like we can do one-on-one conversations and not even be there in the room and trust them and you can facilitate meaningful discourse by having a few cars on the screen. How do you do that? \",\"startTime\":1740788705,\"endTime\":1740788717},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I love it. We can just dive in and get to all this good stuff.\",\"startTime\":1740788717,\"endTime\":1740788721},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. So I think it''s two reasons I''m here. One, I''m still on my quest \",\"startTime\":1740788722,\"endTime\":1740788726},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to facilitate meaningful discourse and I''m learning how to do it. I''m getting \",\"startTime\":1740788726,\"endTime\":1740788730},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"better at it because I love people. I love working with them. And I realize \",\"startTime\":1740788730,\"endTime\":1740788733},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1740788731,\"endTime\":1740788731},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it''s really important to let them do the talking and the learning and the the driving and the painting and all that stuff and to get out of the way. \",\"startTime\":1740788733,\"endTime\":1740788741},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And also.\",\"startTime\":1740788742,\"endTime\":1740788744},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I just love getting chance to see people do their things and want to get to interact with them and learn about them and hear from them. But I love being \",\"startTime\":1740788744,\"endTime\":1740788751},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"able to enhance their identity and agency as they''re doing their things and then synthesize their thinking and bring it together to the whole class or the whole group. And, and now it''s like my zone approximal development. How do you \",\"startTime\":1740788751,\"endTime\":1740788763},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"do that, Jeff, with educators all over the place? \",\"startTime\":1740788763,\"endTime\":1740788766},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And how do I use AI tools? So it feels to me much of A growing and how do I \",\"startTime\":1740788768,\"endTime\":1740788773},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788772,\"endTime\":1740788772},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"help grow community and grow educators and get out of the way and stop like now talking so much or taking so much air time in a classroom. But really just \",\"startTime\":1740788773,\"endTime\":1740788781},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"give them the tools to to do the things that they need to do to grow. \",\"startTime\":1740788781,\"endTime\":1740788785},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1740788781,\"endTime\":1740788781},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s why I''m here.\",\"startTime\":1740788786,\"endTime\":1740788787},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, wow.\",\"startTime\":1740788786,\"endTime\":1740788786},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I love that and I think like you''re really in the right, you''re in the right place. Like this is perfect for you and I''m so glad that you are doing this \",\"startTime\":1740788787,\"endTime\":1740788793},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"and sharing all of your knowledge and wisdom and just supporting our community at whole. \",\"startTime\":1740788793,\"endTime\":1740788799},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1740788794,\"endTime\":1740788795},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Thanks. Really appreciate it.\",\"startTime\":1740788800,\"endTime\":1740788802},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You slide that one in right there, thanking your partner. Thank you, Brittany. \",\"startTime\":1740788804,\"endTime\":1740788808},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I learned from you today. It''s called Text Blaze, and I said it a bunch of times. \",\"startTime\":1740788808,\"endTime\":1740788812},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thank you, Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1740788809,\"endTime\":1740788810},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Text Blaze Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788811,\"endTime\":1740788812},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So I remember text plays and what it does. I know more about what it does. I \",\"startTime\":1740788812,\"endTime\":1740788817},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"knew a little bit before by now I know more. Thank you. \",\"startTime\":1740788817,\"endTime\":1740788821},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Beautiful. Well, thank you, thank you, and thank you, Jeff. I learned how to \",\"startTime\":1740788820,\"endTime\":1740788825},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"use UPDUO for my first time. And so I''m really excited to get this out of the \",\"startTime\":1740788825,\"endTime\":1740788829},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"way so I do feel more comfortable engaging in these deep and powerful conversations with other professionals. \",\"startTime\":1740788829,\"endTime\":1740788838},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Awesome, awesome.\",\"startTime\":1740788838,\"endTime\":1740788839},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right. When you hit end, it like ends, ends, just FYI. So if you''re chatting \",\"startTime\":1740788840,\"endTime\":1740788844},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1740788843,\"endTime\":1740788844},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"with somebody like Next and you think it''s next, it''s not. It''s really end. \",\"startTime\":1740788844,\"endTime\":1740788848},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So yeah, yeah. Anything else Brittany you''re wondering about since we''re on \",\"startTime\":1740788848,\"endTime\":1740788853},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK, good to know.\",\"startTime\":1740788849,\"endTime\":1740788850},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a call besides the cards and stuff, anything about side by or what you''re wondering or had questions or wanted to say anything while you had a chance? It is almost \",\"startTime\":1740788853,\"endTime\":1740788861},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"430, but I just wanted to be mindful. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1740788861,\"endTime\":1740788866},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I think that now that I''ve had this I a lot of my questions were answered on how does it work. I was a little confused at first but I feel like this really \",\"startTime\":1740788867,\"endTime\":1740788876},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"clarified a lot for me so this has been helpful. \",\"startTime\":1740788876,\"endTime\":1740788880},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Awesome, good, good. And I''ll send you a follow up note, but uh, in your dashboard \",\"startTime\":1740788877,\"endTime\":1740788882},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"at my side by dot AI look in your feed and umm, we''re working on it and even next week we''re gonna have more updates that come. But uh, I''ll take our transcript \",\"startTime\":1740788882,\"endTime\":1740788892},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and it''s being automated now, which is better taking our transcript and then I can pull out of there and press the button. \",\"startTime\":1740788892,\"endTime\":1740788901},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And from our transcript, ask it our assistant, our robot.\",\"startTime\":1740788901,\"endTime\":1740788905},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hey, give us some insight and then it goes through and it will give us some insights from the conversation, quotes and interesting moments, challenges, inspiring this or whatever. And then I''ll, I''ll, I''ll hit push and it will push \",\"startTime\":1740788906,\"endTime\":1740788919},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to your feet. So I''ll be watching on there and I''ll send you a note too when \",\"startTime\":1740788919,\"endTime\":1740788923},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Ya, uh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1740788920,\"endTime\":1740788924},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it comes on there. But it''s great ''cause then you get artifacts back to you. \",\"startTime\":1740788923,\"endTime\":1740788928},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Instead of you trying to put all the stuff together, we want to put together for you artifacts so that you can, can just focus on conversation. \",\"startTime\":1740788928,\"endTime\":1740788936},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And get back to what you''re doing. And then out of it will come. Hey, here''s \",\"startTime\":1740788937,\"endTime\":1740788940},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I love that.\",\"startTime\":1740788937,\"endTime\":1740788938},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"your cool podcast or whatever down the road. Not yet. We''re not there yet. Yeah, \",\"startTime\":1740788940,\"endTime\":1740788943},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you got it. \",\"startTime\":1740788943,\"endTime\":1740788946},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I love that we get to create more, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788944,\"endTime\":1740788947},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, have a happy, wonderful Friday and a weekend. Hope you take care \",\"startTime\":1740788948,\"endTime\":1740788951},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Love that.\",\"startTime\":1740788948,\"endTime\":1740788949},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of yourself. Remember, nobody else will, OK? \",\"startTime\":1740788951,\"endTime\":1740788953},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thank you, Jeff. Have a good weekend. Bye, bye.\",\"startTime\":1740788954,\"endTime\":1740788957},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You''re welcome. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1740788956,\"endTime\":1740788957}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.882124+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.882124+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1428, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.842Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('ffbe89d7-ed50-4713-ad46-60afc77f5849', '1437c66b-ec40-4d5f-ae09-61eaf239da58', '137240', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I teach teachers to use AI so that they can teach their students to use AI.\",\"startTime\":1740437234,\"endTime\":1740437237},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"And.\",\"startTime\":1740437237,\"endTime\":1740437238},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I hope to learn about what''s changing as it changes.\",\"startTime\":1740437239,\"endTime\":1740437242},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Forward. Lean it forward whenever I find myself leaning too far back.\",\"startTime\":1740437256,\"endTime\":1740437258},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I remind myself to lean a little further forward.\",\"startTime\":1740437258,\"endTime\":1740437260},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Forward could means more student centrifuges. Forward could mean more skill. \",\"startTime\":1740437260,\"endTime\":1740437263},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Forward could mean. \",\"startTime\":1740437263,\"endTime\":1740437265},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Umm towards change towards technology umm forward could mean.\",\"startTime\":1740437267,\"endTime\":1740437270},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I don''t know.\",\"startTime\":1740437272,\"endTime\":1740437272},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I teach my kids to ski.\",\"startTime\":1740437288,\"endTime\":1740437289},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I like punk rock music. I like to ski off pieced, jump off of things.\",\"startTime\":1740437289,\"endTime\":1740437295}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.398238+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.398238+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 47, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.360Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('18d479ad-b7e5-45e7-a66a-6ca2c3230b46', '6591e553-8215-4832-843f-a15c716b5863', '137780', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Hello, just jumping in here to introduce myself and make sure I can match with a partner. Appreciate the ability to reflect. \",\"startTime\":1742588967,\"endTime\":1742588974},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I am Erica and.\",\"startTime\":1742588976,\"endTime\":1742588979},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"That''s that.\",\"startTime\":1742588986,\"endTime\":1742588987},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"So I''m in reflecting and it''s says there''s three cards but I''m just on card 1. \",\"startTime\":1742588988,\"endTime\":1742588993},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"And it doesn''t move me to the next card until I''m through a minute. That''s interesting. \",\"startTime\":1742588995,\"endTime\":1742589000},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"So I can''t finish the reflection quickly if I want to, which could be a thing. \",\"startTime\":1742589004,\"endTime\":1742589009},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"But that''s interesting. Like I can see that there''s three. \",\"startTime\":1742589009,\"endTime\":1742589013},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I could, I could just like X myself out, but I can''t. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1742589014,\"endTime\":1742589016},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"That''s interesting. It still did. So now I''ve hit my one minute.\",\"startTime\":1742589027,\"endTime\":1742589030}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.47678+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.47678+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 87, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.454Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('f7b6daa0-f971-4377-8a79-df012b2e34c1', '4734e9cf-74b7-4e89-b92c-8dc6f49c5b2a', '105903', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.270552+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.270552+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 627, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:54.187Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('21440ed0-f089-45aa-8267-9141c741b804', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '138135', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Everyone, my name is Mike Peck. Uh, I''m a director of technology for a public \",\"startTime\":1744720857,\"endTime\":1744720860},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"school in Pennsylvania. I''m excited to. \",\"startTime\":1744720860,\"endTime\":1744720863},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Through Upduo and sci-fi get to meet other.\",\"startTime\":1744720863,\"endTime\":1744720866},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Educators like myself.\",\"startTime\":1744720867,\"endTime\":1744720869},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Who are interested in how we can leverage technology to enhance learning.\",\"startTime\":1744720869,\"endTime\":1744720874},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Outcomes and opportunities.\",\"startTime\":1744720875,\"endTime\":1744720877},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So my stance with respect to teaching and learning, I prior to getting into technology leadership, I was the classroom educator. \",\"startTime\":1744720909,\"endTime\":1744720917},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And in that role?\",\"startTime\":1744720917,\"endTime\":1744720919},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Through the use of technology, I was really focused on how we can use the technology in a way that allows students to explore learning versus telling them how to learn. And so I focused a lot on project based learning and how we can learn \",\"startTime\":1744720921,\"endTime\":1744720938},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"through exploration and play. And this is going back to like 2007, 2008, 2009. \",\"startTime\":1744720938,\"endTime\":1744720944},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Where, you know, we were first seeing the initial like iPad rollouts and things like that. And So what I found was that students were much more interested in \",\"startTime\":1744720945,\"endTime\":1744720955},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"engaged in learning when they could actively explore it on their own and so. \",\"startTime\":1744720955,\"endTime\":1744720961},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"That said, about all sorts of exploration on my own part, looking into gamification. \",\"startTime\":1744720961,\"endTime\":1744720965},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Like I said, project based learning. \",\"startTime\":1744720965,\"endTime\":1744720969},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And then exploring new technologies and how they could really enhance teaching and learning. So my hope is new technologies can allow us to return to a place \",\"startTime\":1744720969,\"endTime\":1744720978},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"where educators can, can be, connectors can be, mentors can be. \",\"startTime\":1744720978,\"endTime\":1744720982},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, you know, supports versus being the thing that, that, uh, allows kids to learn. \",\"startTime\":1744720983,\"endTime\":1744720988},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And I think especially through the use of new technologies like AI that we''re gonna be able to get there. But we have to not just. \",\"startTime\":1744720989,\"endTime\":1744720997},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Think about teaching and learning. We need to think about the systems that undergird \",\"startTime\":1744720997,\"endTime\":1744720999},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"it. \",\"startTime\":1744720999,\"endTime\":1744721001},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I think umm.\",\"startTime\":1744721037,\"endTime\":1744721037},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I find myself most in a state of flow.\",\"startTime\":1744721037,\"endTime\":1744721041},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, when I''m engaging in sort of like passion projects. So certainly.\",\"startTime\":1744721043,\"endTime\":1744721046},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"With work, I like building stuff, planning things.\",\"startTime\":1744721047,\"endTime\":1744721051},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Executing on projects you know checking off the task list really gets me motivated. \",\"startTime\":1744721052,\"endTime\":1744721058},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Outside of work? Umm, I think uh.\",\"startTime\":1744721058,\"endTime\":1744721062},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, I think so. I would say first and foremost outside of work, umm, spending \",\"startTime\":1744721064,\"endTime\":1744721067},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"time with my, my son who''s 2, uh. \",\"startTime\":1744721067,\"endTime\":1744721071},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"He''s incredible and you know, I could spend hours and hours just kind of playing and talking and doing things with him. \",\"startTime\":1744721072,\"endTime\":1744721080},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Spending time with my family, both my my immediate family, my extended family. \",\"startTime\":1744721082,\"endTime\":1744721088},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Those things are really exciting for me and umm, and sports too, so I''m pretty active athlete, umm, still uh. \",\"startTime\":1744721088,\"endTime\":1744721095},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Somehow find my time to play.\",\"startTime\":1744721096,\"endTime\":1744721099},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Soccer, quite a bit, golfing are my 2 favorites and and so yeah, those are the things that I really enjoyed, you know, spending time on outside of work. \",\"startTime\":1744721099,\"endTime\":1744721108}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.263643+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.263643+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 198, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.229Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('b67134b3-70be-4675-ad42-6ca8e4557038', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '137153', '"[{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Hey, Tom, good morning. Happy hot tea to you.\",\"startTime\":1739982512,\"endTime\":1739982515},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1739982529,\"endTime\":1739982529},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, you glitched out for just a second that I agree. Your partner Tom \",\"startTime\":1739982530,\"endTime\":1739982534},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"and press more for the icebreaker. \",\"startTime\":1739982534,\"endTime\":1739982537},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You could have a superpower related to AI. What would it be and why? Oh.\",\"startTime\":1739982540,\"endTime\":1739982545},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Well, one of my super powers that I''ve always wished I had would be to be able to freeze time. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1739982552,\"endTime\":1739982558},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So, umm.\",\"startTime\":1739982562,\"endTime\":1739982563},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Is there a way to like?\",\"startTime\":1739982564,\"endTime\":1739982566},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like freeze time would be.\",\"startTime\":1739982568,\"endTime\":1739982570},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"For AI to.\",\"startTime\":1739982572,\"endTime\":1739982574},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Daily scan my calendar, tell me which things it''s got. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1739982575,\"endTime\":1739982581},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And tell me how much time I just gained and then I can.\",\"startTime\":1739982583,\"endTime\":1739982587},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Fill it with stuff that I would do if I could freeze time.\",\"startTime\":1739982590,\"endTime\":1739982593},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Am I hearing you like the superpower would be is the AI power tool would be to integrate with your calendar to help free up more space so that you would be able to do stuff like time or frozen? \",\"startTime\":1739982596,\"endTime\":1739982609},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes, exactly.\",\"startTime\":1739982611,\"endTime\":1739982612},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, I like that. I really like that.\",\"startTime\":1739982615,\"endTime\":1739982617},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think for me it would be similar but it''s more of time management.\",\"startTime\":1739982620,\"endTime\":1739982625},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"In my brain I have all of these, even kindergarten visuals of Jeff''s health and well-being. And the bars would be going up and down for the different areas \",\"startTime\":1739982627,\"endTime\":1739982635},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that Jeff got exercised. Jeff slept well, Jeff ate good food. Things that Jeff \",\"startTime\":1739982635,\"endTime\":1739982640},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"doesn''t manage really well in his life at times. \",\"startTime\":1739982640,\"endTime\":1739982644},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"But he''s happy when he''s got all of those buckets filled and the bars are reaching critical levels of happiness and getting the tea and walking about having good conversations. So for me, the superpower would be is like the automated. \",\"startTime\":1739982644,\"endTime\":1739982660},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I don''t know the heads up display of like Jarvis from Iron Man showing me how my oxygen levels are, but in all of the areas and and give me recommendations and help schedule out. Jeff, go for a walk and do a up duo chat with Tom a side \",\"startTime\":1739982662,\"endTime\":1739982674},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739982669,\"endTime\":1739982670},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739982671,\"endTime\":1739982672},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"by chat with Tom while you''re going for a walk. Remember your ear buds. And \",\"startTime\":1739982674,\"endTime\":1739982678},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"then it would show me that this is getting my my health and well-being meter up. \",\"startTime\":1739982678,\"endTime\":1739982687},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And scheduling out a ski date with with a friend and then make sure you''re doing art time to get in flow and to do your meditation and just let go of the other stuff and give your brain some space to think deeply. \",\"startTime\":1739982688,\"endTime\":1739982703},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739982690,\"endTime\":1739982691},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like, yeah, it''d be like the kindergarten mom for a little Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1739982703,\"endTime\":1739982707},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Integrated into my system. Oh I like.\",\"startTime\":1739982708,\"endTime\":1739982711},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, by the way, what is your, what''s your art?\",\"startTime\":1739982710,\"endTime\":1739982713},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Creating.\",\"startTime\":1739982716,\"endTime\":1739982717},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I love woodworking, first of all. It''s been a passion for a long time and of \",\"startTime\":1739982717,\"endTime\":1739982720},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"late I''ve been doodling. \",\"startTime\":1739982720,\"endTime\":1739982723},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"As a matter of fact, since I can walk about, I''ll show you my current doodle. \",\"startTime\":1739982725,\"endTime\":1739982729},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Welcome to our world.\",\"startTime\":1739982733,\"endTime\":1739982734},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''ll even put the light on.\",\"startTime\":1739982734,\"endTime\":1739982736},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"See if you can see it.\",\"startTime\":1739982741,\"endTime\":1739982742},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"It''s a line art technique that a friend shared with me and I''ve been morphing it and I like that. \",\"startTime\":1739982744,\"endTime\":1739982752},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739982746,\"endTime\":1739982747},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Use chalk in a medium and put a timer on it. So 5 minutes or 20 minutes or 15 \",\"startTime\":1739982752,\"endTime\":1739982757},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"minutes and then just doodle and do my drawings. So currently I''ve been doing \",\"startTime\":1739982757,\"endTime\":1739982762},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"landscapes and trying to embody what I see in the world and I find that even a 5 minute doodle on the chalkboard knowing that that''s all I have, that''s my canvas. If that''s the. \",\"startTime\":1739982762,\"endTime\":1739982778},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Microwave timer or whatever is cooking in the oven and I got 1520 minutes. I \",\"startTime\":1739982779,\"endTime\":1739982782},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"just put it on and that''s all I get. \",\"startTime\":1739982782,\"endTime\":1739982786},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And just get some space in there and.\",\"startTime\":1739982786,\"endTime\":1739982788},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s my current artwork.\",\"startTime\":1739982789,\"endTime\":1739982790},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Thanks for asking.\",\"startTime\":1739982792,\"endTime\":1739982794},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want to hit next. Oh, you beat me to it, ''cause it says partner ready.\",\"startTime\":1739982795,\"endTime\":1739982799},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, ask Tom.\",\"startTime\":1739982802,\"endTime\":1739982803},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"What recent AI innovation announced in the last week? Who did you find the most \",\"startTime\":1739982804,\"endTime\":1739982809},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"exciting? So if you didn''t hear in the last week, just in general? \",\"startTime\":1739982809,\"endTime\":1739982815},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, in the last week I heard about, learned about, and then played around with the, uh, ChatGPT, deep research. \",\"startTime\":1739982817,\"endTime\":1739982827},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Well, you played with it.\",\"startTime\":1739982829,\"endTime\":1739982830},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Tell me about it, I just read that it came out.\",\"startTime\":1739982831,\"endTime\":1739982833},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I with another guy who I''m just sort of like thinking and dreaming with. We \",\"startTime\":1739982836,\"endTime\":1739982841},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"both went on and went through this series of prompts about starting a new, innovative high school in Denver. \",\"startTime\":1739982841,\"endTime\":1739982851},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And you know, kind of research then it like it went deep into like here''s some funding, here''s structures, here''s. \",\"startTime\":1739982854,\"endTime\":1739982861},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like all these different?\",\"startTime\":1739982862,\"endTime\":1739982863},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"It was 27 pages of like, really kind of good.\",\"startTime\":1739982867,\"endTime\":1739982871},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Stuff that you could put in front of a board and they''d be like, whoa, you''ve really thought about this? \",\"startTime\":1739982871,\"endTime\":1739982876},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That sounds like a magic time stop machine.\",\"startTime\":1739982879,\"endTime\":1739982881},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s crazy.\",\"startTime\":1739982883,\"endTime\":1739982884},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"But I also I graduated to pay versions.\",\"startTime\":1739982887,\"endTime\":1739982892},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"For both ChatGPT and Claude.\",\"startTime\":1739982895,\"endTime\":1739982899},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like I said, I graduated. What gave you the impetus to graduate?\",\"startTime\":1739982901,\"endTime\":1739982905},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, it was. It was interest. Just like if I am the the kind of the person who \",\"startTime\":1739982910,\"endTime\":1739982915},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"is the future''s thinker at my organization. \",\"startTime\":1739982915,\"endTime\":1739982921},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And I''m a huge fan of AI and I use it all the time.\",\"startTime\":1739982922,\"endTime\":1739982926},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I just wanted to learn what the difference was. Lakeside school in Seattle there. \",\"startTime\":1739982927,\"endTime\":1739982933},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Do you track them or do you know anyone there or?\",\"startTime\":1739982935,\"endTime\":1739982937},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We had a couple people come to the AI Summit. We were in Seattle, Tacoma area \",\"startTime\":1739982939,\"endTime\":1739982943},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"2 weeks ago, first week of February and there were a few people there from Lakeside, so I got to meet with them but I don''t have any deep connections at the moment there. \",\"startTime\":1739982943,\"endTime\":1739982954},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So their director of tech is this guy Jamie Britto.\",\"startTime\":1739982954,\"endTime\":1739982957},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Who is an amazing thinker and you 2 are?\",\"startTime\":1739982959,\"endTime\":1739982962},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Absolutely kindred spirits in a lot of ways. So that''s like an interesting connection. \",\"startTime\":1739982965,\"endTime\":1739982971},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"They are offering paid ChatGPT to every student and faculty member. \",\"startTime\":1739982971,\"endTime\":1739982978},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1739982982,\"endTime\":1739982983},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And so just sort of talking with him, seeing what they''re thinking about, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739982982,\"endTime\":1739982987},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, super cool thing that we''ve been doing and it was fun even at just similar. \",\"startTime\":1739982991,\"endTime\":1739982997},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I don''t want to go too far off topic here, but this just reminds me that at the AI Summit, we were able to give three people who are in the session with Mike and I as about how do you, how do you keep up with AI in the next decade? \",\"startTime\":1739982997,\"endTime\":1739983012},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And at side by, even at the, the main page at side by, there''s a opportunity for people to sponsor educators and we had 19 sponsorships available so that we could give. \",\"startTime\":1739983012,\"endTime\":1739983027},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Sponsorships and paid subscriptions. So three people in a session, we were giving \",\"startTime\":1739983029,\"endTime\":1739983034},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"play time and they were exploring and using tools and as Mike said it, hey, when you reach a barrier and it''s a paywall barrier, let us know we happen to have sponsorships. So three people got. \",\"startTime\":1739983034,\"endTime\":1739983048},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Either a ChatGPT plus or access to lovable and and I think the other one was ChatGPT plus also or maybe Claude but. \",\"startTime\":1739983048,\"endTime\":1739983058},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Teachers have that as a barrier and it''s great to hear at Lakeside that they''re removing that barrier for them and that side by some groups are saying, hey, we want to support and what what could we do to support? And we know that one \",\"startTime\":1739983058,\"endTime\":1739983069},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"of the things is to provide access for people to. \",\"startTime\":1739983069,\"endTime\":1739983073},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Get their paid subscriptions so that they can use the tools and drive this super cool ship. \",\"startTime\":1739983073,\"endTime\":1739983079},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That they''re at, they''re at the controls and they can run with it. Yeah, I think \",\"startTime\":1739983079,\"endTime\":1739983083},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that''s a huge thing for educators is to get them into the driver''s seat so they can really play with the the stuff. \",\"startTime\":1739983083,\"endTime\":1739983089},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1739983083,\"endTime\":1739983084},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Exactly.\",\"startTime\":1739983090,\"endTime\":1739983091},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, the by the way.\",\"startTime\":1739983095,\"endTime\":1739983098},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Bueno, güey.\",\"startTime\":1739983099,\"endTime\":1739983099},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"This video call that we''re doing, what''s, what''s the like?\",\"startTime\":1739983100,\"endTime\":1739983104},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"What is up to using for the video call?\",\"startTime\":1739983104,\"endTime\":1739983107},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s a great question. I don''t know all the answers to that, but I do \",\"startTime\":1739983112,\"endTime\":1739983117},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"know that with the software, the engineers programming in and with tools today, it''s pretty easy to even set up your own web space. By the way, you could do \",\"startTime\":1739983117,\"endTime\":1739983125},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Lovable is the app that we''re using to build a bunch of cool stuff. Like you \",\"startTime\":1739983125,\"endTime\":1739983130},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"can even at Lovable. Claude would have something similar, but Lovable would \",\"startTime\":1739983130,\"endTime\":1739983134},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"integrate and there''s like 3 different main pieces. \",\"startTime\":1739983134,\"endTime\":1739983139},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"To run software, to be able to do video calls and to have them recorded, you need a database, you need to have a server and then your your code repository. \",\"startTime\":1739983139,\"endTime\":1739983148},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"There''s something else I''m missing right now, but yeah, we should chat about that one later. I can give you hints on it so. \",\"startTime\":1739983148,\"endTime\":1739983156},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"All good. Yeah, lovable. I just pulled it up and came around with that later. \",\"startTime\":1739983156,\"endTime\":1739983160},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, play with Lovable. Lovable is a great one to build out code for websites \",\"startTime\":1739983160,\"endTime\":1739983163},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1739983161,\"endTime\":1739983161},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"for doing things like what you''re saying. Claude also has that same kind of \",\"startTime\":1739983163,\"endTime\":1739983167},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"ability, but different lovables like turbo power, and you might have fun playing with that one too. \",\"startTime\":1739983167,\"endTime\":1739983174},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Cool for sure.\",\"startTime\":1739983173,\"endTime\":1739983176},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Sorry, hold on a second, you didn''t share your AI?\",\"startTime\":1739983176,\"endTime\":1739983179},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah. All right.\",\"startTime\":1739983177,\"endTime\":1739983178},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I did indirectly and it''s cool is the cards sometimes are more of a asking and a listening roles. So in that case I was asking listen and then you were the \",\"startTime\":1739983183,\"endTime\":1739983192},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"1 to get to speak. \",\"startTime\":1739983192,\"endTime\":1739983196},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"But on this next card, take turns sharing with Tom, so sometimes I don''t get to tell my cool things, I just get to listen. \",\"startTime\":1739983197,\"endTime\":1739983204},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And it''s just how we set up the cards. And by the way, as we generate questions \",\"startTime\":1739983206,\"endTime\":1739983210},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"or we ask the cards or write the curriculum and as administrators, when you do have a a closed community, like you might have it ready lab or the launch network, we can co-author or you could you could write the card questions that you would want for your team. We write them for the open communities at this \",\"startTime\":1739983210,\"endTime\":1739983225},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"point so that people can engage in rich conversation like the next one. Take \",\"startTime\":1739983225,\"endTime\":1739983229},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"turns sharing with Tom. \",\"startTime\":1739983229,\"endTime\":1739983233},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And I I I screwed up. I accidentally hit back.\",\"startTime\":1739983234,\"endTime\":1739983238},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, it''s OK.\",\"startTime\":1739983238,\"endTime\":1739983239},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s cool. I didn''t come back. Now we can go forward again.\",\"startTime\":1739983240,\"endTime\":1739983243},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Now I''m Yeah. Cool. So you in order if I go back, it makes you go back?\",\"startTime\":1739983244,\"endTime\":1739983248},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh it it says the same thing like going for partner ready, but then the arrow was saying go back. \",\"startTime\":1739983248,\"endTime\":1739983254},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. OK. Sorry. Cool.\",\"startTime\":1739983253,\"endTime\":1739983254},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"No, no, don''t be sorry.\",\"startTime\":1739983254,\"endTime\":1739983256},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Take turns to the hotel.\",\"startTime\":1739983257,\"endTime\":1739983258},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"All right, how might these innovations change what is possible in work or personal projects? \",\"startTime\":1739983257,\"endTime\":1739983264},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, and then they''re more enhanced creativity, streamline daily workflows, tasks, potential challenges. \",\"startTime\":1739983266,\"endTime\":1739983274},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, you''re bugging me to answer, so I''m gonna answer first this time.\",\"startTime\":1739983278,\"endTime\":1739983282},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think the creativity we we chatted about a little bit like that time freezing opportunity like to free up more scheduled time in our in our day, automating those tasks like the emails that we don''t really need to read and reply to the calendaring back and forth. \",\"startTime\":1739983285,\"endTime\":1739983302},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739983301,\"endTime\":1739983301},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Automation stuff, Even things like taking our ideas and and.\",\"startTime\":1739983305,\"endTime\":1739983309},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Creating the.\",\"startTime\":1739983310,\"endTime\":1739983312},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Board presentation, but from our ideas.\",\"startTime\":1739983313,\"endTime\":1739983316},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That comes from us and I think that then ties into like those challenges and the concerns that we have is that is the is the computer, is the robot, is the software, is the assistance that we build or create or have. Are we using them \",\"startTime\":1739983317,\"endTime\":1739983334},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So what are the things that you think need?\",\"startTime\":1739983317,\"endTime\":1739983321},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"to and I''m going to use Lori Edwards phrase from yesterday enhance our thinking. \",\"startTime\":1739983334,\"endTime\":1739983339},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Are we using them to enhance our thinking or replace our thinking and that notion and concern of? \",\"startTime\":1739983342,\"endTime\":1739983349},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We using it to to help grow our brains to be stronger or we just replacing and there''s some things that I do think that it should replace our thinking and our thinking time like navigating calendaring. How much time and organizations \",\"startTime\":1739983350,\"endTime\":1739983363},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"do we spend calendaring and back and forth emails and how do I write this e-mail so that it sounds nice to Tom and I want to get on a couple like that''s just a lot of wasted time. I''m totally OK with replacing that kind of thinking. But \",\"startTime\":1739983363,\"endTime\":1739983376},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"when it comes to real. \",\"startTime\":1739983376,\"endTime\":1739983380},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Thinking like you were mentioning.\",\"startTime\":1739983382,\"endTime\":1739983384},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Creating a new innovative school.\",\"startTime\":1739983385,\"endTime\":1739983388},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We need your mind behind that and we need the tools to support you and enhance your thinking, not replace your thinking along those lines. So I think. \",\"startTime\":1739983389,\"endTime\":1739983399},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"The innovations can change the work and the projects. It''s I think it''s like \",\"startTime\":1739983400,\"endTime\":1739983405},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"rocket fuel accelerating us to go faster and to bring in ideas and to bring in wording that I might not have thought about that really comes alongside me. \",\"startTime\":1739983405,\"endTime\":1739983414},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And then again, that challenge and concern would be is. \",\"startTime\":1739983414,\"endTime\":1739983418},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Is it really supporting me in my thinking, enhancing my thinking, enhancing our collective thinking, or is it replacing us? The quote that I''ve liked to \",\"startTime\":1739983419,\"endTime\":1739983429},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"use I stole from Matt Green, who stole it from somebody else''s are. \",\"startTime\":1739983429,\"endTime\":1739983434},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You programming the machine or is the machine programming you?\",\"startTime\":1739983436,\"endTime\":1739983441},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And, and for me, that dopamine hit of the media scroll is, oh, it''s programming me. I have a need to get on and, and do my scroll or play the game to get my \",\"startTime\":1739983445,\"endTime\":1739983454},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"dopamine hit versus you''re using the tools like with this deep research in your programming it, you''re taking your ideas and then you''re using an appropriate tool strategically and you''re telling it what to do and you''re hence then programming it. \",\"startTime\":1739983454,\"endTime\":1739983473},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but what''s possible?\",\"startTime\":1739983477,\"endTime\":1739983478},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Man, I think we could talk all day on this one.\",\"startTime\":1739983479,\"endTime\":1739983481},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"The rocket fuel first.\",\"startTime\":1739983487,\"endTime\":1739983490},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"In my life.\",\"startTime\":1739983492,\"endTime\":1739983494},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"My work or in US as a system. Give me some, give me a lane.\",\"startTime\":1739983495,\"endTime\":1739983500},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739983497,\"endTime\":1739983498},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Good, good.\",\"startTime\":1739983501,\"endTime\":1739983503},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Good question.\",\"startTime\":1739983503,\"endTime\":1739983504},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, in your work.\",\"startTime\":1739983506,\"endTime\":1739983507},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And what does it mean rocket fuel in your work?\",\"startTime\":1739983513,\"endTime\":1739983516}