Time\":1739983580,\"endTime\":1739983585},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And, and it''s like the rocket fuel for me would be maybe talking with the deep research or some of these tools and getting into OK, Jeff, first of all, here is your project management goals and objectives. Here''s your timeline for these \",\"startTime\":1739983587,\"endTime\":1739983601},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"things. Let''s work on this and then focus to tools of OK, here''s this this ABC \",\"startTime\":1739983601,\"endTime\":1739983606},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that we could use for getting you to these goals. And to be that assistant, \",\"startTime\":1739983606,\"endTime\":1739983611},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"like my project manager, I I need AAI assistant. That''s my. \",\"startTime\":1739983611,\"endTime\":1739983616},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Project manager to get the stuff done and not be distracted and also not just, you know how it goes. We ride those emotional ups and downs every day or through \",\"startTime\":1739983617,\"endTime\":1739983625},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the week and you''re like, I don''t really feel like it. I don''t feel the energy \",\"startTime\":1739983625,\"endTime\":1739983628},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"and excitement to be creative today. \",\"startTime\":1739983628,\"endTime\":1739983632},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Or right now, but I still need that project manager to bug me and, and nudge me for it. Hey, Jeff, get that done. It''s important for Tom. Oh yeah, yeah, \",\"startTime\":1739983633,\"endTime\":1739983642},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want to get that done. Yeah. So specifically it''s about helping me manage \",\"startTime\":1739983642,\"endTime\":1739983647},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"out my time and to get the things done in a in a fashion that''s one, doable and then two, really effective. And to get those artifacts. I want to get these \",\"startTime\":1739983647,\"endTime\":1739983656},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"artifacts too. I want to make cool movies and podcasts and and blog posts and. \",\"startTime\":1739983656,\"endTime\":1739983660},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And a proposal for your ready lab crew or for your sandbox crew. I want to have \",\"startTime\":1739983665,\"endTime\":1739983670},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"all of that stuff done and handed to you. That would be my dreamland, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739983670,\"endTime\":1739983674},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"How about you?\",\"startTime\":1739983676,\"endTime\":1739983677},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739983676,\"endTime\":1739983677},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I.\",\"startTime\":1739983692,\"endTime\":1739983692},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"There''s this like.\",\"startTime\":1739983692,\"endTime\":1739983694},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I I would love for the rocket fuel to be poured on.\",\"startTime\":1739983695,\"endTime\":1739983700},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Any choice that I make or like that an educator is making.\",\"startTime\":1739983705,\"endTime\":1739983710},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"On a day when they''re working, you know, having that direct student.\",\"startTime\":1739983710,\"endTime\":1739983713},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Facing, you know, interaction student facing work.\",\"startTime\":1739983716,\"endTime\":1739983720},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Where you''re not like doctors right now are wearing earpieces and it''s recording all their notes and it''s charting it really quickly and. \",\"startTime\":1739983723,\"endTime\":1739983730},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know, you can say and I''ll, you know, order a prescription for blah, blah, blah. And it''s like, like it''s all happening. Like what if we. \",\"startTime\":1739983731,\"endTime\":1739983737},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"What if we were to wear?\",\"startTime\":1739983737,\"endTime\":1739983739},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like to have something that was recording us and the rocket fuel went on to. \",\"startTime\":1739983740,\"endTime\":1739983744},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"A you''ve already like it, it notices a couple of things that you''ve already offered this. \",\"startTime\":1739983747,\"endTime\":1739983751},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"The, the kid didn''t take it. So don''t offer that same thing again, or you''re \",\"startTime\":1739983752,\"endTime\":1739983756},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"just like offering the same thing over and over again or like you''re just repeating like this. Really. I, I don''t know what else to say about this conservative \",\"startTime\":1739983756,\"endTime\":1739983764},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"cycle. \",\"startTime\":1739983764,\"endTime\":1739983767},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Of, you know, like this essay question is.\",\"startTime\":1739983768,\"endTime\":1739983773},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You''re not really pushing them to think, you''re just kind of like being safe and cautious. \",\"startTime\":1739983774,\"endTime\":1739983778},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And here are the.\",\"startTime\":1739983781,\"endTime\":1739983782},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Would that be like the like the coach in the ear so you could be coached live along? Is that what you''re talking about? Or is that an afterwards like you \",\"startTime\":1739983781,\"endTime\":1739983788},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I think that it''s got to be.\",\"startTime\":1739983786,\"endTime\":1739983788},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"would get your? \",\"startTime\":1739983788,\"endTime\":1739983791},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Coaching Debrief.\",\"startTime\":1739983792,\"endTime\":1739983794},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"If it''s coaching live.\",\"startTime\":1739983797,\"endTime\":1739983799},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I don''t know, I mean, this is kind of like the dreamy world. I, I, I''m wondering \",\"startTime\":1739983800,\"endTime\":1739983805},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"if, if you move into debrief, then you''ve got reflection that''s required. And \",\"startTime\":1739983805,\"endTime\":1739983809},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"that''s that reflection is where you know, a teacher can, because if you''re just coach, if it''s just like coaching with this one kid, then it''s like, how does it transfer from kid to kid? How does it transfer to the rescue family? Where \",\"startTime\":1739983809,\"endTime\":1739983822},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"if you''re like you''re reflecting on it, you can kind of notice different patterns. \",\"startTime\":1739983822,\"endTime\":1739983826},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Does that make sense by distinction?\",\"startTime\":1739983830,\"endTime\":1739983832},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Hmm, Yeah, it does. What would you seize most effective for your crew or for \",\"startTime\":1739983832,\"endTime\":1739983835},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"you? \",\"startTime\":1739983835,\"endTime\":1739983838},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Right now, today''s meeting or today''s readiness?\",\"startTime\":1739983840,\"endTime\":1739983843},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I mean, yeah, so it''s like so today''s.\",\"startTime\":1739983844,\"endTime\":1739983847},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Readiness.\",\"startTime\":1739983848,\"endTime\":1739983850},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I mean, one of the things that''s interesting is we spend.\",\"startTime\":1739983852,\"endTime\":1739983854},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Hours, hours, hours on working on schedules where like man that stuff could be really smooth. Like if there was a way to create. \",\"startTime\":1739983855,\"endTime\":1739983867},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Some sort of AI function?\",\"startTime\":1739983870,\"endTime\":1739983872},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"That, you know, just goes and creates schedules or like I go to, you know, my chat bot and I was like, hey, where is Hashem right now? And you know, it''s \",\"startTime\":1739983875,\"endTime\":1739983883},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"just like dials it in because I can''t remember where he is, if he''s supposed to be here or not because we''re kind of all over the place. \",\"startTime\":1739983883,\"endTime\":1739983891},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Number one. Number two is like Martha. I''m about to spend an hour here designing \",\"startTime\":1739983893,\"endTime\":1739983899},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"something for Martha for tomorrow because she''s really stuck with this. \",\"startTime\":1739983899,\"endTime\":1739983905},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Group of kids like she''s and she''s kinda.\",\"startTime\":1739983906,\"endTime\":1739983909},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like at a block with it and kind of down in the dumps about it. So I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1739983909,\"endTime\":1739983912},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"spend some time putting some stuff together. \",\"startTime\":1739983912,\"endTime\":1739983914},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So her to execute tomorrow where like AI could have been like recording all these sessions with kids and it''s like the reason why they''re stuck is you''re doing the same thing over and over again. There''s nothing new. \",\"startTime\":1739983916,\"endTime\":1739983929},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Here are three ideas for something new to do.\",\"startTime\":1739983930,\"endTime\":1739983932},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, I want to up the game a little bit. What if he had a tool like side by where \",\"startTime\":1739983935,\"endTime\":1739983940},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"kids could get in for either reflections or one-on-one conversations with another student about where they are in their their growth journey and their path as a as a student and questions like how was the support? \",\"startTime\":1739983940,\"endTime\":1739983956},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739983951,\"endTime\":1739983952},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"From your your educators, or even more generally, Hey, where did you feel like you were positioned as capable? \",\"startTime\":1739983960,\"endTime\":1739983967},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"How did that feel? Did they give you the steering wheel or the pencil to do \",\"startTime\":1739983967,\"endTime\":1739983971},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"these things this week? How did they do that or how did they not do that? And \",\"startTime\":1739983971,\"endTime\":1739983975},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"how did you feel about your identity this week? What were you as a learner? \",\"startTime\":1739983975,\"endTime\":1739983979},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Did you have your identity enhanced? Who? How did you see yourself as a learner \",\"startTime\":1739983979,\"endTime\":1739983983},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"this week? Where was your agency? How did you? \",\"startTime\":1739983983,\"endTime\":1739983987},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"What was it like for you as a learner along those lines? And then the third \",\"startTime\":1739983988,\"endTime\":1739983992},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"principle that I always go to is valuing multiple contributions. So that did \",\"startTime\":1739983992,\"endTime\":1739983996},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"you position each learners capable? Did you enhance the identity and agency \",\"startTime\":1739983996,\"endTime\":1739984001},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"of each learner? And then did you value multiple contributions? Hey kid, just \",\"startTime\":1739984001,\"endTime\":1739984005},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"reflect with somebody else. Tom, were you were you getting different perspectives \",\"startTime\":1739984005,\"endTime\":1739984009},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"and different ways of thinking from other people and hear about their ideas? \",\"startTime\":1739984009,\"endTime\":1739984013},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And did you feel like you had the the place and space? \",\"startTime\":1739984013,\"endTime\":1739984018},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And felt like you belong to share your thinking so that others valued your contributions as well. Like if you had that, then then I''m just wondering like one-on-one \",\"startTime\":1739984019,\"endTime\":1739984029},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"conversations or even reflections, self reflections for the the learners to get that data to feed into the system that you''re talking about so that you get feedback as an educator. And then you would go, oh, holy crap, little Jeff \",\"startTime\":1739984029,\"endTime\":1739984044},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"is feeling like you took this pencil away. \",\"startTime\":1739984044,\"endTime\":1739984049},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, Tom took his pencil away. That''s what he said. And why don''t you \",\"startTime\":1739984050,\"endTime\":1739984053},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"give him the pencil, Tom? And then Jeff feels like he belongs and he''s at the \",\"startTime\":1739984053,\"endTime\":1739984056},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"controls. And then you can help support him or like you said. \",\"startTime\":1739984056,\"endTime\":1739984060},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You''ve been telling me the same thing over and over again. It''s not working. \",\"startTime\":1739984061,\"endTime\":1739984064},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like you don''t need to tell me 20 more times the same thing. \",\"startTime\":1739984064,\"endTime\":1739984068},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And what if so this is like a like a question about the back end or like how things work, but also like as a way to riff on your idea. \",\"startTime\":1739984068,\"endTime\":1739984078},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like is this transcript being recorded? And then is it the same thing? Saved \",\"startTime\":1739984079,\"endTime\":1739984083},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"ideas get pushed up. It''s like, hey man, you said this thing five different \",\"startTime\":1739984083,\"endTime\":1739984086},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"times and these are the moments of brilliance or these are the the insights and then that kid now has. \",\"startTime\":1739984086,\"endTime\":1739984093},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"A like, you have so many thoughts, right? So you''ve got this like partner in \",\"startTime\":1739984096,\"endTime\":1739984099},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"distilling and crystallizing. Oh, that''s, that''s a, you know, that''s exactly \",\"startTime\":1739984099,\"endTime\":1739984103},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"what I was feeling, but I didn''t kind of notice that because I wasn''t able to capture all of my language that I said out loud, but. \",\"startTime\":1739984103,\"endTime\":1739984110},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Instead of just like journaling with yourself or.\",\"startTime\":1739984111,\"endTime\":1739984113},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know your keyboard, you''re doing it with someone else.\",\"startTime\":1739984113,\"endTime\":1739984116},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Answering your question in brief, I think what we''re trying to do is really \",\"startTime\":1739984117,\"endTime\":1739984124},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"remove the neurological burden, the cognitive load when it comes to note taking, when it comes to reflections and really keen into the strengths that we have as humans and that we''re language based, we''re we''re communicators, we''re storytellers. \",\"startTime\":1739984124,\"endTime\":1739984144},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And even right now I can just start talking and I''m not worried about how it''s spelled or how it''s written or for me, which color pen I''m going to use to write the thing down and is this most important and I write it bigger font or like all of those questions are on my mind that cognitive load is too much. \",\"startTime\":1739984146,\"endTime\":1739984162},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And to free that up for the individual to say, just talk, tell your story, have questioning, go back and forth with rich discourse. And then we''ll use the tools \",\"startTime\":1739984163,\"endTime\":1739984173},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"like from here, the transcript right now, what we can do is, is run it through that process that you saw just real quickly. What are some of the the pluses, \",\"startTime\":1739984173,\"endTime\":1739984182},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the challenges and then really cool inspirational perspectives. That''s where \",\"startTime\":1739984182,\"endTime\":1739984187},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want that turbo or that rocket fuel to really help me in my work is. \",\"startTime\":1739984187,\"endTime\":1739984192},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want it to be even more, I want to give even more to the the user so that on your space at my at side by you''re going to get all of that and even more that I could give you the hey, Tom, you were talking about innovative teaching schools. Here''s five articles that that seemed to be really related to what \",\"startTime\":1739984193,\"endTime\":1739984210},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"you were doing. And here are five people that are are doing wonderful things. \",\"startTime\":1739984210,\"endTime\":1739984215},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And here''s 2 podcasts. \",\"startTime\":1739984215,\"endTime\":1739984219},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Sure, what you''re looking for, but if you''re looking for more, here''s more for you. And Tom, if you want to click on this, we will connect you with with Amy \",\"startTime\":1739984221,\"endTime\":1739984229},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Hancock, who is dreaming about starting a new school, who at dream camp last year articulated that she wants to build a new school and on her timeline XYZ and we can share that with you to connect. Oh, and Tom, here''s a cool article. \",\"startTime\":1739984229,\"endTime\":1739984242},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You know, we could post that with you on LinkedIn to share and showcase this awesome stuff that you''re doing. \",\"startTime\":1739984242,\"endTime\":1739984251},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That is out of the conversation where you are in your journey. We can meet you \",\"startTime\":1739984251,\"endTime\":1739984255},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"where you are, and that''s where I want the rocket fuel to go faster and the tools to get that to life for you. \",\"startTime\":1739984255,\"endTime\":1739984263},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739984260,\"endTime\":1739984260},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"To that point, like record this stuff like hey, by the way, here''s an article that like takes all the things you just said and that and you should post this to LinkedIn now that would be amazing. I have got A10 AMI guess 9:00 AM your \",\"startTime\":1739984264,\"endTime\":1739984278},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"time hard stop. No, no, no, no, I just want to like. \",\"startTime\":1739984278,\"endTime\":1739984283},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s right. That''s right. OK.\",\"startTime\":1739984282,\"endTime\":1739984283},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Honor all the different awesomenesses that we''re going to read the scenario. \",\"startTime\":1739984289,\"endTime\":1739984293},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, the next scenario, let''s just read it real quick because I think we probably answered it. \",\"startTime\":1739984292,\"endTime\":1739984296},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"How could you encourage each other to explore and chat new? Yep.\",\"startTime\":1739984298,\"endTime\":1739984301},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, all right.\",\"startTime\":1739984301,\"endTime\":1739984303},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like you just, you just gave a great scenario on that.\",\"startTime\":1739984302,\"endTime\":1739984305},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And I''m going to challenge for this is the tool that I''m going to try building here. And then I''m going to drop it for you and you build what you want to lovable \",\"startTime\":1739984306,\"endTime\":1739984314},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"might be a great place. And since you already have clawed and you have ChatGPT \",\"startTime\":1739984314,\"endTime\":1739984318},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"my path, I''ve done and and my kid has done it as well as we chat with Claude or ChatGPT and say, hey. \",\"startTime\":1739984318,\"endTime\":1739984327},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want to build out this scheduling monitor tool and you describe it in the way that you were describing to me, but in more detail and then talk about how you want to use a tool like Lovable to try to build that. \",\"startTime\":1739984327,\"endTime\":1739984340},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Cloud or GBT tech? GBT might be able to do that as well for you, but I''m thinking \",\"startTime\":1739984342,\"endTime\":1739984346},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Lovable might really fit for your itch. \",\"startTime\":1739984346,\"endTime\":1739984350},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That I know you want to scratch like how do I build this stuff out? And then \",\"startTime\":1739984350,\"endTime\":1739984354},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"after chatting in one, then go for it and and see what you can do in lovable and see if you can build it an interactive. Hey, where are people at and how \",\"startTime\":1739984354,\"endTime\":1739984362},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"do we make this faster? And that scheduling monitor tool. I''m not sure but that \",\"startTime\":1739984362,\"endTime\":1739984366},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that would be yeah, that''s what I heard from you. All right, rock star. \",\"startTime\":1739984366,\"endTime\":1739984371},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Check it out.\",\"startTime\":1739984368,\"endTime\":1739984368},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I''m gonna play.\",\"startTime\":1739984369,\"endTime\":1739984370},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So thank you.\",\"startTime\":1739984375,\"endTime\":1739984377},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Last card.\",\"startTime\":1739984375,\"endTime\":1739984376},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Learned lovable. Didn''t know lovable.\",\"startTime\":1739984378,\"endTime\":1739984380},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Boom and thanks for the reminder. I guess learning that we can stop time. I \",\"startTime\":1739984381,\"endTime\":1739984385},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"never thought of it that way and I really can''t. \",\"startTime\":1739984385,\"endTime\":1739984390},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"What would I do if I could stop time? I would want to do these other things \",\"startTime\":1739984391,\"endTime\":1739984392},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"so. \",\"startTime\":1739984392,\"endTime\":1739984394},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I can''t stop time, so that''s what I''m learning.\",\"startTime\":1739984394,\"endTime\":1739984397},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Thank you. Yeah, thank you for Lovable.\",\"startTime\":1739984401,\"endTime\":1739984404}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.354088+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.354088+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1896, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.313Z", "session_title": "Innovation in AI - Recent Updates", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1447", "name": "Innovation in AI - Recent Updates", "tags": [{"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}, {"name": "First10"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('0d0ab037-88ba-4ed9-a4b2-551e09f5795a', '903382e8-a889-4f58-85bc-6ec0178aa685', '108011', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.279329+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.279329+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 465, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:54.202Z", "session_title": "AI for Educators: Applying AI in Your Job", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "196", "name": "AI for Educators: Applying AI in Your Job", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('d1da47b8-ea69-40d1-a622-607ee11f6332', 'e703c834-b010-4c88-9b89-e310df8ad353', '138666', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"One of my favorite books or movies that features featuring technology. Let''s \",\"startTime\":1746802822,\"endTime\":1746802824},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"see. \",\"startTime\":1746802824,\"endTime\":1746802826},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I think any kind of book or movie rather that has something to do with like like where we''re in a simulation and then we wake up and we realize this is all the dream. I love this kind of films kind of like black beer. I really like \",\"startTime\":1746802829,\"endTime\":1746802841},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"anything with aliens, like not like aliens like bingo and or anything, but like aliens and such like artificial intelligence, right? And I really enjoy being \",\"startTime\":1746802841,\"endTime\":1746802850},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"like a plot twist inside of a feature technology. \",\"startTime\":1746802850,\"endTime\":1746802854},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I think a black bear episode that just came out was that.\",\"startTime\":1746802856,\"endTime\":1746802859},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"To stay alive, you had to pay money and everything. I I think if you didn''t \",\"startTime\":1746802861,\"endTime\":1746802864},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"have enough money that you couldn''t stay alive. I think that just was released \",\"startTime\":1746802864,\"endTime\":1746802868},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"one where another one where in a Black Mirror episode. I think that''s it. One \",\"startTime\":1746802868,\"endTime\":1746802872},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"minute challenge. Exactly. \",\"startTime\":1746802872,\"endTime\":1746802875},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"It''s really changed.\",\"startTime\":1746802919,\"endTime\":1746802920},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"No, I think it''s testing my patients and.\",\"startTime\":1746802920,\"endTime\":1746802923},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"It''s interesting because we have the technology that.\",\"startTime\":1746802925,\"endTime\":1746802928},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"We''re all supposed to be using, but we don''t know how to use it.\",\"startTime\":1746802929,\"endTime\":1746802931},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Per se. And then there''s a lot of articles about cheating and academic dishonesty \",\"startTime\":1746802932,\"endTime\":1746802936},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"and I have a different type of view on all. \",\"startTime\":1746802936,\"endTime\":1746802940},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"All of that I have a different view on We all cheat. We in the workplace, we''re \",\"startTime\":1746802940,\"endTime\":1746802944},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"all using guidebooks, we''re all using ABCDEFG. And in the world of AI, it''s \",\"startTime\":1746802944,\"endTime\":1746802949},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"a different beast. And so we have to change the way we think about things. \",\"startTime\":1746802949,\"endTime\":1746802953},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"For me, I want to be at the forefront. I want to make a change. I built the \",\"startTime\":1746802954,\"endTime\":1746802958},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"AI faculty lounge and you know, marketing is something new for me. Everything''s \",\"startTime\":1746802958,\"endTime\":1746802962},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"new for me. It''s a new challenge. So it''s made me a better person. It''s made \",\"startTime\":1746802962,\"endTime\":1746802965},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"me think about the world and it''s made me think about how I choose to contribute to the world, especially in a time of AI. It has improved, I have improved rather, \",\"startTime\":1746802965,\"endTime\":1746802973},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"and I love it. At the moment, it''s hard, it''s challenging, and it tests my patients \",\"startTime\":1746802973,\"endTime\":1746802976},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"daily. \",\"startTime\":1746802976,\"endTime\":1746802980},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"But one day at a time.\",\"startTime\":1746802981,\"endTime\":1746802982},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"They think AI think his role learners. Absolutely. I think there''s a new pathway \",\"startTime\":1746803066,\"endTime\":1746803070},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"for me and teachers have to adapt. I firmly believe that the problem is that \",\"startTime\":1746803070,\"endTime\":1746803074},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"the students is the teachers and I''m a teacher. \",\"startTime\":1746803074,\"endTime\":1746803077},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I believe that we have to change and reframe the way that we think about AI and think about learning in the classroom. This semester I have students creating \",\"startTime\":1746803077,\"endTime\":1746803083},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"chat bots that never program before I have students. \",\"startTime\":1746803083,\"endTime\":1746803086},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"That we''re thinking about.\",\"startTime\":1746803087,\"endTime\":1746803088},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"You know, the economy more than they ever had before. And one student told me \",\"startTime\":1746803089,\"endTime\":1746803093},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I feel smart for the first time because they don''t use it to cheat per se, but it was to refine ideas and to learn about things. And when I asked them what \",\"startTime\":1746803093,\"endTime\":1746803102},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"did you learn, they told me straight up everything that they learned. And it \",\"startTime\":1746803102,\"endTime\":1746803106},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"was more than what I could teach in the class. So I believe that. \",\"startTime\":1746803106,\"endTime\":1746803110},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Hey, I will change the role of learners, but teachers have to get on board. \",\"startTime\":1746803112,\"endTime\":1746803115},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Teachers have to be students all over again, and that''s uncomfortable for a lot of us. \",\"startTime\":1746803115,\"endTime\":1746803120},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"We''re both just winging it.\",\"startTime\":1746803122,\"endTime\":1746803124},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"That''s it. So teachers have a choice. Do they want to continue to go back to \",\"startTime\":1746803124,\"endTime\":1746803127},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Blue Books? \",\"startTime\":1746803127,\"endTime\":1746803129},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"And three third times. Or are they thinking about moving forward? Because those \",\"startTime\":1746803130,\"endTime\":1746803133},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"teachers are going to be left behind. And I hope you''re not one of them. Whoever''s \",\"startTime\":1746803133,\"endTime\":1746803137},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"looking at this, I don''t think you are. \",\"startTime\":1746803137,\"endTime\":1746803140},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"But learning is going to be different, but I think there''s a pathway for that, and that''s what I''m doing. \",\"startTime\":1746803143,\"endTime\":1746803149},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I don''t think I''m having a problem per SE.\",\"startTime\":1746803178,\"endTime\":1746803180},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"You know, I, I integrated 100% of my class. I ensure that there is a pathway \",\"startTime\":1746803180,\"endTime\":1746803183},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"for AI versus non AI people. So I have some students that, you know, care about \",\"startTime\":1746803183,\"endTime\":1746803186},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"the environment a lot and say, I don''t want to do it because of this. Well, \",\"startTime\":1746803186,\"endTime\":1746803190},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"great, we''re going to format it for you then 100% because I''m not going to force you to do it because I am concerned about the environment too. And you know, \",\"startTime\":1746803190,\"endTime\":1746803196},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"even in my company I''m, I''m researching actively how do I offset the cost of what I''m doing? \",\"startTime\":1746803196,\"endTime\":1746803203},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I think initially, though, a lot of my issues were going to be how do I integrate it? Because I don''t believe in just using it in the classroom. I firmly believe \",\"startTime\":1746803207,\"endTime\":1746803214},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"in integrating it throughout. And I have a good field of psychology and social \",\"startTime\":1746803214,\"endTime\":1746803218},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"work to really integrate it into, right? But then I think about English and \",\"startTime\":1746803218,\"endTime\":1746803222},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"history, how are they going to do it? And I have ideas. And I think the biggest \",\"startTime\":1746803222,\"endTime\":1746803225},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"thing was, would be how? \",\"startTime\":1746803225,\"endTime\":1746803229},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Do students see this as a potential learning opportunity and not necessarily going to to diminish their level of quality of intelligence? \",\"startTime\":1746803230,\"endTime\":1746803239},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"This past semester was my first time doing the whole entire class integrated and I teach a class on Monday. \",\"startTime\":1746803240,\"endTime\":1746803245},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"And a three-week class and I have to integrate it again because it''s gonna be a three-week class and I think I have the tools readily available to be to do so. \",\"startTime\":1746803245,\"endTime\":1746803253},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"And a lot of it is going to be that little bump of like wildly AI or those that have been using AI, now that I think about it, who''s now saying, wait a minute, you''re using it and I have to learn how to use it as opposed to just automate stuff. \",\"startTime\":1746803254,\"endTime\":1746803267},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"So, umm, I think that''s gonna be, uh, the one thing that I struggle with implementing still is that there''s a group of students that have been using it just for whatever and I''m telling them, all right. \",\"startTime\":1746803267,\"endTime\":1746803277},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Right, I''m gonna burst your bubble for a second. This is what AI is, and this \",\"startTime\":1746803278,\"endTime\":1746803281},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"so on and so forth. So umm, I ramble learning and working on that and hopefully \",\"startTime\":1746803281,\"endTime\":1746803284},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I get better, but adios. \",\"startTime\":1746803284,\"endTime\":1746803287}]"', '2025-05-09 18:49:19.441369+00', '2025-05-09 18:49:19.441369+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 333, "created_at": "2025-05-09T18:49:19.227Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('b3fa972b-88a9-4f54-a20e-c5142854f42e', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '98002', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:40:26.931278+00', '2025-05-06 19:40:26.931278+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 211, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:40:26.866Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('8c5ff5dd-b1f8-472e-bc4c-0fa15d813e81', '11e8adeb-72d2-4cb4-ae26-24d4d1e7565a', '74391', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:40:27.341828+00', '2025-05-06 19:40:27.341828+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 183, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:40:27.133Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('5df895d8-a2b1-4389-b2cf-894399e86744', 'e703c834-b010-4c88-9b89-e310df8ad353', '138243', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"My name is Jason. I''m a professor of psychology at a Community College. I''ve \",\"startTime\":1745376424,\"endTime\":1745376428},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"been teaching for 13 years in higher education. I also teach social work at \",\"startTime\":1745376428,\"endTime\":1745376432},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"the graduate College of social work. I am a social worker. I just recently got \",\"startTime\":1745376432,\"endTime\":1745376436},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"a part time position at the graduate College of social work for AI technology consultant and I recently found a six watts of clarity. We teach AI literacy \",\"startTime\":1745376436,\"endTime\":1745376443},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"to anyone and everyone, specifically non tech individuals and we just launched our platform on Monday our platform next Monday 60 watts AI faculty lounge where we. \",\"startTime\":1745376443,\"endTime\":1745376454},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Or a companion rather. They help faculty members learn, teach, and integrate \",\"startTime\":1745376454,\"endTime\":1745376457},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"AI into their curriculum at their own place. So I''m interested in meeting other \",\"startTime\":1745376457,\"endTime\":1745376460},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"educators to see what they''re doing in the classroom. What are their painstakes \",\"startTime\":1745376460,\"endTime\":1745376464},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"as well? And specifically K to 12. Because one day I will love to work with \",\"startTime\":1745376464,\"endTime\":1745376467},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"someone to build something out there that can actually help KD12. Not just mass \",\"startTime\":1745376467,\"endTime\":1745376470},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"produce and just output an assignment, but also just, you know, at their level at their time and make sure they have integrity inside of it as well. So hit \",\"startTime\":1745376470,\"endTime\":1745376477},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"me up. \",\"startTime\":1745376477,\"endTime\":1745376480},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Right now I think the role of the teacher is different. My role is no longer \",\"startTime\":1745376500,\"endTime\":1745376504},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"going to be that I know everything and I this and this note absolutely not. \",\"startTime\":1745376504,\"endTime\":1745376508},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"The learner and teacher are like this now. We''re both in the same space, so \",\"startTime\":1745376508,\"endTime\":1745376513},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"we are both struggling trying to figure out how to. \",\"startTime\":1745376513,\"endTime\":1745376516},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Integrate AI into our lives. So, you know, along with the transparent about \",\"startTime\":1745376516,\"endTime\":1745376520},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"it. I think the teacher and the learner are now both the learner now and I think \",\"startTime\":1745376520,\"endTime\":1745376523},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"it''s going to stay that way for a very long time because we are very, we are in a unique position of how we can explain our subjects. But the problem is \",\"startTime\":1745376523,\"endTime\":1745376530},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"we need to be able to explain it while integrating AI. \",\"startTime\":1745376530,\"endTime\":1745376533},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"None of the above.\",\"startTime\":1745376557,\"endTime\":1745376558},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I I have been obsessed with AI since it came out. Well, maybe I came out since \",\"startTime\":1745376558,\"endTime\":1745376561},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"last October or August and that''s all I ever do now. I don''t, I don''t go do \",\"startTime\":1745376561,\"endTime\":1745376564},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"anything else. \",\"startTime\":1745376564,\"endTime\":1745376567},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I do play trumpet though. I do kind of hang out with friends now, but mostly \",\"startTime\":1745376568,\"endTime\":1745376573},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I go to work, come back home and do my AI stuff and that''s it. It''s very interesting \",\"startTime\":1745376573,\"endTime\":1745376577},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"right now and I just committed to doing it and see how far I can get with it. \",\"startTime\":1745376577,\"endTime\":1745376581}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.270575+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.270575+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 131, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.240Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('22f37147-8cf9-4582-9761-a6810fb671e4', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '138232', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"My name is Jeff and I''m an educator working with other educators to help them to become better at what they do, hopefully help them reflect as humans, be better learners. \",\"startTime\":1745354012,\"endTime\":1745354022},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I hope to get better at my job.\",\"startTime\":1745354025,\"endTime\":1745354026},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Is that all educators are capable.\",\"startTime\":1745354043,\"endTime\":1745354046},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And that we should position them as capable.\",\"startTime\":1745354046,\"endTime\":1745354050},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Of driving their own learning, determining their own path.\",\"startTime\":1745354051,\"endTime\":1745354055},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And that we should not only position them as capable, but enhance their identity and their agency. \",\"startTime\":1745354061,\"endTime\":1745354066},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"While also valuing multiple contributions or perspectives from their own mind, especially from others. \",\"startTime\":1745354069,\"endTime\":1745354076},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Climbing.\",\"startTime\":1745354093,\"endTime\":1745354093},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Rock climbing. I love rock climbing.\",\"startTime\":1745354094,\"endTime\":1745354095}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.301245+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.301245+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 69, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.267Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('d7ebcb65-bfab-488d-be25-79f8597ed21d', '4f2c17d9-95b8-4de7-8b97-ea6e0874f465', '138233', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Here''s a little crazy right now.\",\"startTime\":1745354197,\"endTime\":1745354198},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I do many things as an educator, or maybe everything I do is as an educator, whether it be as a parent or consultant. \",\"startTime\":1745354198,\"endTime\":1745354205},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I write curricula. Sometimes I work directly with students. Considering going \",\"startTime\":1745354206,\"endTime\":1745354209},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"back into the classroom soon. \",\"startTime\":1745354209,\"endTime\":1745354213},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Work a lot with AI.\",\"startTime\":1745354215,\"endTime\":1745354216},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"My name is docs.\",\"startTime\":1745354240,\"endTime\":1745354240},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I was a classroom teacher for many years. I''m now a consultant. I write curricula \",\"startTime\":1745354241,\"endTime\":1745354246},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"for different clients and different fields. So health education. \",\"startTime\":1745354246,\"endTime\":1745354251},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Workforce development, but also still some K12 education.\",\"startTime\":1745354251,\"endTime\":1745354255},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think I approach everything as an educator.\",\"startTime\":1745354257,\"endTime\":1745354259},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''ve been working a lot with AI over the last year and.\",\"startTime\":1745354260,\"endTime\":1745354264},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''m pretty interested in how to leverage the technology.\",\"startTime\":1745354265,\"endTime\":1745354269},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Particularly to help teachers be effective educators.\",\"startTime\":1745354270,\"endTime\":1745354274},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"For someone who studied education at the far theoretical level, I''m going to stick with the prompts. \",\"startTime\":1745354306,\"endTime\":1745354309},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"What is the role of the teacher? The teacher''s role is to be the intellectual \",\"startTime\":1745354309,\"endTime\":1745354314},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"and moral educator of the student, to help them and lead them on a journey outward from themselves. The role of the learner is to learn. Both of those people have \",\"startTime\":1745354314,\"endTime\":1745354323},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"a job, even if one of them isn''t doing it. \",\"startTime\":1745354323,\"endTime\":1745354327},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"What should change?\",\"startTime\":1745354328,\"endTime\":1745354329},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Man, so many things.\",\"startTime\":1745354331,\"endTime\":1745354333},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Umm.\",\"startTime\":1745354333,\"endTime\":1745354333},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think a lot of probably what needs to change is thinking about motivation, umm, and how to. \",\"startTime\":1745354335,\"endTime\":1745354342},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Help students to become adults and learners and not simply passive.\",\"startTime\":1745354344,\"endTime\":1745354351},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And begrudging recipients of content knowledge.\",\"startTime\":1745354353,\"endTime\":1745354357},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"What should stay the same? I think a formal education system is necessary, and \",\"startTime\":1745354358,\"endTime\":1745354363},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think one that is universal and free is necessary. \",\"startTime\":1745354363,\"endTime\":1745354368},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So I lose myself in most things. I lose myself in writing and reading.\",\"startTime\":1745354397,\"endTime\":1745354401},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I snowboard.\",\"startTime\":1745354401,\"endTime\":1745354402},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Pretty much any project I could lose myself in for a significant amount of time. \",\"startTime\":1745354404,\"endTime\":1745354408},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"If I''m not careful, for example recording a video like this, I could lose myself in. \",\"startTime\":1745354408,\"endTime\":1745354415},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Umm.\",\"startTime\":1745354415,\"endTime\":1745354415},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"In some ways I''m very focused, in other ways I''m very distractible.\",\"startTime\":1745354418,\"endTime\":1745354421},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think that I like to lose myself in stories. I like to lose myself in interactions \",\"startTime\":1745354422,\"endTime\":1745354425},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"with people. \",\"startTime\":1745354425,\"endTime\":1745354429},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I like to lose myself in.\",\"startTime\":1745354432,\"endTime\":1745354434},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Cerebral Pursuits.\",\"startTime\":1745354439,\"endTime\":1745354441},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I do like to lose myself in my work.\",\"startTime\":1745354441,\"endTime\":1745354443},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I have a harder time losing myself and my responsibilities, so like I have to very much think about the things that I have to do. \",\"startTime\":1745354444,\"endTime\":1745354452}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.358141+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.358141+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 172, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.337Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('1971148b-2076-4f58-9148-84005dfc76f6', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '137822', '"[{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"We figured it out for you.\",\"startTime\":1743016274,\"endTime\":1743016276},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Hi, I''m alright. How are you?\",\"startTime\":1743016274,\"endTime\":1743016277},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Don''t get happy Wednesday.\",\"startTime\":1743016277,\"endTime\":1743016279},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes, happy hump day. I''m so glad.\",\"startTime\":1743016279,\"endTime\":1743016281},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"On that side of the slope, where are you in the world?\",\"startTime\":1743016283,\"endTime\":1743016287},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Indiana.\",\"startTime\":1743016288,\"endTime\":1743016291},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Cool, I''m in California near near the Tahoe area. So the part of California \",\"startTime\":1743016291,\"endTime\":1743016293},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"where it snows. \",\"startTime\":1743016293,\"endTime\":1743016296},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Great. OK.\",\"startTime\":1743016296,\"endTime\":1743016297},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Oh fun, I grew up in Wisconsin so I love snow.\",\"startTime\":1743016298,\"endTime\":1743016301},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743016300,\"endTime\":1743016300},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Right on. We just got like 4 1/2 feet in the last week. But it''s that March \",\"startTime\":1743016301,\"endTime\":1743016305},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"snow that melts pretty quickly because it''s warm. So it''s it''s kind of fun. \",\"startTime\":1743016305,\"endTime\":1743016309},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Have you? So I''m guessing this is the first time in this zone. There''s little \",\"startTime\":1743016312,\"endTime\":1743016314},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"prompts on the bottom that tell us kind of what to focus on. The whole thing''s \",\"startTime\":1743016314,\"endTime\":1743016317},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"probably about 15 minutes. \",\"startTime\":1743016317,\"endTime\":1743016319},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, OK.\",\"startTime\":1743016317,\"endTime\":1743016318},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And the first one that asked me is what it What''s something besides becoming fluent in AI? \",\"startTime\":1743016320,\"endTime\":1743016325},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"That you''re working on? What are you learning about?\",\"startTime\":1743016326,\"endTime\":1743016327},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Besides AI.\",\"startTime\":1743016328,\"endTime\":1743016328},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So I teach three different classes. I have a world history class. I''m at high \",\"startTime\":1743016330,\"endTime\":1743016334},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"school. Are you OK? \",\"startTime\":1743016334,\"endTime\":1743016338},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Me too, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743016339,\"endTime\":1743016340},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"OK, so I have world history. I have a fusion.\",\"startTime\":1743016339,\"endTime\":1743016343},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Of geography and world history. So it''s kind of a cultural geography.\",\"startTime\":1743016343,\"endTime\":1743016348},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Indiana decided to do their own thing, so like, they wrote their own standards. \",\"startTime\":1743016349,\"endTime\":1743016352},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It''s great. It''s actually a fun class. I love it. \",\"startTime\":1743016352,\"endTime\":1743016355},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And then I have a sheltered U.S. history class, so only for our English language \",\"startTime\":1743016356,\"endTime\":1743016360},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1743016357,\"endTime\":1743016357},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"learners and since they have a little background. \",\"startTime\":1743016360,\"endTime\":1743016365},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And this is the first year having that.\",\"startTime\":1743016366,\"endTime\":1743016368},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1743016369,\"endTime\":1743016369},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"That is totally an experiment.\",\"startTime\":1743016370,\"endTime\":1743016373},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And I love it. It''s great.\",\"startTime\":1743016374,\"endTime\":1743016375},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''ll be curious to hear how you''re using, how you''re leveraging AI to facilitate translation and stuff like that. I wonder if that''s part of. \",\"startTime\":1743016375,\"endTime\":1743016382},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I do all the time.\",\"startTime\":1743016382,\"endTime\":1743016383},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Like do you do it for kids or do you teach kids to do it for themselves \",\"startTime\":1743016384,\"endTime\":1743016387},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"or somewhere between? \",\"startTime\":1743016387,\"endTime\":1743016391},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Cool. Yeah, similar.\",\"startTime\":1743016391,\"endTime\":1743016392},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"CS go umm.\",\"startTime\":1743016393,\"endTime\":1743016394},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So do you use PowerPoint I''m assuming?\",\"startTime\":1743016395,\"endTime\":1743016398},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I don''t use much PowerPoint. Umm yeah I''m I''m kinda.\",\"startTime\":1743016399,\"endTime\":1743016403},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1743016401,\"endTime\":1743016401},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"One of the things that I use is like I have in PowerPoint. It can translate \",\"startTime\":1743016404,\"endTime\":1743016408},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"like live translate for you as you talk. \",\"startTime\":1743016408,\"endTime\":1743016412},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Oh wow.\",\"startTime\":1743016413,\"endTime\":1743016414},{\"speake