speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"No.\",\"startTime\":1743016562,\"endTime\":1743016563},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So I have kids who are anywhere from a 1 1/2, so here maybe a couple of months or less, two kids who are a four and a half who have been here for a couple of years or have English skills elsewhere. \",\"startTime\":1743016563,\"endTime\":1743016578},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"All in the same classroom in that U.S. history class.\",\"startTime\":1743016579,\"endTime\":1743016582},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And so I have to provide different levels of content.\",\"startTime\":1743016584,\"endTime\":1743016589},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"For them because of that and AI has made that more possible. So I''ll take my \",\"startTime\":1743016590,\"endTime\":1743016595},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"regular U.S. history curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1743016595,\"endTime\":1743016599},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Use AI to reduce it to a.\",\"startTime\":1743016601,\"endTime\":1743016604},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Probably a 6th grade level and then reduce it again down to a second or third grade level for my lower level kids and then it also then. \",\"startTime\":1743016605,\"endTime\":1743016614},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Differentiates my activities and my, you know, anything else that I''m using for them in that sense. So it has saved me. \",\"startTime\":1743016615,\"endTime\":1743016627},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Otherwise this class would be so much harder.\",\"startTime\":1743016629,\"endTime\":1743016631},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Hmm. Hmm. Yes, I''m hearing like a lot of like that like.\",\"startTime\":1743016629,\"endTime\":1743016632},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Lexile level.\",\"startTime\":1743016632,\"endTime\":1743016634},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"In service.\",\"startTime\":1743016634,\"endTime\":1743016635},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743016635,\"endTime\":1743016636},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"English language learners with multiple jumping off points to get, like you said, 6th and 2nd grade. So you''re not teaching the level fours like the level \",\"startTime\":1743016636,\"endTime\":1743016645},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743016639,\"endTime\":1743016640},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"1 so that they''re getting stuff at level that they''re ready for, which is huge. \",\"startTime\":1743016645,\"endTime\":1743016650},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Cool, that''s amazing. That''s that''s really actionable for me. I''ve got two classes. \",\"startTime\":1743016652,\"endTime\":1743016655},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743016652,\"endTime\":1743016653},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''m a part time. I''m part time. So I''ve got a pre calculus class, an AP pre \",\"startTime\":1743016655,\"endTime\":1743016658},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1743016658,\"endTime\":1743016658},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"calculus class. \",\"startTime\":1743016658,\"endTime\":1743016661},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And a video production class and in each of them, yeah, totally. And each of \",\"startTime\":1743016662,\"endTime\":1743016665},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Oh wow, that''s totally different.\",\"startTime\":1743016665,\"endTime\":1743016667},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"them I''ve like I. \",\"startTime\":1743016665,\"endTime\":1743016669},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''ve got 2 English language learners in each one of them who''s kind of in that level, 1, maybe 2. \",\"startTime\":1743016672,\"endTime\":1743016677},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And some like level.\",\"startTime\":1743016678,\"endTime\":1743016680},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"3 1/2 or 4 and I forget what we call it. We have a different acronym but similar \",\"startTime\":1743016680,\"endTime\":1743016682},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1743016681,\"endTime\":1743016682},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"idea. \",\"startTime\":1743016682,\"endTime\":1743016684},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1743016685,\"endTime\":1743016686},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And umm I''m ending. I''m ending the year in pre calc with like college style \",\"startTime\":1743016686,\"endTime\":1743016691},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"lecture so I''ve been very student centric. \",\"startTime\":1743016691,\"endTime\":1743016695},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Self-paced through most of the school year and the last 10 weeks we''re doing matrices. \",\"startTime\":1743016697,\"endTime\":1743016703},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And I''m gonna like, this is gonna be a college class. I, I, I taught the basics \",\"startTime\":1743016704,\"endTime\":1743016707},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"of AI for a little while for NVIDIA. \",\"startTime\":1743016707,\"endTime\":1743016710},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"So I''m gonna teach them how matrices are used in artificial intelligence.\",\"startTime\":1743016710,\"endTime\":1743016713},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Cool.\",\"startTime\":1743016714,\"endTime\":1743016716},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"It''s gonna be very fun. I can''t wait to see what comes out of my mouth.\",\"startTime\":1743016715,\"endTime\":1743016718},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"But for the students who language or English is is difficult, I wanna keep the rigor up ''cause they''re mathematically brilliant. \",\"startTime\":1743016720,\"endTime\":1743016728},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Then they paid it as far as precalculus, but me standing in front of the room speaking in English. \",\"startTime\":1743016728,\"endTime\":1743016734},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Is not an ideal way for them to learn umm and then in video production actually it''s the cousin of the kid here or in pre calc I''ve got like. \",\"startTime\":1743016734,\"endTime\":1743016743},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Right.\",\"startTime\":1743016738,\"endTime\":1743016740},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Like I can get 3 or 4 words across, maybe one idea across as the as he''s trying to like figure out what I''m asking them to do. \",\"startTime\":1743016743,\"endTime\":1743016751},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And my approach so far has been like, kind of like do things for him. I''m bringing \",\"startTime\":1743016752,\"endTime\":1743016755},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"down the rigor so drastically. \",\"startTime\":1743016755,\"endTime\":1743016758},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"But I was able to get get him to get a story told like in Spanish for video so. \",\"startTime\":1743016760,\"endTime\":1743016767},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Umm. And my challenge will be how can I keep the rigor of the craft up while \",\"startTime\":1743016769,\"endTime\":1743016773},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"reducing the barrier of the language? Uh. \",\"startTime\":1743016773,\"endTime\":1743016777},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"It''s the PowerPoint is is a big win. I don''t do much PowerPoint thing but.\",\"startTime\":1743016780,\"endTime\":1743016784},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Live translation. Maybe it maybe it''s about live translation and live translation \",\"startTime\":1743016785,\"endTime\":1743016787},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"at a certain lifestyle level. \",\"startTime\":1743016787,\"endTime\":1743016790},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Are there specific tools that you spend most of your time in as you''re as you''re building or shopping these problems? \",\"startTime\":1743016793,\"endTime\":1743016798},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743016795,\"endTime\":1743016797},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I I use a variety of different things. Do you know magic school?\",\"startTime\":1743016800,\