use it for ideas.\",\"startTime\":1743016892,\"endTime\":1743016896},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And so with U.S. history, it''s kind of a hard content. So I I saw like scratch \",\"startTime\":1743016899,\"endTime\":1743016905},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"art paper at Dollar Tree and I was like, oh, I want to do something with scratch art, but I couldn''t think of what. And my Co teacher was like, OK, let''s ask \",\"startTime\":1743016905,\"endTime\":1743016917},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Chet GPT what we could do because symbols and imagery is really important in showing language learners and so like this. \",\"startTime\":1743016917,\"endTime\":1743016928},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Is World War 2, So this is Nazi Germany. This is Britain defending against. \",\"startTime\":1743016930,\"endTime\":1743016934},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"They''re basically defending against the rest of the world, against Nazi Germany. \",\"startTime\":1743016934,\"endTime\":1743016939},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And so they.\",\"startTime\":1743016940,\"endTime\":1743016941},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Right, so ChatGPT gave us ideas and said, OK, here''s a list of a dozen topics that you could use. It gave some examples of visuals. We didn''t give the examples \",\"startTime\":1743016941,\"endTime\":1743016951},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1743016941,\"endTime\":1743016942},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"of visuals, but. \",\"startTime\":1743016951,\"endTime\":1743016955},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Like one of them was the home front and then you could look at women in factories or. \",\"startTime\":1743016957,\"endTime\":1743016964},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"You know, buying war bonds to try to support, so giving them some clues.\",\"startTime\":1743016966,\"endTime\":1743016972},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So I use ChatGPT for that and then last class we started an escape room.\",\"startTime\":1743016972,\"endTime\":1743016979},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I uploaded my PowerPoint for the the content and said created escape room based on this content because I didn''t want it pulling from too many places. \",\"startTime\":1743016980,\"endTime\":1743016990},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Since the kids don''t have a whole lot of context. And then I had it.\",\"startTime\":1743016991,\"endTime\":1743016996},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Give me ideas from there. And they absolutely loved it. It was so much work, \",\"startTime\":1743016997,\"endTime\":1743017003},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"but they loved it. They were so excited about it. \",\"startTime\":1743017003,\"endTime\":1743017009},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And then I went to Dollar Tree and got some like.\",\"startTime\":1743017011,\"endTime\":1743017016},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017012,\"endTime\":1743017013},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Little like lock boxes and then I had travel locks at home and so then they had to figure out the puzzle to figure out how to get in there. \",\"startTime\":1743017016,\"endTime\":1743017027},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Or put on the back.\",\"startTime\":1743017027,\"endTime\":1743017029},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Like one of the phrases was a day that lives in infamy because it''s Pearl Harbor. \",\"startTime\":1743017030,\"endTime\":1743017035},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So they had to figure out what order the photos went in. And then on the backside \",\"startTime\":1743017035,\"endTime\":1743017040},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"was the the phrase. So they had to figure that out. And that was the the clue \",\"startTime\":1743017040,\"endTime\":1743017045},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"for that topic. So it has totally revolutionized. \",\"startTime\":1743017045,\"endTime\":1743017050},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"So you''re using all the place. You''re using it for like idea generation and \",\"startTime\":1743017050,\"endTime\":1743017054},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"for differentiation and like for for doing the things that used to be administratively prohibitive. But it''s it''s not like it''s in class better. \",\"startTime\":1743017054,\"endTime\":1743017062},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017060,\"endTime\":1743017061},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Make it intrinsically better.\",\"startTime\":1743017063,\"endTime\":1743017065},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Bringing the ideas from here into into practice and turning the beginning of ideas here into full ideas. Very cool. That''s awesome. \",\"startTime\":1743017065,\"endTime\":1743017074},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It is yes and I''m with my ADHD like.\",\"startTime\":1743017072,\"endTime\":1743017077},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Ideas great, putting them into fruition so this is allowing me or facilitating that for me so I can do the things that I. \",\"startTime\":1743017077,\"endTime\":1743017087},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"You know, dream big about.\",\"startTime\":1743017089,\"endTime\":1743017090},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Hmm. Yeah, very cool. Let''s keep going.\",\"startTime\":1743017091,\"endTime\":1743017095},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So how are you using it?\",\"startTime\":1743017094,\"endTime\":1743017095},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I think the more interesting.\",\"startTime\":1743017098,\"endTime\":1743017100},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''m doing like, I want to say like contextualizing math for different hobbies so kids can choose like I like to garden, I like to play basketball, I''m a skier, I like motorcycle, I like to work on cars. And so for like, I''ll take things \",\"startTime\":1743017101,\"endTime\":1743017115},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Cool.\",\"startTime\":1743017110,\"endTime\":1743017111},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"that would have been, here''s the word problem. And I said I''ll give them the \",\"startTime\":1743017115,\"endTime\":1743017120},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"choice of like 5 different contexts. So that''s been really helpful because math \",\"startTime\":1743017120,\"endTime\":1743017125},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"can be really abstracted. And so to, to, to, to, to bring it down the concreteness. \",\"startTime\":1743017125,\"endTime\":1743017130},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017127,\"endTime\":1743017128},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"That''s amazing.\",\"startTime\":1743017133,\"endTime\":1743017133},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"A little wet first class, so I use lovable dot dev to create like for video production. \",\"startTime\":1743017133,\"endTime\":1743017139},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Umm, they submit. It''s like a full blown web app that I created, like where \",\"startTime\":1743017141,\"endTime\":1743017146},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"students submit their video to either. It''s either a story, a joke, or a lesson. \",\"startTime\":1743017146,\"endTime\":1743017150},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And then there''s like a version 2 where they''ve made it better, but there''s some I created a full blown app where the a domain that they go in and they upload it to and they could they could see each others app or see each others videos. The interesting part there is as they''re spending time making videos, \",\"startTime\":1743017151,\"endTime\":1743017166},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I actually have them working lovable and make the website better. So they''ll \",\"startTime\":1743017166,\"endTime\":1743017169},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"That is really cool.\",\"startTime\":1743017168,\"endTime\":1743017169},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"they''ll like tend. It''s what it is. It''s like a GPT prompt on the left and then \",\"startTime\":1743017169,\"endTime\":1743017173},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"you can watch it render as web on the right. And so they''re like, I don''t like \",\"startTime\":1743017173,\"endTime\":1743017176},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"that. It''s all. \",\"startTime\":1743017176,\"endTime\":1743017180},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"All white. We need a dark mode. I''m like, cool, make a dark mode so that they''re \",\"startTime\":1743017183,\"endTime\":1743017187},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"getting the experience of using the tech tool in combination with being a like having a better. \",\"startTime\":1743017187,\"endTime\":1743017194},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Place to put their videos. It''s just like this is what I needed for class. I \",\"startTime\":1743017195,\"endTime\":1743017199},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"needed this app to exist and I''m able to like create create the app. \",\"startTime\":1743017199,\"endTime\":1743017202},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"That''s incredible.\",\"startTime\":1743017200,\"endTime\":1743017201},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Anything else?\",\"startTime\":1743017205,\"endTime\":1743017206},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Controversially, I gave all of my precalculus students GPT plus accounts and they share them. So I I call it chairlift. So it''s chair one, chair 2 up to \",\"startTime\":1743017209,\"endTime\":1743017217},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"13 for all 26 kids and they share an account and they so they have access to all the reasoning models like the O1, the O3 and the research models and I have them. \",\"startTime\":1743017217,\"endTime\":1743017228},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Working in there fairly often. Like put put the math problem in there if if \",\"startTime\":1743017230,\"endTime\":1743017234},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"GPT can do it, you''re not cheating. \",\"startTime\":1743017234,\"endTime\":1743017237},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''ve had to raise the bar a little bit because GPT can solve for X. So my question \",\"startTime\":1743017239,\"endTime\":1743017243},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"to my prequel kids is like what do you want to solve for? \",\"startTime\":1743017243,\"endTime\":1743017246},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I want to solve for energy abundance. I want to solve for more vacation time \",\"startTime\":1743017247,\"endTime\":1743017250},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"like I want to solve for better habits, better eating habits. Well, we''re, we''re \",\"startTime\":1743017250,\"endTime\":1743017253},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"teaching limits right now. \",\"startTime\":1743017253,\"endTime\":1743017256},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Let''s solve for. Let''s solve for.\",\"startTime\":1743017257,\"endTime\":1743017260},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Better eating habits using limits and constraint theory. And so they''re taking \",\"startTime\":1743017262,\"endTime\":1743017267},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Right. Wow.\",\"startTime\":1743017265,\"endTime\":1743017267},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"the ideas instead of just like X is five, they''re like we, the limit is our. \",\"startTime\":1743017267,\"endTime\":1743017272},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Psychology or they''re fine that like so it''s it''s very abstracted, but the take away becomes. \",\"startTime\":1743017273,\"endTime\":1743017278},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"With better tools, the bar can be raised for what kids are capable of.\",\"startTime\":1743017279,\"endTime\":1743017284},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s been fun. I look forward to the next decade.\",\"startTime\":1743017286,\"endTime\":1743017289},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017286,\"endTime\":1743017287},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Wow, no kidding.\",\"startTime\":1743017290,\"endTime\":1743017293},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Oh, that leads us to this one. How will AI change the role of learners? I do \",\"startTime\":1743017292,\"endTime\":1743017295},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"recognize that we''ve got 2 minutes before the 30 minute mark. Do you have a \",\"startTime\":1743017295,\"endTime\":1743017299},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"hard stop at 3:30? OK, cool. Thank you. \",\"startTime\":1743017299,\"endTime\":1743017302},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"No, I don''t.\",\"startTime\":1743017301,\"endTime\":1743017302},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, let''s let''s predict the future here. What''s what will the what will the \",\"startTime\":1743017305,\"endTime\":1743017308},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"role of learners? What will it be like to be a learner given. \",\"startTime\":1743017308,\"endTime\":1743017312},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Given this tool set.\",\"startTime\":1743017314,\"endTime\":1743017315},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Not that anyone knows, but we can pontificate.\",\"startTime\":1743017318,\"endTime\":1743017321},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Right. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1743017322,\"endTime\":1743017323},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"One of the fun things that I have been able to start to leverage in history. \",\"startTime\":1743017325,\"endTime\":1743017331},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Is.\",\"startTime\":1743017332,\"endTime\":1743017332},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Kind of a choose your own adventure. Are you familiar with those like books \",\"startTime\":1743017333,\"endTime\":1743017336},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"that she''s? I loved those as a kid. \",\"startTime\":1743017336,\"endTime\":1743017340},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yes, date 30th I go to go to page 22 if you think that we win, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017338,\"endTime\":1743017345},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So you can create prompts in.\",\"startTime\":1743017346,\"endTime\":1743017349},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And use it in ChatGPT to.\",\"startTime\":1743017349,\"endTime\":1743017352},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Do that for you.\",\"startTime\":1743017353,\"endTime\":1743017354},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So, umm.\",\"startTime\":1743017356,\"endTime\":1743017357},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"The favorite one that my kids did was in geography and it was about the one child policy in China. \",\"startTime\":1743017360,\"endTime\":1743017368},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And how that it creates a personal scenario, a personal narrative for you. And \",\"startTime\":1743017370,\"endTime\":1743017376},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"then it asks you to make decisions. Are you going to follow the party line? \",\"startTime\":1743017376,\"endTime\":1743017382},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Are you going to go into hiding? Are you going to bribe somebody? And it goes \",\"startTime\":1743017382,\"endTime\":1743017388},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"through and plays as you go. So for me, I want to find more opportunities to. \",\"startTime\":1743017388,\"endTime\":1743017394},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Dive into things like that, but not so much that they get burned out and they''re like, oh, she''s doing it again. We''re going on an adventure. \",\"startTime\":1743017396,\"endTime\":1743017403},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Hmm. Mm-hmm. Yeah. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017404,\"endTime\":1743017407},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"From hearing from that is like the future as a learner might be more more self-directed, more more choice. \",\"startTime\":1743017407,\"endTime\":1743017413},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And then they.\",\"startTime\":1743017409,\"endTime\":1743017410},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I''m hoping that I can figure out how to make it more choice within the restraints of my my my standards I guess. \",\"startTime\":1743017413,\"endTime\":1743017422},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017424,\"endTime\":1743017425},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Like the modality can be different, the story can be different, but the learning target is is consistent. So our craft becomes like getting laser focused on. \",\"startTime\":1743017425,\"endTime\":1743017432},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017429,\"endTime\":1743017431},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Like what''s the actual goal here? What do I actually hope? \",\"startTime\":1743017432,\"endTime\":1743017435},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"That the kids in the room come out with given the flexibility of like I don''t care if the the questions about motorcycles or about gardening, but it''s but it''s focused on this direction. Yeah, cool. Yeah, I hear you. \",\"startTime\":1743017436,\"endTime\":1743017448},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017440,\"endTime\":1743017440},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017446,\"endTime\":1743017447},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It''s harder in history with that because we have such specific content, but my my friend across the hall who teaches English, she has much more flexibility because it''s more skill based and she has started to leverage some of those things because it is. \",\"startTime\":1743017448,\"endTime\":1743017466},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017454,\"endTime\":1743017454},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, not too. Yeah, for sure.\",\"startTime\":1743017463,\"endTime\":1743017464},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"A greater skill base than a content base, but.\",\"startTime\":1743017469,\"endTime\":1743017473},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I also don''t want to take it in a sense where we are.\",\"startTime\":1743017476,\"endTime\":1743017480},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Then only letting the AI teach.\",\"startTime\":1743017481,\"endTime\":1743017485},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So one of the things that I then will pull from this.\",\"startTime\":1743017486,\"endTime\":1743017491},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Is they have to then reflect on their experience and I ask ChatGPT or Copilot. \",\"startTime\":1743017491,\"endTime\":1743017497},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It does not work well in Gemini. Gemini has not figured that out yet. \",\"startTime\":1743017497,\"endTime\":1743017502},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"But then I asked the kids to reflect, and then I have them share about their stories, whether in an individual group or a group of four or as the whole class. \",\"startTime\":1743017505,\"endTime\":1743017514},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So that we get a perspective because.\",\"startTime\":1743017514,\"endTime\":1743017517},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Their adventures are so different.\",\"startTime\":1743017518,\"endTime\":1743017520},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"But yet it helps reinforce what they''re learning and getting back to that learning target. \",\"startTime\":1743017521,\"endTime\":1743017527},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017523,\"endTime\":1743017524},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And since teaching each other seems to be more effective in terms of like pedagogy and crap and I. \",\"startTime\":1743017528,\"endTime\":1743017536},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I mean it''s useful, but sometimes I dislike the the traditional.\",\"startTime\":1743017537,\"endTime\":1743017542},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I''m not a traditional teacher, so it doesn''t sound like, you know, that''s great. \",\"startTime\":1743017545,\"endTime\":1743017548},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''m interrupting because of the peer teaching thing is like most of my life is built on it. When I was I was using like 10 years ago data from Khan Academy \",\"startTime\":1743017550,\"endTime\":1743017557},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"to connect a kid who was struggling with a skill to a kid who had mastered that exact skill. \",\"startTime\":1743017557,\"endTime\":1743017561},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And every week they would have a new partner to get like data-driven peer teaching. \",\"startTime\":1743017561,\"endTime\":1743017564},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Like it was authentically like it was awesome. Yes. And and this kind of like \",\"startTime\":1743017564,\"endTime\":1743017568},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It''s amazing.\",\"startTime\":1743017566,\"endTime\":1743017567},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"we''re doing, we''re doing it here, I guess as as professional educators. But \",\"startTime\":1743017568,\"endTime\":1743017571},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017571,\"endTime\":1743017571},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"yeah, I''m super with you. \",\"startTime\":1743017571,\"endTime\":1743017574},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I was talking in front of the class. Isn''t is it? Isn''t it? No matter how fun \",\"startTime\":1743017575,\"endTime\":1743017578},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"it might be something. \",\"startTime\":1743017578,\"endTime\":1743017580},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017579,\"endTime\":1743017580},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I don''t know. That''s too exhausting for me. We''re on a block schedule. I haven''t \",\"startTime\":1743017582,\"endTime\":1743017584},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"got the energy for 80 minutes in front of kids. \",\"startTime\":1743017584,\"endTime\":1743017587},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"100%, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017588,\"endTime\":1743017589},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Not four times a day.\",\"startTime\":1743017589,\"endTime\":1743017590},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, blah blah blah blah blah blah. No hear you.\",\"startTime\":1743017591,\"endTime\":1743017594},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And so I guess we''re, we''re kinda aligning on like this balance of like using the technology where it''s right, but then also making sure that the community of the classroom is still held together. \",\"startTime\":1743017597,\"endTime\":1743017607},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017607,\"endTime\":1743017608},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And so everyone doesn''t kind of end up on their own island. Like we''re still \",\"startTime\":1743017609,\"endTime\":1743017613},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"teachers. Our job is like, we''re all kind of going this direction. Like, are \",\"startTime\":1743017613,\"endTime\":1743017616},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"we, are we on the, are we all going where we as the professionals who studied where why to teach history or why to teach mathematics, We''re still leading them towards where we know they''ll need to go. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1743017616,\"endTime\":1743017626},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017627,\"endTime\":1743017627},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I think we''re going to get there. It''s going to work.\",\"startTime\":1743017629,\"endTime\":1743017630},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''m not super clear on what is being asked here. Do you have?\",\"startTime\":1743017650,\"endTime\":1743017654},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Ideas.\",\"startTime\":1743017655,\"endTime\":1743017656},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So why did we sign up for side by? I think.\",\"startTime\":1743017659,\"endTime\":1743017666},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And or or what''s the problem of practice that that we might be working \",\"startTime\":1743017666,\"endTime\":1743017669},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"on? Like what''s something that you''re trying to actively figure out? Those are \",\"startTime\":1743017669,\"endTime\":1743017671},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"the two. That''s how to interpret it. \",\"startTime\":1743017671,\"endTime\":1743017674},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think that''s.\",\"startTime\":1743017673,\"endTime\":1743017674},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So AI has figured out that I am looking into this.\",\"startTime\":1743017677,\"endTime\":1743017682},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017677,\"endTime\":1743017677},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I just got appointed to a committee in my school community to help kind of shape the way that we are using AI and communicating with our kids how to and when. \",\"startTime\":1743017683,\"endTime\":1743017697},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"To use AI.\",\"startTime\":1743017698,\"endTime\":1743017699},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I''ve kind of always been considered a techie teacher and that''s always been my jam. \",\"startTime\":1743017702,\"endTime\":1743017708},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017710,\"endTime\":1743017711},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And I, I don''t want us to be in a position where we are shying away from this because it''s a great tool. It''s going to be useful and helpful in our world. \",\"startTime\":1743017711,\"endTime\":1743017722},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"But we have to keep, we have to teach the kids how to be responsible with it, just like anything else. \",\"startTime\":1743017722,\"endTime\":1743017727},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And.\",\"startTime\":1743017729,\"endTime\":1743017729},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I am in a suburb of Indianapolis.\",\"startTime\":1743017730,\"endTime\":1743017733},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"We are a very affluent district in terms of of our kids. The district itself, \",\"startTime\":1743017734,\"endTime\":1743017739},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Ya.\",\"startTime\":1743017735,\"endTime\":1743017736},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"no, not so much. The state doesn''t fund us well. \",\"startTime\":1743017739,\"endTime\":1743017745},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"But we''re the third largest district in the entire state, so we''ve got like 22,000 kids. \",\"startTime\":1743017747,\"endTime\":1743017754},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"2 high schools, both about 3500 kids in the high school. So we''re trying to \",\"startTime\":1743017756,\"endTime\":1743017762},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"figure out where do we go with AI, what are we going to do with it and so. \",\"startTime\":1743017762,\"endTime\":1743017768},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I had been doing some research on Twitter. I refused to call it X.\",\"startTime\":1743017770,\"endTime\":1743017773},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Twitter popped up and said hey you should check out sci-fi and I started looking at it and saying huh? \",\"startTime\":1743017775,\"endTime\":1743017782},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"OK didn''t know this existed but I''m in OK what can I learn?\",\"startTime\":1743017783,\"endTime\":1743017787},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So an algorithm LED you to an algorithm, which led you to an algorithm, \",\"startTime\":1743017789,\"endTime\":1743017792},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"which led you to a person. \",\"startTime\":1743017792,\"endTime\":1743017794},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Who also was led by an algorithm.\",\"startTime\":1743017794,\"endTime\":1743017796},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, that''s funny.\",\"startTime\":1743017796,\"endTime\":1743017799},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And, and so, so your problem of practice is how you''re on a committee, you''ll be leading a large district as far as how, how to navigate this unknown terrain. \",\"startTime\":1743017799,\"endTime\":1743017807},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"So you''re, you''re actively thinking about it and will make comment on or guide decision making for the district. \",\"startTime\":1743017807,\"endTime\":1743017816},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017818,\"endTime\":1743017819},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"So so the craft like to try to get.\",\"startTime\":1743017819,\"endTime\":1743017821},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Their opinions from out there, like how are other districts doing it or what are people finding out? Or you might already have some opinion. You want to \",\"startTime\":1743017822,\"endTime\":1743017827},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"make sure that we all know what you''re thinking about. So like sharing what \",\"startTime\":1743017827,\"endTime\":1743017830},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"you''re learning and yeah. \",\"startTime\":1743017830,\"endTime\":1743017833},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I haven''t quite gotten that far. I honestly hadn''t really thought about how \",\"startTime\":1743017836,\"endTime\":1743017840},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"other. \",\"startTime\":1743017840,\"endTime\":1743017844},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Places are using it because I don''t know that there''s been a lot of conversation about that, and that''s simply been what I found in research. So I didn''t even \",\"startTime\":1743017845,\"endTime\":1743017854},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"come here expecting that. \",\"startTime\":1743017854,\"endTime\":1743017858},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I would get other ideas in that sense about how other districts are doing it. \",\"startTime\":1743017858,\"endTime\":1743017862},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017864,\"endTime\":1743017864},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I I think I''m looking for more ways that I can show.\",\"startTime\":1743017866,\"endTime\":1743017870},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"How we can use this in the future because this is what our kids are going to be using. \",\"startTime\":1743017873,\"endTime\":1743017881},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And.\",\"startTime\":1743017883,\"endTime\":1743017883},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017883,\"endTime\":1743017884},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Like anything else, we need to educate them on how to use it effectively and appropriately. So I''m kind of here for all of it. I just, I''m not sure what \",\"startTime\":1743017886,\"endTime\":1743017894},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"that that direction is quite yet, if that makes any sense. \",\"startTime\":1743017894,\"endTime\":1743017899},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no, I think it does for me.\",\"startTime\":1743017901,\"endTime\":1743017904},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''m a geek for peer teaching as I shared, and this is kind of a like. Instead \",\"startTime\":1743017906,\"endTime\":1743017909},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"of applying it with students, it''s applying it for my own learning. \",\"startTime\":1743017909,\"endTime\":1743017912},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Umm also tech heavy teacher through most of my career. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1743017915,\"endTime\":1743017918},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And sometimes I''m I feel like I''m the only one in my building who''s like leaning in on it and I. \",\"startTime\":1743017920,\"endTime\":1743017925},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I I live in AI, live in a.\",\"startTime\":1743017926,\"endTime\":1743017928},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Ski ski town. I live at the base of Palisades Tahoe, formerly Squaw Valley.\",\"startTime\":1743017930,\"endTime\":1743017934},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743017933,\"endTime\":1743017934},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"So it''s like I write, share lists with some of the best steers and snowboarders on the planet. And I learned so much from those short chats that I like. If \",\"startTime\":1743017934,\"endTime\":1743017942},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"my craft as a skier gets better because of my chairlift rides, can my craft as a teacher using technology become better through like a short chat like this? \",\"startTime\":1743017942,\"endTime\":1743017949},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And I think that it can. \",\"startTime\":1743017949,\"endTime\":1743017952},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So I just like for, for the things I''m missing, for the perspectives that \",\"startTime\":1743017955,\"endTime\":1743017957},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I, I didn''t even know that I didn''t know. \",\"startTime\":1743017957,\"endTime\":1743017960},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Umm, and it''s a great meeting. Yeah, yeah. And for the conviction, like the \",\"startTime\":1743017961,\"endTime\":1743017964},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743017962,\"endTime\":1743017963},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"talk shot with someone else, like this is fun. Like at this at a skier, like, \",\"startTime\":1743017964,\"endTime\":1743017967},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"yeah, yeah, this is fun. This is this is working. Our kids''ll kids dig it. It''s \",\"startTime\":1743017967,\"endTime\":1743017970},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It is fun.\",\"startTime\":1743017969,\"endTime\":1743017970},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"actually helping people. \",\"startTime\":1743017970,\"endTime\":1743017973},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And how do we help people go a little faster? Like the ski analogy? I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1743017975,\"endTime\":1743017978},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"apologize over and over again for staying in in that for so long. But people \",\"startTime\":1743017978,\"endTime\":1743017982},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"are there traversing or they''re dropped in when you''re skiing, you''re they''re like going to cross the mountain or, or straight down the mountain. \",\"startTime\":1743017982,\"endTime\":1743017988},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And the more we''re like we call like ski the hypotenuse, if we''re just kind of traversing down the mountain, we''re not having as much fun. So for myself \",\"startTime\":1743017989,\"endTime\":1743017996},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"to get a little more conviction to drop in fully and for to help other people have the conviction to drop in fully and it''s like keep going. This works. \",\"startTime\":1743017996,\"endTime\":1743018003},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yup. No.\",\"startTime\":1743017996,\"endTime\":1743017996},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Is is a big part of the reasons.\",\"startTime\":1743018004,\"endTime\":1743018005},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Love it. Yeah, I skate a lot when I was in Wisconsin. There''s not much in Indiana \",\"startTime\":1743018006,\"endTime\":1743018010},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"other than. I mean, granted we had ice snow in Wisconsin anyway, but here it \",\"startTime\":1743018010,\"endTime\":1743018014},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"is. Nope. Keep me away. It''s not even worth it. \",\"startTime\":1743018014,\"endTime\":1743018019},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Right on.\",\"startTime\":1743018023,\"endTime\":1743018024},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Also thank you I I concretely learned that.\",\"startTime\":1743018026,\"endTime\":1743018030},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I guess the teacher skill would be like using Lexile level as a proxy for.\",\"startTime\":1743018030,\"endTime\":1743018036},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Language proficiency.\",\"startTime\":1743018037,\"endTime\":1743018039},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I think I''m gonna take that with me for sure. And then tactically or technology, \",\"startTime\":1743018039,\"endTime\":1743018042},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"technologically that I can use something like like PowerPoint to do it. \",\"startTime\":1743018042,\"endTime\":1743018046},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I, I just, I''m excited that.\",\"startTime\":1743018052,\"endTime\":1743018054},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743018052,\"endTime\":1743018052},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Like you and I seem to have a a very similar take on.\",\"startTime\":1743018056,\"endTime\":1743018060},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Things and I feel like that makes it much more relatable and makes me want to actually invest my time in doing this. So being someone with ADHD, I need that \",\"startTime\":1743018061,\"endTime\":1743018070},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"dopamine fix. I need something that''s going to engage me. \",\"startTime\":1743018070,\"endTime\":1743018074},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And so the fact that I feel like this is going to be beneficial for me and useful. \",\"startTime\":1743018076,\"endTime\":1743018085},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"For both my kids as well As for the classroom, I think that is huge and I''m excited to see where this takes my brain over the next couple of days to process and then see where that inspiration finds itself. \",\"startTime\":1743018085,\"endTime\":1743018101},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, me too. Me too. I look forward to hearing how it goes. Any questions about \",\"startTime\":1743018104,\"endTime\":1743018108},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"the platform? I''ve been in it for a little bit longer than you. \",\"startTime\":1743018108,\"endTime\":1743018112},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I I wish they had a little bit more direction as to hey here''s a starter guide. \",\"startTime\":1743018118,\"endTime\":1743018126},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I I did not understand that I had to go through and do this like quick video intro before any of this. \",\"startTime\":1743018128,\"endTime\":1743018136},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1743018134,\"endTime\":1743018134},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Started.\",\"startTime\":1743018137,\"endTime\":1743018137},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"But sorry, I''ll figure it out.\",\"startTime\":1743018140,\"endTime\":1743018142},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"First read it again. Yeah, here, yeah. The the next thing that like, so our \",\"startTime\":1743018142,\"endTime\":1743018145},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"little chat will disappear, but you''ll get in your ideas feed, you''ll get like some idea that you shared that like kind of just like distilled that you can do whatever you want with. So that''ll be the next thing. And then you''ll get, \",\"startTime\":1743018145,\"endTime\":1743018154},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1743018148,\"endTime\":1743018148},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"CS GO.\",\"startTime\":1743018154,\"endTime\":1743018154},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"depending on the pace you''ve chosen, like once a week or every two weeks or every month. \",\"startTime\":1743018154,\"endTime\":1743018160},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"You''ll get someone else who is doing similar stuff somewhere else. Uh.\",\"startTime\":1743018160,\"endTime\":1743018165},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"To to teach them. I''m from so thank you for for meeting with me. It was really \",\"startTime\":1743018166,\"endTime\":1743018169},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Oh cool.\",\"startTime\":1743018167,\"endTime\":1743018167},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"fun getting to talk with you. \",\"startTime\":1743018169,\"endTime\":1743018172},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. Thank you. Good luck. Have a great year.\",\"startTime\":1743018171,\"endTime\":1743018174},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"See you around you too.\",\"startTime\":1743018174,\"endTime\":1743018175}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.46092+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.46092+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1907, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.432Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('4834fd54-4887-489f-9b7a-af9695571efb', 'e5a67ee9-d30e-4f26-bafd-bf20b9ba4ab6', '138357', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"Hi, everybody.\",\"startTime\":1745902985,\"endTime\":1745902986},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"My name is Mike and as an educator I''m helping build side by and I teach high school math. \",\"startTime\":1745902986,\"endTime\":1745902992},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"I hope to learn about.\",\"startTime\":1745902992,\"endTime\":1745902994},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"I have to teach.\",\"startTime\":1745903000,\"endTime\":1745903001},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"My stance with respect to teaching and learning is a forward stance, leaning forward new ideas that make it better. \",\"startTime\":1745903017,\"endTime\":1745903023},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"Pushing students to skip steps whenever possible.\",\"startTime\":1745903025,\"endTime\":1745903028},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"We got a lot to learn trying to go fast.\",\"startTime\":1745903028,\"endTime\":1745903030},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"Right now I''m having fun.\",\"startTime\":1745903043,\"endTime\":1745903044},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"Building I''m like writing code.\",\"startTime\":1745903045,\"endTime\":1745903047},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"So that''s new for me. I find that it''s not. Yeah, that''s my.\",\"startTime\":1745903048,\"endTime\":1745903050},{\"speaker\":\"12022\",\"text\":\"I can get lost in that. I do it late on Monday nights.\",\"startTime\":1745903051,\"endTime\":1745903054}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.842379+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.842379+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 57, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.811Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('1a96df64-c5c4-4217-8bc7-6ea86aa37984', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '108378', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.284842+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.284842+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 634, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:54.224Z", "session_title": "Student-Centered Learning Introduction", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "650", "name": "Student-Centered Learning Introduction", "tags": [{"name": "Illustrative Mathematics"}, {"name": "Student-Centered Learning"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('a8fc9a10-22cc-41cd-ba91-cd4c921f4e78', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '117031', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.30622+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.30622+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 210, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:54.234Z", "session_title": "Lesson Structure in Illustrative Mathematics", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "412", "name": "Lesson Structure in Illustrative Mathematics", "tags": [{"name": "Illustrative Mathematics"}, {"name": "Innovations in Mathematics"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('92c514af-d274-4ecd-b62c-9c874300b5d0', '5a8ff088-2eb6-45c7-84d7-d40f066b7a20', '137158', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"My name is David Olson. I''m a fifth grade math and science teacher here at Manson \",\"startTime\":1740070527,\"endTime\":1740070531},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Elementary in Manson, WA. \",\"startTime\":1740070531,\"endTime\":1740070534},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Really had a great time learning about lovable dot dev and one of the things I really wanted to learn is how can I leverage it more to create websites and some tools and things like that. I think it''d be awesome to. \",\"startTime\":1740070534,\"endTime\":1740070545},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Have a website that''s really dedicated for my students learning that they can access. \",\"startTime\":1740070545,\"endTime\":1740070550},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"And have some tools there, some videos to watch things like that. So that''s, \",\"startTime\":1740070551,\"endTime\":1740070554},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"that''s the overall goal of what I''m looking for. \",\"startTime\":1740070554,\"endTime\":1740070557},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Where is a.\",\"startTime\":1740070612,\"endTime\":1740070614},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"And learning. I would say that I''m trying to empower children to take initiative \",\"startTime\":1740070614,\"endTime\":1740070617},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"with their education. \",\"startTime\":1740070617,\"endTime\":1740070620},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Teaching is a second career for me. I was a mechanical engineer for 15 years \",\"startTime\":1740070621,\"endTime\":1740070626},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"and so having been in the, you know, the industry and working as an engineer. \",\"startTime\":1740070626,\"endTime\":1740070630},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Umm, yeah, I''ve got a I''ve got a good view on, you know, what kind of education is necessary to get into. \",\"startTime\":1740070631,\"endTime\":1740070637},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"More complex advanced career fields and I really want to share that with my students. \",\"startTime\":1740070638,\"endTime\":1740070642},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"And really instill that that love of learning so that they can they can be that lifelong learner that is going to be so advantageous to them in their future. \",\"startTime\":1740070642,\"endTime\":1740070651},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"As far as a primary flow activity, I don''t know what what I do for fun.\",\"startTime\":1740070675,\"endTime\":1740070679},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Personally, it''s fishing. I love being in the outdoors and.\",\"startTime\":1740070679,\"endTime\":1740070683},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"It''s it doesn''t get better than that and really, really enjoy.\",\"startTime\":1740070683,\"endTime\":1740070687},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Being turned by nature and you know, kind of getting into a groove with all kinds of fishing, with ice fishing or fly fishing, spin fishing, you name it. \",\"startTime\":1740070687,\"endTime\":1740070695},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"So as far as in the classroom though, you know, I really like to have number talks with the kids. I think it''s great to see how everyone''s brain works differently \",\"startTime\":1740070695,\"endTime\":1740070702},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"to solve a similar problem. And I think that that sharing of that mentality \",\"startTime\":1740070702,\"endTime\":1740070706},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"can be really. \",\"startTime\":1740070706,\"endTime\":1740070710},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Great for helping other students see things through a different lens and even in ways that can help them understand a concept better. So I guess those would \",\"startTime\":1740070710,\"endTime\":1740070718},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"be kind of the two different ways, professionally and personally. \",\"startTime\":1740070718,\"endTime\":1740070722}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.43793+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.43793+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 132, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.412Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('ba44a3c0-49b7-4834-8a6c-886134316bb7', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '137362', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"How''s it going? My name''s Jeff. I''m a high school counselor. I''m also a technology. \",\"startTime\":1740799952,\"endTime\":1740799956},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"And I love to integrate new technology within my practice as a counselor, help other counselors do the same. And so I am hoping to be able to connect with \",\"startTime\":1740799956,\"endTime\":1740799966},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"others to learn new ways of integrating technology within. \",\"startTime\":1740799966,\"endTime\":1740799971},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Educational Practice.\",\"startTime\":1740799972,\"endTime\":1740799973},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"From I work in the front office at school and you know, I''m really interested in learning about AI tools that are out there. \",\"startTime\":1740799974,\"endTime\":1740799981},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Let''s do it in the two.\",\"startTime\":1740799983,\"endTime\":1740799985},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Forget the name of the tool.\",\"startTime\":1740799987,\"endTime\":1740799988},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Love labs or something like that.\",\"startTime\":1740799991,\"endTime\":1740799992},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Really lovely using ChatGPT and some other tools like Claude. And so I''m I''m \",\"startTime\":1740799993,\"endTime\":1740799997},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"just interested in connecting with those that share a passion for trying new things and new tools and being able to expand on that into our work as educators. \",\"startTime\":1740799997,\"endTime\":1740800006},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Well, as I''m not a classroom teacher necessarily, I maybe have a slightly different perspective and some of those that are in the classroom every day. But I do \",\"startTime\":1740800042,\"endTime\":1740800051},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"think that my perspective as counselor helps to. \",\"startTime\":1740800051,\"endTime\":1740800056},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Understand a little bit better, and I do believe that right now in education, the adults often hold too much of the onus. \",\"startTime\":1740800056,\"endTime\":1740800067},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"To have students succeed.\",\"startTime\":1740800072,\"endTime\":1740800074},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"And I think that we are potentially out of balance in that sense. I think that \",\"startTime\":1740800074,\"endTime\":1740800077},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"we''ve taken a lot of the responsibility, at least at the high school level off of the students and. \",\"startTime\":1740800077,\"endTime\":1740800085},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Tend to focus on either end of the spectrum in terms of students who are achieving highly or students who are struggling greatly. \",\"startTime\":1740800088,\"endTime\":1740800094},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"We oftentimes leave some of the folks who we can move probably the most in the middle behind. And so that''s one thing that I would. \",\"startTime\":1740800095,\"endTime\":1740800101},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Wish that I had a better answer and a solution for and and maybe through this platform I can start to consider that and think about. \",\"startTime\":1740800103,\"endTime\":1740800109},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Ways to tackle that hidden and forgotten middle.\",\"startTime\":1740800109,\"endTime\":1740800112},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"But it''s something that I struggle with is, you know, I feel like sometimes the adults are doing so much of the work and heavy lifting that it has potentially backfired. And on our support for students. \",\"startTime\":1740800112,\"endTime\":1740800123},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Probably cooking is my definite activity. I enjoy creativity.\",\"startTime\":1740800161,\"endTime\":1740800165},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Not necessarily a chore for me to cook, kind of the main.\",\"startTime\":1740800165,\"endTime\":1740800168},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"In our household and it''s something that I do to relax to.\",\"startTime\":1740800169,\"endTime\":1740800174},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"That dominion of that kitchen in that space and so, but it also allows me to. \",\"startTime\":1740800176,\"endTime\":1740800182},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Both be creative and follow a set of rules and expectations. I''m not really \",\"startTime\":1740800182,\"endTime\":1740800186},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"a recipe follower, which is why I don''t do a kind of baking. \",\"startTime\":1740800186,\"endTime\":1740800190},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"But I do typically use a recipe for some sort of inspiration and then kind of invalid along the way depending on what I feel like or what I''ve done in the past. \",\"startTime\":1740800191,\"endTime\":1740800200}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.705721+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.705721+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 192, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.690Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('856b5ec0-e5b2-4088-a30a-4072eb4d4e17', '1437c66b-ec40-4d5f-ae09-61eaf239da58', '137242', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Learner from 2001. In 2001 I was in 10th grade and I was learning.\",\"startTime\":1740438013,\"endTime\":1740438019},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"As a student As a capital S student in high school in Petaluma, CA.\",\"startTime\":1740438019,\"endTime\":1740438025},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Umm, I now teach.\",\"startTime\":1740438027,\"endTime\":1740438029},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"People that have more guts than they would.\",\"startTime\":1740438030,\"endTime\":1740438032},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Without me, uh, how to skip steps?\",\"startTime\":1740438033,\"endTime\":1740438035},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Had a drop in, had to point their skis straight downhill.\",\"startTime\":1740438038,\"endTime\":1740438041},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I want to learn.\",\"startTime\":1740438042,\"endTime\":1740438043},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"How to be more effective in that and how to make my impact scale and help us go faster towards wherever it is that we''re going? \",\"startTime\":1740438044,\"endTime\":1740438050},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I say, what might I say? I might say Fast forward leaning, standing tall when \",\"startTime\":1740438064,\"endTime\":1740438067},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I''m at my best. \",\"startTime\":1740438067,\"endTime\":1740438070},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Student centered.\",\"startTime\":1740438070,\"endTime\":1740438072},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Tech forward.\",\"startTime\":1740438074,\"endTime\":1740438075},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Uh, rhythmic. There''s a lot of cadence in my teaching, uh.\",\"startTime\":1740438079,\"endTime\":1740438082},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Like the analogy of.\",\"startTime\":1740438083,\"endTime\":1740438085},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"And I think that teachers are incredible.\",\"startTime\":1740438086,\"endTime\":1740438089},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I think that learners are everywhere and can be motivated by good teachers or by good experiences. \",\"startTime\":1740438090,\"endTime\":1740438097},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Eat, eat, eat apples and bananas.\",\"startTime\":1740438108,\"endTime\":1740438111},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I like to eat, eat, eat those apples, those bananas.\",\"startTime\":1740438111,\"endTime\":1740438115},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I love to oat oat oat, those opals and bononos.\",\"startTime\":1740438116,\"endTime\":1740438120},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I like to sing songs.\",\"startTime\":1740438121,\"endTime\":1740438123},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Play guitar and go skiing.\",\"startTime\":1740438123,\"endTime\":1740438126}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.878092+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.878092+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 103, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.846Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('1edf68d7-a63f-4f88-bcba-e31773cf9dc4', 'bd47a56c-b275-4972-987f-30b0cd993f17', '138038', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Hello.\",\"startTime\":1744212401,\"endTime\":1744212401},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Let me do.\",\"startTime\":1744212404,\"endTime\":1744212405},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hey, hey, hey.\",\"startTime\":1744212409,\"endTime\":1744212410},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, you lagged out a little bit.\",\"startTime\":1744212416,\"endTime\":1744212418},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Let''s go try. Do you know?\",\"startTime\":1744212418,\"endTime\":1744212420},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"In the app to headphones.\",\"startTime\":1744212420,\"endTime\":1744212422},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Also.\",\"startTime\":1744212426,\"endTime\":1744212426},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1744212426,\"endTime\":1744212427},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK. Be your partner. Hey, Tom.\",\"startTime\":1744212429,\"endTime\":1744212433},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Hey, can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1744212434,\"endTime\":1744212436},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yes, I can hear you now.\",\"startTime\":1744212438,\"endTime\":1744212439},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Sweet umm.\",\"startTime\":1744212441,\"endTime\":1744212442},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Do you know how I swear?\",\"startTime\":1744212443,\"endTime\":1744212444},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Go to my headphones.\",\"startTime\":1744212445,\"endTime\":1744212446},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"If my phone''s connected to it already, oh, for whatever reason it''s here. Got \",\"startTime\":1744212447,\"endTime\":1744212449},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"it. I''m ready, Rock. \",\"startTime\":1744212449,\"endTime\":1744212451},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, ready to go? OK, Greet your partner and then press more. Hi, Tom. \",\"startTime\":1744212454,\"endTime\":1744212458},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"First experience using an AI tool.\",\"startTime\":1744212463,\"endTime\":1744212466},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"First of all, thank you, Abduo for the grounding question.\",\"startTime\":1744212473,\"endTime\":1744212475},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Do you want to go first?\",\"startTime\":1744212479,\"endTime\":1744212481},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, either one, go for it.\",\"startTime\":1744212481,\"endTime\":1744212484},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I can''t really.\",\"startTime\":1744212486,\"endTime\":1744212487},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I mean, I''m doing that thing where I''m just thinking about when was the first time that I got on ChatGPT. \",\"startTime\":1744212491,\"endTime\":1744212497},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I don''t know if that''s the right question.\",\"startTime\":1744212499,\"endTime\":1744212500},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh well, tell me about chat TPT. This is great feedback for the question. I \",\"startTime\":1744212501,\"endTime\":1744212505},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"think we should update the question to one of your first experiences. \",\"startTime\":1744212505,\"endTime\":1744212509},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"One of my first experiences was a year ago sorry probably last November.\",\"startTime\":1744212510,\"endTime\":1744212516},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"After like.\",\"startTime\":1744212519,\"endTime\":1744212520},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Messing around with it for a minute, I threw a kid on ChatGPT to help her create a business plan. \",\"startTime\":1744212522,\"endTime\":1744212527},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744212529,\"endTime\":1744212529},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"For this idea she had, and ultimately what she.\",\"startTime\":1744212530,\"endTime\":1744212533},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And I, I kind of knew this going into it, but what she really wanted to do was to impress her dad. \",\"startTime\":1744212534,\"endTime\":1744212538},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1744212540,\"endTime\":1744212540},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So so in my mind I was like fuck it, I don''t care, there''s no cheating here because all you really want to do is impress and connect with your dad. So let''s \",\"startTime\":1744212541,\"endTime\":1744212548},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"chat GP the hell out of this so you can impress your dad. \",\"startTime\":1744212548,\"endTime\":1744212551},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I love it.\",\"startTime\":1744212553,\"endTime\":1744212554},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, by the way, I learned something in here. If the card questions in the way \",\"startTime\":1744212556,\"endTime\":1744212560},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of the person that you''re chatting with, you just touch the screen like on their face or something, not on the card, and then it goes away and then you can touch it again and it comes back. \",\"startTime\":1744212560,\"endTime\":1744212571},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, that''s cool. How was that experience helping the kid? Like you just, \",\"startTime\":1744212573,\"endTime\":1744212576},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"like, chatted? \",\"startTime\":1744212576,\"endTime\":1744212579},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Would you say use ChatGPT the hell out of it?\",\"startTime\":1744212580,\"endTime\":1744212583},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s on the chat cheap between the Halo so you can press your dad. And \",\"startTime\":1744212582,\"endTime\":1744212585},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I didn''t see that to her because that was like anyways, like I was like the adult in the situation saying let''s use this tool to actually get to the real goal. \",\"startTime\":1744212585,\"endTime\":1744212592},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And it like totally it. It helped her.\",\"startTime\":1744212596,\"endTime\":1744212601},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744212600,\"endTime\":1744212600},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Have a conversation with her dad about.\",\"startTime\":1744212602,\"endTime\":1744212605},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Going to college because she was a senior last year.\",\"startTime\":1744212607,\"endTime\":1744212609},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And it just sort of like.\",\"startTime\":1744212609,\"endTime\":1744212613},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Elevated the whole thing and I mean there were so many layers of like parents are divorced and. \",\"startTime\":1744212613,\"endTime\":1744212618},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh cool.\",\"startTime\":1744212618,\"endTime\":1744212618},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know, like some deep misogyny and all that. Like, like there''s all that \",\"startTime\":1744212619,\"endTime\":1744212621},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"type of stuff that was. \",\"startTime\":1744212621,\"endTime\":1744212623},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"At play and so it was just a cool vehicle to get to something really important and it helped her have a great conversation with her dad about. \",\"startTime\":1744212624,\"endTime\":1744212632},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Colleges. And he was like, oh, you''re for real, like.\",\"startTime\":1744212633,\"endTime\":1744212636},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You could actually go and do stuff as opposed to just being like an objectified female, which is what he was. That''s how kind of he looked into the world. So \",\"startTime\":1744212636,\"endTime\":1744212642},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"anyways, it was so like, honestly, from that point on, I was like, yes, more of this, please. \",\"startTime\":1744212642,\"endTime\":1744212648},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wow that''s such a cool story of hearing that AI was a tool that really empowered a girl to stand tall and show her dad that she has identity and agency of her own. \",\"startTime\":1744212650,\"endTime\":1744212663},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And she is. She''s capable. That''s way cool.\",\"startTime\":1744212665,\"endTime\":1744212668},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744212668,\"endTime\":1744212668},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ll go with the.\",\"startTime\":1744212669,\"endTime\":1744212671},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"''Cause I''m not sure the AI were just good programming, but I''ll go with ChatGPT too. I was thinking about the other predictions on phones and swipe technology, \",\"startTime\":1744212673,\"endTime\":1744212682},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"which is a whole fun other conversation, but uh, I remember hopping on ChatGPT cause I''ve been reading, reading, reading about AI and what it could do and all of these things and it''s been years. I''m like, OK, this is really cool. \",\"startTime\":1744212682,\"endTime\":1744212695},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"This is really cool. Now I get to put my hands on it and uh. I. \",\"startTime\":1744212695,\"endTime\":1744212699},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I was asking it to do things with my Google Drive and suite and documents, taking lessons of curriculum that I''ve been part of and, and asking it to generate templates and then build up new lessons and all the stuff. Which today I realized \",\"startTime\":1744212700,\"endTime\":1744212715},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"takes a lot of work or programming the AI to even be able to do that. And I \",\"startTime\":1744212715,\"endTime\":1744212720},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"was imagining it could do way more super powered things than than it could do at the time. And I was really underwhelmed because. \",\"startTime\":1744212720,\"endTime\":1744212730},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Couldn''t do it. No, I can''t read your Google Drive. No, I can''t read that link. \",\"startTime\":1744212732,\"endTime\":1744212736},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, I can''t do this. I''m like, well, what can you do? And it helped me get back \",\"startTime\":1744212736,\"endTime\":1744212740},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to the reality. Oh, yeah, there is a lot that is needing to be done. I was in \",\"startTime\":1744212740,\"endTime\":1744212744},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"the house analogy. I was like, build me a house, but not just build me a house, \",\"startTime\":1744212744,\"endTime\":1744212748},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"build me a whole development. No, not just a whole develop. Let''s build a city. \",\"startTime\":1744212748,\"endTime\":1744212752},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, not just a city. Let''s build a whole world. \",\"startTime\":1744212752,\"endTime\":1744212756},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And instead of, you know, it takes a lot of time to even draft out what your house plans are for one house and then what the environmental impact is and all these other things like the thoughtfulness that I was wanting the the AI tool to put into it. I was just imagining that this. \",\"startTime\":1744212757,\"endTime\":1744212774},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Years, this decade of work or a lifetime of work for me that I consolidate and they would be able to understand it and then be able to implement it immediately. \",\"startTime\":1744212777,\"endTime\":1744212787},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I didn''t realize how complex the world is and how complex things are. Like \",\"startTime\":1744212787,\"endTime\":1744212792},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"creating curriculum, creating really good curriculum. That''s what I was wanting \",\"startTime\":1744212792,\"endTime\":1744212797},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it to do at that time. I forgot how complex it is because at the moment. \",\"startTime\":1744212797,\"endTime\":1744212802},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s simple. It''s right in front of me. You just do it. Duh.\",\"startTime\":1744212803,\"endTime\":1744212806},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Teach. It''s what you know how to do.\",\"startTime\":1744212807,\"endTime\":1744212809},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I was expecting the tool to be able to catch up to speed immediately without doing the training or the grounding or using it specifically. So it was quite \",\"startTime\":1744212810,\"endTime\":1744212818},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a quite a eye opening experiment for me. \",\"startTime\":1744212818,\"endTime\":1744212823},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, I''m going to press next. This is just the ice breaker.\",\"startTime\":1744212825,\"endTime\":1744212827},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744212828,\"endTime\":1744212829},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK. And then?\",\"startTime\":1744212829,\"endTime\":1744212830},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"There was a lot of different things that I just thought about. So OK, partner \",\"startTime\":1744212829,\"endTime\":1744212832},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"ready, here we go. \",\"startTime\":1744212832,\"endTime\":1744212834},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1744212833,\"endTime\":1744212833},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Share your thoughts on real fears versus misplaced fears about using AI tools in education. Then ask your partner to add to your answer. Oh, so yours probably \",\"startTime\":1744212837,\"endTime\":1744212846},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"says Ask Jeff. \",\"startTime\":1744212846,\"endTime\":1744212850},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Ask your partner, what do you think are some real fears versus misplaced fears? \",\"startTime\":1744212851,\"endTime\":1744212855},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Listen for the information and more.\",\"startTime\":1744212856,\"endTime\":1744212859},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah. All right. OK.\",\"startTime\":1744212861,\"endTime\":17442