asks. \",\"startTime\":1744212930,\"endTime\":1744212936},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Can just be functionally programmed. When the student says or does A, then output \",\"startTime\":1744212939,\"endTime\":1744212943},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"B. If that''s what we''re doing in our jobs, in our work, then then we''re not \",\"startTime\":1744212943,\"endTime\":1744212947},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"being creative or we''re not being human in the way that we should be. \",\"startTime\":1744212947,\"endTime\":1744212951},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I think we need to change our jobs. But that''s my first thought on the fears. \",\"startTime\":1744212952,\"endTime\":1744212956},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Alright, umm.\",\"startTime\":1744212961,\"endTime\":1744212961},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m looking at them more now.\",\"startTime\":1744212962,\"endTime\":1744212964},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How about your thoughts on it?\",\"startTime\":1744212971,\"endTime\":1744212972},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You just like made me think about.\",\"startTime\":1744212975,\"endTime\":1744212977},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You want to share?\",\"startTime\":1744212983,\"endTime\":1744212984},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Start the edge on the right shoes for a second. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1744212986,\"endTime\":1744212988},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"One yes, yeah, I''m gonna share should I click more though first to like stay true to the to the experience. \",\"startTime\":1744212988,\"endTime\":1744212994},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, no, go with it.\",\"startTime\":1744212994,\"endTime\":1744212995},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, the experiences we get to drive the conversation.\",\"startTime\":1744212996,\"endTime\":1744212998},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, right.\",\"startTime\":1744212999,\"endTime\":1744213000},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"What what that just made me think about was that I agree that that is a fear and it''s misplaced. And what is like if you get to the root of what is misplaced \",\"startTime\":1744213001,\"endTime\":1744213011},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"there, and the fear is that teachers don''t value what they do. \",\"startTime\":1744213011,\"endTime\":1744213017},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So in other words, like if you think you''re going to get replaced by ChatGPT, Chat cheap or whatever, AI is going to replace menial repetitive tasks. And \",\"startTime\":1744213022,\"endTime\":1744213029},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hmm, tell me more about that.\",\"startTime\":1744213022,\"endTime\":1744213025},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"if that''s the only thing that we do as teachers and if that''s our most important thing. \",\"startTime\":1744213029,\"endTime\":1744213036},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Then yes, that probably would be replaced or be replaceable through some some technology and some chat bots and blah blah blah. \",\"startTime\":1744213038,\"endTime\":1744213045},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And so if that''s like where you''re stuck and then that''s like what you think you do and that''s the value you bring, and that''s how you look at your work. \",\"startTime\":1744213046,\"endTime\":1744213054},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744213056,\"endTime\":1744213057},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wow, you made me think when you were saying that about the teachers who teach kids to do menial, repetitive tasks. \",\"startTime\":1744213060,\"endTime\":1744213070},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"If my job is to teach kids, for example, how to solve a 2 step equation for the quadratic formula through this process of repetitive simple tasks procedures that you can mimic? \",\"startTime\":1744213072,\"endTime\":1744213086},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Then my job is is gone. What? What''s my value?\",\"startTime\":1744213090,\"endTime\":1744213093},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then I think that''s a very real fear for those math teachers who see their jobs or do their jobs in that way is or any other content area if my job is to. \",\"startTime\":1744213097,\"endTime\":1744213108},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Provide students with repetitive, simple steps for them to be quote, UN quote successful, at least on my assessment. If that''s what they''re doing, then that''s \",\"startTime\":1744213110,\"endTime\":1744213118},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"gonna really challenge what their job''s gonna be like, because AI totally could replace them. \",\"startTime\":1744213118,\"endTime\":1744213126},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And what we''re saying.\",\"startTime\":1744213131,\"endTime\":1744213132},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Is wake up folks. That is not your job and it''s never been our job.\",\"startTime\":1744213132,\"endTime\":1744213137},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, right there. OK. I''m ready for next.\",\"startTime\":1744213139,\"endTime\":1744213142},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"By the way, up in the corner, I see there''s a timer for how long we''ve been going and then the red light of like, I think that is we''ve been spending plenty of time on on the topic or maybe we just were behind. I don''t care. \",\"startTime\":1744213144,\"endTime\":1744213155},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I think, I think we''re behind because each, like each one was supposed to be two minutes. \",\"startTime\":1744213156,\"endTime\":1744213159},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Got it. I don''t care. I''m good, alright.\",\"startTime\":1744213160,\"endTime\":1744213163},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"What have you seen, heard, or experienced that raises concerns about bias?\",\"startTime\":1744213162,\"endTime\":1744213167},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And and GBT or AI tools.\",\"startTime\":1744213169,\"endTime\":1744213172},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I mean, I guess what have you seen her or experienced?\",\"startTime\":1744213175,\"endTime\":1744213178},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Is I was talking about the scene and the herd is.\",\"startTime\":1744213179,\"endTime\":1744213182},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know, kids misusing it, kids using students using it as a way to like.\",\"startTime\":1744213184,\"endTime\":1744213189},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Replace their own voice, umm and uh, to the thread that we were talking about, and the teachers would be replaced. \",\"startTime\":1744213189,\"endTime\":1744213195},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And and.\",\"startTime\":1744213198,\"endTime\":1744213198},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"What have I experienced? You know, I''ll go back to that story, a page that I \",\"startTime\":1744213200,\"endTime\":1744213203},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"already talked about, so I can see like the real value. I see this kid Jackson, \",\"startTime\":1744213203,\"endTime\":1744213206},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"who I wanna like. \",\"startTime\":1744213206,\"endTime\":1744213209},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"As an aside, see if you and Jackson can talk for a little bit.\",\"startTime\":1744213209,\"endTime\":1744213213},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Jackson is creating a.\",\"startTime\":1744213215,\"endTime\":1744213216},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"An AI tool. He just downloaded all the AP rubrics as a way to train.\",\"startTime\":1744213218,\"endTime\":1744213225},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"His his bot or his tool or whatever.\",\"startTime\":1744213227,\"endTime\":1744213230},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"As a way to grade student work.\",\"startTime\":1744213230,\"endTime\":1744213234},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And but like it''s a whole like brainstorming developmental tool as opposed to like an assessment final tool. \",\"startTime\":1744213235,\"endTime\":1744213243},{\"speake