\":\"Pre trained transformer. Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745344535,\"endTime\":1745344538},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745344537,\"endTime\":1745344537},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Umm, I like the other part. Umm. And maybe I''ll change the the phrase around \",\"startTime\":1745344538,\"endTime\":1745344542},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"in the question. What do you think GPT does or stands for? But like or, or what \",\"startTime\":1745344542,\"endTime\":1745344547},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"does it do? Yeah, I think that''s great. And that word transformer is huge in \",\"startTime\":1745344547,\"endTime\":1745344551},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745344547,\"endTime\":1745344548},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"it. Yeah, it takes inputs and transforms it into an output. \",\"startTime\":1745344551,\"endTime\":1745344556},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm, mm-hmm, mm-hmm. That.\",\"startTime\":1745344557,\"endTime\":1745344561},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Lowest, lowest or best probable pathway to get there? Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745344559,\"endTime\":1745344563},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745344564,\"endTime\":1745344565},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And then this one is interesting I think, but I want your feedback. What have \",\"startTime\":1745344566,\"endTime\":1745344571},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"you noticed about the quality of your input and how it affects the output? \",\"startTime\":1745344571,\"endTime\":1745344575},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so.\",\"startTime\":1745344576,\"endTime\":1745344578},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, of course I have If you, if you.\",\"startTime\":1745344578,\"endTime\":1745344581},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Right, a low quality prompt you leave too much room for.\",\"startTime\":1745344582,\"endTime\":1745344587},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"For the transformer to hallucinate.\",\"startTime\":1745344588,\"endTime\":1745344590},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So it basically makes up stuff so.\",\"startTime\":1745344590,\"endTime\":1745344593},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"The better the prompt, the better the quality of it. Sometimes I''m tired or \",\"startTime\":1745344594,\"endTime\":1745344597},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"whatever and I just like. \",\"startTime\":1745344597,\"endTime\":1745344601},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Put a bunch of code and then I''m like. I don''t even explain it, I just copy \",\"startTime\":1745344602,\"endTime\":1745344604},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"my code, my error code. \",\"startTime\":1745344604,\"endTime\":1745344607},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And and and put it in in the platform or whatever. And they start like spitting \",\"startTime\":1745344608,\"endTime\":1745344612},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"out just crap. \",\"startTime\":1745344612,\"endTime\":1745344615},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So yeah, the the result depends highly depends on the quality of the prompt. \",\"startTime\":1745344615,\"endTime\":1745344618},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. \",\"startTime\":1745344618,\"endTime\":1745344622},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745344624,\"endTime\":1745344625},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Have you, you use Chat JPT and you have a umm, the crew at Sidebys that have an account with with our group. Umm, I''m gonna try to share some of the projects \",\"startTime\":1745344627,\"endTime\":1745344636},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''ve been building. Last week I started doing projects in chat TPT. \",\"startTime\":1745344636,\"endTime\":1745344641},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like projects around community correspondence, which is all the welcome emails and the nudges and things. And it''s been fun. And I don''t know, I was gonna \",\"startTime\":1745344642,\"e