2,\"endTime\":1745344783},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm, Mm-hmm, mm-hmm, mm-hmm. Yeah, Yeah. I know. I was going through the \",\"startTime\":1745344781,\"endTime\":1745344786},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"the document that you sent. I was going through the document. It''s really nice, \",\"startTime\":1745344786,\"endTime\":1745344791},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745344787,\"endTime\":1745344788},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"really nice. And you''re keeping track of all the emails that you''re you''re sending. \",\"startTime\":1745344791,\"endTime\":1745344796},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So that''s, that''s huge because it''s gonna like, we''re gonna basically using your style of communication, your writing style to communicate with the. \",\"startTime\":1745344796,\"endTime\":1745344803},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"With the user, so that''s great.\",\"startTime\":1745344803,\"endTime\":1745344805},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. And I don''t know at what point it automates with this way or that, \",\"startTime\":1745344805,\"endTime\":1745344810},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"but I have built like I''ve taken all of those old emails and on that artifacts doc, I had old welcome emails and then version one point O2 where I took all of the previous ones and I said, hey, this is where we are now. This is how \",\"startTime\":1745344810,\"endTime\":1745344822},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"it''s changed, use my language, etcetera. And then and then crafted in the instructions \",\"startTime\":1745344822,\"endTime\":1745344827},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"for my project to be able to to articulate that and then gave them a samples. \",\"startTime\":1745344827,\"endTime\":1745344831},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"So it''s been fun to do that already. \",\"startTime\":1745344831,\"endTime\":1745344835},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And my hope would be is that as we figure that out, was that you don''t have to do double work or something that I or Mike have done already. Let''s make \",\"startTime\":1745344835,\"endTime\":1745344843},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"sure that we''re good on that. But I''m so stoked about automating those quick \",\"startTime\":1745344843,\"endTime\":1745344847},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745344845,\"endTime\":1745344846},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"emails like, hey, what''s the welcome e-mail really need to have? Yeah, OK. \",\"startTime\":1745344847,\"endTime\":1745344851},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"A colleague shares that he''s been using.\",\"startTime\":1745344856,\"endTime\":1745344860},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Umm, and then.\",\"startTime\":1745344856,\"endTime\":1745344857},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Interesting. Yeah, question to ponder to.\",\"startTime\":1745344864,\"endTime\":1745344867},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Umm OK, this is cool.\",\"startTime\":1745344870,\"endTime\":1745344873},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Hmm, so the threads, yeah, so.\",\"startTime\":1745344876,\"endTime\":1745344879},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So as I understand it, there''s two things.\",\"startTime\":1745344882,\"endTime\":1745344885},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"The context.\",\"startTime\":1745344887,\"endTime\":1745344888},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Context memory of it.\",\"startTime\":1745344889,\"endTime\":1745344891},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Right right now ChatGPT has like a context memory.\",\"startTime\":1745344891,\"endTime\":1745344895},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"From all your conversations so far, right? So you can you can prompt it like \",\"startTime\":1745344896,\"endTime\":1745344900},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"very interesting things such as like. \",\"startTime\":1745344900,\"endTime\":1745344905},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"From everything that you know about me so far, can you please describe me using? \",\"startTime\":1745344907,\"endTime\":1745344913},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I don''t know whatever fun thing you you can do right? Or or or. There was one \",\"startTime\":1745344913,\"endTime\":1745344918},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745344915,\"endTime\":1745344915},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"very, very interested, interested, interesting one, which was. \",\"startTime\":1745344918,\"endTime\":1745344924},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Uh, the display and I did it with my own, uh, account.\",\"startTime\":1745344925,\"endTime\":1745344929},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And it''s like, based on all you know and, uh, and all our previous conversations, please elaborate. \",\"startTime\":1745344929,\"endTime\":1745344936},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Like FBI?\",\"startTime\":1745344937,\"endTime\":1745344938},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"A summary of my personality or something like that and it goes crazy.\",\"startTime\":1745344940,\"endTime\":1745344945},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Try, give it a try. Like it''s crazy. So yeah. So that''s one thing. Now it''s \",\"startTime\":1745344945,\"endTime\":1745344949},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''ll try that. That sounds fun. That sounds fun.\",\"startTime\":1745344946,\"endTime\":1745344948},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"keeping track of all the each conversation. \",\"startTime\":1745344949,\"endTime\":1745344954},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Uh, in the in the backstage, I believe that each conversation gets stored, but it doesn''t get stored. \",\"startTime\":1745344957,\"endTime\":1745344965},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"As a transcript, it gets stored as a vector, right? So it''s basically pure numbers, \",\"startTime\":1745344967,\"endTime\":1745344972},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"right? And weights and stuff like a big, big, big number. \",\"startTime\":1745344972,\"endTime\":1745344977},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And then so that''s one thing and the other one, it''s like the context memory of each chat. \",\"startTime\":1745344978,\"endTime\":1745344984},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"In each shot has a context memory in.\",\"startTime\":1745344985,\"endTime\":1745344989},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Depends in it. I don''t remember very well how it how is it, but for example \",\"startTime\":1745344989,\"endTime\":1745344993},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"old models had a context memory of like 4000 tokens. \",\"startTime\":1745344993,\"endTime\":1745344998},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And newer models like Gemini for example have context memory of like 1 million or 2 million tokens. \",\"startTime\":1745344999,\"endTime\":1745345007},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And so it''s, it''s crazy. So basically it''s moving along. So that''s why sometimes \",\"startTime\":1745345007,\"endTime\":1745345012},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"maybe in the in, in, in the short context memory models. \",\"startTime\":1745345012,\"endTime\":1745345017},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"For example, if you move, if you start chatting, chatting, chatting, chatting. \",\"startTime\":1745345017,\"endTime\":1745345021},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"It forgets the initial context of your question, right? That''s why sometimes \",\"startTime\":1745345023,\"endTime\":1745345027},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"it makes sense when you are like. \",\"startTime\":1745345027,\"endTime\":1745345031},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Noticing that the model is getting a little like hallucinogenic or dump.\",\"startTime\":1745345032,\"endTime\":1745345037},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"It''s better to open a new chat and start again with the with a new problem, right? Because you have you start with the problem and then you start chatting \",\"startTime\":1745345037,\"endTime\":1745345045},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"with it and then, and then suddenly. \",\"startTime\":1745345045,\"endTime\":1745345048},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345045,\"endTime\":1745345046},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"You went through too far. You went too far. And then it''s usually it''s it''s \",\"startTime\":1745345049,\"endTime\":1745345054},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"a good idea to start all over, but with renewed problems statement or something like that. Yeah, that''s, that''s what I do. Do you do? \",\"startTime\":1745345054,\"endTime\":1745345062},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think Speaking of like home improvement in Brick Lane and things like that, it''s, it''s to me, it''s almost like going to the hardware store and I''m talking to somebody there to to find my answers or to get help on something. \",\"startTime\":1745345062,\"endTime\":1745345078},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And sometimes we''re talking for too long and it''s not happening. It''s not working. \",\"startTime\":1745345078,\"endTime\":1745345082},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"They''re not seeing what I''m seeing. Or we''re off target and we''re doing something \",\"startTime\":1745345082,\"endTime\":1745345085},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"else and you''re like, Oh my God. \",\"startTime\":1745345085,\"endTime\":1745345088},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And then you come back to the point which you''re trying to get. I just need \",\"startTime\":1745345088,\"endTime\":1745345090},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"paint. \",\"startTime\":1745345090,\"endTime\":1745345092},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m gonna go talk to somebody else. And it helps in that way because you have \",\"startTime\":1745345093,\"endTime\":1745345098},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, no.\",\"startTime\":1745345096,\"endTime\":1745345098},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"a, as a user, a fresher perspective of what you''re trying to do. So you can \",\"startTime\":1745345098,\"endTime\":1745345102},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"articulate it better. You can have a better prompt. And then also it''s fresher \",\"startTime\":1745345102,\"endTime\":1745345106},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"for them. So not all the other stuff is in the way. So you can really hone in \",\"startTime\":1745345106,\"endTime\":1745345110},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"on what you''re trying to do. Yeah, I like it. OK, These are fun. I would, I \",\"startTime\":1745345110,\"endTime\":1745345115},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"would do one of these almost every day with you. But we have other work to do. \",\"startTime\":1745345115,\"endTime\":1745345119},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Um, OK, uh, I''m going to say done on this one and then you''re ready and then thank your partner. Oh, I learned one thing from you today. Uh, thanks Diego, \",\"startTime\":1745345121,\"endTime\":1745345129},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"but it''s about the tokens. \",\"startTime\":1745345129,\"endTime\":1745345132},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745345132,\"endTime\":1745345133},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I know that there were some things about tokens, but I didn''t know it was like that and that we''ve gone from numbers like 4000 tokens to over 1,000,000. And \",\"startTime\":1745345133,\"endTime\":1745345141},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that''s such a huge difference. I see that experientially as amusing the AI tools \",\"startTime\":1745345141,\"endTime\":1745345146},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that I hadn''t even thought about it in that regard and why they''re they''re short term memory is as it is. Yeah. So thanks for that. \",\"startTime\":1745345146,\"endTime\":1745345154},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, because token. A token by definition right now, is 3/4 of a word of an \",\"startTime\":1745345154,\"endTime\":1745345158},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"English word. \",\"startTime\":1745345158,\"endTime\":1745345162},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So it''s a 3/4 of an English word. So if you have like.\",\"startTime\":1745345164,\"endTime\":1745345168},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Hello. That''s, uh, you have like 3 fourth tokens, right? Something like that. \",\"startTime\":1745345168,\"endTime\":1745345175},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So a million tokens would be like 700,000 words, right? So that''s the right. \",\"startTime\":1745345175,\"endTime\":1745345181},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So in the other umm.\",\"startTime\":1745345183,\"endTime\":1745345185},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Interesting.\",\"startTime\":1745345183,\"endTime\":1745345183},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Measurement is input tokens and output tokens.\",\"startTime\":1745345186,\"endTime\":1745345191},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Input tokens are cheaper than output tokens in newer models.\",\"startTime\":1745345191,\"endTime\":1745345196},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So, uh, the other day as, uh, I was doing something for, for, for Chile.\",\"startTime\":1745345197,\"endTime\":1745345203},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And and suddenly I started playing with Gemini 2.5, which is the latest Google \",\"startTime\":1745345205,\"endTime\":1745345211},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"model. And suddenly I see my bail because you can you connect it to your bill. \",\"startTime\":1745345211,\"endTime\":1745345217},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And in a few hours of coding, I spent $100 in, in codes like in tokens, I mean. \",\"startTime\":1745345217,\"endTime\":1745345222},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And it was what the, uh, you know, it was like, OK, I''m going to turn it up like. \",\"startTime\":1745345223,\"endTime\":1745345228},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345226,\"endTime\":1745345226},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I don''t understand.\",\"startTime\":1745345229,\"endTime\":1745345231},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Turn it off. Turn it off.\",\"startTime\":1745345230,\"endTime\":1745345231},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1745345233,\"endTime\":1745345234},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Can you imagine the parents now with their teenage kids who are doing programming and their their parents gave them the credit card and now they''re like 500 or $1000 a day that they''re it''s like, it''s like the old Internet or cell phones for international calling them. I''m calling my friend in in Connecticut''s \",\"startTime\":1745345234,\"endTime\":1745345250},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"long distance. You can''t talk with with with Diego all day long. We don''t have \",\"startTime\":1745345250,\"endTime\":1745345254},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345252,\"endTime\":1745345253},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the money. \",\"startTime\":1745345254,\"endTime\":1745345258},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Was it was it like that before, uh, calling in between state? It was, it was \",\"startTime\":1745345259,\"endTime\":1745345262},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"considered like long distance. \",\"startTime\":1745345262,\"endTime\":1745345265},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345262,\"endTime\":1745345263},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"It was long distance. Yeah, like my sister.\",\"startTime\":1745345266,\"endTime\":1745345268},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m 53 and my sister''s 43, and she''s blind. She''s from Guatemala. And so she \",\"startTime\":1745345269,\"endTime\":1745345273},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"loved talking on the phone. So when she was a teenager and she would go like, \",\"startTime\":1745345273,\"endTime\":1745345276},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"she went to blind camp in the summer and she would meet these people from all over the States and she would want to connect with them. And then so it''s easy \",\"startTime\":1745345276,\"endTime\":1745345284},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"on the phone. You just like pick up the phone and talk. And my dad would tell \",\"startTime\":1745345284,\"endTime\":1745345288},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the stories about their, their phone bill and he''d be like you. And they would \",\"startTime\":1745345288,\"endTime\":1745345291},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"argue back and forth. And she''s just like a teenager. I just want to talk to \",\"startTime\":1745345291,\"endTime\":1745345295},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"my friends. \",\"startTime\":1745345295,\"endTime\":1745345299},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I have here similar stories, but even.\",\"startTime\":1745345300,\"endTime\":1745345302},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345300,\"endTime\":1745345300},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Less significant, like a kid.\",\"startTime\":1745345303,\"endTime\":1745345306},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"A A a parent giving access to the, uh, to the credit card connected to your cell phone to your kid, and then the kid buying skins for a video game and spending like crazy amounts of money in video games. So it''s not new. \",\"startTime\":1745345306,\"endTime\":1745345321},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s not new. Nope, Nope.\",\"startTime\":1745345321,\"endTime\":1745345323},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, Diego, thanks. Let me know how this works with transcript stuff. \",\"startTime\":1745345324,\"endTime\":1745345329},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And I want to give a thumbs up for text output though on our new version on the admin panel, when we download a tech or a transcript, if it''s in a TXT file format, it''s faster, simpler and the the robots read it better. When we would \",\"startTime\":1745345329,\"endTime\":1745345344},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745345340,\"endTime\":1745345343},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"use AVT format like on up below when you download it from up Duo, which you can see it does do. \",\"startTime\":1745345344,\"endTime\":1745345354},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Format which is great for some things, but I found that my bots were hallucinating because it wouldn''t always read it correctly or it wouldn''t go through the process of even reading it. So a text file is way faster and easier for all things. \",\"startTime\":1745345354,\"endTime\":1745345367},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745345363,\"endTime\":1745345363},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I think it''s.\",\"startTime\":1745345367,\"endTime\":1745345368},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Text. It''s a text file, yeah, no, right now you can download uh.\",\"startTime\":1745345369,\"endTime\":1745345374},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Umm, TXT files? Yeah, I''m gonna send you a screenshot right now.\",\"startTime\":1745345375,\"endTime\":1745345379},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah. OK, great. Yeah, I know we can do that. Currently in our admin panel when \",\"startTime\":1745345380,\"endTime\":1745345384},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"we download it, it is a TXT file. So as you''re figuring and and fiddling TXT \",\"startTime\":1745345384,\"endTime\":1745345388},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"file would be the preference. That''s the best and this great. All right, Anything \",\"startTime\":1745345388,\"endTime\":1745345392},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Hey.\",\"startTime\":1745345391,\"endTime\":1745345391},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"else? \",\"startTime\":1745345392,\"endTime\":1745345396},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"That''s great. See you. No, we''re good.\",\"startTime\":1745345394,\"endTime\":1745345396},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, awesome. Thanks, Diego.\",\"startTime\":1745345397,\"endTime\":1745345399}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.375752+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.375752+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1161, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.338Z", "session_title": "Understanding and Utilizing GPT and AI Threads", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "197", "name": "Understanding and Utilizing GPT and AI Threads", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('0f47bd84-f61d-4480-aa8a-b121d03f394a', '0df8e918-c6f4-4615-aadf-42c257edb6f4', '137556', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How are you?\",\"startTime\":1741725053,\"endTime\":1741725054},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Good. How are you doing?\",\"startTime\":1741725055,\"endTime\":1741725057},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Good, we made it.\",\"startTime\":1741725056,\"endTime\":1741725057},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I know it''s working. I''m so exciting.\",\"startTime\":1741725057,\"endTime\":1741725059},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that was funny last time. It makes sense that I had done too many of the \",\"startTime\":1741725060,\"endTime\":1741725063},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"sessions, so you can only do them twice. \",\"startTime\":1741725063,\"endTime\":1741725066},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But uh, this is great. So I just did a different account so we are here. Awesome. \",\"startTime\":1741725067,\"endTime\":1741725073},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Perfect.\",\"startTime\":1741725070,\"endTime\":1741725071},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I wanna talk so much about your day, but we''ll do the questions.\",\"startTime\":1741725075,\"endTime\":1741725078},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So the.\",\"startTime\":1741725076,\"endTime\":1741725077},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725080,\"endTime\":1741725080},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK. Meet your partner.\",\"startTime\":1741725080,\"endTime\":1741725082},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Great partner. Hi, Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1741725081,\"endTime\":1741725084},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Aye.\",\"startTime\":1741725086,\"endTime\":1741725086},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Hey I.\",\"startTime\":1741725088,\"endTime\":1741725088},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"What''s a skill besides AI fluency that you''ve been you''re working to improve? \",\"startTime\":1741725090,\"endTime\":1741725096},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Oh, I have been learning how to write poetry. I''ve been. Yeah, it''s been awesome. \",\"startTime\":1741725097,\"endTime\":1741725101},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Like, I got into like, somatic therapy and it''s all about feeling your feelings in your body. And so I found that, like, metaphors have been so helpful for \",\"startTime\":1741725101,\"endTime\":1741725111},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"that and trying to process it through writing. \",\"startTime\":1741725111,\"endTime\":1741725115},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I love that. That''s way cool. I need to get back to my writing. That''s a skill \",\"startTime\":1741725116,\"endTime\":1741725120},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that I''ve been working on but I put aside for some reason, but I have been working on. I want to hear so much more about your poems. Would you share one with me \",\"startTime\":1741725120,\"endTime\":1741725128},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"sometime just for if you want to? Yeah, that would be really fun. Like to hear \",\"startTime\":1741725128,\"endTime\":1741725132},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"more about it. And then by the way, in the background on your board, are those \",\"startTime\":1741725132,\"endTime\":1741725136},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, awesome. What are you? Oh.\",\"startTime\":1741725133,\"endTime\":1741725136},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"like Nets for things to fold together or are they just. Yeah. What grade do \",\"startTime\":1741725136,\"endTime\":1741725140},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you teach? What grade do you work with again? \",\"startTime\":1741725140,\"endTime\":1741725144},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725143,\"endTime\":1741725144},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Middle school math.\",\"startTime\":1741725145,\"endTime\":1741725146},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, that''s what I was thinking. Like that''s about the right time, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725146,\"endTime\":1741725150},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yep, Sir.\",\"startTime\":1741725150,\"endTime\":1741725151},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Skill for me is saying no to more things. I''m learning to say no and be more \",\"startTime\":1741725152,\"endTime\":1741725156},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"balanced and not overextend which is. \",\"startTime\":1741725156,\"endTime\":1741725161},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s a hard.\",\"startTime\":1741725160,\"endTime\":1741725162},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, this adulting thing, I just want to do everything.\",\"startTime\":1741725163,\"endTime\":1741725166},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And the balance of productivity versus like self-care, but not also being stagnant, like it''s so hard to find the middle line. \",\"startTime\":1741725167,\"endTime\":1741725174},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Exactly, exactly. You know what? Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725174,\"endTime\":1741725177},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Totally. OK then if I click XI think or next.\",\"startTime\":1741725177,\"endTime\":1741725181},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Alright.\",\"startTime\":1741725181,\"endTime\":1741725181},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Next.\",\"startTime\":1741725183,\"endTime\":1741725184},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"OK, next. Oh, it''s a.\",\"startTime\":1741725184,\"endTime\":1741725186},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Now mine says partner ready so I''m gonna put next. OK. If you press next before \",\"startTime\":1741725186,\"endTime\":1741725191},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I do then it will say partner ready on mine versus yours. \",\"startTime\":1741725191,\"endTime\":1741725197},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741725192,\"endTime\":1741725192},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s a That''s a good feature. I like that.\",\"startTime\":1741725196,\"endTime\":1741725198},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And also, if you wanted to go back, you can always press back. So then it will \",\"startTime\":1741725199,\"endTime\":1741725203},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"say your partner wants to go back or you''re waiting for your partner, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1741725203,\"endTime\":1741725206},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I gotcha. I like this. This is so cool. OK.\",\"startTime\":1741725206,\"endTime\":1741725209},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, you get to drive it with a partner instead of just a reflection, All right? \",\"startTime\":1741725209,\"endTime\":1741725213},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Ask Haley. How has AI changed your work as an educator or leader of educators \",\"startTime\":1741725213,\"endTime\":1741725218},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Right or.\",\"startTime\":1741725215,\"endTime\":1741725216},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"so far? \",\"startTime\":1741725218,\"endTime\":1741725223},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yep, and then ask Jeff to add more. OK, so it has reduced my workload and makes \",\"startTime\":1741725224,\"endTime\":1741725229},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"this profession feel manageable. Like it, I have a thought partner constantly \",\"startTime\":1741725229,\"endTime\":1741725234},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"and instead of spending five hours like creating scaffolding for a lesson, I can do it in 5 minutes. And so it helps me reach kids but then also like have \",\"startTime\":1741725234,\"endTime\":1741725244},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"a work life balance. \",\"startTime\":1741725244,\"endTime\":1741725249},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. That''s awesome. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1741725250,\"endTime\":1741725253},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, how are you?\",\"startTime\":1741725252,\"endTime\":1741725253},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Well, I''m I''m supposed to ask or look for considered tools or platforms you''ve used? \",\"startTime\":1741725255,\"endTime\":1741725260},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And think about efficiency impact improvements and then reflect on on changes in student engagement. So because I''m asking you the question, I''m being mindful \",\"startTime\":1741725260,\"endTime\":1741725268},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that. So I''m curious, what tools are you using to help do that? Like you talked \",\"startTime\":1741725268,\"endTime\":1741725273},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"about scaffolds, like what tools are you doing? \",\"startTime\":1741725273,\"endTime\":1741725277},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Colleague for sure, right ''cause that''s who who I''m with and everything. But \",\"startTime\":1741725278,\"endTime\":1741725282},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I have found that it''s just so helpful with best practices and stuff. So often \",\"startTime\":1741725282,\"endTime\":1741725287},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"times I''ll say like make a student facing graphic organizer with sentence stems and a word bank and then I''ll type in like. \",\"startTime\":1741725287,\"endTime\":1741725296},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Speed and MLL, that''s all I have to say. And then it''ll like revise it so it \",\"startTime\":1741725296,\"endTime\":1741725300},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"has pictures, cognitive dictionaries, like all the things. \",\"startTime\":1741725300,\"endTime\":1741725304},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And umm, it''s cool ''cause I have a printer in my room, so if something''s not working I''ll just be like, this didn''t work, I need this. Instead, print it \",\"startTime\":1741725304,\"endTime\":1741725309},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"off and give it to the kids. \",\"startTime\":1741725309,\"endTime\":1741725311},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wow, that''s awesome. What are you noticing for impact with students?\",\"startTime\":1741725314,\"endTime\":1741725319},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725315,\"endTime\":1741725316},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Engagement has increased a lot.\",\"startTime\":1741725319,\"endTime\":1741725321},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I, I used to teach 4th grade and I looped up with my kids. So the 8th graders \",\"startTime\":1741725324,\"endTime\":1741725328},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I''ve had, I''ve had since COVID and yeah, it''s been great, but it''s. \",\"startTime\":1741725328,\"endTime\":1741725332},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I noticed so much resistance when they hit middle school because of like being perceived by their peers. \",\"startTime\":1741725333,\"endTime\":1741725339},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And yesterday I had them like come up to the board to do math, which I shifted away from because of the resistance. And they were again willing, like they \",\"startTime\":1741725339,\"endTime\":1741725346},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"were in fourth and 5th grade, to like talk in front of their peers because they felt more confident. \",\"startTime\":1741725346,\"endTime\":1741725352},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hmm, wow, way to go. Nice job. Really nice.\",\"startTime\":1741725354,\"endTime\":1741725359},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1741725355,\"endTime\":1741725356},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So proud of them.\",\"startTime\":1741725358,\"endTime\":1741725359},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, mine just said ask Haley so.\",\"startTime\":1741725360,\"endTime\":1741725362},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Let me go back to see what mine said. OK, then ask Jeff to add to your answer. \",\"startTime\":1741725363,\"endTime\":1741725366},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So. \",\"startTime\":1741725366,\"endTime\":1741725370},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh OK, add to your answer I guess that''s my perspective. Oh I like what you \",\"startTime\":1741725370,\"endTime\":1741725375},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"said. Like what used to take hours, now it takes minutes. \",\"startTime\":1741725375,\"endTime\":1741725379},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Doing some things like.\",\"startTime\":1741725380,\"endTime\":1741725382},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Like it''s fun that you were saying about math and doing scaffolding for work. \",\"startTime\":1741725382,\"endTime\":1741725387},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"With Dale Berry, who''s over in Madison, WI, we created an AI assistant that focuses on special education, but from Washington''s perspective. \",\"startTime\":1741725387,\"endTime\":1741725398},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"According to Washington''s OSPI guidelines around menus of best practices and their their inclusionary practices report, We took all of that and put it in and created an AI bot as an assistant. And we''re using it to do things so slightly \",\"startTime\":1741725399,\"endTime\":1741725414},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1741725400,\"endTime\":1741725402},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"as you said, but then it''s it''s has from the knowledge base because I find that. \",\"startTime\":1741725414,\"endTime\":1741725419},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Each of the, or each of us has bias. It''s just built in. It''s, it''s our perspective \",\"startTime\":1741725419,\"endTime\":1741725424},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"on it. And so whether it''s Gemini or Copilot or ChatGPT or Perplexity or Cloud \",\"startTime\":1741725424,\"endTime\":1741725428},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"or whoever''s out there, they all have their, their knowledge base. And so Dale \",\"startTime\":1741725428,\"endTime\":1741725433},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"was helpful for me to think about. \",\"startTime\":1741725433,\"endTime\":1741725438},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How do we really make sure that the knowledge base is?\",\"startTime\":1741725438,\"endTime\":1741725442},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Based on the right stuff, so that the bias is biased towards what Washington state knows is best for inclusionary practices, the stance that our state has in mind for that. And so using tools like that to be able to do like, OK, now \",\"startTime\":1741725442,\"endTime\":1741725454},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725451,\"endTime\":1741725453},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"let''s go ahead and do. \",\"startTime\":1741725454,\"endTime\":1741725458},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How do we adapt this lesson 7th grade math lesson from molester to mathematics? \",\"startTime\":1741725458,\"endTime\":1741725463},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"By the way, illustrative mathematics stuff is epic good and it''s publicly available. \",\"startTime\":1741725463,\"endTime\":1741725467},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So even in the Chat GPTI can just say 7th grade unit 4 lesson 7 and it will go find it for me the whole lesson. I only have to upload it now. Yeah, at least \",\"startTime\":1741725467,\"endTime\":1741725476},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725469,\"endTime\":1741725470},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I can ChatGPT and that saves so much time because then I can have a lesson from a good knowledge base and help minimize the bias that we don''t want and elevate the biases. \",\"startTime\":1741725476,\"endTime\":1741725488},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"That''s amazing and even.\",\"startTime\":1741725477,\"endTime\":1741725479},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725481,\"endTime\":1741725481},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That we do want.\",\"startTime\":1741725489,\"endTime\":1741725490},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. And it''s like using the lessons that they give you and stuff. So \",\"startTime\":1741725490,\"endTime\":1741725494},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I guess that''s the right way to say it, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725491,\"endTime\":1741725493},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"that''s so helpful where it''s just like already there and then build on top of it kind of thing. \",\"startTime\":1741725494,\"endTime\":1741725501},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, exactly.\",\"startTime\":1741725502,\"endTime\":1741725503},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, I changed my work totally that way. And then.\",\"startTime\":1741725505,\"endTime\":1741725509},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725506,\"endTime\":1741725507},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Another one, which has been epic, is having recording of my own reflections or conversation with somebody. I can let go of so many details of trying to \",\"startTime\":1741725509,\"endTime\":1741725517},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"take notes because I can''t get it all down, and I can enjoy the conversation or enjoy the time of reflection and just hit record and then take it in the transcript and make the notes and do the things that I need to with it later. \",\"startTime\":1741725517,\"endTime\":1741725529},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s been super helpful. \",\"startTime\":1741725529,\"endTime\":1741725533},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Do you use a free app?\",\"startTime\":1741725532,\"endTime\":1741725533},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"My phone I got a Google pixel last year and it has built in transcription software with it. But I have really liked Otter. I''ve tried and played with a few different \",\"startTime\":1741725535,\"endTime\":1741725544},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"ones but Otter and I pay for the subscription because I really like it. \",\"startTime\":1741725544,\"endTime\":1741725549},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I like it ''cause I can integrate it with my Google Meet or my calendar meetings if I have a online meeting. But I can just have the app on my phone and I just \",\"startTime\":1741725550,\"endTime\":1741725558},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"press record. And I like it because it shows a live transcription. So I can \",\"startTime\":1741725558,\"endTime\":1741725562},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741725562,\"endTime\":1741725563},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"just look back real quickly ''cause I get lost in a detail and then I go, what was the thing that she just said? Haley mentioned What tool? \",\"startTime\":1741725562,\"endTime\":1741725570},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725570,\"endTime\":1741725571},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"''Cause I was thinking and processing the other stuff and then I can just skim right up and go, oh, that''s what it was called. She said she used that and so. \",\"startTime\":1741725571,\"endTime\":1741725577},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"No, and it looks like it says start here for free. So I think that there is \",\"startTime\":1741725578,\"endTime\":1741725581},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"a free option. \",\"startTime\":1741725581,\"endTime\":1741725584},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and I like the free option and I know that you can do certain things for free with it. And then I know the paid version, you can upload videos or audio \",\"startTime\":1741725583,\"endTime\":1741725591},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and then have it transcribe or do different things. \",\"startTime\":1741725591,\"endTime\":1741725596},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Remember, I should see about going to the free version. Maybe that''s all I need \",\"startTime\":1741725597,\"endTime\":1741725600},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"now. Yeah, yeah. But I really, really, really love that one, especially on Mana \",\"startTime\":1741725600,\"endTime\":1741725603},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1741725603,\"endTime\":1741725604},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Drive, coming back from a school district or whatever, and I or I''m going for a walk. \",\"startTime\":1741725603,\"endTime\":1741725609},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Put my earbuds in, I could just reflect and talk about the stuff that''s going on and then it''s got it. And then I have it and I can put it into my GPT assistant \",\"startTime\":1741725610,\"endTime\":1741725618},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725611,\"endTime\":1741725612},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and ask it, hey, what are we doing today? Or put this together, write my poem \",\"startTime\":1741725618,\"endTime\":1741725622},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"for me or, or whatever. \",\"startTime\":1741725622,\"endTime\":1741725625},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725624,\"endTime\":1741725625},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK, We''re gonna get way off topic. I know we could talk all day. I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1741725626,\"endTime\":1741725628},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I love.\",\"startTime\":1741725626,\"endTime\":1741725627},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"press next. \",\"startTime\":1741725628,\"endTime\":1741725631},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Next, go take turns sharing with Jeff. How do you think AI will change the role \",\"startTime\":1741725631,\"endTime\":1741725635},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"of learners in the future? Press more for ideas, personalized learning experience, \",\"startTime\":1741725635,\"endTime\":1741725639},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"AI tutors and assistants and learning analytics and personalized feedback. OK, \",\"startTime\":1741725639,\"endTime\":1741725643},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"you go first because I''ve been going first last two. \",\"startTime\":1741725643,\"endTime\":1741725648},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I think the role of learners is going to become more creators and problem solvers, and we have to really dial those parts up, even clear communicators, because the prompts that we use, there''s no perfect prompt. \",\"startTime\":1741725650,\"endTime\":1741725665},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"As you''ve probably found like when you''re talking to it, it makes sense in your brain, but then it doesn''t understand it the way you thought. You''re like, I \",\"startTime\":1741725666,\"endTime\":1741725672},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725670,\"endTime\":1741725671},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"didn''t mean that way. \",\"startTime\":1741725672,\"endTime\":1741725673},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And we have to become more articulate in our thinking and expressing our ideas and about problem solving. I think these, these tools are really tools. They, \",\"startTime\":1741725673,\"endTime\":1741725682},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725674,\"endTime\":1741725675},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"they are AI assistance for us to, to problem solve and to create things like, hey, how do I adapt and find the scaffolding for this lesson so I can enjoy my time with my kids. And I don''t spend so much time doing it. But I think we''ll \",\"startTime\":1741725682,\"endTime\":1741725696},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"have to become better problem solvers as learners. \",\"startTime\":1741725696,\"endTime\":1741725701},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Students and adults alike.\",\"startTime\":1741725703,\"endTime\":1741725705},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All of us as learners, we have to become better problem solvers and think about how do we solve these problems and what are the right tools to use and what are the right prompts to ask. Not like the perfect prompt, but what do I really \",\"startTime\":1741725705,\"endTime\":1741725714},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"want to ask? \",\"startTime\":1741725714,\"endTime\":1741725718},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Kind of like when we were first using Google and learning about Google searches, there''s different ways that you can get good results. So similarly, how do we \",\"startTime\":1741725718,\"endTime\":1741725725},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"use these AI tools to get the results that can help us move forward in in our work? \",\"startTime\":1741725725,\"endTime\":1741725732},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Hmm, Yeah, yeah, it definitely makes me think about communication and learning how to like articulate and your thoughts and ask the right questions, you know? \",\"startTime\":1741725731,\"endTime\":1741725741},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So then if you''re practicing that with a chat bot or AI and stuff, then you comes out in human interactions as well. \",\"startTime\":1741725741,\"endTime\":1741725751},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Umm, but for AI and education, it makes me think about equity. And I''ve always \",\"startTime\":1741725751,\"endTime\":1741725756},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"taught in title one schools. And so it''s you don''t need as many resources, right? \",\"startTime\":1741725756,\"endTime\":1741725761},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725758,\"endTime\":1741725758},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Like in that cost money. And I think like any barriers to access to curriculum \",\"startTime\":1741725761,\"endTime\":1741725766},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"or knowledge, the kids like don''t have those barriers anymore because they can just chat with ChatGPT or whatever. And so it just opens up a whole new world \",\"startTime\":1741725766,\"endTime\":1741725775},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"of information. \",\"startTime\":1741725775,\"endTime\":1741725780},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it.\",\"startTime\":1741725782,\"endTime\":1741725783},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725783,\"endTime\":1741725783},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But it really helps, helps with those equity issues. It provided that they have \",\"startTime\":1741725784,\"endTime\":1741725787},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Internet and a device that can get on and they have access to one of those AI tools. Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1741725787,\"endTime\":1741725794},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I just the free version, you know, and stuff. And I, it''s so funny ''cause \",\"startTime\":1741725793,\"endTime\":1741725797},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"when I started it, kids didn''t have access to Internet, computers, home or whatever. \",\"startTime\":1741725797,\"endTime\":1741725801},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And now it''s ''cause I''ve been Title 1 urban or suburban setting. So it rules \",\"startTime\":1741725801,\"endTime\":1741725804},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"different. But it''s like most kids have a cell phone at home with Internet and \",\"startTime\":1741725804,\"endTime\":1741725808},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"stuff. \",\"startTime\":1741725808,\"endTime\":1741725812},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725813,\"endTime\":1741725814},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then by middle school, they''re having more access to it. Yeah, that''s for \",\"startTime\":1741725814,\"endTime\":1741725818},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Good, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725817,\"endTime\":1741725820},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"sure. Anything else about the role of learners in the future? \",\"startTime\":1741725818,\"endTime\":1741725822},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I think that they will be taking ownership of being the holders of the knowledge instead of relying so much on the teacher to tell them. \",\"startTime\":1741725826,\"endTime\":1741725834},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Because they that it''s one question away to access the knowledge versus I don''t know how to do this and I need my teacher to teach me. \",\"startTime\":1741725836,\"endTime\":1741725843},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So they''ll take more ownership of their learning, I think.\",\"startTime\":1741725843,\"endTime\":1741725846},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hmm nice nice. Tell me more umm about ownership of that knowledge and learning. \",\"startTime\":1741725847,\"endTime\":1741725852},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m curious what you mean by that ''cause I think I''m getting it in the aspect of they''re not just turning to the teacher for the answer or the teacher to how to do it, but what what makes them the owner and not the GPT the owner. \",\"startTime\":1741725852,\"endTime\":1741725865},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725856,\"endTime\":1741725857},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725862,\"endTime\":1741725862},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so I think that there''s a line kinda to go, ''cause I see kids where it''s just like, give me the answer and then they write down what the answer is. But \",\"startTime\":1741725865,\"endTime\":1741725873},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"I think that it naturally is kind of sparking curiosity because they''ll have that extra time of like, what do I do in class now? And so it may not always \",\"startTime\":1741725873,\"endTime\":1741725881},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"be the learning objective that they''re, you know, getting the knowledge for from that, but I''ve seen a lot of kids just play with it and like, oh, look, it makes diagrams. Oh, look at this. And they''ve kind of. \",\"startTime\":1741725881,\"endTime\":1741725894},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Create. It''s almost like Montessori vibes, right? Where they like go down their \",\"startTime\":1741725895,\"endTime\":1741725897},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"own path that they''re interested in. \",\"startTime\":1741725897,\"endTime\":1741725900},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Got it. Got it. So they''re directing their their experience more than they would \",\"startTime\":1741725902,\"endTime\":1741725905},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"they would otherwise. So that makes them the owners of their knowledge and their \",\"startTime\":1741725905,\"endTime\":1741725908},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"experience, is that what you''re saying? \",\"startTime\":1741725908,\"endTime\":1741725911},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And yeah. And autonomy makes them like buy in more.\",\"startTime\":1741725909,\"endTime\":1741725914},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, I like it. I like it. Yeah. There''s something magical about being behind \",\"startTime\":1741725916,\"endTime\":1741725919},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"the driver''s wheel. \",\"startTime\":1741725919,\"endTime\":1741725921},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yes, definitely.\",\"startTime\":1741725921,\"endTime\":1741725923},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725924,\"endTime\":1741725925},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, I like it, Yeah. So I think that role of being a learner is it will.\",\"startTime\":1741725925,\"endTime\":1741725930},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Require increased autonomy.\",\"startTime\":1741725932,\"endTime\":1741725934},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"As as you''re saying and ownership that we will be the ones making the decisions driving the the the ship or the boat behind the wheel. And we are the ones who \",\"startTime\":1741725935,\"endTime\":1741725943},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"as learners get to move it left and right, up and down, more gas, more brakes, more steering, whatever it would be that we would be at the controls. Yeah, \",\"startTime\":1741725943,\"endTime\":1741725951},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I think so too. \",\"startTime\":1741725951,\"endTime\":1741725955},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, I like that metaphor.\",\"startTime\":1741725955,\"endTime\":1741725958},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh thanks, I''ve been playing with it for a bit here in my brain.\",\"startTime\":1741725958,\"endTime\":1741725962},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725961,\"endTime\":1741725961},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK oh that''s interesting. I didn''t know that before if I tapped.\",\"startTime\":1741725963,\"endTime\":1741725966},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I made the box go down the dialogue box somehow.\",\"startTime\":1741725968,\"endTime\":1741725970},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Oh, oh, OK, yes, I was going to ask that if there was a feature because it''s cover, it was covering half your face. But now I just tap the screen, OK. \",\"startTime\":1741725971,\"endTime\":1741725980},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s it. Just tap the screen. I tap there. Thank you. I didn''t know that. \",\"startTime\":1741725980,\"endTime\":1741725985},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Read the chapter.\",\"startTime\":1741725981,\"endTime\":1741725982},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I should have shared that with the OR I should have. I should have shared something \",\"startTime\":1741725985,\"endTime\":1741725989},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"No, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741725986,\"endTime\":1741725988},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I didn''t know. Thanks, Haley. No, I know know something I wish past Jeff could \",\"startTime\":1741725989,\"endTime\":1741725993},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"have shared with I was I was chatting with somebody, Lori, and she had that same thing ''cause I, I hold it too close to my face. \",\"startTime\":1741725993,\"endTime\":1741726001},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, it''s OK. I have it up against a water bottle.\",\"startTime\":1741726002,\"endTime\":1741726006},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s a good idea.\",\"startTime\":1741726006,\"endTime\":1741726007},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Let''s.\",\"startTime\":1741726007,\"endTime\":1741726007},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, that''s better. OK, I press next. So I''m waiting for partner.\",\"startTime\":1741726010,\"endTime\":1741726015},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"So OK, thank your partner and share one thing you learned from them today.\",\"startTime\":1741726016,\"endTime\":1741726021},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Thank you for meeting with me. I think I''ve just, I mean, every time I interact \",\"startTime\":1741726023,\"endTime\":1741726027},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"with you, I''m learning the value of like social interactions again and again and again because it''s not my default. \",\"startTime\":1741726027,\"endTime\":1741726035},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"To be.\",\"startTime\":1741726037,\"endTime\":1741726038},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Pulled towards, I''d rather just like be in my classroom by myself kind of thing. \",\"startTime\":1741726039,\"endTime\":1741726042},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And there''s always so much value in it. So just getting out of your comfort \",\"startTime\":1741726042,\"endTime\":1741726045},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"zone and talking to people. \",\"startTime\":1741726045,\"endTime\":1741726048},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, thanks. I really appreciate that.\",\"startTime\":1741726050,\"endTime\":1741726052},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And thank you, Haley, for time together. And I learned that it''s really efficient \",\"startTime\":1741726052,\"endTime\":1741726057},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to do things like asking for scaffolding. \",\"startTime\":1741726057,\"endTime\":1741726061},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"For your students and then even if it''s not working, you got a printer right there and you could just go like thinking about right now and how to do it and also. \",\"startTime\":1741726062,\"endTime\":1741726070},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741726066,\"endTime\":1741726067},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"The Somatics.\",\"startTime\":1741726073,\"endTime\":1741726074},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Or that what you''re talking about for poetry?\",\"startTime\":1741726075,\"endTime\":1741726077},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then helping to just process it with our emotions in that somatic, like what''s in our body, what''s going on here and thinking about that and how to express I''m just like you helped pique my interest into that. \",\"startTime\":1741726078,\"endTime\":1741726089},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So I would say fully learned it, but you''ve, you''ve helped me open my eyes to that, that notion of I guess I''ve learned that there''s something very embody about not just our emotions, which are in our head, but the whole body aspect and how we can express it through poetry and how healthy that can be. So thank \",\"startTime\":1741726089,\"endTime\":1741726105},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1741726090,\"endTime\":1741726090},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you for that. \",\"startTime\":1741726105,\"endTime\":1741726109},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, awesome. Yeah, No, I''m, I''ve always appreciate our talks together.\",\"startTime\":1741726110,\"endTime\":1741726114},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, you''re welcome. You''re welcome. I love him too. Thank you so much. After \",\"startTime\":1741726114,\"endTime\":1741726118},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"this, when you, by the way, when you press end, it''s end. And then you can do \",\"startTime\":1741726118,\"endTime\":1741726121},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a you can do a little message to me if you want to at the end. But I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1741726121,\"endTime\":1741726125},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"work. I''ll take our transcript. I get to see the video and transcript and I''ll \",\"startTime\":1741726125,\"endTime\":1741726129},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741726127,\"endTime\":1741726127},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"put some artifacts for you into your dashboard at side by. So go to go to your \",\"startTime\":1741726129,\"endTime\":1741726132},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"my side by and then I''ll match you up because we''ve been matched. I''ll match \",\"startTime\":1741726132,\"endTime\":1741726136},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you with somebody else and you guys can figure out a time to connect for your next one. \",\"startTime\":1741726136,\"endTime\":1741726143},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You wanted to have more social time and there''s so many amazing other people out there and I''m thinking of some other cool people who are specialists in in MTSS and the work that they do there and that might be super fun. \",\"startTime\":1741726144,\"endTime\":1741726156},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Or just other geeky math teachers. I have a couple in mind. You would love them \",\"startTime\":1741726156,\"endTime\":1741726159},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741726157,\"endTime\":1741726158},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and they would love you. \",\"startTime\":1741726159,\"endTime\":1741726161},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s awesome. Oh my gosh. I''m so thankful. Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1741726162,\"endTime\":1741726165},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You''re welcome. Thank you, Haley. Have a wonderful, wonderful day. Appreciate \",\"startTime\":1741726165,\"endTime\":1741726167},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you. \",\"startTime\":1741726167,\"endTime\":1741726170}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.471301+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.471301+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1121, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.437Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
