896\",\"text\":\"If only.\",\"startTime\":1740769680,\"endTime\":1740769681},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"All right, partner ready. Oh, that''s pretty cool.\",\"startTime\":1740769682,\"endTime\":1740769684},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Share What announce AI innovation did you find exciting?\",\"startTime\":1740769684,\"endTime\":1740769689},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1740769684,\"endTime\":1740769685},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"So I would say mine would be notebook.\",\"startTime\":1740769693,\"endTime\":1740769695},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1740769697,\"endTime\":1740769698},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"We''ve been doing that a lot. We, we, we''ve been showing some teachers how to, \",\"startTime\":1740769698,\"endTime\":1740769702},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"you know, how to use it ''cause it''s great for, you know, how to, you know. \",\"startTime\":1740769702,\"endTime\":1740769706},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1740769704,\"endTime\":1740769704},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Prep Lesson plan.\",\"startTime\":1740769707,\"endTime\":1740769708},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"So oh notebook LM, you tell it what sources you''re using and that''s all it takes from. So there you go. Perfect. \",\"startTime\":1740769714,\"endTime\":1740769720},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1740769720,\"endTime\":1740769720},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we, so my team and I, we went to a statewide AI summit and we''re like, Oh my gosh, notebook LM this is amazing. We went to go log into it using our \",\"startTime\":1740769722,\"endTime\":1740769730},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"work accounts and we were blocked. \",\"startTime\":1740769730,\"endTime\":1740769734},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1740769734,\"endTime\":1740769735},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"So we made the IT department a 