ou can \",\"startTime\":1740770007,\"endTime\":1740770011},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"make like, you know, images I''ve been trying to make like coloring pages based upon like, you know, historic events and whatnot. \",\"startTime\":1740770011,\"endTime\":1740770020},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770018,\"endTime\":1740770019},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I think that''s what it''s called. Let me know if you get there if that''s that''s. \",\"startTime\":1740770021,\"endTime\":1740770025},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Nice. Yeah, I see it.\",\"startTime\":1740770025,\"endTime\":1740770026},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"OK, perfect. OK. Yeah. So, yeah, So I mean, yeah, I don''t know if you ever dabble \",\"startTime\":1740770026,\"endTime\":1740770029},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"in like coloring pages or maybe you like the color or if you have kids or anything of that nature. \",\"startTime\":1740770029,\"endTime\":1740770035},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Umm.\",\"startTime\":1740770035,\"endTime\":1740770035},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well-being in an elementary school, we do a lot of colouring.\",\"startTime\":1740770036,\"endTime\":1740770040},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Right. You can do a lot of like, you know, just like robots sitting at a computer \",\"startTime\":1740770040,\"endTime\":1740770044},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"or something like that, or, you know, speak more towards the curriculum maybe. \",\"startTime\":1740770044,\"endTime\":1740770049},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well, and for especially for like social emotional groups, that would be an amazing tool. \",\"startTime\":1740770050,\"endTime\":1740770055},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and I I kind of like app smashed and I asked chatty, but he said give me a good prompt. If I want to generate a coloring book page, what should the \",\"startTime\":1740770053,\"endTime\":1740770062},{\