atever you want it to say. It can also translate what you want it to say into multiple \",\"startTime\":1740770114,\"endTime\":1740770122},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1740770120,\"endTime\":1740770120},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"languages and dialects. \",\"startTime\":1740770122,\"endTime\":1740770126},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"And you can. There are also preset avatars.\",\"startTime\":1740770128,\"endTime\":1740770133},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"That you can use that are fully moving.\",\"startTime\":1740770133,\"endTime\":1740770137},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"And they have a bunch of different.\",\"startTime\":1740770138,\"endTime\":1740770140},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Like options for poses and locations and all sorts of things in a bunch of different voices, Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1740770142,\"endTime\":1740770147},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Huh, That''s pretty cool. That sounds awesome. I''m I''m wondering if if our county \",\"startTime\":1740770145,\"endTime\":1740770150},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"It''s very cool.\",\"startTime\":1740770148,\"endTime\":1740770149},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"has it blocked, but I''ll look look at it on my personal account so that way we can definitely see it. So hey Jen, OK. \",\"startTime\":1740770150,\"endTime\":1740770160},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Ah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770158,\"endTime\":1740770158},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"And it''s HEGHEYGEN.\",\"startTime\":1740770162,\"endTime\":1740770165},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Right, right. OK, like generative kind of.\",\"startTime\":1740770166,\"endTime\":1740770169},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770167,\"endTime\":1740770167},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770170,\"endTime\":1740770170},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"That makes sense.\",\"startTime\":1740770171,\"endTime\":1740770172},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I learned hey, Jen, and I''m looking forward to trying that out. That sounds \",\"startTime\":1740770177,\"endTime\":1740770180},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"like a really cool thing. \",\"startTime\":1740770180,\"endTime\":1740770183},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and I learned about Colorify and I''m actually really excited to use that, make some coloring pages for my kids. \",\"startTime\":1740770183,\"endTime\":1740770189},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770187,\"endTime\":1740770188},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Yeah, for sure. Yeah. I mean, even like, you know, I''m sure you can make other \",\"startTime\":1740770190,\"endTime\":1740770193},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"kind of things, but that''s what I''ve been using. \",\"startTime\":1740770193,\"endTime\":1740770195},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I would I would dot or something like that. It''d be cool to have her cover, \",\"startTime\":1740770197,\"endTime\":1740770200},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"you know, certain things that are, you know, things that she''s seen on TV or things that were like, you know. \",\"startTime\":1740770200,\"endTime\":1740770206},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770206,\"endTime\":1740770207},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Trying to trying to like learn about SO.\",\"startTime\":1740770207,\"endTime\":1740770210},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Absolutely. I love that.\",\"startTime\":1740770211,\"endTime\":1740770212},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770212,\"endTime\":1740770213},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Well, it was great connecting with you, Allison. It was nice to meet you. So \",\"startTime\":1740770214,\"endTime\":1740770216},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"you. \",\"startTime\":1740770216,\"endTime\":1740770218},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"You as well, Michael.\",\"startTime\":1740770217,\"endTime\":1740770218},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Here in Washington state, you said.\",\"startTime\":1740770218,\"endTime\":1740770220},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yes, Yep. And you''re in North Carolina. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770220,\"endTime\":1740770222},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"OK. North Carolina. Yes, So it is near the end of the working day for me, not \",\"startTime\":1740770222,\"endTime\":1740770226},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Nice, nice.\",\"startTime\":1740770225,\"endTime\":1740770226},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"quite, but it''s it''s getting there. \",\"startTime\":1740770226,\"endTime\":1740770229},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Nice, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770228,\"endTime\":1740770229},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"I''m about to go get lunch so.\",\"startTime\":1740770231,\"endTime\":1740770233},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, there we go. There we go. Awesome. Well.\",\"startTime\":1740770233,\"endTime\":1740770237},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740770236,\"endTime\":1740770236},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I don''t. I don''t know how this app works, if we''ll get connected again or or. \",\"startTime\":1740770237,\"endTime\":1740770239},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"OK, cool. \",\"startTime\":1740770239,\"endTime\":1740770242},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"I think we might.\",\"startTime\":1740770240,\"endTime\":1740770241},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah. All right. Well, it was great meeting you.\",\"startTime\":1740770244,\"endTime\":1740770247},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"All right, Well, yeah, you as well. And we''ll talk to you soon maybe.\",\"startTime\":1740770246,\"endTime\":1740770250},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Absolutely. All right, bye.\",\"startTime\":1740770250,\"endTime\":1740770252},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"All right, bye, bye.\",\"startTime\":1740770252,\"endTime\":1740770253}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.896978+00', '2025-