	('f45f132f-ab6b-4007-a246-e11270544423', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '138203', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Hi, Michelle, How are you?\",\"startTime\":1745254929,\"endTime\":1745254930},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Hi, Jess.\",\"startTime\":1745254930,\"endTime\":1745254931},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m good. How are you doing?\",\"startTime\":1745254931,\"endTime\":1745254932},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Good, good, it''s another sunny day. We just moved to Tucson a couple weeks ago \",\"startTime\":1745254932,\"endTime\":1745254937},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and it''s sunny almost every day so far, so we''re loving it. \",\"startTime\":1745254937,\"endTime\":1745254941},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, nice. Yeah, we''re you can see a tiny bit of Spain out there. That''s Spain. \",\"startTime\":1745254942,\"endTime\":1745254948},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745254943,\"endTime\":1745254943},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Not much of it, not much of you.\",\"startTime\":1745254949,\"endTime\":1745254950},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, where in Spain are you?\",\"startTime\":1745254949,\"endTime\":1745254951},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"We''re in a town called Almonica, which is on the southern coast. If you were \",\"startTime\":1745254951,\"endTime\":1745254954},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to find Grenada on the map and just go straight down from there, pretty much directly down on the coast. \",\"startTime\":1745254954,\"endTime\":1745254961},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Ah, I love it.\",\"startTime\":1745254961,\"endTime\":1745254962},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I wasn''t knowing if you were in Spain or not when you said mid Europe. And I''m \",\"startTime\":1745254962,\"endTime\":1745254967},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"like, oh, I''m wondering where my wife and I and we love the area over there. \",\"startTime\":1745254967,\"endTime\":1745254972},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I was wanting us to go to Spain maybe even for a year. I was, I was pitching \",\"startTime\":1745254972,\"endTime\":1745254976},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"for Valencia pretty hard, but we we ended up landing in Tucson, so. \",\"startTime\":1745254976,\"endTime\":1745254981},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745254982,\"endTime\":1745254983},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but we''ll get to Valencia soon.\",\"startTime\":1745254984,\"endTime\":1745254986},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Probably, yes, yeah, we our plan was to come for one year and now we''re finishing our second year and Terry tearing ourselves away to the to go back to the US but at the end of the school year. But it''s been a really great adventure. We \",\"startTime\":1745254986,\"endTime\":1745254998},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Oh.\",\"startTime\":1745254996,\"endTime\":1745254998},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"have two children and that was a big part of the impetus was to get them here to learn Spanish. So they''re going to school just at the regular public school \",\"startTime\":1745254998,\"endTime\":1745255007},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"here and watching their magic that happens when when a brain, a young brain especially, is immersed in another language so and another. \",\"startTime\":1745255007,\"endTime\":1745255015},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Sure. Like they''re getting just priceless experience. So it''s been amazing.\",\"startTime\":1745255017,\"endTime\":1745255020},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. That''s awesome. Oh, wonderful. OK, I''m pressing them more because \",\"startTime\":1745255020,\"endTime\":1745255024},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255023,\"endTime\":1745255023},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it says greet your partner and then press more. \",\"startTime\":1745255024,\"endTime\":1745255028},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What''s the skill besides AI fluency that you''re working to improve?\",\"startTime\":1745255031,\"endTime\":1745255036},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"The first one that comes to mind is always. I am trying to work on kind of two \",\"startTime\":1745255036,\"endTime\":1745255041},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"big things for me. One is like just efficiency I can get so. \",\"startTime\":1745255041,\"endTime\":1745255046},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Bogged down in the details of and I''m, I''m thinking kind of specifically of like curriculum planning work or you know, I can get so bogged down in the details of that, but. \",\"startTime\":1745255050,\"endTime\":1745255059},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It causes me more stress than is necessary and I''ve been, I think because I I transitioned from just classroom teaching to a lot of coaching work in the last few years. \",\"startTime\":1745255060,\"endTime\":1745255068},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And when I would see other teachers with habits similar to mine and I would try to encourage them like you got to find your good enough point and give yourself permission to move on. And I was like, oh this is really good advice I should \",\"startTime\":1745255068,\"endTime\":1745255077},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"take as well so. \",\"startTime\":1745255077,\"endTime\":1745255080},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah. I think that''s the biggest one that I feel like I''ve made growth in, but \",\"startTime\":1745255080,\"endTime\":1745255083},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m just I''m always working on and. \",\"startTime\":1745255083,\"endTime\":1745255085},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I also think it ties into the AI tools that are now becoming available because. \",\"startTime\":1745255086,\"endTime\":1745255092},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I don''t have to get so hung up on every single word I''m trying to write.\",\"startTime\":1745255092,\"endTime\":1745255096},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I can give myself permission to get my ideas out and then use the tool that''s available, like, hey, Polish this for me, and then I can go back and revise that a bit. Yeah. How about you? \",\"startTime\":1745255096,\"endTime\":1745255106},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That oh, that resonated really hard and so many a good heart in so many ways. \",\"startTime\":1745255108,\"endTime\":1745255113},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm, for me, it''s about trying to focus. That''s a skill for because there''s \",\"startTime\":1745255113,\"endTime\":1745255118},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"so many possibilities. Like you said with the details. I see it as like an example \",\"startTime\":1745255118,\"endTime\":1745255122},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"of curriculum. If I''m chatting with an AI bot or just in general with my work, \",\"startTime\":1745255122,\"endTime\":1745255126},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I''m thinking about there''s infinite possibilities. Now, what we could do this \",\"startTime\":1745255126,\"endTime\":1745255130},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"way, we could do it this way, we could do it this way. And I see them as. \",\"startTime\":1745255130,\"endTime\":1745255135},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Things to go and to do. And. And I like how you were saying it. It''s like it''s \",\"startTime\":1745255136,\"endTime\":1745255140},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"good enough. Like you don''t have to explore all of the ends of the universe, \",\"startTime\":1745255140,\"endTime\":1745255144},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Jeff, to just pick up half to go play and to go do something. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745255144,\"endTime\":1745255148},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah. It''s, there''s some balance there between like we, we want \",\"startTime\":1745255149,\"endTime\":1745255153},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to continuously improve and that goes for our curriculum work as well. But at \",\"startTime\":1745255153,\"endTime\":1745255157},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"some point like because there we are fortunate and also not to work in this field where like there are many pathways to to a positive end and many you''re never really going to get like the right answer, but you could always. So it \",\"startTime\":1745255157,\"endTime\":1745255170},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"was really hard for me not to every year like I want to revisit things, but I also. \",\"startTime\":1745255170,\"endTime\":1745255178},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Know that at some point I need to say like, that worked last year, that''ll probably work again, and it''s OK to give myself permission to to instead like. \",\"startTime\":1745255179,\"endTime\":1745255186},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"No, What''s that like? Oh, that''s fun. So Michelle, you''re right now you said \",\"startTime\":1745255184,\"endTime\":1745255188},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Spend time with my spouse instead or something instead of.\",\"startTime\":1745255187,\"endTime\":1745255191},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"you''re not in the classroom, but you''re doing lots of coaching. Is that tell \",\"startTime\":1745255188,\"endTime\":1745255191},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"me more about that. I''m curious about your role. \",\"startTime\":1745255191,\"endTime\":1745255195},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255192,\"endTime\":1745255193},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well, yeah, this this year is is unusual because of my current geographic location. So right now I''m. \",\"startTime\":1745255200,\"endTime\":1745255210},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m doing when I when I left the school that I that I do still currently work with. When I left campus and and started working remotely. At that time I was \",\"startTime\":1745255211,\"endTime\":1745255219},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"working as an instructional coach. \",\"startTime\":1745255219,\"endTime\":1745255223},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And teaching just one.\",\"startTime\":1745255223,\"endTime\":1745255225},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I would teach one course, like an elective course every year just to kind of stay in the classroom and help support that work that was needed the team. \",\"startTime\":1745255226,\"endTime\":1745255234},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And was also just doing leadership work to support the school''s director and teachers in general. And so when I transitioned to what I thought was going \",\"startTime\":1745255234,\"endTime\":1745255243},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to be one year living in Spain, I continued to do. \",\"startTime\":1745255243,\"endTime\":1745255247},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"The coaching work from afar for for some people who needed a bit of that, but but mostly I was coaching the person who took over my position in my absence. \",\"startTime\":1745255249,\"endTime\":1745255258},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And then I''m writing a lot of our advisory curriculum, doing some, making some improvements to that. \",\"startTime\":1745255259,\"endTime\":1745255265},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745255264,\"endTime\":1745255264},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And then this year that pair that work paired down even or when I wrote our WASC report, I got to do much of the crafting of that is that, do you know what I mean when I say a wasp report? \",\"startTime\":1745255266,\"endTime\":1745255276},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What''s No I don''t.\",\"startTime\":1745255276,\"endTime\":1745255278},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"A big.\",\"startTime\":1745255277,\"endTime\":1745255278},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It''s an accreditation document that schools have to engage with in California periodically and in other places I think as well. But anyway, it''s a big lift. \",\"startTime\":1745255280,\"endTime\":1745255287},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Got it, Got it.\",\"startTime\":1745255282,\"endTime\":1745255283},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And so I did some of that work. So I was really doing doing very different. \",\"startTime\":1745255287,\"endTime\":1745255290},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Remote work that was important to the school that disconnected from certainly from connecting directly with students and then even less so with with the adults on campus over time. So this and then in over the past six months or so as I \",\"startTime\":1745255291,\"endTime\":1745255303},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"was trying to kind of look for a little more work to tide me over until I returned to California in the fall. \",\"startTime\":1745255303,\"endTime\":1745255311},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Or the summer, rather. I I started looking for some curriculum development work \",\"startTime\":1745255313,\"endTime\":1745255317},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to supplement the income, and so I''ve been doing that. Right now the big project \",\"startTime\":1745255317,\"endTime\":1745255320},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m doing is writing. \",\"startTime\":1745255320,\"endTime\":1745255324},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Entire year long courses in biology, chemistry and physics for a school that''s like an online Independent School that''s starting up this fall. So that is feeling \",\"startTime\":1745255325,\"endTime\":1745255335},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"like a big lift or I''m thinking about it. It''s great. Like it''s very interesting \",\"startTime\":1745255335,\"endTime\":1745255340},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"work, but it''s a lot too. And it''s where I''m really appreciating and wanting \",\"startTime\":1745255340,\"endTime\":1745255345},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to know more about all of the tools that are available to help make that. \",\"startTime\":1745255345,\"endTime\":1745255350},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"A task I can accomplish in the time that I have available.\",\"startTime\":1745255352,\"endTime\":1745255355},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Wow, I am.\",\"startTime\":1745255356,\"endTime\":1745255358},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I admire the work that you''re doing right now. That seems so intense.\",\"startTime\":1745255358,\"endTime\":1745255362},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Thanks. Yeah, it''s a lot. It is.\",\"startTime\":1745255363,\"endTime\":1745255367},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm, yeah, yeah. Uh, I wanna get back to our conversation here, but I would \",\"startTime\":1745255363,\"endTime\":1745255366},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"totally wanna chat more about all of the online learning and, and the writing of curriculum. I totally geek out. I am such a curriculum geek. Like at the \",\"startTime\":1745255366,\"endTime\":1745255373},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"heart, like I realized that forever ago and I''m always still doing curriculum and curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1745255373,\"endTime\":1745255379},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But later I did notice this, that on the app, if you if you don''t want the words there, you can touch away from the words. I could just touch on the picture \",\"startTime\":1745255381,\"endTime\":1745255387},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"MMM. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745255382,\"endTime\":1745255382},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"on the person. \",\"startTime\":1745255387,\"endTime\":1745255390},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And then it will go away and then tap it again, it''ll come back. I just figured \",\"startTime\":1745255390,\"endTime\":1745255392},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Wondered. Ah, you have a chin. OK, yay.\",\"startTime\":1745255390,\"endTime\":1745255396},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that out. \",\"startTime\":1745255392,\"endTime\":1745255394},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I do have a chin. Oh, and I even see in the app I can tell you where it''s gonna \",\"startTime\":1745255394,\"endTime\":1745255397},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"like know my eyes. Looks like you have your phone propped up somewhere and I \",\"startTime\":1745255397,\"endTime\":1745255401},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"don''t. I''m just trying to hold it out. \",\"startTime\":1745255401,\"endTime\":1745255404},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I do.\",\"startTime\":1745255406,\"endTime\":1745255406},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK. I''m going to press. I''m going to press next.\",\"startTime\":1745255406,\"endTime\":1745255408},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It''s I haven''t some of this crown molding fell off of my daughter''s bedroom ceiling. Oh, that''s unfortunate. I chose the the crusty corner. So that''s why \",\"startTime\":1745255407,\"endTime\":1745255415},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m trying this. But you know what? \",\"startTime\":1745255415,\"endTime\":1745255418},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, wouldn''t even notice. Yeah, not today. What was you saying earlier? Just \",\"startTime\":1745255417,\"endTime\":1745255422},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Let''s just leave it, yeah?\",\"startTime\":1745255420,\"endTime\":1745255421},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it''s good enough. It''s good enough. Doesn''t have to be perfect. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745255422,\"endTime\":1745255427},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, exactly. Good enough. You''re right.\",\"startTime\":1745255425,\"endTime\":1745255427},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"True. Yeah. What''s Jeff, can I ask you really quickly, what''s your area of specialty \",\"startTime\":1745255428,\"endTime\":1745255430},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"All right, OK, I''m gonna press.\",\"startTime\":1745255428,\"endTime\":1745255430},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"in education? \",\"startTime\":1745255430,\"endTime\":1745255433},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It was mathematics and curriculum. So for example, in 2005 I was on the lead \",\"startTime\":1745255435,\"endTime\":1745255439},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK, OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255436,\"endTime\":1745255437},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"in our district to put our first online math. \",\"startTime\":1745255439,\"endTime\":1745255443},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Course together and so as you were saying that like writing a full year courses, I''m like, oh, I know that joy and then I''m thinking. \",\"startTime\":1745255444,\"endTime\":1745255452},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255451,\"endTime\":1745255452},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, but now they have and you have AI tools, so.\",\"startTime\":1745255452,\"endTime\":1745255455},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"How much cooler and more wonderful is it? And we know so much more 20 years \",\"startTime\":1745255456,\"endTime\":1745255460},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"later. Yeah, we do. But math and then high school math. I did a 17 year stint \",\"startTime\":1745255460,\"endTime\":1745255464},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255462,\"endTime\":1745255463},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"at Ferris High School up in the Pacific Northwest, Spokane, WA home with a Gonzaga Bulldogs and. \",\"startTime\":1745255464,\"endTime\":1745255472},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Hmm. Uh-huh. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255472,\"endTime\":1745255475},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s where we just moved from and my focus has been curriculum and then professional learning, including professional learning curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1745255474,\"endTime\":1745255482},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255482,\"endTime\":1745255482},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So not only.\",\"startTime\":1745255482,\"endTime\":1745255483},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Facilitating professional learning, So moving from the classroom working with students to working with teachers a lot. I did instructional coaching that you''re \",\"startTime\":1745255484,\"endTime\":1745255491},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"mentioning you''re doing and I was doing that in the in the district and then online and then remotely and then doing a lot more work supporting curricular material sets. \",\"startTime\":1745255491,\"endTime\":1745255501},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Analyzing them, giving feedback consultant work for that and then some really fun state national projects and then. \",\"startTime\":1745255502,\"endTime\":1745255509},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And then my journey ended up being back around to professional learning. How \",\"startTime\":1745255510,\"endTime\":1745255512},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"do you do professional learning and how do you develop professional learning curriculum and how how do you give? \",\"startTime\":1745255512,\"endTime\":1745255517},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Good quality feedback for that. Like even this, like the questions on here. \",\"startTime\":1745255517,\"endTime\":1745255521},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s my my current work is how do you give questions knowing you get 5 cards to give to people you don''t get to facilitate other than giving them the tool and then letting them go? Oh, that''s a different weird feel about curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1745255521,\"endTime\":1745255533},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255523,\"endTime\":1745255525},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Oh.\",\"startTime\":1745255534,\"endTime\":1745255535},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but how exciting, like to get to do something. Yeah, apply that skill \",\"startTime\":1745255535,\"endTime\":1745255539},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255538,\"endTime\":1745255540},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"set in such a different way. Nice. OK, so then I, I, I, I went over your question, \",\"startTime\":1745255539,\"endTime\":1745255542},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, it totally is.\",\"startTime\":1745255541,\"endTime\":1745255542},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"you know, or your turn answering the question in order to ask that one. So yeah, \",\"startTime\":1745255542,\"endTime\":1745255546},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"go back to that. \",\"startTime\":1745255546,\"endTime\":1745255549},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I don''t care.\",\"startTime\":1745255548,\"endTime\":1745255549},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So what''s a skill that you''re working to improve? I guess, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255551,\"endTime\":1745255554},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m going to press.\",\"startTime\":1745255551,\"endTime\":1745255553},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That was focused. I''m trying to focus, Yeah. I''m trying to focus and let go \",\"startTime\":1745255555,\"endTime\":1745255557},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255557,\"endTime\":1745255558},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"of all of those details, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745255557,\"endTime\":1745255560},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"What a funny thing for me to not remember you said.\",\"startTime\":1745255560,\"endTime\":1745255563},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, it''s funny, ''cause I wouldn''t remember otherwise. Had a good flashback. \",\"startTime\":1745255564,\"endTime\":1745255567},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Whoopsie.\",\"startTime\":1745255565,\"endTime\":1745255566},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m gonna press next. \",\"startTime\":1745255567,\"endTime\":1745255570},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK, OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255569,\"endTime\":1745255569},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"On the bottom and then I think yours will Oh you beat me to it because right right before I pressed next it said waiting for partner. OK mine says ask Michelle. \",\"startTime\":1745255570,\"endTime\":1745255579},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Got it.\",\"startTime\":1745255574,\"endTime\":1745255575},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255579,\"endTime\":1745255580},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So I''m gonna ask you, how has AI changed your work?\",\"startTime\":1745255581,\"endTime\":1745255584},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Wait, where?\",\"startTime\":1745255583,\"endTime\":1745255584},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Then ask Jeff to add to your answer. OK, I didn''t see that part at the bottom \",\"startTime\":1745255585,\"endTime\":1745255587},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"first so. \",\"startTime\":1745255587,\"endTime\":1745255589},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah. How is the I changed your work as an educator or leader of educators \",\"startTime\":1745255589,\"endTime\":1745255592},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"so far? \",\"startTime\":1745255592,\"endTime\":1745255595},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It''s interesting. I feel like so much of it, when it sort of first emerged, \",\"startTime\":1745255596,\"endTime\":1745255600},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"at least in a kind of the everyday conversation for educators a few years ago, it was really like, what are we going to do with this tool that kids are going to use to cheat with? \",\"startTime\":1745255600,\"endTime\":1745255611},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And that was so much of the conversation.\",\"startTime\":1745255612,\"endTime\":1745255615},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And now not that that conversation is I expect over and I just haven''t been working with teachers in that same capacity for the last couple of years. And \",\"startTime\":1745255618,\"endTime\":1745255626},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"so I''m I''m curious to know. \",\"startTime\":1745255626,\"endTime\":1745255630},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Like for our English teachers, for example, like what are they thinking about this as a tool or an enemy? Right now we''re a little bit of both. \",\"startTime\":1745255631,\"endTime\":1745255638},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Umm, and instead myself, the work that I''m focused on right now, just in the last, like very present in the last couple of weeks ''cause I really dug into this work. \",\"startTime\":1745255640,\"endTime\":1745255651},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"For example, trying to find.\",\"startTime\":1745255653,\"endTime\":1745255656},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Sample anchor text that I can use.\",\"startTime\":1745255656,\"endTime\":1745255659},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"For a particular unit or project and instead of me just.\",\"startTime\":1745255660,\"endTime\":1745255664},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Kind of doing like Internet searches blindly. I can ask ChatGPT what what it \",\"startTime\":1745255664,\"endTime\":1745255667},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"says and it proposes a bunch and some of them I can use. I''m still applying \",\"startTime\":1745255667,\"endTime\":1745255671},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"my expertise to say like, no, that one''s not quite right or that one''s off the mark or the Alexa level wouldn''t be right on that. But then there''s other things \",\"startTime\":1745255671,\"endTime\":1745255678},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"like it would point me toward I found, you know, some really excellent Open Access scientific, you know, peer reviewed journal articles. I was like, these \",\"startTime\":1745255678,\"endTime\":1745255686},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"are perfect. This is exactly what I want to use. And I don''t know if I had sifted \",\"startTime\":1745255686,\"endTime\":1745255690},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"through the countless number of those that that. \",\"startTime\":1745255690,\"endTime\":1745255693},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Available through a standard Google search like what? I found that so I think \",\"startTime\":1745255695,\"endTime\":1745255699},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"it''s changing my work in both efficiency and probably quality as well. \",\"startTime\":1745255699,\"endTime\":1745255703},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And I still for me to realize like, but I''m not cheating like. And there are \",\"startTime\":1745255704,\"endTime\":1745255708},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"ways for us to teach kids to do this without where it''s not like they''re not learning skill, but it''s one of the tools that''s available to them. \",\"startTime\":1745255708,\"endTime\":1745255716},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And how do we use it to improve our thinking, improve our ideas and improve the application of what we we did create with our human brains that are also amazing machines, you know, that can do can do a lot. So so I''m finding that \",\"startTime\":1745255718,\"endTime\":1745255732},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"every day now I am my work is being made more. \",\"startTime\":1745255732,\"endTime\":1745255737},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It may be easier, but I don''t even know that it''s easy. I''m still doing hard \",\"startTime\":1745255740,\"endTime\":1745255743},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"work, but it''s, I think the work I''m putting in on getting more out of it through the use of these tools and that, you know, benefits kids, the quality of the of the curriculum they''re going to get to access. \",\"startTime\":1745255743,\"endTime\":1745255753},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. I love how you''re saying that the the amount of work that you \",\"startTime\":1745255755,\"endTime\":1745255758},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes.\",\"startTime\":1745255758,\"endTime\":1745255760},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"put in to the effect that you get out. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1745255758,\"endTime\":1745255762},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It just seems like we have turbo boosters on our our work or like a new gear for pedalling our bike or something. They''re like, oh, I can go faster with \",\"startTime\":1745255764,\"endTime\":1745255772},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the same amount of work or I can get more done or. \",\"startTime\":1745255772,\"endTime\":1745255776},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I think especially about what you were saying for checking for references and resources, as soon as you started talking about that, I imagine. \",\"startTime\":1745255778,\"endTime\":1745255784},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"You or me or any of us as writers of content online after dark, the kids are in bed and we''re hacking away at the machine trying to find, please, what''s a good quote? What''s a good resource for this? How about a nice video? I''ll \",\"startTime\":1745255784,\"endTime\":1745255797},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"get up at 4:00 in the morning and watch all of the videos on the Internet to see if I can find one that works for my kids. That''s what we would do as teachers. \",\"startTime\":1745255797,\"endTime\":1745255806},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s what we do as authors. And today you can just. \",\"startTime\":1745255806,\"endTime\":1745255811},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Is uh, yes, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255807,\"endTime\":1745255811},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Ask a couple prompts and get a huge list of resources that you never knew was there. Yeah, it''s amazing. \",\"startTime\":1745255812,\"endTime\":1745255818},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yes, yeah, I love the I love the Usain like turbo boosters are like easier gear to pedal in cause features and kids too, because this is all about like what are kids getting out of this too? Like they need that. Like the work is \",\"startTime\":1745255820,\"endTime\":1745255832},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"the work is really hard, especially if you''re not going to just plop A textbook down in front of a kid and, you know, work through that together if you''re going to create really dynamic, meaningful, authentic curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1745255832,\"endTime\":1745255845},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"That''s just so much work and anything we can do to make that a little easier for teachers, a little more possible, a little more efficient is really important. \",\"startTime\":1745255847,\"endTime\":1745255856},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I think it''s like it''s going to keep people in the in the profession longer. \",\"startTime\":1745255856,\"endTime\":1745255861},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1745255861,\"endTime\":1745255861},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, burnout has been a real issue for us as educators, that''s for sure. And \",\"startTime\":1745255863,\"endTime\":1745255867},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I hope that we can find a good balance between using AI as a tool to support us rather than another thing on our plate to do. \",\"startTime\":1745255867,\"endTime\":1745255875},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255869,\"endTime\":1745255870},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That wears this down.\",\"startTime\":1745255877,\"endTime\":1745255878},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yes, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255879,\"endTime\":1745255881},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, this is awesome. OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255881,\"endTime\":1745255883},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Great take turns sharing with Michelle. How do you think AI will change the \",\"startTime\":1745255886,\"endTime\":1745255889},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"role of learners in the future? \",\"startTime\":1745255889,\"endTime\":1745255891},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"You already mentioned this on your last question, and I''m going to see if I can paraphrase what you''re saying. You were saying the role of learners. \",\"startTime\":1745255894,\"endTime\":1745255901},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I''m trying to think what you were saying. But they''re gonna be able to do \",\"startTime\":1745255904,\"endTime\":1745255907},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"more and get there faster because of the tools. So I''m wondering about the role \",\"startTime\":1745255907,\"endTime\":1745255911},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"of the learners, how that changes. \",\"startTime\":1745255911,\"endTime\":1745255914},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Is the rule now that they''re going to have to manage their learning more because they have more to do or they''re going to have to become more organized or more meta? I''m not sure from what you were saying. Tell me what you''re thinking on \",\"startTime\":1745255917,\"endTime\":1745255926},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I I''m, I don''t.\",\"startTime\":1745255926,\"endTime\":1745255928},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that. Like how would that change their role? \",\"startTime\":1745255926,\"endTime\":1745255929},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I think you''re gonna hear me verbally process a lot right now because, because I don''t know. This is a question that I''m really mulling over. It''s like, what \",\"startTime\":1745255934,\"endTime\":1745255939},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"is this gonna mean for learners in the future? And. \",\"startTime\":1745255939,\"endTime\":1745255942},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I think that when you''re interacting with any of the AI tools that are available, so much of it is still about knowing what the quality question to ask. So I \",\"startTime\":1745255944,\"endTime\":1745255954},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"think that''s the same thing for students learning in a classroom that don''t have access to those tools immediately. It''s like, how do you how do you know \",\"startTime\":1745255954,\"endTime\":1745255963},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"what questions to ask? And then in the more in recent years where we usually. \",\"startTime\":1745255963,\"endTime\":1745255968},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"You know, release students to like, open their computers and go like, start searching Google, ask your good question or look for the prompt, and then you''re gonna get all this information. \",\"startTime\":1745255971,\"endTime\":1745255978},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And you have to be able to sift through that and pick out what information is valid, what''s serving, what''s answering your question best. And I think kids \",\"startTime\":1745255979,\"endTime\":1745255988},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"are still going to need to do that with what we''re currently seeing with, again, with a tool like ChatGPT, you put something in, it''s going to give you something back, but you, the learner still needs to. \",\"startTime\":1745255988,\"endTime\":1745256002},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Not just copy and paste that or pick the first thing on the list, but instead think a little bit about what. \",\"startTime\":1745256006,\"endTime\":1745256011},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Possible information they could lean on.\",\"startTime\":1745256014,\"endTime\":1745256016},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Are you saying, are you saying that there will have to be even more critical consumers of information? \",\"startTime\":1745256016,\"endTime\":1745256023},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I don''t know if I''ll have.\",\"startTime\":1745256022,\"endTime\":1745256023},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"To be more, it depends on how we build our tools. Do those tools work to already \",\"startTime\":1745256023,\"endTime\":1745256027},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"get rid of a lot of the garbage that would show up otherwise? \",\"startTime\":1745256027,\"endTime\":1745256031},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Or not. Yeah, that''s those are my initial thoughts about it, but I yeah, I think \",\"startTime\":1745256033,\"endTime\":1745256037},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745256037,\"endTime\":1745256040},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I love him. Yeah, I think, I think my thoughts are really similar along those \",\"startTime\":1745256039,\"endTime\":1745256043},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"lines of the user, the role of the learner now. And I like how you called it \",\"startTime\":1745256043,\"endTime\":1745256046},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"out because you called out you''re a learner and then you''re learning how to use these tools. And it''s the same thing for the kids as they''re learning to \",\"startTime\":1745256046,\"endTime\":1745256053},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"use these tools. So I think it''s. \",\"startTime\":1745256053,\"endTime\":1745256056},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"One the role of learner is that we and I''m stealing from the math practice standards in math. I love the 8 practices the habits of mind we''re trying to grow in kids. \",\"startTime\":1745256058,\"endTime\":1745256068},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Or in everybody and I think about and this is like.\",\"startTime\":1745256069,\"endTime\":1745256072},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Pre-K like from their baby till you''re dead and one of them is use appropriate tools strategically and I think the role of the learner. \",\"startTime\":1745256072,\"endTime\":1745256080},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"At all ages for us, especially as educators and then our kids is.\",\"startTime\":1745256080,\"endTime\":1745256084},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Is to teach them to.\",\"startTime\":1745256084,\"endTime\":1745256086},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Use appropriate tools strategically, and that''s their role is that they''re users of tools. \",\"startTime\":1745256087,\"endTime\":1745256092},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But then I have to think about when is it the right tool so it''s the appropriate tool, and then how do I use it strategically? And as you''re talking about that, \",\"startTime\":1745256092,\"endTime\":1745256098},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256098,\"endTime\":1745256099},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it wasn''t just about the information I was hearing. It''s about do I ask the \",\"startTime\":1745256098,\"endTime\":1745256101},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"right question and do I get it this way? And does it get the thing that I want \",\"startTime\":1745256101,\"endTime\":1745256104},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it to get me at the end? \",\"startTime\":1745256104,\"endTime\":1745256107},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I and I kept thinking that sounds like tools.\",\"startTime\":1745256109,\"endTime\":1745256111},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So that''s one of the things I''ve been thinking about a lot, is we''re gonna be like new tool users, like how do you use the new cool tools and how do you use them to solve problems? \",\"startTime\":1745256112,\"endTime\":1745256123},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256118,\"endTime\":1745256120},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think the role is gonna be different for, for, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256123,\"endTime\":1745256126},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s it''s not the first time we''re having this conversation, right, about new tools like, and do you let kids use calculators? When do you, when the Internet \",\"startTime\":1745256125,\"endTime\":1745256133},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, no, no.\",\"startTime\":1745256131,\"endTime\":1745256134},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"came along, like how that was going to destroy, you know, kids ability to look things up in encyclopedias and like, well, maybe that''s OK, maybe this is better. \",\"startTime\":1745256133,\"endTime\":1745256140},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Don''t give them encyclopedias, they might look it up.\",\"startTime\":1745256143,\"endTime\":1745256146},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So we just have to be ready to.\",\"startTime\":1745256144,\"endTime\":1745256146},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, right.\",\"startTime\":1745256148,\"endTime\":1745256149},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"They might look ahead, they might get to the F encyclopedia and see all the kind of fish before my special F day. \",\"startTime\":1745256151,\"endTime\":1745256157},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we''re not there yet.\",\"startTime\":1745256155,\"endTime\":1745256156},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Exactly, yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256159,\"endTime\":1745256160},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it. OK, I think there''s more on the more. Yeah, lots of things we \",\"startTime\":1745256162,\"endTime\":1745256166},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"could have gone down, but I liked our conversation. But yeah, OK, I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1745256166,\"endTime\":1745256169},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"say next. \",\"startTime\":1745256169,\"endTime\":1745256173},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, read the challenges and choose 10.\",\"startTime\":1745256177,\"endTime\":1745256180},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So we choose one, but we might choose different ones like we don''t tell each other which is that what that means? \",\"startTime\":1745256182,\"endTime\":1745256186},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I like this game. Yeah, sounds good.\",\"startTime\":1745256186,\"endTime\":1745256188},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Share your story or solve a problem with practice. Oh OK, you get to go first. \",\"startTime\":1745256193,\"endTime\":1745256199},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256198,\"endTime\":1745256198},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"In your own words, what''s your sad?\",\"startTime\":1745256200,\"endTime\":1745256201},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"What''s a problem? What''s the problem with practices?\",\"startTime\":1745256204,\"endTime\":1745256206},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Well, it''s being recorded, right?\",\"startTime\":1745256213,\"endTime\":1745256215},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But we don''t ever use anything on here 1 you should you should know this is your data and it''s my data because it''s our conversation and side by we help own and protect the data. But your it''s your data to even hit delete and if \",\"startTime\":1745256216,\"endTime\":1745256230},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"anything is ever going to be used when it comes back to you on your dashboard. \",\"startTime\":1745256230,\"endTime\":1745256234},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"My snow. Uh-huh.\",\"startTime\":1745256232,\"endTime\":1745256233},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"With the robot, the museum robots to help do that and so I''ll take this and create artifacts. \",\"startTime\":1745256236,\"endTime\":1745256240},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"To put back on your dashboard. But second, we would never use anything like \",\"startTime\":1745256240,\"endTime\":1745256244},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"as soon as you get it, it''s yours to use as you please ''cause it''s yours to have and even as an artifact. But even on that that our end, we would never \",\"startTime\":1745256244,\"endTime\":1745256252},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256249,\"endTime\":1745256250},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"use it for anything unless we got we had approval from you. \",\"startTime\":1745256252,\"endTime\":1745256256},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It starts with you owning it and then you sharing.\",\"startTime\":1745256256,\"endTime\":1745256259},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I I super I appreciate that. I I think I was just thinking about my helpful \",\"startTime\":1745256257,\"endTime\":1745256262},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"probably to share how like my literal like my my story of why I''m here on this conversation is. \",\"startTime\":1745256262,\"endTime\":1745256273},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, whatever.\",\"startTime\":1745256275,\"endTime\":1745256276},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It''s not it''s like, no, it''s no knowing the right people like by by chance, I happen to run into cross paths with the brilliant brains of Erica Crane and Mike Mendelsohn like what, 11 years ago, an hour or so. And we worked on starting \",\"startTime\":1745256276,\"endTime\":1745256291},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"a school together and it was a really. Yeah, yeah, it was the found. So that''s \",\"startTime\":1745256291,\"endTime\":1745256296},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"the school that I that I''m still currently doing some of that work for unlike the last remaining founder from that that tiny team that started. \",\"startTime\":1745256296,\"endTime\":1745256306},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Did you get to work at the school with them?\",\"startTime\":1745256297,\"endTime\":1745256298},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"School umm so yeah I had I got the deep pleasure of working with with both of them and just Mike and I are really interesting pair because we we make a good team because I think. \",\"startTime\":1745256310,\"endTime\":1745256326},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"In that creation, like he''s such a creator brain. He has so many big ideas and \",\"startTime\":1745256327,\"endTime\":1745256331},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"for me, I get really like that''s overwhelming to me sometimes when there''s like so many possibilities and so I can feel a little lost in there and I''m a really. \",\"startTime\":1745256331,\"endTime\":1745256339},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Great details person which can drive a person like him probably a little bonkers. \",\"startTime\":1745256341,\"endTime\":1745256344},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Be like, hey, details, details like we''ll worry about that. So when we got to \",\"startTime\":1745256344,\"endTime\":1745256347},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"be on teams together, it was actually really magic. I was like you come up with \",\"startTime\":1745256347,\"endTime\":1745256350},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"all the ideas, you brainstorm all the stuff. I''ll tell you I''ll be like the \",\"startTime\":1745256350,\"endTime\":1745256354},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"crusher of dreams is like that won''t work and then. \",\"startTime\":1745256354,\"endTime\":1745256357},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And then we''ll settle on one and we''ll we''ll build something and together and. \",\"startTime\":1745256358,\"endTime\":1745256362},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So yeah, we worked together for a couple of years and then have just stayed in touch. And then, yeah, Erica, I worked with very closely until she left the \",\"startTime\":1745256362,\"endTime\":1745256372},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"school in 2022 or so. And part of I knew that I wanted to go to Spain, but also \",\"startTime\":1745256372,\"endTime\":1745256377},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I was feeling like with the change in leadership, it I just, she''s a very intense, she''s she''s brilliant in the work that she can produce and the standard of work that she creates and like just watching her like she really she could. \",\"startTime\":1745256377,\"endTime\":1745256392},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Like typing an e-mail.\",\"startTime\":1745256395,\"endTime\":1745256397},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Having a conversation and like watching Keeping Up with the Kardashians, like all at the same time. And her brain can do all of that. And so to get to work \",\"startTime\":1745256398,\"endTime\":1745256405},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"with her and see that done and just like the standard of quality that she would hold and what she could meet, but then also trying to meet that sometimes it''s like we''re not all superhuman. Like, this is really hard. \",\"startTime\":1745256405,\"endTime\":1745256416},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"But also then when she left and I worked for like a normal person, like normal person is not. \",\"startTime\":1745256417,\"endTime\":1745256423},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Doing it for me exactly. I''m a normal person who I really love and is a great \",\"startTime\":1745256425,\"endTime\":1745256428},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it. I love it.\",\"startTime\":1745256425,\"endTime\":1745256426},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"friend. But also like you are not Erica Crane. \",\"startTime\":1745256428,\"endTime\":1745256431},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So I kind of had to step away from the school for a bit too. And now related \",\"startTime\":1745256431,\"endTime\":1745256436},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"the second question, which I won''t answer because I don''t want to ramble on too much, but but has to do with now. And it''s not a problem of practice, but \",\"startTime\":1745256436,\"endTime\":1745256444},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"it''s the problem on my mind most right now is deciding when I go back this summer, if I return to that position and that school. \",\"startTime\":1745256444,\"endTime\":1745256453},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Or if I take another position that''s been offered to me, the school that I''m developing the curriculum for has asked if I would want to teach for them. So \",\"startTime\":1745256453,\"endTime\":1745256460},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I have to decide if I want to go be a founding teacher again at an online school. \",\"startTime\":1745256460,\"endTime\":1745256463},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And the biggest thing is like, oh, do I want to sign up to be bad at something for a while? Because I really don''t like that. And I just, I know that like \",\"startTime\":1745256463,\"endTime\":1745256470},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''ll be a learner, like a super learner. And like I say, I like to be a learner \",\"startTime\":1745256470,\"endTime\":1745256473},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"and I do, but I don''t like to be like such a public learner. I''m like, I''m hey \",\"startTime\":1745256473,\"endTime\":1745256477},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"guys, can you tell me I''m learning right now because I''m not doing this well like that. \",\"startTime\":1745256477,\"endTime\":1745256483},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Intimidating to me so yeah, so I''m here because I know the right people and Erica was like it was such an honor that she asked me to like have any kind of even small role in here. But it''s because she knows me too and she knows \",\"startTime\":1745256485,\"endTime\":1745256495},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"that like I can that I''m that I would I would the person who is not already very tech savvy and very like. \",\"startTime\":1745256495,\"endTime\":1745256502},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"But I''m very much a learner when it comes to do with a lot, when it comes to do with a lot of this stuff. So yes, that''s my long answer to that question. \",\"startTime\":1745256504,\"endTime\":1745256511},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, this is great. And I think we we totally did the stories even at the beginning \",\"startTime\":1745256513,\"endTime\":1745256517},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"a little bit. But thanks for that more insight. I was wondering how. \",\"startTime\":1745256517,\"endTime\":1745256520},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256521,\"endTime\":1745256522},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What was your journey to get into side by? And that makes a lot of sense. Mine \",\"startTime\":1745256521,\"endTime\":1745256524},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"is similar but different. \",\"startTime\":1745256524,\"endTime\":1745256528},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"In that I got to work with Mike Mendelsohn 2 springs ago or three years ago this fall when we connected at a Bath conference, Northwest Math Conference. \",\"startTime\":1745256529,\"endTime\":1745256540},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And we might have connected via Chase Orton, a math friend of mine and colleague. \",\"startTime\":1745256541,\"endTime\":1745256545},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And we were working with a small district who then given grant funding. Not \",\"startTime\":1745256545,\"endTime\":1745256548},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"a super small district, a medium sized district. \",\"startTime\":1745256548,\"endTime\":1745256552},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Scope of things and but they were not able to apply the grant. And this teacher \",\"startTime\":1745256553,\"endTime\":1745256557},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"leader, she had gotten the grant money for them to do lesson studies in their school. But the school district said, no, you can''t do it in your school because \",\"startTime\":1745256557,\"endTime\":1745256565},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"we don''t have the funds to do it for all of the schools. \",\"startTime\":1745256565,\"endTime\":1745256569},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So it wouldn''t be fair. So you can''t do that. So we took that opportunity and \",\"startTime\":1745256570,\"endTime\":1745256574},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256570,\"endTime\":1745256572},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"brainstormed and Mike had his tool called up Duo and I was working professional learning for the state of Washington and for different regions. And so we brainstormed \",\"startTime\":1745256574,\"endTime\":1745256581},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"out how to make it happen. And then through that, I''ve been working with Mike \",\"startTime\":1745256581,\"endTime\":1745256585},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the last couple years, well, three years now. \",\"startTime\":1745256585,\"endTime\":1745256589},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Ended up like, how do we bring this to education? How do we get educators talking \",\"startTime\":1745256591,\"endTime\":1745256595},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"about their practice? And then this January, starting side by and then with \",\"startTime\":1745256595,\"endTime\":1745256598},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Eric at the helm. And totally agree with all the things you said about Superwoman \",\"startTime\":1745256598,\"endTime\":1745256601},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745256598,\"endTime\":1745256600},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Erica. \",\"startTime\":1745256601,\"endTime\":1745256604},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And you''re like, all right, lady, we don''t know what''s in your coffee, but you''ve been going hard for a long time and you love it and you''re 1 to keep it clean. \",\"startTime\":1745256605,\"endTime\":1745256613},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But some of us need to dream. And as I''ve said to Erica, Erica, I''m so glad \",\"startTime\":1745256613,\"endTime\":1745256617},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"you''re at the the lead of things because otherwise I would have and we would have 80,000 projects and dreams that never got completed because Mike and I would just go have fun doing them. \",\"startTime\":1745256617,\"endTime\":1745256629},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256627,\"endTime\":1745256633},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And we would have a backyard full of fun toys.\",\"startTime\":1745256629,\"endTime\":1745256631},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256633,\"endTime\":1745256634},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"She''s not gonna let that happen. Things are gonna get done.\",\"startTime\":1745256635,\"endTime\":1745256637},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Nope, Nope. And it''s great. Well, I wanted to say that. Thanks for this. And \",\"startTime\":1745256638,\"endTime\":1745256642},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"then on the next card, let''s go to the next and thinking for time because we''ve gotten a full half hour. \",\"startTime\":1745256642,\"endTime\":1745256650},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"This last card when you see end there when you press end it closes, hangs up your call. \",\"startTime\":1745256650,\"endTime\":1745256656},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256651,\"endTime\":1745256651},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK, OK. Good to know.\",\"startTime\":1745256656,\"endTime\":1745256658},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So just for FYI, umm, we can chat for a little bit more if you want to or, uh, schedule a chat. I''m sure that Erica, she''s letting me in on a little bit of \",\"startTime\":1745256657,\"endTime\":1745256664},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it and she wanna make sure you get the full user experience. \",\"startTime\":1745256664,\"endTime\":1745256668},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But let''s do this card and then if you''ve got a minute, we can chat a little bit more. But I do know it''s 10:30 or whatever, 30 time it is. Here''s 30. \",\"startTime\":1745256669,\"endTime\":1745256677},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, here it''s 7:30.\",\"startTime\":1745256679,\"endTime\":1745256681},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Thank, thank 730. Yeah, thank your partner and share one thing you learned from \",\"startTime\":1745256681,\"endTime\":1745256685},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"them. Oh, thank you so much for. \",\"startTime\":1745256685,\"endTime\":1745256689},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Being human and sharing your insight to passion and learning and one thing that I learned from you is. \",\"startTime\":1745256690,\"endTime\":1745256696},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That it''s still, even though you might have done it before and knowing about all of the details, you still have to struggle with it. And it''s a good thing \",\"startTime\":1745256696,\"endTime\":1745256702},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"to just let go of it go, oh, it''s good enough. I gotta, I gotta hit print or \",\"startTime\":1745256702,\"endTime\":1745256705},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"whatever it is. \",\"startTime\":1745256705,\"endTime\":1745256708},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I struggle with that a lot personally. So thanks for that encouragement. \",\"startTime\":1745256710,\"endTime\":1745256713},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah, Yeah. Well, thank you for making this really comfortable and easy \",\"startTime\":1745256714,\"endTime\":1745256717},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"too. Like I really, yeah, enjoyed this conversation and look forward to when \",\"startTime\":1745256717,\"endTime\":1745256721},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I get to chat with you next. And I''ve got a whole, my little, my little notebook \",\"startTime\":1745256721,\"endTime\":1745256724},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"of all kinds of things, like things Jeff said I thought were great and that I want to reference again, but. \",\"startTime\":1745256724,\"endTime\":1745256731},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Oh, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1745256728,\"endTime\":1745256731},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"One of them it''s, it''s a small thing and it''s not really related to anything we were talking about, but I was like, oh, they eat math habits. Like I want \",\"startTime\":1745256732,\"endTime\":1745256738},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to look at those because even if those are math habits, like those are learner habits, like everything you were saying. And I just want to look at that and \",\"startTime\":1745256738,\"endTime\":1745256744},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"think about that as I''m very much focused right now on the science curriculum work that I''m doing. \",\"startTime\":1745256744,\"endTime\":1745256750},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And just look at where I can make sure I''m infusing those wherever possible. \",\"startTime\":1745256752,\"endTime\":1745256757},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Both in language and just in the spirit to the types of activities and things that I''m selecting for students. \",\"startTime\":1745256758,\"endTime\":1745256764},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So thank you for that. So it''s going to send me digging for more things \",\"startTime\":1745256765,\"endTime\":1745256767},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Oh, you''re welcome.\",\"startTime\":1745256767,\"endTime\":1745256768},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to think about. \",\"startTime\":1745256767,\"endTime\":1745256769},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, if you Google search.\",\"startTime\":1745256771,\"endTime\":1745256773},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Standards for math practices, that''s how it will come up. Standards for mathematical \",\"startTime\":1745256773,\"endTime\":1745256778},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Cool.\",\"startTime\":1745256778,\"endTime\":1745256778},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"practices in the Common Core standards. There''s the content standards and then \",\"startTime\":1745256778,\"endTime\":1745256784},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"then the practice standards. And those are the ones that resonate well and intentionally \",\"startTime\":1745256784,\"endTime\":1745256789},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"as you think about our brains being linguistic and mathematical at the core. \",\"startTime\":1745256789,\"endTime\":1745256794},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"The mathematical part, those are the habits of mind that we should all be developing all the time. Like you''ll love them. You''re like, oh, and when we would, we \",\"startTime\":1745256796,\"endTime\":1745256804},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Yeah. Yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256801,\"endTime\":1745256804},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"would talk about them with our English or science or any other teachers, they''re like, Oh my God, these are the same things we''re doing in our classes. So. \",\"startTime\":1745256804,\"endTime\":1745256811},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I think you really like him in the language is really rich, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256811,\"endTime\":1745256814},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256813,\"endTime\":1745256814},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Cool. Yes, Yeah, I''ll be looking at that soon.\",\"startTime\":1745256815,\"endTime\":1745256818},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. OK, sweet. And then, umm, I don''t know, umm, I have to check with Erica \",\"startTime\":1745256816,\"endTime\":1745256819},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"for when you and I might connect again. Just if we wanted to do a check in or \",\"startTime\":1745256819,\"endTime\":1745256823},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"call. But I know she''s got you doing some work, but I''d love any of the feedback \",\"startTime\":1745256823,\"endTime\":1745256827},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"from your experience about how it is. \",\"startTime\":1745256827,\"endTime\":1745256831},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256831,\"endTime\":1745256831},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Coming through and all of the stuff, even with our funky, quirky tools that we have right now and fun being a learner in front of other learners, knowing that it''s going to not work all the time. \",\"startTime\":1745256831,\"endTime\":1745256844},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no, so far, great.\",\"startTime\":1745256837,\"endTime\":1745256840},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Uh, what did you say? Do I want to be bad at something or do I want to suck \",\"startTime\":1745256845,\"endTime\":1745256848},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Oh yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256846,\"endTime\":1745256846},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"at something for the first year? \",\"startTime\":1745256848,\"endTime\":1745256850},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, that''s exactly, that''s sort of what I''m. Yeah. Publicly, I thought \",\"startTime\":1745256851,\"endTime\":1745256855},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"In front of others.\",\"startTime\":1745256851,\"endTime\":1745256852},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I was done with that. Yeah, no, Yeah, I think so. I''m meeting with Erica. We \",\"startTime\":1745256855,\"endTime\":1745256859},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256855,\"endTime\":1745256856},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"have a meeting scheduled on the 29th. \",\"startTime\":1745256859,\"endTime\":1745256863},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745256860,\"endTime\":1745256861},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And I believe she wanted me to make sure I had at least two conversations.\",\"startTime\":1745256865,\"endTime\":1745256869},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Before that meeting. So that''s that''s what comes to mind right now as far as \",\"startTime\":1745256870,\"endTime\":1745256873},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Great.\",\"startTime\":1745256873,\"endTime\":1745256874},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"like what we want to try to make sure I get. \",\"startTime\":1745256873,\"endTime\":1745256877},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256875,\"endTime\":1745256875},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Then let''s be real authentic to the process and I will match you with some other educators like. \",\"startTime\":1745256879,\"endTime\":1745256884},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Curriculum authors or people who are doing remote learning or have been in that same kind of position and of leadership instructional work as well. I''ll see \",\"startTime\":1745256885,\"endTime\":1745256892},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"what I can do to partner you up. And it would be wonderful to get that feedback \",\"startTime\":1745256892,\"endTime\":1745256895},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"from your journey because it''s new and we don''t have 1000 people online yet, so you don''t get somebody right away to match. \",\"startTime\":1745256895,\"endTime\":1745256903},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256897,\"endTime\":1745256899},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256903,\"endTime\":1745256904},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm, not like the popular whatever games online or whatever, umm, that will get you there and it''ll be great to get your feedback from that and like what that process is like. So alright. \",\"startTime\":1745256904,\"endTime\":1745256914},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm, Great. Yeah. I''ve been keeping a doc, a document of just running notes \",\"startTime\":1745256913,\"endTime\":1745256917},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"and I shared that with Erica and think mentioned like I don''t know if they if I should share it with anybody else on the team at this point or not, but I it''s possible like that''s where I''ve been kind of keeping everything. So yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745256917,\"endTime\":1745256931},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"You''re welcome to share it with me. I would, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256928,\"endTime\":1745256930},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So that''s helpful. I''ll just share you on those. \",\"startTime\":1745256931,\"endTime\":1745256935},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Yeah, No, I would love to see. Yeah, if you want to share with that \",\"startTime\":1745256932,\"endTime\":1745256934},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"with me, that would be awesome, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745256934,\"endTime\":1745256937},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256937,\"endTime\":1745256938},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Sweet beans. Oh, I hope you have a wonderful evening. Oh, Spain.\",\"startTime\":1745256939,\"endTime\":1745256943},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Great. OK, Well, in.\",\"startTime\":1745256939,\"endTime\":1745256941},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1745256942,\"endTime\":1745256943},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, is it warm today?\",\"startTime\":1745256945,\"endTime\":1745256947},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, if you can do your year, your year in Valentine.\",\"startTime\":1745256945,\"endTime\":1745256948},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Beautiful. Like, yeah, today was the first day I was like, I gotta get out the \",\"startTime\":1745256948,\"endTime\":1745256951},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"big sun hat for my walk to town because it''s getting pretty intense. But yeah, \",\"startTime\":1745256951,\"endTime\":1745256955},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"it''s a beautiful time of year here. The humidity is not super high yet and. \",\"startTime\":1745256955,\"endTime\":1745256958},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Beautiful.\",\"startTime\":1745256959,\"endTime\":1745256959},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Love it. I love it. Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745256960,\"endTime\":1745256962},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but looks like Tucson''s treating you OK, too. Great.\",\"startTime\":1745256960,\"endTime\":1745256963},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It is like 0 humidity pretty much and in our place we bought their cacti and palm trees already growing in. \",\"startTime\":1745256963,\"endTime\":1745256971},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Ah, no.\",\"startTime\":1745256972,\"endTime\":1745256972},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It''s wonderful. Yeah. All right. More chats later. Have a great day. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1745256973,\"endTime\":1745256977},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Nice. All right. Well, enjoy it. Yes. We''ll talk soon. You too.\",\"startTime\":1745256975,\"endTime\":1745256978}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.398817+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.398817+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 2055, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.365Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('820c7334-dec6-47ea-9fd8-f6fd626641d0', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', '138086', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"To talk to for a whole minute I guess. But umm, you know, my name is Cassie \",\"startTime\":1744315434,\"endTime\":1744315438},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"and I am not a teacher. I''m a lifelong learner. I''m here to hopefully make this \",\"startTime\":1744315438,\"endTime\":1744315442},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"app a little. \",\"startTime\":1744315442,\"endTime\":1744315446},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Better.\",\"startTime\":1744315446,\"endTime\":1744315447},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Umm, I''m kind of troubleshooting my way through this with Jeff live and just trying to keep the time. \",\"startTime\":1744315450,\"endTime\":1744315456},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Umm, we''ll see.\",\"startTime\":1744315459,\"endTime\":1744315460},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I wonder if this session will not be improved because I''m not really saying anything I''m supposed to. \",\"startTime\":1744315460,\"endTime\":1744315464},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"One minute is such a long time to talk about yourself. By the way, I could have \",\"startTime\":1744315465,\"endTime\":1744315468},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"said everything about myself in 15 seconds. \",\"startTime\":1744315468,\"endTime\":1744315471},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Hmm OK, can this be done?\",\"startTime\":1744315484,\"endTime\":1744315486},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"OK, talking blah blah blah blah blah blah.\",\"startTime\":1744315487,\"endTime\":1744315492},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Umm, once again, I''m not a teacher so I can''t really answer this prompt, but I mean the role of the teacher is. \",\"startTime\":1744315512,\"endTime\":1744315518},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"To be there to support a student''s journey of learning. Which means, I guess \",\"startTime\":1744315518,\"endTime\":1744315522},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"in my view is more about. \",\"startTime\":1744315522,\"endTime\":1744315525},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Giving them frameworks for curiosity versus giving them information to memorize. \",\"startTime\":1744315526,\"endTime\":1744315531},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Hopefully you''re inspiring them to think for themselves, to ask questions, to practice an open mind, to meet new information with openness and hostility. \",\"startTime\":1744315531,\"endTime\":1744315540},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Umm, you know, the role of the learner is attention and.\",\"startTime\":1744315541,\"endTime\":1744315546},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, uh, attention doesn''t mean agreement, it doesn''t mean subservience. It \",\"startTime\":1744315546,\"endTime\":1744315549},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"just means listening with an open mind. \",\"startTime\":1744315549,\"endTime\":1744315552},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Umm, I think obviously in America right now we have a lot of prescriptive memorization based learning and. \",\"startTime\":1744315555,\"endTime\":1744315561},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I just don''t think that is the best that things can be. Just my opinion, OK? \",\"startTime\":1744315562,\"endTime\":1744315568},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I like to compost. It really helps soothe my mind and settle me down. I don''t \",\"startTime\":1744315584,\"endTime\":1744315588},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"really need to talk about this for a full minute. Is it gonna make me? \",\"startTime\":1744315588,\"endTime\":1744315592},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I don''t know, there''s just something about getting into the earth and getting dirty and. \",\"startTime\":1744315594,\"endTime\":1744315597},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Using your body and being outside and.\",\"startTime\":1744315598,\"endTime\":1744315601},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Turning a bunch of junk into something vital and full of life. It''s just completely \",\"startTime\":1744315603,\"endTime\":1744315607},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"beautiful and I love it. \",\"startTime\":1744315607,\"endTime\":1744315611},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Oh no, I have 30 more seconds. I have to talk about this. I love it though.\",\"startTime\":1744315611,\"endTime\":1744315614},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Umm umm.\",\"startTime\":1744315619,\"endTime\":1744315619},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, just, you know, chill in. OK, Woo.\",\"startTime\":1744315622,\"endTime\":1744315626},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Uh, I think I have to talk for one minute.\",\"startTime\":1744315628,\"endTime\":1744315630},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Umm, yeah. Composting. Commas. Compost. Love to you. Compost. Oh my God, am \",\"startTime\":1744315632,\"endTime\":1744315635},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I gonna fail again? \",\"startTime\":1744315635,\"endTime\":1744315639},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1744315640,\"endTime\":1744315640}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.407878+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.407878+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 189, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.365Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('d7578d84-a832-4cf9-9822-27bb832bd6e4', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '138138', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I''m an educator who works with other educators and yeah, that''s what I do. I \",\"startTime\":1744724147,\"endTime\":1744724150},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"hope to grow as an educator. \",\"startTime\":1744724150,\"endTime\":1744724154},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I think that every human being is capable of learning and we all learn in our own way very similarly to each other, and the best thing to do for a learner is give them the space and opportunity to learn and facilitate the. \",\"startTime\":1744724167,\"endTime\":1744724179},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"The conditions so that they can do their growing.\",\"startTime\":1744724179,\"endTime\":1744724182},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, primary flow activity, being in the sunshine early in the morning.\",\"startTime\":1744724196,\"endTime\":1744724199},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And hiking, biking, swimming, climbing. Something human powered.\",\"startTime\":1744724199,\"endTime\":1744724204}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.445476+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.445476+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 47, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.416Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('bba9ac9e-bf16-48c3-8c89-44cf9643668f', '57be074b-d837-43b9-a5a1-6f3959cdea53', '106641', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.390631+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.390631+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 346, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:54.326Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('478f7daf-1234-44aa-8676-a8275c3b4d4d', '6591e553-8215-4832-843f-a15c716b5863', '137130', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"I can hear you. Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1739898097,\"endTime\":1739898099},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1739898098,\"endTime\":1739898099},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I can hear you. Great. Awesome. Good to see you, Skylar.\",\"startTime\":1739898099,\"endTime\":1739898103},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Super. Yeah, you too. I''m, I''m, I''m thrilled that it worked immediately.\",\"startTime\":1739898103,\"endTime\":1739898109},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well.\",\"startTime\":1739898105,\"endTime\":1739898106},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, thanks for working through the process. We was a good peek behind the \",\"startTime\":1739898110,\"endTime\":1739898113},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898113,\"endTime\":1739898113},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"curtain and good for us to move through the process with folks. And so thanks \",\"startTime\":1739898113,\"endTime\":1739898117},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"for bearing with us as we move through. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739898117,\"endTime\":1739898121},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Sweet.\",\"startTime\":1739898123,\"endTime\":1739898124},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"All right, so clarifying stance on education. OK, what''s your favorite hobby \",\"startTime\":1739898125,\"endTime\":1739898129},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"and why? Is what our card says. \",\"startTime\":1739898129,\"endTime\":1739898133},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Cool. I''m just I''m just like finding my way through the I''m I''m seeing a thing \",\"startTime\":1739898138,\"endTime\":1739898142},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yep, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898141,\"endTime\":1739898143},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"that says greet your partner Erica, then press more. So OK, OK, what''s your \",\"startTime\":1739898142,\"endTime\":1739898146},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"favorite hobby and why? There we go. \",\"startTime\":1739898146,\"endTime\":1739898150},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yep. And then it''ll. Yeah, there you go. Yep.\",\"startTime\":1739898148,\"endTime\":1739898150},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Actually answer the question.\",\"startTime\":1739898155,\"endTime\":1739898157},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. We''ll move through like just to play a little bit and I''ll make \",\"startTime\":1739898156,\"endTime\":1739898160},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1739898159,\"endTime\":1739898159},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"them. I might adjust some of them. Like for this one we can say what''s a hobby \",\"startTime\":1739898160,\"endTime\":1739898164},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Yeah, cool.\",\"startTime\":1739898163,\"endTime\":1739898164},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"or like something you''re trying to learn that isn''t AI related, but like, yeah, just something you''re trying to learn or you like to do that isn''t AI related. \",\"startTime\":1739898164,\"endTime\":1739898171},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"This one, this round. \",\"startTime\":1739898171,\"endTime\":1739898175},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Sure. Well my I don''t know if it''s a hobby or a sport, but I''m a skier as I \",\"startTime\":1739898177,\"endTime\":1739898182},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"said, so definitely at least this time of year. \",\"startTime\":1739898182,\"endTime\":1739898187},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898186,\"endTime\":1739898186},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"I wouldn''t say consumes, but has a lot of my.\",\"startTime\":1739898190,\"endTime\":1739898193},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Time and energy and and background thought processes.\",\"startTime\":1739898196,\"endTime\":1739898201},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Nice. Yeah, yeah, I''m a gravel biker and so this time of year is tricky out \",\"startTime\":1739898203,\"endTime\":1739898208},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"here because I''m not into fat biking or really cold riding yet. So I''m waiting \",\"startTime\":1739898208,\"endTime\":1739898213},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"for it to melt and I''ll take some mud. But yeah, it''s a little tricky. So right \",\"startTime\":1739898213,\"endTime\":1739898218},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"now I''m just on the indoor trainer making it work. \",\"startTime\":1739898218,\"endTime\":1739898223},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Right. And uh, semi related question on that is, umm, you''re in, in New York, \",\"startTime\":1739898223,\"endTime\":1739898228},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"in in the Bronx, you said, Oh, OK. \",\"startTime\":1739898228,\"endTime\":1739898233},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Madison, WI. I wasn''t. Yeah, I was in New York for about 10 years, but yeah, \",\"startTime\":1739898231,\"endTime\":1739898233},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Madison. \",\"startTime\":1739898233,\"endTime\":1739898236},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah. I was like why are we using central time? But OK, gotcha. Cool.\",\"startTime\":1739898235,\"endTime\":1739898242},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898240,\"endTime\":1739898240},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"There we go.\",\"startTime\":1739898242,\"endTime\":1739898242},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"All right, all right, so we click next and then it''ll say waiting for your partner. \",\"startTime\":1739898244,\"endTime\":1739898248},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Just curious.\",\"startTime\":1739898245,\"endTime\":1739898246},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"OK. I just have a thing that says partner ready, so I''ll say yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898250,\"endTime\":1739898254},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"There we go. What is your stance? And we''ll say education and AI to make this \",\"startTime\":1739898253,\"endTime\":1739898257},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"a little more relevant to some of the ways I want to ask these questions. So \",\"startTime\":1739898257,\"endTime\":1739898261},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"yeah, what''s your stance toward AI and education and why? \",\"startTime\":1739898261,\"endTime\":1739898265},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Thinking a little bit.\",\"startTime\":1739898272,\"endTime\":1739898273},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, for sure.\",\"startTime\":1739898274,\"endTime\":1739898276},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Stance on AI for education is it''s as far as I.\",\"startTime\":1739898281,\"endTime\":1739898286},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"View it. It''s just.\",\"startTime\":1739898289,\"endTime\":1739898290},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"A different channel into information. Umm. And what I mean by that is.\",\"startTime\":1739898293,\"endTime\":1739898298},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Back in the day you would go to the library and get a book.\",\"startTime\":1739898300,\"endTime\":1739898306},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Or ask somebody who already knew.\",\"startTime\":1739898307,\"endTime\":1739898310},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"More recently you would Google like crazy.\",\"startTime\":1739898312,\"endTime\":1739898316},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Until you drill down into the answer that you were looking for and.\",\"startTime\":1739898318,\"endTime\":1739898323},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739898324,\"endTime\":1739898325},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"And now it''s just things are are honed.\",\"startTime\":1739898324,\"endTime\":1739898327},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Ajá.\",\"startTime\":1739898325,\"endTime\":1739898325},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"In such a way that.\",\"startTime\":1739898330,\"endTime\":1739898332},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"I guess ultimately AI has already done or is immediately doing all the Super Googling that you and walking to the library and and. \",\"startTime\":1739898335,\"endTime\":1739898346},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Essentially has the library the world of libraries in its back pocket and can. \",\"startTime\":1739898347,\"endTime\":1739898353},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Pulled all the other way way faster than you ever could.\",\"startTime\":1739898356,\"endTime\":1739898358},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"And so.\",\"startTime\":1739898360,\"endTime\":1739898360},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"For me it''s like.\",\"startTime\":1739898363,\"endTime\":1739898364},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"It''s just that it''s, it''s not a, it''s not a monster.\",\"startTime\":1739898365,\"endTime\":1739898371},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"It''s it''s.\",\"startTime\":1739898374,\"endTime\":1739898375},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Just a computer that''s working has, you know, has collected all this information, like I said, and and is working way faster than you can. And it''s a, it''s a \",\"startTime\":1739898377,\"endTime\":1739898386},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"benefit. There''s nothing wrong with that. It''s there. It''s not going away. \",\"startTime\":1739898386,\"endTime\":1739898390},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898390,\"endTime\":1739898390},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"We might as well use it.\",\"startTime\":1739898396,\"endTime\":1739898397},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. And that we''re trying to work with educators who have been either \",\"startTime\":1739898398,\"endTime\":1739898401},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"told like don''t use it, don''t let your students use it, or have been given the green light without guidance or have been given the green light with a lot of guidance. Like all across that continuum, I''ve interacted with professors and \",\"startTime\":1739898401,\"endTime\":1739898412},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"K12 teachers who are in those boats and and then students who are then interacting with those systems where it might be different from professor to professor. \",\"startTime\":1739898412,\"endTime\":1739898419},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"So. \",\"startTime\":1739898419,\"endTime\":1739898422},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Trying to figure out how do you support people who are in such different places and spaces, but we''re all dealing with the same idea of how will this impact and influence formal elements of education and then also just learning in general. \",\"startTime\":1739898423,\"endTime\":1739898433},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739898433,\"endTime\":1739898436},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. So that''s a.\",\"startTime\":1739898438,\"endTime\":1739898441},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Amazing topic for conversation, but at the same time, like my stance is just almost like it doesn''t have to be it can just but yeah, there''s, there''s all different kinds of channels to go down. \",\"startTime\":1739898443,\"endTime\":1739898454},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"All right, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898455,\"endTime\":1739898458},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And this is giving us an idea of like we''re answering the questions and \",\"startTime\":1739898458,\"endTime\":1739898459},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"we''re playing in the app. \",\"startTime\":1739898459,\"endTime\":1739898461},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"We''ll see. Let''s see, what''s the next one here?\",\"startTime\":1739898462,\"endTime\":1739898464},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Yep, more.\",\"startTime\":1739898465,\"endTime\":1739898467},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Mention any influences that have shaped your views. Is that where we''re at?\",\"startTime\":1739898467,\"endTime\":1739898470},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"What changes or is that I?\",\"startTime\":1739898472,\"endTime\":1739898473},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"The, the more is like if you needed some other prompts to answer that question, but I think I think we''re good. And then you can go like ready to go to the \",\"startTime\":1739898472,\"endTime\":1739898479},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898476,\"endTime\":1739898477},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"next one and it''ll move us to the next round. \",\"startTime\":1739898479,\"endTime\":1739898483},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"On the bottom there, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898484,\"endTime\":1739898487},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"OK, yeah, I''m just, I''m just cruising. I was like, let me see if those prompts, \",\"startTime\":1739898485,\"endTime\":1739898488},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"if I did accidentally hit those prompts even. \",\"startTime\":1739898488,\"endTime\":1739898492},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, see how it looks?\",\"startTime\":1739898488,\"endTime\":1739898490},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Take turns. Are you there? What do you know about?\",\"startTime\":1739898494,\"endTime\":1739898496},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I''m going to let me I might revise this one for us. I think the.\",\"startTime\":1739898498,\"endTime\":1739898503},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Umm, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898498,\"endTime\":1739898499},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1739898502,\"endTime\":1739898503},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Thinking about you''ve been able to engage with coming into side by and then side by saying like we use these other tools come into up Duo. And I think I \",\"startTime\":1739898506,\"endTime\":1739898515},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"talked a little bit before in the first round about how our CTO Mike founded Up Duo, Up Duo was acquired. We still have the ability to use UP Duo and for \",\"startTime\":1739898515,\"endTime\":1739898524},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"education purposes, specifically for educators with education folks. \",\"startTime\":1739898524,\"endTime\":1739898529},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"But then feeling this flow of this onboarding in these apps connecting, is there \",\"startTime\":1739898530,\"endTime\":1739898534},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"something that there''s a lot of feedback that could be given, but is there something \",\"startTime\":1739898534,\"endTime\":1739898537},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"right away that jumps out to you and thinking about what feedback would you give right away for design and, and how side by and then how it''s interacting with Upduo and what this feels like and means like what are the things right away you''re thinking, oh, this is where I would potentially contribute. So I''m \",\"startTime\":1739898537,\"endTime\":1739898552},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"totally hijacking this question. \",\"startTime\":1739898552,\"endTime\":1739898556},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Yeah. No, it''s OK.\",\"startTime\":1739898559,\"endTime\":1739898560},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Well, I I think I would have a.\",\"startTime\":1739898567,\"endTime\":1739898569},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Quicker. Clearer.\",\"startTime\":1739898571,\"endTime\":1739898574},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Set of, you know, at least you know a small handful of of suggestions if this were maybe the the second or third time that we were going through this. \",\"startTime\":1739898576,\"endTime\":1739898585},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yep, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1739898585,\"endTime\":1739898586},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Not, I mean, I''m not, not to like dodge the question, but.\",\"startTime\":1739898588,\"endTime\":1739898591},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739898592,\"endTime\":1739898593},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Because like.\",\"startTime\":1739898594,\"endTime\":1739898595},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Basically as I''ve 