122, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.841Z", "session_title": "Clarifying Stances on Education", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1429", "name": "Clarifying Stances on Education", "tags": [{"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('efeb3924-6ee0-44dd-8ad6-7f146af95c8f', 'c9d72e87-97e2-4131-bf2e-7298453c0e52', '138222', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Hello, my name is Mike Mendelsohn.\",\"startTime\":1745283431,\"endTime\":1745283434},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And I, umm, I''m one of those teachers here. I''m hoping to build it, umm.\",\"startTime\":1745283434,\"endTime\":1745283438},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"I currently teach high school math in the last 8 weeks.\",\"startTime\":1745283443,\"endTime\":1745283446},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And.\",\"startTime\":1745283446,\"endTime\":1745283447},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"I am excited about how much.\",\"startTime\":1745283449,\"endTime\":1745283451},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"I''m excited at creating a a community where people can talk with each other and learn about each other''s perspective and how we''re all thinking so that we can all think a little faster together. \",\"startTime\":1745283456,\"endTime\":1745283470},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Uh, I I actually don''t care what I learn about. I hope everyone else here learns \",\"startTime\":1745283475,\"endTime\":1745283478},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"a lot. \",\"startTime\":1745283478,\"endTime\":1745283481},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"I''m sure that I will learn a lot.\",\"startTime\":1745283481,\"endTime\":1745283483},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"But my job is to learn how to make it easier for you guys to learn.\",\"startTime\":1745283483,\"endTime\":1745283486},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"My stance with respect to teaching and learning is that, umm, we should do more of it. \",\"startTime\":1745283502,\"endTime\":1745283508},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"When we decide to learn something, we do and we get better and thus make the world better. When we decide to teach something, I don''t mean profess about \",\"startTime\":1745283512,\"endTime\":1745283519},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"it, but I mean like take knowledge we have and. \",\"startTime\":1745283519,\"endTime\":1745283522},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Put it in someone else''s brain and make them more capable so we make the world better in that way as well. \",\"startTime\":1745283524,\"endTime\":1745283529},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"My primary full activity is skiing, snow skiing. I like not to ski in a very \",\"startTime\":1745283543,\"endTime\":1745283547},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"playful, exploratory way and one of the things that marks my skiing. \",\"startTime\":1745283547,\"endTime\":1745283552},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Is that I''m always either pointed straight downhill or in a traverse.\",\"startTime\":1745283552,\"endTime\":1745283557},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And I found that I can because of that I can find more fresh turns.\",\"startTime\":1745283558,\"endTime\":1745283561},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"And I can.\",\"startTime\":1745283562,\"endTime\":1745283564},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"Have more fun.\",\"startTime\":1745283567,\"endTime\":1745283568},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"All the time.\",\"startTime\":1745283569,\"endTime\":1745283570},{\"speaker\":\"11999\",\"text\":\"I tend to stay off of trails and ski alone or with friends.\",\"startTime\":1745283570,\"endTime\":1745283576}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.873025+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.873025+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 134, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.827Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('699f5e1b-e392-4e16-b46b-6f52451bba6c', '59e9f386-0ecc-4201-99dd-802f7f8e7b33', '138230', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Hi there, I''m Nova Katz and I''m a math coach. I specialize in supporting teachers \",\"startTime\":1745350408,\"endTime\":1745350413},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"with elementary math, and in particular I love talking about multiple representations in mathematics and supporting students with using manipulatives and connecting representations. \",\"startTime\":1745350413,\"endTime\":1745350426},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"My why is to decrease barriers to access.\",\"startTime\":1745350426,\"endTime\":1745350432},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Based on students math abilities and their beliefs in themselves.\",\"startTime\":1745350433,\"endTime\":1745350436},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Umm, I hope to learn about how other people are doing this work and how other people are, umm, supporting students with a growth mindset. \",\"startTime\":1745350437,\"endTime\":1745350446},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Umm, my stance is that everyone can. Just like we say that every student can \",\"startTime\":1745350477,\"endTime\":1745350482},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"learn math at very high levels and that every student should be appropriately challenged in math class umm, I also believe that every teacher can. So as a \",\"startTime\":1745350482,\"endTime\":1745350492},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"math coach, I work specifically with teachers. I believe that every teacher \",\"startTime\":1745350492,\"endTime\":1745350497},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"can teach math to high levels, and I believe that every teacher can meet the needs of every single learner in their class and I. \",\"startTime\":1745350497,\"endTime\":1745350506},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Empowering teachers to see that they have everything they already need within themselves. \",\"startTime\":1745350506,\"endTime\":1745350511},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And I say that I get to do all of the research and reading that as teachers we don''t get time to do. And I bring to you what might be useful. \",\"startTime\":1745350512,\"endTime\":1745350519},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Things I do to flow include knitting.\",\"startTime\":1745350554,\"endTime\":1745350558},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I love to knit, although I don''t I haven''t been knitting lately. I''ve also recently \",\"startTime\":1745350558,\"endTime\":1745350562},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"done pottery and I love spinning ceramics on the wheel. Umm, I definitely lose \",\"startTime\":1745350562,\"endTime\":1745350566},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"track of time when I''m doing that. \",\"startTime\":1745350566,\"endTime\":1745350570},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And I also love playing games with my family, in particular games like Catan and Terraforming Mars. Really big bulky games that take a long time to play. \",\"startTime\":1745350570,\"endTime\":1745350577},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Those are really fun for me. \",\"startTime\":1745350577,\"endTime\":1745350581}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.889751+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.889751+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 124, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.860Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('f838f2cf-0553-4e40-8671-aefc4a913571', '4bb175fe-ebd9-4641-9edc-593037b6152d', '138201', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Hi, I''m Michelle and I am a science teacher by trade. I have done that for about \",\"startTime\":1745072027,\"endTime\":1745072031},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"20 years. \",\"startTime\":1745072031,\"endTime\":1745072033},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"But I''m also.\",\"startTime\":1745072033,\"endTime\":1745072034},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Really proud to be a leader in my school. I do some instructional coaching and \",\"startTime\":1745072035,\"endTime\":1745072038},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"that''s my favorite work that I do right now is working with teachers to help improve their practice. \",\"startTime\":1745072038,\"endTime\":1745072044},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And then I''ve also gotten to do a lot of work as an advisor to students in our crew structure. \",\"startTime\":1745072044,\"endTime\":1745072049},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And something that I hope to learn about through this process is just a lot more about how to utilize AI to. \",\"startTime\":1745072050,\"endTime\":1745072059},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Make the teaching process, the communication process better, easier for myself and then especially for the teachers that I work with, I want to understand the capabilities of that tool in order to make. \",\"startTime\":1745072062,\"endTime\":1745072076},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"To free up some capacity for teachers so that they can use their time.\",\"startTime\":1745072079,\"endTime\":1745072084},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Hi, I''m Michelle coming to you from California. I am a science teacher, high \",\"startTime\":1745072117,\"endTime\":1745072122},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"school science teacher by trade, and also an advisor for students through our crew structure and then the work that I''ve done over the past few years that I have really fallen in love with and where my energy is going. \",\"startTime\":1745072122,\"endTime\":1745072135},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Umm, in. The biggest way right now is toward coaching teachers as an instructional \",\"startTime\":1745072135,\"endTime\":1745072136},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"guide. \",\"startTime\":1745072136,\"endTime\":1745072138},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And what I''m hoping to learn through this process is specifically a lot more about AI and what its capabilities are. \",\"startTime\":1745072141,\"endTime\":1745072151},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Within education and.\",\"startTime\":1745072151,\"endTime\":1745072153},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Both for myself from when I''m in Pasadena as a teacher, but also.\",\"startTime\":1745072153,\"endTime\":1745072158},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"CS GO awful hate it.\",\"startTime\":1745072161,\"endTime\":1745072162},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Hi, I''m Michelle. I am a high school science teacher from California. I also \",\"startTime\":1745072182,\"endTime\":1745072188},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"do some crew advising and work as an instructional guide coaching teachers. \",\"startTime\":1745072188,\"endTime\":1745072193},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And I hope through this process to learn a lot more from.\",\"startTime\":1745072193,\"endTime\":1745072198},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Peers about what the potential is to utilize AI.\",\"startTime\":1745072199,\"endTime\":1745072203},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Umm, to make a really challenging job, uh.\",\"startTime\":1745072205,\"endTime\":1745072208},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"More efficient, more impactful and to help growth for myself when I am in teaching capacity, use it to improve and support my lesson design and then when I''m in a coaching capacity, when I''m working with teachers. \",\"startTime\":1745072209,\"endTime\":1745072224},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And especially those who are feeling just really overburdened by the workload to figure out how we can use technology to. \",\"startTime\":1745072224,\"endTime\":1745072231},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Lift off some of that weight and do some of the work.\",\"startTime\":1745072232,\"endTime\":1745072236},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Umm, for them?\",\"startTime\":1745072236,\"endTime\":1745072238},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So that they can concentrate their expertise in other areas that are maybe more directly helping students, leave them with a little more energy for the good work that they have to do. \",\"startTime\":1745072238,\"endTime\":1745072247},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"My stance with respect, teaching and learning.\",\"startTime\":1745072513,\"endTime\":1745072515},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It''s hard to capture in one minute. I have a lot to say about that, but if I \",\"startTime\":1745072515,\"endTime\":1745072517},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"boiled it down. \",\"startTime\":1745072517,\"endTime\":1745072520},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I would say that the job of a teacher is to ask great questions to.\",\"startTime\":1745072520,\"endTime\":1745072525},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Create or curate resources for students to create the conditions for learning. \",\"startTime\":1745072527,\"endTime\":1745072533},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And to model curiosity for students.\",\"startTime\":1745072533,\"endTime\":1745072536},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And then the job of the students is to do the work. They should be the ones \",\"startTime\":1745072536,\"endTime\":1745072539},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"working hard. They should be the ones feeling. \",\"startTime\":1745072539,\"endTime\":1745072542},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Challenged in class they.\",\"startTime\":1745072543,\"endTime\":1745072546},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Should be the ones talking especially to each other, using each other as resources and then they also should be asking. \",\"startTime\":1745072547,\"endTime\":1745072553},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Good questions, hard questions, and seeking the answers, often with guidance from the teacher and support from their peers as well. \",\"startTime\":1745072554,\"endTime\":1745072562},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I have two main flow activities that come to mind. The 1st is running which. \",\"startTime\":1745072600,\"endTime\":1745072604},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"To say it takes me the 1st 10 minutes or so usually not in the flow but I think. \",\"startTime\":1745072604,\"endTime\":1745072609},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Push myself beyond that the next.\",\"startTime\":1745072609,\"endTime\":1745072611},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Sometimes hours. So it feels really good about having a good day. Umm And then \",\"startTime\":1745072612,\"endTime\":1745072616},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"the other thing that I can really get lost in and really enjoy doing is is cooking. \",\"startTime\":1745072616,\"endTime\":1745072621},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So making dinner for myself and my family. \",\"startTime\":1745072621,\"endTime\":1745072625},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Umm, especially if I can have the kitchen and the space all to myself. And maybe \",\"startTime\":1745072626,\"endTime\":1745072629},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"if I can also. \",\"startTime\":1745072629,\"endTime\":1745072631},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Pop in some headphones and watch a show, some junky show, while I am chopping and sauteing and cooking up something delicious. That''s something that. \",\"startTime\":1745072631,\"endTime\":1745072640},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I really look forward to and can get lost in in my daily routine.\",\"startTime\":1745072641,\"endTime\":1745072645}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.447439+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.447439+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 178, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.430Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('78fb5887-6aa5-425b-84cc-30f314c3ff0d', 'bd47a56c-b275-4972-987f-30b0cd993f17', '114750', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.428889+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.428889+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 35, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:54.357Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('e46f7b23-8ce0-47c6-b187-65b00ca2565a', 'e6a3a52f-5383-4756-9c91-2b4068ee26e3', '138316', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Hi my name is Joseph Marvie. I am currently a middle school math teacher teaching \",\"startTime\":1745632283,\"endTime\":1745632286},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"7th and 8th grades and. \",\"startTime\":1745632286,\"endTime\":1745632289},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"I have a history of teaching elementary, middle, and high school.\",\"startTime\":1745632289,\"endTime\":1745632293},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"I''ve had a significant amount of experience with curriculum instruction, uh, kind of coaching uh, teachers through organizations like uh, National Math and Science Initiative and its illustrative mathematics. But throughout this time, \",\"startTime\":1745632293,\"endTime\":1745632306},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"I''ve been pretty invested in Ed tech. In fact, my own uh, background is in technology \",\"startTime\":1745632306,\"endTime\":1745632311},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"and, uh, kind of in the technology background. \",\"startTime\":1745632311,\"endTime\":1745632315},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"And that kind of path naturally took me.\",\"startTime\":1745632317,\"endTime\":1745632321},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"To kind of AI about five years ago and there''s been a lot of work that we''ve done. What I''m really curious about is how do we use AI right now? That''s been \",\"startTime\":1745632321,\"endTime\":1745632329},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"something that''s on my mind. \",\"startTime\":1745632329,\"endTime\":1745632333},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"So how do we use AI from a kind of a learner perspective, right, Where the learner first and the solution like all these AI solutions later. So how do we use AI \",\"startTime\":1745632335,\"endTime\":1745632346},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"to kind of create equity access and present high quality learning materials for that make accessibility both manageable for both the teacher and the student and also make sure that you are not compromising the relations. \",\"startTime\":1745632346,\"endTime\":1745632364},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Between the student and the teacher, so that it''s not just, you know, technology focus. \",\"startTime\":1745632364,\"endTime\":1745632369},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Umm, yeah. So that''s kind of my interest in kind of pursuing with the AI path \",\"startTime\":1745632369,\"endTime\":1745632372},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"right now. \",\"startTime\":1745632372,\"endTime\":1745632374},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Uh, my name is Yusuf. Uh, I''m currently a middle school math teacher.\",\"startTime\":1745632390,\"endTime\":1745632394},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Teaching 8th grade, that''s that''s my full time kind of job.\",\"startTime\":1745632394,\"endTime\":1745632399},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"In addition to it, I''m pretty heavily invested within my district kind of thinking about what AI looks like both in terms of just another technology, but in terms of. \",\"startTime\":1745632400,\"endTime\":1745632411},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"You know the AI policies. I''m a member of the AI Academic Honesty Committee. \",\"startTime\":1745632411,\"endTime\":1745632416},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Which is trying to create like kind of a protocol and a guideline for the school district of 30,000 about what engagement both from a learning teacher perspective looks like. I also work pretty intensely with the school district and trying \",\"startTime\":1745632417,\"endTime\":1745632432},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"to onboard the first student facing AI. \",\"startTime\":1745632432,\"endTime\":1745632437},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Product for the school district, which has gone great.\",\"startTime\":1745632438,\"endTime\":1745632442},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"So right now what''s on my mind and what I''m really trying to learn about is how do we use AI to create access? \",\"startTime\":1745632443,\"endTime\":1745632450},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"And at the same time bring rigorous learning without compromising the relationship between the student and the teacher. Not just like the student teacher relationship, \",\"startTime\":1745632451,\"endTime\":1745632461},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"but but also where the teacher is a facilitator of the learning. \",\"startTime\":1745632461,\"endTime\":1745632465},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"So not just, you know, printing worksheets, having more worksheets in the name of differentiation, but, uh. \",\"startTime\":1745632465,\"endTime\":1745632470},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so kind of really add that Nexus of.\",\"startTime\":1745632471,\"endTime\":1745632475},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Make How do we use this technology for creating a more equitable learning environment without compromising the rigor and the quality of the education at the same time? \",\"startTime\":1745632476,\"endTime\":1745632489},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Managing the teacher student relationship and actually using AI to deepen that rather than compromising that. \",\"startTime\":1745632490,\"endTime\":1745632498},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Umm, So as I think about umm, what you know, the stance in terms of teaching and learning? \",\"startTime\":1745632538,\"endTime\":1745632544},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Avoid the tropes about, you know, the facilitator and things like that. And \",\"startTime\":1745632544,\"endTime\":1745632548},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"they''re 100% true. A teacher is a facilitator. \",\"startTime\":1745632548,\"endTime\":1745632552},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"But I think where I my stance is in terms of the role of the teacher and the student is that as part of the spectrum, right? What the student teacher relationship \",\"startTime\":1745632552,\"endTime\":1745632560},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"looks like in one environment. So I worked in Title 1 environments is really \",\"startTime\":1745632560,\"endTime\":1745632564},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"highly populations. And I''m currently in a environment where it would be considered \",\"startTime\":1745632564,\"endTime\":1745632569},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"privileged environment. That relationship looks very different. Regardless, \",\"startTime\":1745632569,\"endTime\":1745632573},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"in all those environments, my job is to make the learning happen, right? So, \",\"startTime\":1745632573,\"endTime\":1745632577},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"and that happens with the. \",\"startTime\":1745632577,\"endTime\":1745632581},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"In between the completely understanding a the needs of the student and the community and the aspirations of the community and where the learning that you are responsible for fits in And what do you what role do you play in making it happen? \",\"startTime\":1745632583,\"endTime\":1745632599},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"So that that''s what I really think. I think it''s, it''s all within a spectrum, \",\"startTime\":1745632600,\"endTime\":1745632605},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"but fundamentally teacher is making responsible for finding ways for that learning to happen to have the transformational change, not just within a student, but within that, that the family and hopefully in the larger community as well. \",\"startTime\":1745632605,\"endTime\":1745632619},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"I think what should change is I don''t think. \",\"startTime\":1745632619,\"endTime\":1745632623},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Much should change in the sense of what I hope a teaching experience looks like, but I do think what it should like look like is. \",\"startTime\":1745632624,\"endTime\":1745632632},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"More ways that a teacher becomes that role model or that conduit for that connection. \",\"startTime\":1745632633,\"endTime\":1745632638},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Umm, and in terms of technology for that to do so, it can do all of it, but whatever role it plays. \",\"startTime\":1745632638,\"endTime\":1745632647},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"I''m just really excited to see what that could look like, especially in terms of instruction. It can do maybe the relationship, but it can definitely facilitate. \",\"startTime\":1745632649,\"endTime\":1745632656},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"The equity and accessibility of that instruction, and as I mentioned, what should stay the same, is that the where the teacher fits in that spectrum of how learning happens. \",\"startTime\":1745632657,\"endTime\":1745632668},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"Although I, I, it would be kind of hypocritical for me to accept it because I don''t get to do it as often. But there are very few things that kind of get \",\"startTime\":1745632701,\"endTime\":1745632709},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"me going as like even a, a, a mile or two mile run. So I was saying my flow \",\"startTime\":1745632709,\"endTime\":1745632714},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"activity would be running because it really helps me reset. It really brings \",\"startTime\":1745632714,\"endTime\":1745632718},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"up my energy levels. Something as small as a one mile run can really kind of \",\"startTime\":1745632718,\"endTime\":1745632722},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"change how my day is going. So I, I, I, I as much as I can, I, I would love \",\"startTime\":1745632722,\"endTime\":1745632726},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"to be outside. \",\"startTime\":1745632726,\"endTime\":1745632730},{\"speaker\":\"12020\",\"text\":\"I don''t get to do it that much, but I''ve been much better at it in the last two months and I hope to continue that. \",\"startTime\":1745632730,\"endTime\":1745632736}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.797969+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.797969+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 287, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.775Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('da3d477d-1f80-4d1f-acaa-d34c9bffe9b5', 'c9d72e87-97e2-4131-bf2e-7298453c0e52', '137943', '"[]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.858831+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.858831+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 45, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.841Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('f60c8474-b212-4c81-927a-938757746564', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '137348', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hello, My name''s Jeff Crawford.\",\"startTime\":1740784077,\"endTime\":1740784078},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I''m an educator who loves to facilitate learning. I think of myself as one \",\"startTime\":1740784078,\"endTime\":1740784084},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"who enjoys getting people to think and talk about things, whether that''s putting them in conversations with each other or engaging with tasks problems. \",\"startTime\":1740784084,\"endTime\":1740784096},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Or something that''s even like a project that''s important and big.\",\"startTime\":1740784099,\"endTime\":1740784103},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Where they''re put in a position.\",\"startTime\":1740784104,\"endTime\":1740784107},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That they have to try something or think about something differently than they''ve ever done before. \",\"startTime\":1740784109,\"endTime\":1740784114},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That is, I feel like I''m a.\",\"startTime\":1740784115,\"endTime\":1740784116},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Budding neuroscientist who''s learned that education is all about cultivating the brain. \",\"startTime\":1740784119,\"endTime\":1740784125},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I think of humans and the chemicals and the stuff that happens in our brain, and I want to help each learner at each stage in their life to grow. \",\"startTime\":1740784126,\"endTime\":1740784135},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And currently.\",\"startTime\":1740784136,\"endTime\":1740784137},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"What I hope to learn about through this time.\",\"startTime\":1740784137,\"endTime\":1740784139},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"With side by is to enjoy the richness of other people''s perspective so that I might get clearer on what I can do and how I can grow to be better when I''m an educator in any situation, whether it''s online writing through e-mail or text, or some messaging. \",\"startTime\":1740784140,\"endTime\":1740784159},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Or whether I''m facilitating in person, I want to get better.\",\"startTime\":1740784161,\"endTime\":1740784164},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"My stance is that each learner is capable of figuring things out on their own. \",\"startTime\":1740784202,\"endTime\":1740784210},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That the role of the teacher.\",\"startTime\":1740784211,\"endTime\":1740784213},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Is to create a safe place.\",\"startTime\":1740784213,\"endTime\":1740784215},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"For each learner to feel one where they are positioned as capable.\",\"startTime\":1740784215,\"endTime\":1740784221},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And two, that they have an identity, an agency that''s valuable.\",\"startTime\":1740784223,\"endTime\":1740784229},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And that three, that there''s other perspectives that are wonderful that would help their thinking, and that their own thinking in ways of doing things would help others. \",\"startTime\":1740784229,\"endTime\":1740784238},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I believe the role of the the teacher is rather a facilitator of learning.\",\"startTime\":1740784239,\"endTime\":1740784243},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And the role of the student is to press themselves as far as they can to do things that that are beyond what they''ve even imagined doing before, Like a little child who''s learning to walk or talk, They stumble through it. I think \",\"startTime\":1740784243,\"endTime\":1740784256},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that''s the role of the learner, And the role of the teacher is to encourage them and gently guide them. \",\"startTime\":1740784256,\"endTime\":1740784264},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And provide tasks and opportunities in safe places.\",\"startTime\":1740784267,\"endTime\":1740784271},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Where they can get out of their survival mode in their brain and they know that they have value and belonging in whatever community or group or space that they''re in and that they can grow. And that role as a facilitator is to help learners \",\"startTime\":1740784271,\"endTime\":1740784285},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"engage and feel welcome and invited into the learning to stimulate their challenge, their task. \",\"startTime\":1740784285,\"endTime\":1740784294},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Their way of thinking beyond what they''ve done before.\",\"startTime\":1740784297,\"endTime\":1740784301},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then to help the learner to synthesize their learning.\",\"startTime\":1740784303,\"endTime\":1740784306},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I enjoy climbing rock climbing, whether it''s bouldering down low with no ropes in a crash pad below me. \",\"startTime\":1740784325,\"endTime\":1740784332},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"In the gym or outside or on a rope where I have safety gear and I''m up high. \",\"startTime\":1740784332,\"endTime\":1740784338},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I enjoy the climbing, especially when it''s a new route or a problem that I''ve never done before. I find myself hyper focused. \",\"startTime\":1740784340,\"endTime\":1740784350},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"In feeling and enjoying the rock and the rest of the world goes away.\",\"startTime\":1740784350,\"endTime\":1740784354}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.934134+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.934134+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 243, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.893Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('36f9c35c-f2b2-47a1-b0d5-9de8fa2a6af2', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '138134', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1744664452,\"endTime\":1744664453},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Is that avocado toast?\",\"startTime\":1744664453,\"endTime\":1744664454},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"You''re always in the car. I''m sorry, I''m in the middle of eating lunch with \",\"startTime\":1744664453,\"endTime\":1744664455},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"my mom. \",\"startTime\":1744664455,\"endTime\":1744664458},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"No worries, no worries. I''m not always in the car, but lately, yes, a lot.\",\"startTime\":1744664459,\"endTime\":1744664463},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Just between things.\",\"startTime\":1744664464,\"endTime\":1744664465},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Is it moving?\",\"startTime\":1744664464,\"endTime\":1744664467},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, it''s moving, dropping stuff off and we took a load of goodwill and my wife said she wanted to go and this is the time of the day at work. I''m like, but \",\"startTime\":1744664466,\"endTime\":1744664472},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I have a 2:00. \",\"startTime\":1744664472,\"endTime\":1744664475},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"So we get to, we get to chat this way.\",\"startTime\":1744664476,\"endTime\":1744664478},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"No, this counts.\",\"startTime\":1744664478,\"endTime\":1744664480},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I don''t count.\",\"startTime\":1744664479,\"endTime\":1744664480},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"No. I mean it counts, but I don''t care if you''re in the car. You could call \",\"startTime\":1744664481,\"endTime\":1744664484},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"me from like a forest and I wouldn''t care. You know what I mean? \",\"startTime\":1744664484,\"endTime\":1744664487},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I know, I know. I hear you there. Oh, how are you today?\",\"startTime\":1744664488,\"endTime\":1744664492},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Good, I''m home visiting my family.\",\"startTime\":1744664494,\"endTime\":1744664495},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"This is my last meeting of the day, and then I think I''m gonna take a little time and, umm, go walk my dog in a park and stuff and like, hang out. \",\"startTime\":1744664496,\"endTime\":1744664503},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Good for you, good for you.\",\"startTime\":1744664503,\"endTime\":1744664505},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And where is home with family?\",\"startTime\":1744664506,\"endTime\":1744664508},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, wait, Petaluma, CA.\",\"startTime\":1744664506,\"endTime\":1744664509},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, got you.\",\"startTime\":1744664509,\"endTime\":1744664510},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Wait, so I''ve greeted you then press more?\",\"startTime\":1744664513,\"endTime\":1744664517},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I was just killed.\",\"startTime\":1744664518,\"endTime\":1744664519},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Oh my God, AI has totally changed my whole life.\",\"startTime\":1744664521,\"endTime\":1744664523},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Nice. What''s one way?\",\"startTime\":1744664523,\"endTime\":1744664527},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Honestly, I can do a lot more. Oh, actually, the most meaningful way that it''s \",\"startTime\":1744664529,\"endTime\":1744664532},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"changed my life actually does mean a lot to me. \",\"startTime\":1744664532,\"endTime\":1744664535},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"In a in a pre AI creating like structured deliverables and like plans like for people was really hard for me. Like a huge part of my job is like, excuse me, \",\"startTime\":1744664536,\"endTime\":1744664544},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"sorry. \",\"startTime\":1744664544,\"endTime\":1744664548},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"A huge part of my job is creating like structural structured content plans. \",\"startTime\":1744664550,\"endTime\":1744664553},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"So it''s like I like or, or deliverables like that where like I engage with a client, I learn about them and I need to make recommendations for them to like do a bunch of things. And I''m just always, my brain has always struggled to \",\"startTime\":1744664553,\"endTime\":1744664564},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"organize information. \",\"startTime\":1744664564,\"endTime\":1744664568},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"In that way, I just want to talk to people and I want to tell them things and I want to share things with them. I''ve always struggled to translate my raw \",\"startTime\":1744664570,\"endTime\":1744664575},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"thought into like. \",\"startTime\":1744664575,\"endTime\":1744664578},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Structure formatted deliverable, my raw talk dump thing and then ask AI to put it into a structured format for me and it will. And it''s like and it looks so \",\"startTime\":1744664583,\"endTime\":1744664592},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"good and it it''s so fast and it makes communication with my clients so easy and I''m just so grateful for that. \",\"startTime\":1744664592,\"endTime\":1744664600},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, that is so.\",\"startTime\":1744664600,\"endTime\":1744664602},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"What about you?\",\"startTime\":1744664601,\"endTime\":1744664602},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s hilarious because I''m doing almost the same type of thing. My day-to-day \",\"startTime\":1744664603,\"endTime\":1744664607},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"biggest win is I am. \",\"startTime\":1744664607,\"endTime\":1744664610},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And I did it because and I even did a post and I said.\",\"startTime\":1744664612,\"endTime\":1744664614},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Adding structure. Whose job is it? And I just got my thoughts out on, uh, what \",\"startTime\":1744664617,\"endTime\":1744664622},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I was thinking. And that''s my general thing I''ve been doing in my day-to-day. \",\"startTime\":1744664622,\"endTime\":1744664626},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Uh, I''ll use my Otter or some robot to record or just hit record on my phone. \",\"startTime\":1744664626,\"endTime\":1744664630},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And then from there I''ll record and then take and dump that into one of my robots. \",\"startTime\":1744664630,\"endTime\":1744664634},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And umm, it was great because it''s just taking and adding structure. And that \",\"startTime\":1744664634,\"endTime\":1744664638},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"was, that was my reflection even at the time, which is like now double meta is that. \",\"startTime\":1744664638,\"endTime\":1744664646},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m using it and I can let go of the, you know, like when you''re writing a book, for example, or blog post. \",\"startTime\":1744664648,\"endTime\":1744664654},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"MMM.\",\"startTime\":1744664650,\"endTime\":1744664651},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Or five paragraph paper when the way that we learn, like I learn in high school was here''s the title. And then you need to have your internal paragraph and \",\"startTime\":1744664656,\"endTime\":1744664663},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"then you have your main thesis and then you need to have three paragraphs and you''re like, Oh, I don''t know what my main thesis is that structure, the title or the, the thing we get hung up on that because it comes linearly first. And \",\"startTime\":1744664663,\"endTime\":1744664674},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744664666,\"endTime\":1744664666},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"so I''ve been letting go of that structure and just talking and getting like you said, you want to have conversations. So I''ll be chatting with my AI bots \",\"startTime\":1744664674,\"endTime\":1744664682},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"by just like hitting. \",\"startTime\":1744664682,\"endTime\":1744664685},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Forward and getting the transcript and sometimes I''ll do it straight into the AI bot but I like it better. \",\"startTime\":1744664685,\"endTime\":1744664691},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"As I''m driving or walking, I''ll just be like reflection, thinking and talking about something because I know I go all over the place. And then I''m letting \",\"startTime\":1744664691,\"endTime\":1744664699},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"go of the wondering about the structure, like you said, about what the title is or what The thing is. And then I let it get some cool stuff out of it and \",\"startTime\":1744664699,\"endTime\":1744664707},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"then help me to move to structure. And if I know the structure already, then \",\"startTime\":1744664707,\"endTime\":1744664711},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I get there. But like what you''re saying. So that was really similar. \",\"startTime\":1744664711,\"endTime\":1744664715},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"It''s so helpful. I just have such raw dialogue brain and it''s so hard for me \",\"startTime\":1744664716,\"endTime\":1744664720},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"to put it into anyways. OK, do we? \",\"startTime\":1744664720,\"endTime\":1744664724},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, same thing.\",\"startTime\":1744664725,\"endTime\":1744664726},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s a fun fact about me too. Would you call it something dialogue brain? \",\"startTime\":1744664727,\"endTime\":1744664730},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Raw dialogue brain? \",\"startTime\":1744664730,\"endTime\":1744664733},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Wait, write dialogue frame and hit OK.\",\"startTime\":1744664733,\"endTime\":1744664736},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, alright. What are some things that shape how you learn?\",\"startTime\":1744664737,\"endTime\":1744664741},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Umm, do you answer or do I answer?\",\"startTime\":1744664743,\"endTime\":1744664746},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Ask your partner. So I''m asking you, what are some things, some things cast \",\"startTime\":1744664747,\"endTime\":1744664750},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that shape how you learn? \",\"startTime\":1744664750,\"endTime\":1744664753},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"How the information is presented to me and also experience. I''m so sensitive \",\"startTime\":1744664755,\"endTime\":1744664760},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"to how somebody presents information if I get the slightest whiff that they''re trying to convince me or I feel manipulated and become hostile to receiving information. I''m so aware that I function this way emotionally. If somebody \",\"startTime\":1744664760,\"endTime\":1744664773},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744664761,\"endTime\":1744664761},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"presents something to me with like. \",\"startTime\":1744664773,\"endTime\":1744664778},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Intellectual humility where they''re like, well, this is what I think and it''s because of this. And then I read this and it like if they kind of like are really \",\"startTime\":1744664780,\"endTime\":1744664785},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"good at. \",\"startTime\":1744664785,\"endTime\":1744664788},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Being like I think this and This is why and there and I''m like very receptive to it. But if someone is conveying information to me in a way where I can tell \",\"startTime\":1744664788,\"endTime\":1744664795},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"their. \",\"startTime\":1744664795,\"endTime\":1744664798},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"They have an agenda about wanting me to believe it or just like there''s a you know what I mean? There''s a way of presenting information where I. \",\"startTime\":1744664802,\"endTime\":1744664808},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"If I feel manipulated by someone, I immediately just don''t believe anything they say. And it''s like rhetorical strategies, certain rhetorical strategies. \",\"startTime\":1744664810,\"endTime\":1744664817},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"That people will employ to seem confident or to be convincing can trigger that feeling in me and then I just won''t believe them instead of and like I''m trying to get better about that instead of just being like, no. \",\"startTime\":1744664818,\"endTime\":1744664831},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I like it. I like it on press on with your ideas that the question is what are \",\"startTime\":1744664833,\"endTime\":1744664838},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"some things that shape how you learn? You''re talking about people and their \",\"startTime\":1744664838,\"endTime\":1744664842},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"transparency or manipulation. \",\"startTime\":1744664842,\"endTime\":1744664846},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"What about when it comes to learning tech like tech tools like How is technology shape you? \",\"startTime\":1744664846,\"endTime\":1744664853},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"It''s oh, just have to.\",\"startTime\":1744664850,\"endTime\":1744664852},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I just I just.\",\"startTime\":1744664853,\"endTime\":1744664855},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I don''t, I mean is the question how tech using technology is shaped how I learn? \",\"startTime\":1744664857,\"endTime\":1744664862},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Or is it how do I learn new technology? \",\"startTime\":1744664862,\"endTime\":1744664867},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Or how, how, how is technology shaped your identity as a learner? That''s \",\"startTime\":1744664866,\"endTime\":1744664869},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the question. \",\"startTime\":1744664869,\"endTime\":1744664872},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"It''s so hard for me to say because I''ve been using tech as long as I''ve been conscious. My dad put a computer in my room when I was like 6. \",\"startTime\":1744664872,\"endTime\":1744664881},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"And I''ve always, and I was like using an apple too when I was like barely able to write sentences. And I just never haven''t had. \",\"startTime\":1744664881,\"endTime\":1744664890},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I, I, I don''t know. I have no idea. There''s no before and after in my life. \",\"startTime\":1744664893,\"endTime\":1744664895},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I don''t know. \",\"startTime\":1744664895,\"endTime\":1744664897},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Well, when you think about that is, is that like partner tool right there with you so long in your life? How do you think that that''s shaped who you are as \",\"startTime\":1744664899,\"endTime\":1744664906},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"a learner or how you see yourself as a learner? \",\"startTime\":1744664906,\"endTime\":1744664910},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Hmm, I guess it''s made me not believe things at face value and want to explore them more always. I always assume there''s more to know because I have always \",\"startTime\":1744664917,\"endTime\":1744664928},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"had this connection to more resources that was very accessible to me. \",\"startTime\":1744664928,\"endTime\":1744664934},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"So instead of someone says something and I''m like OK and believe them, I''m like, oh, that could be true for you and then I''ll just keep looking for more. \",\"startTime\":1744664935,\"endTime\":1744664945},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Which I think is annoying to people, but.\",\"startTime\":1744664946,\"endTime\":1744664948},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I like it.\",\"startTime\":1744664947,\"endTime\":1744664947},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"No, I think some people really appreciate that and enjoy it and I think others are catching up. Maybe they didn''t grow up with one in their their their little \",\"startTime\":1744664953,\"endTime\":1744664958},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"kid bedroom. \",\"startTime\":1744664958,\"endTime\":1744664961},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, my dad was a very early adopter of computers.\",\"startTime\":1744664961,\"endTime\":1744664964},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s cool, that''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1744664965,\"endTime\":1744664966},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"What are some things that shape how you learn? Or do we just do you tell me \",\"startTime\":1744664967,\"endTime\":1744664968},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, I''m first.\",\"startTime\":1744664967,\"endTime\":1744664968},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"no. \",\"startTime\":1744664968,\"endTime\":1744664970},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I don''t know what to say on yours.\",\"startTime\":1744664971,\"endTime\":1744664972},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Mine says the same thing as yours, so we both got the same instructions which makes it. \",\"startTime\":1744664973,\"endTime\":1744664977},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That makes me wanna. Oh, that''s just a back and forth then, OK.\",\"startTime\":1744664978,\"endTime\":1744664982},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744664982,\"endTime\":1744664983},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Shaping my learning.\",\"startTime\":1744664984,\"endTime\":1744664985},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think it''s a lot of those experiences even with technology and AI tools that I can go faster with technology. Like you were just mentioned, writing out that \",\"startTime\":1744664987,\"endTime\":1744664995},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Lesson plan or the slide deck construct or whatever it is like that''s been super helpful even in the. \",\"startTime\":1744664995,\"endTime\":1744665003},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Copying and pasting or having files or building a template or organizing things, it feels like I can. \",\"startTime\":1744665005,\"endTime\":1744665011},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"It shapes how I learn is that I can step back and know that it''s already saved and I don''t have to remember it all and then and now even that helps create the structure, even file systems or way to organize my thinking. It helps me \",\"startTime\":1744665012,\"endTime\":1744665021},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"to organize my thinking. \",\"startTime\":1744665021,\"endTime\":1744665024},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think that''s a huge component, but I think along the way it''s been, and you alluded to this is new things and trying it and testing it has put me at that learner position of I''m going to fail a lot and I''m going to break stuff and it''s going to crash. And I don''t know what''s going to really happen. I don''t \",\"startTime\":1744665024,\"endTime\":1744665039},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1744665039,\"endTime\":1744665039},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"know how to use it yet, but I, I don''t even have an idea. And I''m guessing it''s, \",\"startTime\":1744665039,\"endTime\":1744665043},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"it''s big like your number would be of how many new apps or new programs that we''ve learned or try to assimilate. And then like you''ve gone down that path \",\"startTime\":1744665043,\"endTime\":1744665050},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"of, oh, it''s. \",\"startTime\":1744665050,\"endTime\":1744665054},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Program. It''s a new thing and a new system, a new whatever.\",\"startTime\":1744665057,\"endTime\":1744665059},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"New e-mail, all of that. So I think that shaped me a lot and somewhat it''s put \",\"startTime\":1744665059,\"endTime\":1744665063},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"me a little bit jaded. Now I''m finding like, oh, come on, don''t do that to me. \",\"startTime\":1744665063,\"endTime\":1744665066},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it was not in 1984. Seriously, folks. \",\"startTime\":1744665066,\"endTime\":1744665070},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665071,\"endTime\":1744665073},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Umm, because I''ve had had a lot of that experience, but also allows me to.\",\"startTime\":1744665072,\"endTime\":1744665075},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Easily adapt to I think new programs or tech stuff and.\",\"startTime\":1744665076,\"endTime\":1744665080},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Shaped how I learn is that I also I don''t want to be inquisitive. I want problems \",\"startTime\":1744665081,\"endTime\":1744665084},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"in front of me. I want to use new tools to figure it out and do new things. \",\"startTime\":1744665084,\"endTime\":1744665086},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think that''s a. \",\"startTime\":1744665086,\"endTime\":1744665089},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I, I see now also I can click more and there''s like these additional, there''s additional ideas and the question that I didn''t see before. Sorry, I didn''t \",\"startTime\":1744665088,\"endTime\":1744665094},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"mean to interrupt. \",\"startTime\":1744665094,\"endTime\":1744665098},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, no worries, no worries. You''re you''re a new user with this stuff.\",\"startTime\":1744665098,\"endTime\":1744665102},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, I''m good with that question. Oh, by the way, mine says partner ready \",\"startTime\":1744665102,\"endTime\":1744665107},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1744665104,\"endTime\":1744665104},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"right now as soon as you hit next. And then when I hit it, if I hit back, for \",\"startTime\":1744665107,\"endTime\":1744665111},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"example, now it''ll tell you waiting like I wanted to go back and I have to wait for you to go back to the last card, otherwise we can''t go forward. \",\"startTime\":1744665111,\"endTime\":1744665119},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1744665123,\"endTime\":1744665123},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"But OK, now we''ll go forward.\",\"startTime\":1744665125,\"endTime\":1744665126},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"So we have got it. Oh, got it. OK, sorry I was reading the questions simultaneously. \",\"startTime\":1744665126,\"endTime\":1744665130},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"No worries, but that gives me a note that we need to edit this as a new lesson because this one does say take turns sharing with your partner. \",\"startTime\":1744665130,\"endTime\":1744665137},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665137,\"endTime\":1744665138},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"The other question was confusing ''cause it. The other question was confusing \",\"startTime\":1744665139,\"endTime\":1744665141},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"''cause it. \",\"startTime\":1744665141,\"endTime\":1744665144},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"If it''s giving us both the same prompt, it''s. It was confusing. Like whatever \",\"startTime\":1744665145,\"endTime\":1744665148},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I''ll put my thoughts down. \",\"startTime\":1744665148,\"endTime\":1744665151},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah. No, no, exactly. I''m with you.\",\"startTime\":1744665153,\"endTime\":1744665156},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Oops, I just came back by accident. I''m so sorry.\",\"startTime\":1744665155,\"endTime\":1744665158},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We have to go back. Yeah, no, but it does say ask your partner. So instead of \",\"startTime\":1744665159,\"endTime\":1744665162},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"OK, yeah, but.\",\"startTime\":1744665159,\"endTime\":1744665162},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"take turns sharing that either, I''ll change the prompt on that. \",\"startTime\":1744665162,\"endTime\":1744665166},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Your thoughts are your what time?\",\"startTime\":1744665165,\"endTime\":1744665167},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''ll change the prompt to be like the third card, take turn sharing, or make it an actual listener in question or cards. \",\"startTime\":1744665170,\"endTime\":1744665179},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yes, yeah, ''cause it''s.\",\"startTime\":1744665175,\"endTime\":1744665177},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"When it says share your thoughts on your partner''s prompt, I''m like why isn''t my partner''s prompt if I''m looking at it but it''s both of our prompts? If we \",\"startTime\":1744665180,\"endTime\":1744665186},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"both are seeing the same prompt, making the distinction there doesn''t quite make sense. \",\"startTime\":1744665186,\"endTime\":1744665191},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Good feedback.\",\"startTime\":1744665191,\"endTime\":1744665192},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, what are some pros and cons?\",\"startTime\":1744665196,\"endTime\":1744665198},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"What is the?\",\"startTime\":1744665197,\"endTime\":1744665198},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Of using AI in education.\",\"startTime\":1744665201,\"endTime\":1744665203},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Uh, this? I have no idea because I''ve never tried to do it, obviously.\",\"startTime\":1744665205,\"endTime\":1744665212},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Well, you do know because you''re a learner, A lifelong learner, and education is supposed to be about helping learners get better at learning. So if you think \",\"startTime\":1744665211,\"endTime\":1744665218},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"about AI now, today, what are some pros and cons if you''re thinking about even what you know about yourself as a learner or what you would hope others would do? \",\"startTime\":1744665218,\"endTime\":1744665230},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. I think the pros are what exactly what you and I talked about. I think \",\"startTime\":1744665230,\"endTime\":1744665234},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"AI can be a dialectical partner that can have conversations with you and some people learn a lot better that way versus just reading. It''s a more dynamic \",\"startTime\":1744665234,\"endTime\":1744665243},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"learning experience. Possibly Cons would be when it''s tempting to use AI as \",\"startTime\":1744665243,\"endTime\":1744665247},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"a shortcut instead of an expansive tool, It''s like just like making it do the work for you and not learning anything but just skipping through like. \",\"startTime\":1744665247,\"endTime\":1744665256},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"And cons would also at this point be accuracy issues. It''s like great to dialogue \",\"startTime\":1744665256,\"endTime\":1744665260},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"with an AI but if it just starts hallucinating information at you and you''re learning weird and wrong things, that''s not so good. \",\"startTime\":1744665260,\"endTime\":1744665268},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665269,\"endTime\":1744665269},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665269,\"endTime\":1744665270},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m totally with you pros about going faster, assimilating knowledge, having so much at your fingertips. I think it helps really focus on some things if \",\"startTime\":1744665272,\"endTime\":1744665280},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"we allow it to. Like you were just talking about having the AI tool help you \",\"startTime\":1744665280,\"endTime\":1744665285},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"to create structure and what a wonderful place to know that you can just play and. \",\"startTime\":1744665285,\"endTime\":1744665293},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1744665297,\"endTime\":1744665297},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"As you were talking about, you can just engage in rich conversation even with yourself, and then you could take that rich conversation without being mindfully trying to fill in all the details about structure. But then you can have AI \",\"startTime\":1744665298,\"endTime\":1744665310},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"get that structure for you. \",\"startTime\":1744665310,\"endTime\":1744665313},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Kids writing papers, helping encourage them on all those things. There''s so \",\"startTime\":1744665315,\"endTime\":1744665318},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"many pros I can see. And then the cons. \",\"startTime\":1744665318,\"endTime\":1744665321},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m with you on that for inaccuracies, but I''m also seeing things like this one was really bothersome to me, Erica reported back from a group. \",\"startTime\":1744665322,\"endTime\":1744665329},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Women in AI.\",\"startTime\":1744665329,\"endTime\":1744665331},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"They''re finding that if even the AI tool thinks that you''re female.\",\"startTime\":1744665333,\"endTime\":1744665338},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Thinks that you''re a girl, You don''t even know for sure that you''re a girl, that the responses, like with tech, are less sophisticated, even thinks you''re a girl. That is the bias, that gender bias that''s built into it. \",\"startTime\":1744665339,\"endTime\":1744665351},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Hmm, interesting.\",\"startTime\":1744665349,\"endTime\":1744665354},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"The bias is there. That''s really problematic. And then for me, I''ve seen some \",\"startTime\":1744665353,\"endTime\":1744665357},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"That''s the thing.\",\"startTime\":1744665356,\"endTime\":1744665358},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"other cons around bias, not like a gender bias, but a a reflection of who we are. The AI tools are just reflecting what we popularly believe or hold true \",\"startTime\":1744665357,\"endTime\":1744665365},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"or what''s out there. \",\"startTime\":1744665365,\"endTime\":1744665369},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And that that''s a, that''s a con. It shouldn''t just reflect it in an example \",\"startTime\":1744665371,\"endTime\":1744665375},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"for me in that regard was I was trying to get an AI tool to. \",\"startTime\":1744665375,\"endTime\":1744665380},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Do an adaptation of a lesson not too long ago. A really quality lesson and the \",\"startTime\":1744665380,\"endTime\":1744665383},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"AI. \",\"startTime\":1744665383,\"endTime\":1744665386},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Said to preload and pre teach, which was totally against the principles and the guidelines and the teaching of the whole of the curriculum. And the lesson \",\"startTime\":1744665388,\"endTime\":1744665396},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665391,\"endTime\":1744665391},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"is is a wonderful lesson already about inviting kids in and and activating their previous knowledge, but welcoming them in at welcome welcome mean them in as a learner and the the AI tool totally took what was common out there. Oh, you \",\"startTime\":1744665396,\"endTime\":1744665410},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"got to tell them what to do and do it this way and you''re like. \",\"startTime\":1744665410,\"endTime\":1744665414},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"No, please no. And so I think there''s those cons is that we as educators and \",\"startTime\":1744665415,\"endTime\":1744665419},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"as students both are getting this output from the AI tools and we generally take it at face value is that it''s right because it''s authoritative and it sounds right or it looks good. And I think that''s really damaging if we''re not really \",\"startTime\":1744665419,\"endTime\":1744665431},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"careful consumers, critical consumers with that. \",\"startTime\":1744665431,\"endTime\":1744665435},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah. That''s a really good point.\",\"startTime\":1744665436,\"endTime\":1744665438},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Now, OK, I''m going to press more and.\",\"startTime\":1744665440,\"endTime\":1744665443},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We hit.\",\"startTime\":1744665445,\"endTime\":1744665446},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And we did identity and agency, we talked about using it for us.\",\"startTime\":1744665448,\"endTime\":1744665453},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"So we can we get it? I didn''t even think about privacy, to be honest.\",\"startTime\":1744665450,\"endTime\":1744665455},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Hmm, alright. Well, maybe we''ll have to think more on that, OK.\",\"startTime\":1744665457,\"endTime\":1744665461},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Scenario problem solved together. How would you best respond to this situation? \",\"startTime\":1744665468,\"endTime\":1744665473},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Uh, uh.\",\"startTime\":1744665470,\"endTime\":1744665470},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I''m like, I would just say we''re not going to do that. Thank you. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1744665473,\"endTime\":1744665477},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I just don''t like, I just don''t think it''s healthy for students. I don''t think \",\"startTime\":1744665479,\"endTime\":1744665483},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"it''s healthy for young people to feel monitored at risk of punishment like. \",\"startTime\":1744665483,\"endTime\":1744665488},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"That''s not the right way to support a growing mind. Like that''s just such bad, \",\"startTime\":1744665489,\"endTime\":1744665493},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"a bad value system to instill in them that like you should do the right thing because you''re being watched and not because. \",\"startTime\":1744665493,\"endTime\":1744665500},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I''m going to show you the benefit of the positive benefit to your life, of developing a value system that you live, that you embody like I want. \",\"startTime\":1744665500,\"endTime\":1744665509},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Students to pay attention because learning is joyful for them and they see the benefits that learning brings to their lives. Like that''s what I want to encourage \",\"startTime\":1744665510,\"endTime\":1744665518},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"and students or would want to encourage in students, I don''t want students. \",\"startTime\":1744665518,\"endTime\":1744665522},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"To feel like they have to pay attention and they''ll be punished. That''s such \",\"startTime\":1744665523,\"endTime\":1744665526},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"a terrible value system. Terrible, terrible. There''s so many reasons. I would \",\"startTime\":1744665526,\"endTime\":1744665528},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"just be like, we''re not doing that. \",\"startTime\":1744665528,\"endTime\":1744665531},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think my question to surface that would be right away is how is this going to monitor and what feedback will it give kids? Like tell me more, tell me more \",\"startTime\":1744665532,\"endTime\":1744665542},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665540,\"endTime\":1744665541},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"about how this works because if the feedback is. \",\"startTime\":1744665542,\"endTime\":1744665546},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Pass. Your eyes aren''t on the screen and that''s what it''s saying. Or you''re \",\"startTime\":1744665546,\"endTime\":1744665550},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"getting marks for not paying attention that way or. \",\"startTime\":1744665550,\"endTime\":1744665554},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"It''s a negative. We caught you because you weren''t engaging that way versus \",\"startTime\":1744665555,\"endTime\":1744665557},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665555,\"endTime\":1744665556},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the. \",\"startTime\":1744665557,\"endTime\":1744665560},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Flip flop where it was maybe afterwards, and it gave a summary of oh, Cass, here''s a summary of the cool things that you were saying. We noticed XY and \",\"startTime\":1744665560,\"endTime\":1744665567},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Z and. \",\"startTime\":1744665567,\"endTime\":1744665570},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like I don''t know what they''re talking about for this AI tool that monitors student engagement like. \",\"startTime\":1744665570,\"endTime\":1744665575},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s it''s a good point that I immediately assumed it would be punitive though. When you''re like, how are they going to monitor? And I was like, Oh \",\"startTime\":1744665574,\"endTime\":1744665582},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"yeah, what if it''s like noticing things and asking questions and like helping guide the student? What if it''s like we noticed your eyes are on the screen. \",\"startTime\":1744665582,\"endTime\":1744665589},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Is everything OK? And, and me personally, when I''m listening, I fidget and, \",\"startTime\":1744665589,\"endTime\":1744665593},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"and like, I''m so aware of this, but like when I''m really listening to someone, I like have to fidget with something and like, I''m like, I look away and I''m like listening and fidgeting. Like that''s my listening mode. But sometimes it. \",\"startTime\":1744665593,\"endTime\":1744665604},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"People is I''m not paying attention.\",\"startTime\":1744665604,\"endTime\":1744665606},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Hey, hey, I have a meeting out here. Sorry.\",\"startTime\":1744665607,\"endTime\":1744665611},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Same. No worries.\",\"startTime\":1744665612,\"endTime\":1744665614},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Umm, I uh, uh, it sometimes reads to people as me not paying attention, but I''m actually deep paying attention. That''s what it''s a signal of and if some \",\"startTime\":1744665613,\"endTime\":1744665619},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"It''s funny that you''re that way.\",\"startTime\":1744665614,\"endTime\":1744665616},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"monitoring tool was like. \",\"startTime\":1744665619,\"endTime\":1744665622},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Just helping, you know, just being like, hey, we''re noticing this or can we do this? Or what if we do it this way? Like it could be really positive assistant. \",\"startTime\":1744665623,\"endTime\":1744665629},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I didn''t even think of that. I just assumed it would be punitive. \",\"startTime\":1744665629,\"endTime\":1744665633},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Because the popular culture is, that''s how we use. That''s what monitors student \",\"startTime\":1744665635,\"endTime\":1744665638},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"engagement means, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1744665638,\"endTime\":1744665640},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, totally.\",\"startTime\":1744665640,\"endTime\":1744665641},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I''m so sorry. Whoop. I Oh, there you are. I dropped the screen really quick. \",\"startTime\":1744665643,\"endTime\":1744665645},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And.\",\"startTime\":1744665643,\"endTime\":1744665643},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"You''re back. \",\"startTime\":1744665645,\"endTime\":1744665647},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh by the way for future ones, because sometimes the words are like a lot on the screen. If you just touch the screen not on the words the they go away. \",\"startTime\":1744665649,\"endTime\":1744665657},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I I figured that out. But I just like accidentally like because my screen \",\"startTime\":1744665656,\"endTime\":1744665660},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"is broken. I accidentally like moved the camera, but now you''re back. \",\"startTime\":1744665660,\"endTime\":1744665665},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, got it, got it. It''s all good.\",\"startTime\":1744665666,\"endTime\":1744665668},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1744665668,\"endTime\":1744665668},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think also along that way, if the scenario is your school, your school''s considering adopting a new AI tool that monitors student engagement during online classes. \",\"startTime\":1744665668,\"endTime\":1744665678},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I would, I would be asking questions about, OK, so who like what''s the criteria that you''re using to measure engagement? And is this, is this what teachers \",\"startTime\":1744665679,\"endTime\":1744665687},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"are doing and what students are doing? And is it to facilitate and is it in \",\"startTime\":1744665687,\"endTime\":1744665692},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"a positive or is this a deficit minded approach? Like I would want to know and \",\"startTime\":1744665692,\"endTime\":1744665696},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"ask those kind of questions because. \",\"startTime\":1744665696,\"endTime\":1744665701},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665702,\"endTime\":1744665703},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like even engagement. I''m so sorry if you''re doing a monitoring tool that is \",\"startTime\":1744665702,\"endTime\":1744665706},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"measuring student engagement but the teacher is using horrible practices or bad practices just want want want want want for an hour. Don''t put it on the \",\"startTime\":1744665706,\"endTime\":1744665715},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665714,\"endTime\":1744665715},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"kid monitoring student has to start. That''s why I''m like wasn''t going. What''s \",\"startTime\":1744665715,\"endTime\":1744665719},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665719,\"endTime\":1744665721},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the criteria? \",\"startTime\":1744665719,\"endTime\":1744665723},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"It''s like is this?\",\"startTime\":1744665722,\"endTime\":1744665723},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Gateway one is the teacher doing.\",\"startTime\":1744665724,\"endTime\":1744665727},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I''m like, is the student engaged? Sorry, go on.\",\"startTime\":1744665725,\"endTime\":1744665728},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no, I want to call it out. It doesn''t say gateway one for the monitoring \",\"startTime\":1744665728,\"endTime\":1744665731},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"tool. Is the teacher using effective teaching strategies, yes or no? If no, \",\"startTime\":1744665731,\"endTime\":1744665735},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"then don''t worry. \",\"startTime\":1744665735,\"endTime\":1744665738},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665736,\"endTime\":1744665738},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"It''s a really good, really good perspective. Really, really holistic, like whole \",\"startTime\":1744665740,\"endTime\":1744665743},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"picture thinking. It''s really good. \",\"startTime\":1744665743,\"endTime\":1744665747},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I love it.\",\"startTime\":1744665747,\"endTime\":1744665748},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, Hard ready.\",\"startTime\":1744665749,\"endTime\":1744665751},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Alright, umm.\",\"startTime\":1744665752,\"endTime\":1744665753},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"I know what I''ve taken from this conversation. I thought just that question \",\"startTime\":1744665753,\"endTime\":1744665756},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"we just had, I thought the way you were like. \",\"startTime\":1744665756,\"endTime\":1744665759},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"You responded by asking questions 1st and not leaving the judgment. I was like, \",\"startTime\":1744665760,\"endTime\":1744665763},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"that was a powerful learning moment for me to be like, like it was a really nice reminder like always ask questions and always think about the whole thing. \",\"startTime\":1744665763,\"endTime\":1744665769},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"And also this idea that. \",\"startTime\":1744665769,\"endTime\":1744665772},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"A tool like that is only capturing partial information. It''s like, OK, kids \",\"startTime\":1744665773,\"endTime\":1744665776},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"are struggling to pay attention. It might not just be the kid. Like, what are \",\"startTime\":1744665776,\"endTime\":1744665778},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"the other factors that we should be considering? I thought that was really powerful, \",\"startTime\":1744665778,\"endTime\":1744665781},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"and I feel like I learned from that. \",\"startTime\":1744665781,\"endTime\":1744665783},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it. I love it.\",\"startTime\":1744665785,\"endTime\":1744665786},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Thank you for the great conversation. And it was something right away early \",\"startTime\":1744665787,\"endTime\":1744665790},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"on in the conversation that I''m going to take away and try. \",\"startTime\":1744665790,\"endTime\":1744665794},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And you said that after you were doing your thing, you were going to just go for a walk. And and I was like, I don''t remember exactly what you said, but \",\"startTime\":1744665794,\"endTime\":1744665802},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744665801,\"endTime\":1744665802},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"taking that time to go for a walk, then meditate and think deeply about stuff like. \",\"startTime\":1744665802,\"endTime\":1744665809},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I need to do that more in my practice, so I like to do it. I know I should do \",\"startTime\":1744665811,\"endTime\":1744665815},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that. I have done that at times, but right now as I''m building routines again. \",\"startTime\":1744665815,\"endTime\":1744665819},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want to put that into practice and not just go from one thing to the next thing to the next thing, but be really mindful so. \",\"startTime\":1744665820,\"endTime\":1744665826},{\"speaker\":\"11978\",\"text\":\"Critical. OK, I''m going to hit end now.\",\"startTime\":1744665826,\"endTime\":1744665829},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right. Well, Bonita.\",\"startTime\":1744665828,\"endTime\":1744665830}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.979721+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.979721+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1383, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.931Z", "session_title": "Exploring the Relationship between Learning, Identity, and AI", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1700", "name": "Exploring the Relationship between Learning, Identity, and AI", "tags": [{"name": "draft-leaders"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('c3a78173-f994-411b-92c3-b18918d70baa', 'd2928ae9-b58d-4c7a-bc24-53d1567bba0e', '138665', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"My name is Tara. I am the associate director of a non profit that''s focused \",\"startTime\":1746752389,\"endTime\":1746752393},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"on exploring how. \",\"startTime\":1746752393,\"endTime\":1746752396},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"We can best empower Gen. Z voices to navigate AI''s impacts on learning career \",\"startTime\":1746752396,\"endTime\":1746752399},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"readiness. \",\"startTime\":1746752399,\"endTime\":1746752402},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"So a lot of what I do is host engagements with Gen. Z students and early and \",\"startTime\":1746752404,\"endTime\":1746752407},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"career professionals. \",\"startTime\":1746752407,\"endTime\":1746752410},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I also work on producing insight reports.\",\"startTime\":1746752411,\"endTime\":1746752414},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"Sometimes we do interviews of young people. We''re trying to showcase, you know, \",\"startTime\":1746752415,\"endTime\":1746752417},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"different ways that Gen. Z is. \",\"startTime\":1746752417,\"endTime\":1746752420},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"Really taking ownership of their learning your career using AI or on the flip side what their gaps and understanding are so we can better think about how to best equip them. \",\"startTime\":1746752423,\"endTime\":1746752432},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I really want to learn about other educators who are interested in how AI is impacting the learning model or the process of learning itself, not just specific tools. \",\"startTime\":1746752432,\"endTime\":1746752446},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I also want to learn about.\",\"startTime\":1746752450,\"endTime\":1746752452},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"Applications of AI that are really innovative and.\",\"startTime\":1746752454,\"endTime\":1746752458},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I also want to learn more about how to have conversations about AI bias.\",\"startTime\":1746752460,\"endTime\":1746752464},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"AI hallucinations and just some of these big questions about A IS limitations. \",\"startTime\":1746752465,\"endTime\":1746752470},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I think that my stance on learning would be that.\",\"startTime\":1746752490,\"endTime\":1746752492},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I really value learning environments that are collaborative and exploratory and really place emphasis on things like project based learning, interdisciplinary collaboration. \",\"startTime\":1746752492,\"endTime\":1746752503},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I feel strongly that play.\",\"startTime\":1746752503,\"endTime\":1746752505},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"As a concept is something that lends itself well to education.\",\"startTime\":1746752507,\"endTime\":1746752511},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I feel like.\",\"startTime\":1746752512,\"endTime\":1746752514},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"What else?\",\"startTime\":1746752517,\"endTime\":1746752518},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I feel like learners need to have room to make mistakes, fail, experiment, and that''s how they grow the most. \",\"startTime\":1746752518,\"endTime\":1746752524},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"This is also what the science of learning tells us. So I''m very passionate about \",\"startTime\":1746752525,\"endTime\":1746752529},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"the fact that the best way for people to learn is to be given hands on experiences with it as well as. \",\"startTime\":1746752529,\"endTime\":1746752536},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"Conceptual frameworks from their educator and I also feel strongly that.\",\"startTime\":1746752537,\"endTime\":1746752541},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"When we''re teaching students in school environments, it needs to be in ways that then map on to what their future lives are going to look like, so equipping them with real practical skills that will serve them. \",\"startTime\":1746752543,\"endTime\":1746752554},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"As lifelong learners and in career.\",\"startTime\":1746752555,\"endTime\":1746752557},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"My big flow activities is mixed martial arts so I I do jujitsu and kickboxing. \",\"startTime\":1746752575,\"endTime\":1746752579},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I really enjoy it. \",\"startTime\":1746752579,\"endTime\":1746752582},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I like being challenged, I like using my body. I also really enjoy cooking.\",\"startTime\":1746752582,\"endTime\":1746752588},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I enjoy spending time in nature. I love being at the ocean.\",\"startTime\":1746752589,\"endTime\":1746752593},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"I lived in Santa Barbara for a few years, so that kind of lifestyle is very, very near and dear to my heart. \",\"startTime\":1746752593,\"endTime\":1746752599},{\"speaker\":\"12042\",\"text\":\"And I also like to meditate, and I''m pretty spiritual.\",\"startTime\":1746752601,\"endTime\":1746752607}]"', '2025-05-09 18:49:19.575216+00', '2025-05-09 18:49:19.575216+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 196, "created_at": "2025-05-09T18:49:19.356Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('c2ec1559-c6c2-4dac-8c29-118e4e55e932', '6591e553-8215-4832-843f-a15c716b5863', '137782', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"What are you? What are you getting better at? I''m going to mute over again. \",\"startTime\":1742589433,\"endTime\":1742589437},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Hey, Mike.\",\"startTime\":1742589435,\"endTime\":1742589436},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"What are you getting better at besides AI fluency? \",\"startTime\":1742589437,\"endTime\":1742589440},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Bike skills, it''s the like the realize I put a lot of emphasis on endurance that was great, but now I got to mess around with being able to really dynamically move and not fall off bike. And so that building the body stuff that can do \",\"startTime\":1742589444,\"endTime\":1742589456},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"it without me thinking about it to like. \",\"startTime\":1742589456,\"endTime\":1742589460},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"All the parts being on a bike like that.\",\"startTime\":1742589461,\"endTime\":1742589463},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Very cool. Like, uh.\",\"startTime\":1742589464,\"endTime\":1742589466},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Body bike dynamics The athletics of of getting the bike to go where you want to go, when you want to go there. \",\"startTime\":1742589468,\"endTime\":1742589473},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, like in swimming, I can like I can get hit by crazy waves. I can, \",\"startTime\":1742589474,\"endTime\":1742589480},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I can like navigate swimming as if I am a part of water. \",\"startTime\":1742589480,\"endTime\":1742589483},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"And it''s wild. It''s like if you watch me in water and Dale on a bike, like that \",\"startTime\":1742589483,\"endTime\":1742589486},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"bike is a part of Dale''s body. Like he''s just, it''s a part. And that when you \",\"startTime\":1742589486,\"endTime\":1742589488},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"watch me on a bike, you''re like, oh. \",\"startTime\":1742589488,\"endTime\":1742589491},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Yeah, when Dale and I share like ripping around our little towns on our tiny BMX bikes with our friends, jumping off of things. \",\"startTime\":1742589493,\"endTime\":1742589499},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"And.\",\"startTime\":1742589494,\"endTime\":1742589494},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"I''m sure it''s like.\",\"startTime\":1742589499,\"endTime\":1742589500},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"10,000 hours, it''s just so much time with your friends saying like, I bet you can''t and you''d be like, let me try. So it''s a lot, it''s a lot of bike time. \",\"startTime\":1742589500,\"endTime\":1742589509},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1742589504,\"endTime\":1742589505},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And that like I was in a pool, you know, I think I got up to like 20 in \",\"startTime\":1742589509,\"endTime\":1742589513},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"a row spinning around underwater. Like I could do like 5 lengths of my pool \",\"startTime\":1742589513,\"endTime\":1742589516},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"underwater. I could do pool basketball. Like I, I just so much pool like water \",\"startTime\":1742589516,\"endTime\":1742589520},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"related things that my body and water does. \",\"startTime\":1742589520,\"endTime\":1742589523},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Or I''m like, yeah, I could do that.\",\"startTime\":1742589524,\"endTime\":1742589526},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Yeah, cool.\",\"startTime\":1742589527,\"endTime\":1742589528},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1742589527,\"endTime\":1742589528},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"It''ll transfer.\",\"startTime\":1742589528,\"endTime\":1742589530},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Listen to a podcast. The latest Joe Rogan podcast is with Josh Waitzkin, who \",\"startTime\":1742589531,\"endTime\":1742589535},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"is one of my favorite thinkers in the world. And so it''s funny hearing. \",\"startTime\":1742589535,\"endTime\":1742589540},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Joe be a kind of dummy, but like has a platform and Josh being like the smartest. \",\"startTime\":1742589541,\"endTime\":1742589546},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Speak like Thinker that I''ve run across and having them try to have a conversation is very silly. But they talk about bikes for a little while and they''re in a \",\"startTime\":1742589546,\"endTime\":1742589552},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"very, very frustrating way. \",\"startTime\":1742589552,\"endTime\":1742589555},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"So enjoy not listening to that.\",\"startTime\":1742589557,\"endTime\":1742589559},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Sounds good, but that is fun to hear people playing that. OK. Hey Mike, how \",\"startTime\":1742589559,\"endTime\":1742589564},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"All right, moving forward.\",\"startTime\":1742589562,\"endTime\":1742589564},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"has AI changed your work as an educator or leader of educators so far? \",\"startTime\":1742589564,\"endTime\":1742589569},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Nothing. I''m not really using it. I think that AI is a little spooky.\",\"startTime\":1742589573,\"endTime\":1742589578},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Do you mind if I ask what Spooks you the most?\",\"startTime\":1742589580,\"endTime\":1742589586},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"I mean, you''ve seen Terminator, right?\",\"startTime\":1742589585,\"endTime\":1742589587},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"More recently than not, yes I did finally see Terminator. But doesn''t he get \",\"startTime\":1742589589,\"endTime\":1742589592},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"like nice ''cause we I watched a bunch of them in a row. \",\"startTime\":1742589592,\"endTime\":1742589596},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"In character, out of character. I don''t think I''ve seen it.\",\"startTime\":1742589598,\"endTime\":1742589601},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I feel like because at first he''s like, it''s like, oh, but then it''s like he''s nice or something. \",\"startTime\":1742589602,\"endTime\":1742589605},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I guess to be a more authentic I, I was with hands last night at hands, he said. I don''t think we''re gonna get smarter. I think we''re gonna, we''re gonna \",\"startTime\":1742589607,\"endTime\":1742589612},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"get, we''re gonna get. \",\"startTime\":1742589612,\"endTime\":1742589614},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Complacent and lazy.\",\"startTime\":1742589616,\"endTime\":1742589618},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"That might be another.\",\"startTime\":1742589620,\"endTime\":1742589621},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Worst case.\",\"startTime\":1742589622,\"endTime\":1742589623},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I did have my first experience where I think someone was trying to push me to a voice agent. \",\"startTime\":1742589624,\"endTime\":1742589629},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"And so she was probably, it was good. I was like, sure, she saw me on a slack. \",\"startTime\":1742589629,\"endTime\":1742589634},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Engage with me like I think she would. You. You''re the leading edge people. \",\"startTime\":1742589635,\"endTime\":1742589637},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Engage with your people. \",\"startTime\":1742589637,\"endTime\":1742589640},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I was like, let''s ride this trampoline. Then she was like, don''t you want to \",\"startTime\":1742589640,\"endTime\":1742589643},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"meet up? And I was like, hey, I''m already on your calendar. And then it''s like, \",\"startTime\":1742589643,\"endTime\":1742589645},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"oh, sorry. And so I''m like, then the calendar invite came from a very weird \",\"startTime\":1742589645,\"endTime\":1742589648},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"e-mail. \",\"startTime\":1742589648,\"endTime\":1742589651},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Then she missed it and so I''m sitting on there and then two minutes and it''s, hey, I got to jump in my car. Would you be up for a call? \",\"startTime\":1742589652,\"endTime\":1742589658},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"And I was like this, it just didn''t feel authentic. I was so I''m fascinated. \",\"startTime\":1742589659,\"endTime\":1742589663},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I''m like, oh, would I have been on with her truly in her car? Would I have been \",\"startTime\":1742589663,\"endTime\":1742589667},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"on with someone pretending to be her on the phone? Would I be in on with a voice \",\"startTime\":1742589667,\"endTime\":1742589671},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"agent? And I kind of wanted to be like, hey, could I just like get on with your \",\"startTime\":1742589671,\"endTime\":1742589674},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"voice agent because this is super interesting. Even though I''m deeply annoyed \",\"startTime\":1742589674,\"endTime\":1742589678},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"that you''re a liar, like, and but that kind of thing of like. \",\"startTime\":1742589678,\"endTime\":1742589682},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"The feeling hadness of it, I was excited as an AI learner and I was really annoyed as like a human person who I take these calls because we we like genuinely are trying to connect about. \",\"startTime\":1742589685,\"endTime\":1742589695},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Educationy things or?\",\"startTime\":1742589695,\"endTime\":1742589697},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Could help each other in the world.\",\"startTime\":1742589697,\"endTime\":1742589698},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. So like that be being manipulated very well, will, is not what we \",\"startTime\":1742589698,\"endTime\":1742589703},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"want. But like we actually do want teachers to manipulate students to learn \",\"startTime\":1742589703,\"endTime\":1742589707},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"important shit. Like that''s kind of our job. \",\"startTime\":1742589707,\"endTime\":1742589711},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s it''s to manipulate in a direction.\",\"startTime\":1742589713,\"endTime\":1742589715},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1742589713,\"endTime\":1742589714},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Yes, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1742589715,\"endTime\":1742589716},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so let''s put it in front of teachers and not just advertisers.\",\"startTime\":1742589718,\"endTime\":1742589721},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes.\",\"startTime\":1742589722,\"endTime\":1742589724},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Yeah, let''s let''s click through a little bit because like this is kind of working and it''s hard. Of course, I''d love to have this conversation with you. \",\"startTime\":1742589723,\"endTime\":1742589729},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Yep, agreed. Agreed. You love it, love it.\",\"startTime\":1742589728,\"endTime\":1742589732}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.450309+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.450309+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 304, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.424Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('fd77b282-2177-42b0-8588-c1fc0b7386de', '0df8e918-c6f4-4615-aadf-42c257edb6f4', '137148', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"My name''s Kelly Spahn. I teach school math in Federal Way. I''m also an educational \",\"startTime\":1739914931,\"endTime\":1739914935},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"consultant for AI. \",\"startTime\":1739914935,\"endTime\":1739914938},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"And I really just hope to connect with people that are in AI and education and learn different use cases and just become the best educator I can be. \",\"startTime\":1739914938,\"endTime\":1739914949},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Dance for teaching and learning is very much learned by doing and being involved in an active participant. The person doing is the person learning. I am also \",\"startTime\":1739914994,\"endTime\":1739915004},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"got into teaching for the idea of liberation and freedom. So knowing that the \",\"startTime\":1739915004,\"endTime\":1739915009},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"more knowledge you have. \",\"startTime\":1739915009,\"endTime\":1739915013},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"The more power you have and justice knowledge to navigate the world and the systems that affect you. \",\"startTime\":1739915013,\"endTime\":1739915020},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"My primary flow activity is anything creative, so I love to create digital colleges using the Pinterest tool. I dabble in writing poetry and also cooking is one \",\"startTime\":1739915052,\"endTime\":1739915060},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"of my favorites. \",\"startTime\":1739915060,\"endTime\":1739915064}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.392276+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.392276+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 70, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.348Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('b7a85374-2963-4e30-b03a-542e077f727c', '59e9f386-0ecc-4201-99dd-802f7f8e7b33', '138260', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Who is this person?\",\"startTime\":1745506809,\"endTime\":1745506810},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Hey, how are you?\",\"startTime\":1745506811,\"endTime\":1745506813},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Hi friend.\",\"startTime\":1745506813,\"endTime\":1745506813},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I''m all right, Yeah. What time is it for you?\",\"startTime\":1745506813,\"endTime\":1745506816},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"It is.\",\"startTime\":1745506817,\"endTime\":1745506818},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"8:00 in the morning. 8:00 AM.\",\"startTime\":1745506818,\"endTime\":1745506820},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"That''s not the worst.\",\"startTime\":1745506821,\"endTime\":1745506822},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"No, I need what?\",\"startTime\":1745506826,\"endTime\":1745506828},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Like 4 in the afternoon or something there.\",\"startTime\":1745506830,\"endTime\":1745506832},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Great it is. And it''s sunny. It looks like it''s sunny for you too.\",\"startTime\":1745506832,\"endTime\":1745506838},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"This is our new place. We moved to Tucson. Yeah, it''s.\",\"startTime\":1745506837,\"endTime\":1745506841},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Look at that pool.\",\"startTime\":1745506840,\"endTime\":1745506841},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"You''re in Tucson.\",\"startTime\":1745506843,\"endTime\":1745506844},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Are boys happy?\",\"startTime\":1745506846,\"endTime\":1745506847},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Whoa. Aww.\",\"startTime\":1745506848,\"endTime\":1745506849},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we moved to Tucson, Anna and I.\",\"startTime\":1745506849,\"endTime\":1745506851},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I''m loving it. We''re loving it.\",\"startTime\":1745506851,\"endTime\":1745506853},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"This is this is mine right now.\",\"startTime\":1745506854,\"endTime\":1745506856},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1745506859,\"endTime\":1745506860},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"There she is.\",\"startTime\":1745506861,\"endTime\":1745506862},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, what''s her name?\",\"startTime\":1745506862,\"endTime\":1745506864},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Say hi.\",\"startTime\":1745506863,\"endTime\":1745506864},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Callie.\",\"startTime\":1745506867,\"endTime\":1745506868},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Callie, oh sweet puppy.\",\"startTime\":1745506868,\"endTime\":1745506870},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, how are you?\",\"startTime\":1745506870,\"endTime\":1745506872},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Dude, I''m all right. Life is like.\",\"startTime\":1745506873,\"endTime\":1745506876},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Challenging and exciting and there''s like opportunity and I''m trying to figure out. \",\"startTime\":1745506878,\"endTime\":1745506884},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"You know, like some some deep stuff around, like what is it that I''m really doing with my life? \",\"startTime\":1745506886,\"endTime\":1745506892},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"No big deal.\",\"startTime\":1745506895,\"endTime\":1745506896},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Just nothing much, you know? Gotta figure out a couple things, like where my \",\"startTime\":1745506899,\"endTime\":1745506902},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"socks go and I reorganize them. \",\"startTime\":1745506902,\"endTime\":1745506905},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Exactly. Exactly.\",\"startTime\":1745506905,\"endTime\":1745506906},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, is this is this because just life in your that place where you''re seeing all of the stuff, or are you getting like impetus from work things or? \",\"startTime\":1745506907,\"endTime\":1745506918},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I mean, my job, like my, my coaching gig continues to like be pretty lackluster as far as like, I mean, it pays. It''s like the opposite of what most people \",\"startTime\":1745506920,\"endTime\":1745506930},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like actually. I have the dream of what most people want. And it''s like my worst \",\"startTime\":1745506930,\"endTime\":1745506935},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"nightmare. Like my work expects nothing of me. Like no teacher wants to be with \",\"startTime\":1745506935,\"endTime\":1745506940},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"me. And my job is like, we''ll just keep paying, don''t leave. \",\"startTime\":1745506940,\"endTime\":1745506945},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I''m like but I want to actually do work.\",\"startTime\":1745506947,\"endTime\":1745506950},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I think I wanna actually like make the world a better place. That''s why I''m \",\"startTime\":1745506950,\"endTime\":1745506953},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"here. That''s what I do like, like I wanna. Yeah, yeah, yeah. So I, I like, that''s \",\"startTime\":1745506953,\"endTime\":1745506956},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Umm, that is so frustrating, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745506955,\"endTime\":1745506959},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"why this year I''ve taken on some outside of work stuff. That''s why I''m doing \",\"startTime\":1745506956,\"endTime\":1745506960},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"the BTC conference, which is like, awesome. I love doing that. It''s really good \",\"startTime\":1745506960,\"endTime\":1745506963},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"work. \",\"startTime\":1745506963,\"endTime\":1745506966},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Umm, I''m doing.\",\"startTime\":1745506970,\"endTime\":1745506972},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Roberts Consultants Workshop.\",\"startTime\":1745506972,\"endTime\":1745506974},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Which is really, really cool and teaching me a lot of things about just like what that looks like. \",\"startTime\":1745506976,\"endTime\":1745506980},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And I''ve been going to some new international conferences and like experiencing that I presented in Switzerland last month. \",\"startTime\":1745506981,\"endTime\":1745506989},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745506991,\"endTime\":1745506991},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s fine.\",\"startTime\":1745506992,\"endTime\":1745506994},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Umm and yeah, I just like, I think so there''s like 2 kind of big unknowns down the Pike right now for me just to like really get into it. They''re the kind \",\"startTime\":1745506995,\"endTime\":1745507003},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"of things where like, I don''t know where they''re gonna go. So like it''s, I feel \",\"startTime\":1745507003,\"endTime\":1745507007},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"nervous to like talk about them because. \",\"startTime\":1745507007,\"endTime\":1745507011},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I like, I don''t know if it''s just gonna like turn into nothing or if it''s gonna turn into something. Do you know what I mean? \",\"startTime\":1745507014,\"endTime\":1745507019},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Umm, but.\",\"startTime\":1745507020,\"endTime\":1745507021},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"One is I''m meeting with Peter in.\",\"startTime\":1745507021,\"endTime\":1745507025},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Prague in a couple weeks.\",\"startTime\":1745507027,\"endTime\":1745507029},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"To talk about joining his European team.\",\"startTime\":1745507030,\"endTime\":1745507033},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1745507035,\"endTime\":1745507035},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So I don''t know what that means. And I don''t like, I don''t want BTC to be my \",\"startTime\":1745507035,\"endTime\":1745507039},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"wife. It''s not like my wife, you know, But it''s also like a really great opportunity. \",\"startTime\":1745507039,\"endTime\":1745507043},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And Chase is like, why wouldn''t you do this? Like it''s kind of a no brainer, \",\"startTime\":1745507043,\"endTime\":1745507046},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507043,\"endTime\":1745507044},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"right? Yeah. And I was like, you don''t have a European team. And Peter was like, \",\"startTime\":1745507046,\"endTime\":1745507050},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Across Europe, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507049,\"endTime\":1745507051},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"that''s correct. \",\"startTime\":1745507050,\"endTime\":1745507054},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Like OK, he has two people in Denmark that just work in Denmark.\",\"startTime\":1745507057,\"endTime\":1745507062},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Right. I''m like, OK.\",\"startTime\":1745507067,\"endTime\":1745507068},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, I''m hearing so much of like the the space you''re in and I totally know what that''s like being in a district or with a school and you have a position. \",\"startTime\":1745507068,\"endTime\":1745507076},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I just started cashing in my sick days. I''m like, it''s fresh snow today. \",\"startTime\":1745507076,\"endTime\":1745507079},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I can go ski because none of you want me to be in your rooms or in your meetings. \",\"startTime\":1745507079,\"endTime\":1745507082},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And you don''t want to do any of the stuff that you said you wanted to do. We \",\"startTime\":1745507082,\"endTime\":1745507085},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"built out your plans, but you''re all like. \",\"startTime\":1745507085,\"endTime\":1745507088},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Or you, you switch plans up at the last minute and you don''t come to the meeting that you said you wanted to do to get these things done or do these and you''re like. \",\"startTime\":1745507090,\"endTime\":1745507099},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507094,\"endTime\":1745507096},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"What am I supposed to do? And then I''m also hearing.\",\"startTime\":1745507099,\"endTime\":1745507101},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507100,\"endTime\":1745507102},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Like there''s so many cool opportunities out there. It feels like the the land \",\"startTime\":1745507101,\"endTime\":1745507104},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"of hope where you''re like, oh, I could see that and I could see the Earth is Vista. But then every time you like move forward towards it, you see there''s \",\"startTime\":1745507104,\"endTime\":1745507110},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"this huge Cliff and you have no idea how to get there. You''re like, I don''t \",\"startTime\":1745507110,\"endTime\":1745507113},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"know if I could get there. \",\"startTime\":1745507113,\"endTime\":1745507116},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well, the.\",\"startTime\":1745507118,\"endTime\":1745507120},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And then this BTC thing sounds amazing because it''s great work. You''re well \",\"startTime\":1745507118,\"endTime\":1745507123},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"qualified, you would be amazing at it. It''s a good crew. It pays well. \",\"startTime\":1745507123,\"endTime\":1745507128},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1745507126,\"endTime\":1745507127},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"But it''s not your. Why? So how do you use that? If you use it to help get you \",\"startTime\":1745507128,\"endTime\":1745507131},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"or grow the way you want to grow? \",\"startTime\":1745507131,\"endTime\":1745507135},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Right, right. How do I use it as leverage? And like, I think what I figured \",\"startTime\":1745507135,\"endTime\":1745507139},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"out is like what I want to do right, ''cause like Graham was here, Graham Fletcher was here in February and kept just being like, Noble, what''s your North Star? \",\"startTime\":1745507139,\"endTime\":1745507146},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"CS GO.\",\"startTime\":1745507145,\"endTime\":1745507145},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Like where like what is it that''s driving you? Where are you going? And I was \",\"startTime\":1745507146,\"endTime\":1745507150},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like, honestly, I just love working with other coaches. Like I want to support \",\"startTime\":1745507150,\"endTime\":1745507154},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"other coaches that are like in a similar position where like this is where I always feel like I''m at my best is when I''m able to support other coaches and like that''s not really a thing that''s out there very much right now. It''s like. \",\"startTime\":1745507154,\"endTime\":1745507165},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"How do I develop myself as like the coaches coach specializing in like elementary school math coaches? Like that''s the niche right there. And it''s something that \",\"startTime\":1745507166,\"endTime\":1745507174},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I do feel really passionate about, but then like I also feel really passionate about like parent education and like. \",\"startTime\":1745507174,\"endTime\":1745507183},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"You know, like working with students, like all these other things, right? So \",\"startTime\":1745507184,\"endTime\":1745507188},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I''m like, is that gonna pigeonhole me into a place where, like, anyway, so it''s just a lot of questions. It''s all exciting. It''s all really good stuff. And \",\"startTime\":1745507188,\"endTime\":1745507195},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I also have to say, my kids currently get free tuition at my school. \",\"startTime\":1745507195,\"endTime\":1745507199},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So I can''t leave my job.\",\"startTime\":1745507201,\"endTime\":1745507203},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Y viaje.\",\"startTime\":1745507204,\"endTime\":1745507205},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I would just encourage you to relish the spaces that you have there.\",\"startTime\":1745507208,\"endTime\":1745507211},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"They know that it''s not perfect, but they know that you being there is better than you not being there. If they have the money and funds, then go for it. \",\"startTime\":1745507211,\"endTime\":1745507218},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Yeah, Exactly. Exactly. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507216,\"endTime\":1745507219},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, you''ll figure it out. It''s gonna be a fun adventure.\",\"startTime\":1745507220,\"endTime\":1745507222},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it sure is. So tell me what''s going on.\",\"startTime\":1745507223,\"endTime\":1745507225},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You got this one.\",\"startTime\":1745507224,\"endTime\":1745507225},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So you made a huge move.\",\"startTime\":1745507225,\"endTime\":1745507227},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I left the the education service district because I felt in very much what you were saying is there''s all of these things that we could do, all of these banners of equity and goals and purpose statements and vision things and. \",\"startTime\":1745507229,\"endTime\":1745507243},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And yet we we weren''t really getting anything done. And it was overly frustrating. \",\"startTime\":1745507244,\"endTime\":1745507248},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And then also, I had planned out like, OK, I was thinking last spring would be a great time for me. It would have been the end of 4 1/2 years. I think it \",\"startTime\":1745507248,\"endTime\":1745507256},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"was at my position about then to do a lump. She''s like, OK, what are you gonna \",\"startTime\":1745507256,\"endTime\":1745507260},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"do, Jeff? And. \",\"startTime\":1745507260,\"endTime\":1745507263},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1745507262,\"endTime\":1745507263},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Moving, uh.\",\"startTime\":1745507265,\"endTime\":1745507266},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Out of that space and then in with Erica and Mike to focus on, OK, what are we gonna do next? And we spent last summer and fall. \",\"startTime\":1745507266,\"endTime\":1745507274},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Going through systematically, what is it that we could do? OK, now what what \",\"startTime\":1745507275,\"endTime\":1745507278},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"is it that we''re going to do and what''s the data and feedback that we got? And \",\"startTime\":1745507278,\"endTime\":1745507282},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"then by the end of November closing out that six month cycle of OK, what did we really do and what are we going to do next? The team decision was let''s do \",\"startTime\":1745507282,\"endTime\":1745507290},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"side by and when Erica showed me. \",\"startTime\":1745507290,\"endTime\":1745507293},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"It was great too ''cause it wasn''t AI generated. She just wrote it for each of \",\"startTime\":1745507294,\"endTime\":1745507296},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"the three of us. Little blurbs about us. \",\"startTime\":1745507296,\"endTime\":1745507299},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And when she put that up and she shared it with us members on a Friday.\",\"startTime\":1745507300,\"endTime\":1745507304},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I felt so good one about how she described who I was.\",\"startTime\":1745507304,\"endTime\":1745507309},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Because I find myself being in that teacher role or the coach role or the problem solver, I will fix everything for everybody. That''s my, that''s what I love to \",\"startTime\":1745507309,\"endTime\":1745507315},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"do. \",\"startTime\":1745507315,\"endTime\":1745507318},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"But I can''t fix everything for everybody. And it it felt oh.\",\"startTime\":1745507318,\"endTime\":1745507323},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745507320,\"endTime\":1745507321},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I now have clarity and singularity focus and that''s really what I do like doing what she''s talking about. So hopping on board with them. And then for me, it''s \",\"startTime\":1745507324,\"endTime\":1745507332},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Co thinking. That''s where I really think about getting teachers or educators \",\"startTime\":1745507332,\"endTime\":1745507335},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"to have conversations like this and Co think. \",\"startTime\":1745507335,\"endTime\":1745507339},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Ya. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745507337,\"endTime\":1745507338},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Not really talk about problems and talk about their problems of practice or just highlights or cool perspectives or struggles and being human. \",\"startTime\":1745507340,\"endTime\":1745507347},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That part I incur. I just love. I love doing it myself and getting other people \",\"startTime\":1745507348,\"endTime\":1745507351},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"to do it. \",\"startTime\":1745507351,\"endTime\":1745507353},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So it''s been really wonderful on that part to resonate.\",\"startTime\":1745507354,\"endTime\":1745507359},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507354,\"endTime\":1745507356},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Also.\",\"startTime\":1745507359,\"endTime\":1745507360},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"How do we do this and how do we make it right and how do we not do all of these other tangents that sound really good and fun and. \",\"startTime\":1745507360,\"endTime\":1745507366},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Keep singularity of focus through it. It''s been good and challenging, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507367,\"endTime\":1745507371},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s amazing. So are you doing side by full time? Is that all you''re \",\"startTime\":1745507370,\"endTime\":1745507372},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"doing right now? \",\"startTime\":1745507372,\"endTime\":1745507374},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, full time. Thanks. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507375,\"endTime\":1745507378},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Congrats.\",\"startTime\":1745507377,\"endTime\":1745507378},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Which is a lot of fun and a lot of struggle. Umm the last couple months it''s \",\"startTime\":1745507379,\"endTime\":1745507383},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"That''s so cool, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507380,\"endTime\":1745507381},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"been I''m trying to make the app work to get people to talk and finding bugs like the end of last week that even you weren''t automatically registered into upduo when you signed in to side by. However that was a function that was working \",\"startTime\":1745507383,\"endTime\":1745507396},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"earlier but then it broke about a month ago so nobody could get in unless they emailed and said hey I''m not able to get it. \",\"startTime\":1745507396,\"endTime\":1745507404},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Were like new and we don''t have all of the fancy tools that track everybody''s clicks and all that. So yeah, how do you grow a group? Like my goal is by the \",\"startTime\":1745507406,\"endTime\":1745507414},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh, uh, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507410,\"endTime\":1745507414},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"end of June to have 3 to 5000 people in. \",\"startTime\":1745507414,\"endTime\":1745507418},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Dude, I''m so, I''m so happy to hear that. Like it makes my heart so happy to \",\"startTime\":1745507419,\"endTime\":1745507423},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"hear that ''cause it''s gonna happen and it''s gonna be epic. \",\"startTime\":1745507423,\"endTime\":1745507427},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So thanks, Thanks. But I really need to be wise and not do the quiet Jeff, hide \",\"startTime\":1745507427,\"endTime\":1745507431},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"in the corner and watch until people need something. I need to be a leader and, \",\"startTime\":1745507431,\"endTime\":1745507435},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and reach out and reach out to people like you and say, hey, you''re working with educators. Here''s samples of what we''re doing. And I really think that \",\"startTime\":1745507435,\"endTime\":1745507443},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507443,\"endTime\":1745507445},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"you and your team and your teachers would like this and why and give give them reason and, and move them forward. \",\"startTime\":1745507443,\"endTime\":1745507451},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507449,\"endTime\":1745507451},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Amazing. But just to say Charles, my husband.\",\"startTime\":1745507451,\"endTime\":1745507455},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507452,\"endTime\":1745507452},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Is using an add-on or program that we learned about from Robert actually?\",\"startTime\":1745507456,\"endTime\":1745507462},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"But like it just analyzes literally like where people click and point on your on the. \",\"startTime\":1745507464,\"endTime\":1745507470},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Screen page just like, I don''t know, that''s like a thing that exists.\",\"startTime\":1745507470,\"endTime\":1745507473},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, on your website you can. Yeah, you can have that part. But like when you \",\"startTime\":1745507474,\"endTime\":1745507476},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"You already know about it.\",\"startTime\":1745507474,\"endTime\":1745507475},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"send an e-mail out, unless you do an e-mail tracking system like HubSpot or something like that. \",\"startTime\":1745507476,\"endTime\":1745507482},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Like I sent the welcome e-mail out to you.\",\"startTime\":1745507483,\"endTime\":1745507485},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I get a notification in Slack, we got the little robot saying, oh, somebody did this in the database so triggers this and so I get your name and e-mail and then I I go in and if I know you, I just type a little bit into my robot to make sure it''s the same template and then send it out but. \",\"startTime\":1745507486,\"endTime\":1745507501},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Uh huh.\",\"startTime\":1745507494,\"endTime\":1745507497},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I don''t know if you got the e-mail, I don''t know if you did anything on it, clicked on it at least yet. And so it''s it''s interesting and in fun to figure \",\"startTime\":1745507502,\"endTime\":1745507509},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh, uh, yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507508,\"endTime\":1745507511},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"out like what''s the user journey and. \",\"startTime\":1745507509,\"endTime\":1745507513},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Where the places along the way that the funnel leaks.\",\"startTime\":1745507514,\"endTime\":1745507518},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507514,\"endTime\":1745507516},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And people aren''t getting to where they go and.\",\"startTime\":1745507518,\"endTime\":1745507520},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The last month it was how do we get this product stable so that at least functional so that you and I can go in and chat like now we have notifications. \",\"startTime\":1745507522,\"endTime\":1745507530},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That was huge.\",\"startTime\":1745507530,\"endTime\":1745507531},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So it''s, it''s, it''s, it''s wobbly. It''s really wobbly. And it''s challenging \",\"startTime\":1745507533,\"endTime\":1745507537},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"It''s amazing.\",\"startTime\":1745507533,\"endTime\":1745507534},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"to keep pushing forward and to know that we only have so much time with our current funding to make this happen. \",\"startTime\":1745507537,\"endTime\":1745507544},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah. It''s interesting. Do you, are you interested in sharing with me \",\"startTime\":1745507546,\"endTime\":1745507550},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, alright.\",\"startTime\":1745507547,\"endTime\":1745507548},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"a little bit about the journey? You don''t have to if you''re like, I don''t wanna \",\"startTime\":1745507550,\"endTime\":1745507554},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"waste time on that. I''m curious about the journey of like building side by instant \",\"startTime\":1745507554,\"endTime\":1745507558},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like on the on the side of of duo like that, that it''s not the same product that it''s two separate products. Like do you wanna talk about that? \",\"startTime\":1745507558,\"endTime\":1745507566},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that part is is a horrible hiccup in our system right now and and we know it and currently we''re at that place of up Duo has been dissolved as a company or organization. It was bought by another one or however that was assimilated \",\"startTime\":1745507566,\"endTime\":1745507581},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and and all those things. But we have rights to use the app and to use the software. \",\"startTime\":1745507581,\"endTime\":1745507586},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So do we go through the process in rebranding it with just a new name, which takes money and time, or do we take the code and rebuild our own new one which takes money and time? \",\"startTime\":1745507587,\"endTime\":1745507597},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh, right.\",\"startTime\":1745507595,\"endTime\":1745507596},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And all of the fun problems along the way, but it''s definitely a hiccup right now that it''s not just in one app that. \",\"startTime\":1745507597,\"endTime\":1745507605},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"All of your messaging, your chats with other people, oh me to connect with, with Nova right now, Little notification you''re meeting with Nova in 10 minutes. \",\"startTime\":1745507605,\"endTime\":1745507613},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh, uh huh. Uh-huh.\",\"startTime\":1745507607,\"endTime\":1745507607},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s the future. So it''s really different now than what we hope it will \",\"startTime\":1745507615,\"endTime\":1745507620},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"be. But we still need something to to drive and to ride and to play with and. \",\"startTime\":1745507620,\"endTime\":1745507625},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Ya ya.\",\"startTime\":1745507623,\"endTime\":1745507624},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507625,\"endTime\":1745507626},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1745507626,\"endTime\":1745507627},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, it is pretty cool, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507627,\"endTime\":1745507630},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Hey Cortana. Well, thanks for sharing. It''s so exciting to hear your guys updates. \",\"startTime\":1745507629,\"endTime\":1745507633},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I feel like it''s just like really weird. Like, you know, I''ve been with Woody \",\"startTime\":1745507633,\"endTime\":1745507637},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"since like, like ideation. I feel like, and then like, like he and I touch, \",\"startTime\":1745507637,\"endTime\":1745507641},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like lose touch and then like I like, like the universe keeps bringing us back together. If you''re like other people, it''s like this really weird kind of thing \",\"startTime\":1745507641,\"endTime\":1745507649},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507644,\"endTime\":1745507644},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"that happened like. \",\"startTime\":1745507649,\"endTime\":1745507654},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"It''s so cool.\",\"startTime\":1745507654,\"endTime\":1745507655},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, anyway.\",\"startTime\":1745507656,\"endTime\":1745507657},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The human networking map is mind blowing on how it works and how we affect each other. \",\"startTime\":1745507657,\"endTime\":1745507662},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, yeah, yeah. So thank you for the opinion.\",\"startTime\":1745507662,\"endTime\":1745507665},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"OK, let''s do this. Let''s do this up to A1, see how it is. I want your feedback. \",\"startTime\":1745507663,\"endTime\":1745507666},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And at the end, one of the thing that''s been really fun is now I have my robots and I work with them to craft. \",\"startTime\":1745507666,\"endTime\":1745507673},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Ideas to put on your page afterwards, quick artifacts from the transcripts. \",\"startTime\":1745507675,\"endTime\":1745507679},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And that part''s been great to to train my assistants and to work with them real quick and be like, I''ll take this transcript and get something back to the people. \",\"startTime\":1745507679,\"endTime\":1745507687},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Cool, I love it.\",\"startTime\":1745507680,\"endTime\":1745507681},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And sometimes the conversations go on and are really rich and in depth and then I can make like. \",\"startTime\":1745507687,\"endTime\":1745507694},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Like a three page article for an Ed journal or something and give it to them that it''s it''s cool. And I do want to hear from you and from others about what''s \",\"startTime\":1745507695,\"endTime\":1745507703},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, amazing.\",\"startTime\":1745507698,\"endTime\":1745507700},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"valuable. Like after a conversation, you hope you hopefully and every time people \",\"startTime\":1745507703,\"endTime\":1745507707},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"have a rich conversation and they seem to be encouraged. \",\"startTime\":1745507707,\"endTime\":1745507711},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And they''re like excited and they''re challenged, but.\",\"startTime\":1745507711,\"endTime\":1745507713},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Afterwards having some digital gift, an artifact of some sort.\",\"startTime\":1745507713,\"endTime\":1745507719},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Like what are valuable things? What makes the value add to you as the user? \",\"startTime\":1745507720,\"endTime\":1745507723},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That''s one of the big questions I have. And then and I''ll ask you about that \",\"startTime\":1745507723,\"endTime\":1745507726},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"later, But OK, what what is it that you want after a conversation kind of thing? \",\"startTime\":1745507726,\"endTime\":1745507730},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745507730,\"endTime\":1745507733},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Cool question, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745507733,\"endTime\":1745507734},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"All right, I''m gonna do this. We we greeted for 15 minutes. Yes.\",\"startTime\":1745507734,\"endTime\":1745507738},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"All right, I don''t know. Good.\",\"startTime\":1745507735,\"endTime\":1745507736},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"OK. Oh, this is great.\",\"startTime\":1745507740,\"endTime\":1745507742},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And then we''re gonna skip the ice picker ''cause we were good. No, we''re good. \",\"startTime\":1745507742,\"endTime\":1745507746},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh oh. Sorry. OK.\",\"startTime\":1745507743,\"endTime\":1745507745},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"How has AI changed your work as an educator or a leader of educators so far? \",\"startTime\":1745507746,\"endTime\":1745507750},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I mean, I''m still just dabbling with the theme project that I was before, so that hasn''t changed and I I haven''t made a lot of progress with it, to be quite honest. \",\"startTime\":1745507758,\"endTime\":1745507766},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I think like everyone else, I''m using.\",\"startTime\":1745507768,\"endTime\":1745507770},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"GPT for crafting emails and and making that work easier.\",\"startTime\":1745507771,\"endTime\":1745507776},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Actually I guess something I''m working on recently.\",\"startTime\":1745507777,\"endTime\":1745507780},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I''m currently facilitating a.\",\"startTime\":1745507782,\"endTime\":1745507784},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Five week for like 5 part series for families that''s an hour and a half each session. \",\"startTime\":1745507785,\"endTime\":1745507792},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And I''m relying heavily on ChatGPT to be my file partner in, in facilitating or designing those sessions. Like I''ll know more or less what I, what I want \",\"startTime\":1745507793,\"endTime\":1745507800},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"to get out of the session. And so I''ll just tell like I fed it the experiential \",\"startTime\":1745507800,\"endTime\":1745507804},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"learning cycle and said, I want to follow this like meeting design and I want to have a interactive, you know, da, da, da. And then I''ll just say like, OK, \",\"startTime\":1745507804,\"endTime\":1745507812},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"this is cool, but I don''t like this. And actually I''m going to use this activity. \",\"startTime\":1745507812,\"endTime\":1745507815},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And here''s the reading that we''re going to do. And I''ll say, like, do you, what \",\"startTime\":1745507815,\"endTime\":1745507819},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"excerpts do you recommend from? \",\"startTime\":1745507819,\"endTime\":1745507823},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"You know, mouthish or whatever. So just using it as like my thought partnership \",\"startTime\":1745507823,\"endTime\":1745507827},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"has been really helpful, especially as like a team of 1. \",\"startTime\":1745507827,\"endTime\":1745507831},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Umm, so that''s pretty cool. And that''s been really effective for just getting \",\"startTime\":1745507833,\"endTime\":1745507836},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"the work done faster. And just again, like being on my own and like having that, \",\"startTime\":1745507836,\"endTime\":1745507839},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"that partnership. That''s really cool. \",\"startTime\":1745507839,\"endTime\":1745507842},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And then the other cool thing that I''m doing with AI as a leader right now is I''ve actually become. \",\"startTime\":1745507843,\"endTime\":1745507851},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"The coordinator for our 4th grade camping trip.\",\"startTime\":1745507852,\"endTime\":1745507855},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Nova Cats camping coordinator.\",\"startTime\":1745507860,\"endTime\":1745507862},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So Yep, Yep, it''s like a survival camping, right? It''s like you have to like \",\"startTime\":1745507862,\"endTime\":1745507867},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"do first aid and like eat fish eyeballs and stuff. \",\"startTime\":1745507867,\"endTime\":1745507871},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I''ve never been, but now I''m the coordinator. I love it. Anyway, so we have \",\"startTime\":1745507872,\"endTime\":1745507876},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"to create. There''s 103 kiddos and they each get to request who they want to \",\"startTime\":1745507876,\"endTime\":1745507881},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"be in their tent with them. And so normally there''s this like 6 hour long process \",\"startTime\":1745507881,\"endTime\":1745507886},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"where the teachers cut up slips of paper and they like manually move all the groups around. And I''ve been using taught GPT to like recreate multiple iterations \",\"startTime\":1745507886,\"endTime\":1745507896},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"of possible groupings that like keep in mind all of the different requirements. \",\"startTime\":1745507896,\"endTime\":1745507901},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And it''s interesting, it''s breaking GPT. And then today Charles is like, actually, \",\"startTime\":1745507902,\"endTime\":1745507905},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"it''s like having an actual issue today. Like it''s not just you. It''s like, actually \",\"startTime\":1745507905,\"endTime\":1745507907},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"there''s like a known issue today. I was like, OK, well, that makes me feel a \",\"startTime\":1745507907,\"endTime\":1745507910},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"little better, but. \",\"startTime\":1745507910,\"endTime\":1745507913},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"This has been interesting, like really like pushing it to its limits. And I''m \",\"startTime\":1745507913,\"endTime\":1745507916},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like, I don''t feel like this is like a big data set. I don''t feel like this \",\"startTime\":1745507916,\"endTime\":1745507920},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"is a complex problem, but it''s complex enough that it''s like reaching the limits of, of chat, GP, TS capabilities. It''s like, we recommend that you run this \",\"startTime\":1745507920,\"endTime\":1745507927},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"script locally and like, no, you do it. \",\"startTime\":1745507927,\"endTime\":1745507930},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Try harder.\",\"startTime\":1745507932,\"endTime\":1745507933},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it. I''ve had that same experience where you''re like getting into \",\"startTime\":1745507934,\"endTime\":1745507938},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"something, you''re like, you should totally be able to do this and. \",\"startTime\":1745507938,\"endTime\":1745507941},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"When I look at the GPT thread and I have to walk away and go for a walk to sometimes do it. \",\"startTime\":1745507942,\"endTime\":1745507948},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"But I have to think of the AI tool as a human being. I know it''s not, but it''s \",\"startTime\":1745507949,\"endTime\":1745507953},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"built on a neural network. And if I think of it as a new college graduate. \",\"startTime\":1745507953,\"endTime\":1745507958},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That just got hired and it''s my new assistant following me around and I''m asking you to do something. \",\"startTime\":1745507959,\"endTime\":1745507964},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And it''s just like stuck on something. I''m like, come on, why can''t you do it \",\"startTime\":1745507964,\"endTime\":1745507967},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"so simple? You were trained to do this. \",\"startTime\":1745507967,\"endTime\":1745507970},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I just need a break and realize oh wait, it''s just doing what it''s trying and thinking it''s best to do. \",\"startTime\":1745507970,\"endTime\":1745507975},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I''m realizing that in my work, I keep thinking like, not just grouping like you''re doing, but how do you do things like? \",\"startTime\":1745507975,\"endTime\":1745507983},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Create good artifacts. I ran into one forever that the GPT would not give me \",\"startTime\":1745507984,\"endTime\":1745507989},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"back verbatim quotes. It would just quote up something that sounded good. \",\"startTime\":1745507989,\"endTime\":1745507993},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I know she''s. I know she''s yelling and you don''t like it. It''s OK, Kelly. I \",\"startTime\":1745507994,\"endTime\":1745507997},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I would ask it.\",\"startTime\":1745507994,\"endTime\":1745507995},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"know you don''t like it. I know she''s yellow. \",\"startTime\":1745507997,\"endTime\":1745508000},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s OK. It''s OK. Look, she''s gonna go inside now. It''s all done, OK? \",\"startTime\":1745508000,\"endTime\":1745508002},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"It''s OK. \",\"startTime\":1745508002,\"endTime\":1745508004},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"She''s all done, All done.\",\"startTime\":1745508006,\"endTime\":1745508007},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Sorry, the lady next door was screaming at someone on the phone and Kelly did not like it. \",\"startTime\":1745508008,\"endTime\":1745508012},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, oh God, sense that.\",\"startTime\":1745508014,\"endTime\":1745508018},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"OK, say that again.\",\"startTime\":1745508015,\"endTime\":1745508016},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Umm was trying to get my GPT assistant specially built to make sure that the quotes. \",\"startTime\":1745508018,\"endTime\":1745508024},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so sorry.\",\"startTime\":1745508018,\"endTime\":1745508018},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So Nova said this is actually. Nova said this from the transcript.\",\"startTime\":1745508025,\"endTime\":1745508028},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"But I would have it verified and it was going through things and it would be like, Nope, none of those quotes were from the transcript. I''m just like. \",\"startTime\":1745508028,\"endTime\":1745508034},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"WTF I told you and then ask and it says would you like me to write it again? \",\"startTime\":1745508036,\"endTime\":1745508039},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And you get into these stuck loops and you''re like. \",\"startTime\":1745508039,\"endTime\":1745508041},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yes.\",\"startTime\":1745508042,\"endTime\":1745508043},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So I''m like, I need to walk away.\",\"startTime\":1745508043,\"endTime\":1745508045},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I gotta breathe on it and I gotta remember.\",\"startTime\":1745508045,\"endTime\":1745508047},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"They''re highly skilled as a human. If they were my new assistant that I hired \",\"startTime\":1745508049,\"endTime\":1745508053},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and I wouldn''t doubt them. But this GPT tool, something''s wrong in the way that \",\"startTime\":1745508053,\"endTime\":1745508057},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''m describing it or the structure I''m giving or. \",\"startTime\":1745508057,\"endTime\":1745508061},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"For the explanation of what we''re trying to do or something.\",\"startTime\":1745508061,\"endTime\":1745508065},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Hello, Cortana. Hello.\",\"startTime\":1745508063,\"endTime\":1745508066},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I''m finding myself getting into that when I get frustrated. It''s changed \",\"startTime\":1745508065,\"endTime\":1745508069},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"the way I''m working because I''m thinking now. \",\"startTime\":1745508069,\"endTime\":1745508072},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"More about structure and real clarity what I''m trying to do.\",\"startTime\":1745508072,\"endTime\":1745508076},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And you see it a lot, I''m sure, as a educator, instructional coach.\",\"startTime\":1745508076,\"endTime\":1745508081},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Is you talking with admin and teams, they have so many ideas that there are 30,000 tangents through a meeting or or you whatever you''re like, can we just focus on one thing? \",\"startTime\":1745508082,\"endTime\":1745508091},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I think that as I share out my thinking with the GPT, when I hit record on my phone or I do, especially when I''m doing voice to text, somehow I talk more and I give it more info than it needs. And I''m trying to put all of these \",\"startTime\":1745508091,\"endTime\":1745508104},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"things together instead of saying. \",\"startTime\":1745508104,\"endTime\":1745508108},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508104,\"endTime\":1745508104},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Hey, would you fix this light bulb on the porch? Oh, by the way, over there, \",\"startTime\":1745508109,\"endTime\":1745508112},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"we have a pool and we want it clean and someday we''re going to have a party and when the little kids and do you know that? \",\"startTime\":1745508112,\"endTime\":1745508119},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And you know how we go in our brains and we attach all of these random things. \",\"startTime\":1745508120,\"endTime\":1745508123},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And it breaks the GPT''s. I''m like, OK, Jeff, stop.\",\"startTime\":1745508123,\"endTime\":1745508126},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508126,\"endTime\":1745508128},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So it''s changed the way I''m thinking because I have to think more about.\",\"startTime\":1745508126,\"endTime\":1745508130},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508128,\"endTime\":1745508129},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"What''s the structure I want it to have and when do I not give it give it structure like when is it structure important because. \",\"startTime\":1745508131,\"endTime\":1745508138},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"We wanna run the 4th grade camp this way. It has to be these things. And then \",\"startTime\":1745508139,\"endTime\":1745508142},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745508142,\"endTime\":1745508144},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"when is it OK to not give structure? \",\"startTime\":1745508142,\"endTime\":1745508145},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Because, you know, I don''t know what the title of this article should be. Let''s \",\"startTime\":1745508146,\"endTime\":1745508148},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"just talk and see what it is and what the most important quotes are or the main things, and then we''ll come up to the title later. \",\"startTime\":1745508148,\"endTime\":1745508154},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508154,\"endTime\":1745508156},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Duh. Yeah, it''s been challenging, that''s for sure.\",\"startTime\":1745508156,\"endTime\":1745508159},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Charles has such an interesting inner. You''ve never met my husband, but he has \",\"startTime\":1745508160,\"endTime\":1745508163},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"he''s like got the brain for it. And it''s like infuriating for me, but also really \",\"startTime\":1745508163,\"endTime\":1745508166},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"helpful. But like today I was and it''s I love that we share our ChatGPT too. \",\"startTime\":1745508166,\"endTime\":1745508169},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So like I''ll be like, you know, griping in him about something like via text and he like goes in and just like gives it a prompt and I''ll go and I''m like, oh. \",\"startTime\":1745508169,\"endTime\":1745508179},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508177,\"endTime\":1745508178},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s a really smart problem. Like you just like jumps in and like does \",\"startTime\":1745508179,\"endTime\":1745508182},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"it for me. \",\"startTime\":1745508182,\"endTime\":1745508184},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"But I learned so much from it. So like, for example, today this was like an \",\"startTime\":1745508184,\"endTime\":1745508188},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"awful today. Today it would say, here''s a new alternative grouping for the boys. \",\"startTime\":1745508188,\"endTime\":1745508192},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"You didn''t insert the table. Where''s the data? And it''s like, yeah, here''s the \",\"startTime\":1745508192,\"endTime\":1745508197},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"data. Do you want an export file? Yes, I want an export file. Great, here''s \",\"startTime\":1745508197,\"endTime\":1745508201},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"your export file. I click on the export file, file doesn''t exist. And I''m like, \",\"startTime\":1745508201,\"endTime\":1745508205},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"what is happening? It keeps saying that it''s giving me the data, but there''s \",\"startTime\":1745508205,\"endTime\":1745508209},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"no data. And so then Charles was like, you have to ask it if. \",\"startTime\":1745508209,\"endTime\":1745508214},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"There''s actually a file or if it''s a hallucination, So literally I put in, is there a, is there an actual file or is this a hallucination? And it says, yes, \",\"startTime\":1745508217,\"endTime\":1745508224},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"this is an actual file. Sorry, it didn''t link properly. Here''s a, here''s another \",\"startTime\":1745508224,\"endTime\":1745508228},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"version of the file. And then that file worked. \",\"startTime\":1745508228,\"endTime\":1745508232},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So like even that like, right, Like even like I was like, I never would have thought to like just ask it that. Like, oh, is there a real file? Like duh, \",\"startTime\":1745508234,\"endTime\":1745508242},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745508234,\"endTime\":1745508235},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"it''s just so basic. And then even in the way that he was like that, he helped \",\"startTime\":1745508242,\"endTime\":1745508246},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"me frame like, what''s the information that I have to give it at the outset? \",\"startTime\":1745508246,\"endTime\":1745508250},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Like so like setting up like Larry, just like sort of a new thread and was like, let''s start over. \",\"startTime\":1745508250,\"endTime\":1745508258},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Here''s the parameters that everything that you give me has to follow.\",\"startTime\":1745508259,\"endTime\":1745508263},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Cool. Now I''m gonna give you the data set for the girls. And here are some additional \",\"startTime\":1745508264,\"endTime\":1745508268},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"parameters just for the girls. And that worked so much more effectively than \",\"startTime\":1745508268,\"endTime\":1745508271},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like having this like conversation that was like. \",\"startTime\":1745508271,\"endTime\":1745508275},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, that''s what I mean. Like after a while you you have to step back \",\"startTime\":1745508275,\"endTime\":1745508279},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and go, OK, what''s that structure you gave it the structure. Here''s the outline \",\"startTime\":1745508279,\"endTime\":1745508283},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"in the parameter. And I''m learning that we have to think more clearly. \",\"startTime\":1745508283,\"endTime\":1745508286},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508286,\"endTime\":1745508289},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Just like with somebody else, when we want somebody to do something, a business, an organization or an individual. \",\"startTime\":1745508287,\"endTime\":1745508292},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"How do we ask them very clearly what we want to get done and what the parameters are? \",\"startTime\":1745508292,\"endTime\":1745508297},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And where do we give them freedom and flexibility to do their work and be their awesome experts and not tell them what to do? \",\"startTime\":1745508298,\"endTime\":1745508305},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508301,\"endTime\":1745508302},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Exactly. Exactly. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508305,\"endTime\":1745508308},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, MM called it out. He had a great video that Dan, I forgot his last name, \",\"startTime\":1745508307,\"endTime\":1745508311},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Programmer guy. \",\"startTime\":1745508311,\"endTime\":1745508314},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Was watching yesterday that and Dan is the program was interviewing Mike and Mike was sharing about what he''s doing a sci-fi and he even used the phrase like. \",\"startTime\":1745508314,\"endTime\":1745508323},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Well, I think about positioning it as capable. And if you just hired a new MIT \",\"startTime\":1745508323,\"endTime\":1745508327},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"graduate, you''d be like, oh, you''re an expert in coding. I''m gonna trust you \",\"startTime\":1745508327,\"endTime\":1745508331},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and I''m gonna over teach you. I''m gonna position you as capable and I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1745508331,\"endTime\":1745508335},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"tell you the ideas of our project and then let you go do your work. And you''re \",\"startTime\":1745508335,\"endTime\":1745508339},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"like, oh, same thing. Like how? How do you know? \",\"startTime\":1745508339,\"endTime\":1745508343},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508341,\"endTime\":1745508342},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Right. That''s it. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508343,\"endTime\":1745508344},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"How do you know how to position that GPT is capable of doing that work and.\",\"startTime\":1745508345,\"endTime\":1745508350},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508350,\"endTime\":1745508353},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, OK, let me do next 10.\",\"startTime\":1745508353,\"endTime\":1745508355},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Sharing How do you think AI will change the role of learners in the future?\",\"startTime\":1745508359,\"endTime\":1745508364},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Circle alright.\",\"startTime\":1745508367,\"endTime\":1745508370},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Did you happen to catch Dan Myers session that he presented at the AI conference a couple weekends ago? \",\"startTime\":1745508374,\"endTime\":1745508381},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I did not.\",\"startTime\":1745508382,\"endTime\":1745508383},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"He did this 15 minute long. It''s definitely, you should definitely watch it \",\"startTime\":1745508383,\"endTime\":1745508387},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"just because it''s like your world, it''s your realm. \",\"startTime\":1745508387,\"endTime\":1745508390},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745508387,\"endTime\":1745508387},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And I was just like, I don''t know what this dude''s getting on. Like this is \",\"startTime\":1745508392,\"endTime\":1745508396},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"a bit much for me. It''s like basically likening AI to church and it, it went \",\"startTime\":1745508396,\"endTime\":1745508400},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like probably this went sideways. And then I came to learn that there''s this \",\"startTime\":1745508400,\"endTime\":1745508405},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like whole like religion of AI. There''s like a real thing. Like people are actually \",\"startTime\":1745508405,\"endTime\":1745508409},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like going to church and saying like AI is going to be the next coming. It''s \",\"startTime\":1745508409,\"endTime\":1745508413},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like. \",\"startTime\":1745508413,\"endTime\":1745508418},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Like a real So anyway I I I have.\",\"startTime\":1745508420,\"endTime\":1745508423},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So is that your? Is that you''re changing the role of learners? Tell me more \",\"startTime\":1745508423,\"endTime\":1745508425},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"about this, I can''t wait. \",\"startTime\":1745508425,\"endTime\":1745508427},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Well, it''s so the, the connection is like, I think that there is fear of the unknown and fear of like being replaced, but I think the reality is that AI is going to actually just assist teachers in doing their job easier and more efficiently. \",\"startTime\":1745508428,\"endTime\":1745508449},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And I think that like, the fear just comes from the unknown. The fear comes \",\"startTime\":1745508450,\"endTime\":1745508453},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"from these. Like, it''s like the pendulum is swinging, you know, like the pendulum \",\"startTime\":1745508453,\"endTime\":1745508457},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"swinging real far. \",\"startTime\":1745508457,\"endTime\":1745508460},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"But I agree that like, you know, I hear Bill Gates saying like it''s going to replace teachers. I don''t agree, don''t think that that''s true. \",\"startTime\":1745508462,\"endTime\":1745508471},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And I think that there are some schools that are gonna like do that, and there''s gonna be people that are into it and there''s gonna be like, I hope that it helps build equity. I hope that in places where people can''t get to school or afford \",\"startTime\":1745508473,\"endTime\":1745508485},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"to get to school or whatever, there''s like cheap AI alternatives that like help educate people and that wouldn''t be able to get education otherwise. But. \",\"startTime\":1745508485,\"endTime\":1745508493},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Your turn.\",\"startTime\":1745508495,\"endTime\":1745508496},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Tell me more about how that affects the role of the learner. Like what? What \",\"startTime\":1745508497,\"endTime\":1745508502},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"is the what''s the learner role gonna be like? And I think of learners as kids \",\"startTime\":1745508502,\"endTime\":1745508507},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and adults who want to learn too, like anybody, but specifically students. \",\"startTime\":1745508507,\"endTime\":1745508512},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"What are you just I, I don''t know what''s happening here. What are you doing? \",\"startTime\":1745508511,\"endTime\":1745508515},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Why are you? What are you doing down there? She''s like.\",\"startTime\":1745508516,\"endTime\":1745508520},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, it''s a good place to hide.\",\"startTime\":1745508519,\"endTime\":1745508522},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"She''s like digging.\",\"startTime\":1745508521,\"endTime\":1745508522},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"She''s been really annoying, right? That''s why I was distracted. She''s she''s \",\"startTime\":1745508523,\"endTime\":1745508525},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"not being annoying, she''s being very distracting. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1745508525,\"endTime\":1745508528},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, how about students? How do you think students role will change?\",\"startTime\":1745508531,\"endTime\":1745508536},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I think I think I needed a more global prompt before I narrowed it down to the role of the learner. \",\"startTime\":1745508540,\"endTime\":1745508544},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Umm, I think that.\",\"startTime\":1745508547,\"endTime\":1745508549},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I don''t know if I''ve given that much thought.\",\"startTime\":1745508551,\"endTime\":1745508553},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"From being honest.\",\"startTime\":1745508555,\"endTime\":1745508556},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"From what I''ve heard from you though.\",\"startTime\":1745508559,\"endTime\":1745508561},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You''re talking about the way that you''re using AI and thinking about prompts and interactions with the prompts and the amount of reading that you have to do with it. And then I''m not sure for for learners what their role is going \",\"startTime\":1745508561,\"endTime\":1745508571},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"to be and what you''re saying for your story, but definitely is they''re using AI. \",\"startTime\":1745508571,\"endTime\":1745508578},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"They''re gonna have to read a lot more and they''re gonna have to be critical consumers of that information that''s given and be persistent in conversation. \",\"startTime\":1745508581,\"endTime\":1745508588},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I think they have to be more articulate in their in their in their role about what they want and what to happen. And I think they''ll have to be more active \",\"startTime\":1745508588,\"endTime\":1745508595},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Sure. Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508590,\"endTime\":1745508593},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and if if the AI is. \",\"startTime\":1745508595,\"endTime\":1745508598},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The thing in front of them or their tool that they have, then are they able to articulate what they''re saying, thinking, be able to ask clarifying questions or clarifying prompts? \",\"startTime\":1745508600,\"endTime\":1745508612},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Uh huh.\",\"startTime\":1745508612,\"endTime\":1745508613},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Get that information and have that dialogue back and forth. Like you said, you \",\"startTime\":1745508612,\"endTime\":1745508615},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"had a thought partner. You feel like you have a thought partner right now with \",\"startTime\":1745508615,\"endTime\":1745508618},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"coaching with that same thing because that''s you as a learner with that same thing. Apply for kids. \",\"startTime\":1745508618,\"endTime\":1745508624},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Uh huh. Right?\",\"startTime\":1745508619,\"endTime\":1745508621},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And so them Co thinking with an AI tool, I think that their their engagement will have to be now I need to take the role of the discourse. \",\"startTime\":1745508626,\"endTime\":1745508637},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Active discourse person? And what does that mean for me as a learner? OK, how \",\"startTime\":1745508637,\"endTime\":1745508640},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"do I do active discourse? \",\"startTime\":1745508640,\"endTime\":1745508643},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, right.\",\"startTime\":1745508642,\"endTime\":1745508644},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I think, I think can I just push a little bit too of like, I think it''s hard for us to know what the role of the learner will be and. \",\"startTime\":1745508644,\"endTime\":1745508653},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1745508645,\"endTime\":1745508645},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508653,\"endTime\":1745508653},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I guess I''m going a little sideways here. I apologize. But so like we had a \",\"startTime\":1745508656,\"endTime\":1745508661},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"convert. I went to the conference that I presented at in Switzerland. There \",\"startTime\":1745508661,\"endTime\":1745508665},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"was an extended session on AI. It was really interesting. I learned a lot. \",\"startTime\":1745508665,\"endTime\":1745508670},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"But like the conversation afterwards with my team was a lot of like, what do we, what parameters do we need to put in place to support students with AI? \",\"startTime\":1745508674,\"endTime\":1745508682},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And we''re the, they were brainstorming these perimeters and I had this funny moment where I was like, Oh my God, we sound like a bunch of old geezers. Like \",\"startTime\":1745508682,\"endTime\":1745508690},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"we sound like old people, like students are going to be AI natives like they are. \",\"startTime\":1745508690,\"endTime\":1745508699},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"They get it. So like my tech coordinator.\",\"startTime\":1745508702,\"endTime\":1745508705},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Does.\",\"startTime\":1745508706,\"endTime\":1745508707},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"My tech coordinator does this activity for digital citizenship. Is it a boy \",\"startTime\":1745508709,\"endTime\":1745508712},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"or girl him right? \",\"startTime\":1745508712,\"endTime\":1745508715},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"It''s a boy, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508716,\"endTime\":1745508717},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"His eyes are so beautiful.\",\"startTime\":1745508717,\"endTime\":1745508718},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So does it.\",\"startTime\":1745508717,\"endTime\":1745508718},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I know, aren''t they?\",\"startTime\":1745508718,\"endTime\":1745508719},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"But so she does this activity where the students have to figure out it''s like 2 truths and a lie, but it''s like 2 reals and a fake and they have to figure out which is the fake AI generated image and and the students have like 85% accuracy. Like teachers do not like we cannot tell the difference, they can. \",\"startTime\":1745508721,\"endTime\":1745508740},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"They''re so good.\",\"startTime\":1745508737,\"endTime\":1745508738},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So like we talk about like, that''s such interesting data. And she said it''s \",\"startTime\":1745508742,\"endTime\":1745508746},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"consistent time and time again. Like she has to come up with like harder examples \",\"startTime\":1745508746,\"endTime\":1745508749},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"because the kiddos can tell, they can suss it out. So like we''re talking about \",\"startTime\":1745508749,\"endTime\":1745508752},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"what the role of the learner is going to be. And I''m like, we need to start \",\"startTime\":1745508752,\"endTime\":1745508756},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"asking children what the role of their role is going to be because they get it better than we do. \",\"startTime\":1745508756,\"endTime\":1745508763},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"True, true. Oh my. Umm. That opens up a huge can of worms about how much we''re \",\"startTime\":1745508765,\"endTime\":1745508769},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"going to listen to the voice of kids and then take the the wisdom of learned experience. \",\"startTime\":1745508769,\"endTime\":1745508776},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Anyway.\",\"startTime\":1745508771,\"endTime\":1745508771},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"As adults and educators to help craft what''s next, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508776,\"endTime\":1745508780},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I I totally believe that we are long overdue to have the voice of of students elevated. \",\"startTime\":1745508780,\"endTime\":1745508787},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"In in district decisions, policy making, et cetera.\",\"startTime\":1745508789,\"endTime\":1745508793},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Seriously, do that.\",\"startTime\":1745508792,\"endTime\":1745508794},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Umm, yeah, all right, next one.\",\"startTime\":1745508794,\"endTime\":1745508797},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, read the challenge and I''m mindful of time.\",\"startTime\":1745508798,\"endTime\":1745508801},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I think challenge #1 so we get to pick challenge number one is Share your story. \",\"startTime\":1745508802,\"endTime\":1745508807},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Cool, cool. I feel like we did that.\",\"startTime\":1745508807,\"endTime\":1745508810},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I think we did, and then solve a problem of practice. I think we did too. All \",\"startTime\":1745508808,\"endTime\":1745508811},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I feel like we did challenge 2 also.\",\"startTime\":1745508810,\"endTime\":1745508812},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"right. \",\"startTime\":1745508811,\"endTime\":1745508813},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''m gonna say good to go.\",\"startTime\":1745508816,\"endTime\":1745508818},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"All right. By the way, when you hit end, it is like end, like hang up.\",\"startTime\":1745508821,\"endTime\":1745508826},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Next. Oh, that''s it.\",\"startTime\":1745508821,\"endTime\":1745508823},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"It''s done. Done, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508826,\"endTime\":1745508828},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Umm, so.\",\"startTime\":1745508829,\"endTime\":1745508829},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I want to say thanks one just for the fun time and also learning from you that we really don''t know and that. \",\"startTime\":1745508831,\"endTime\":1745508839},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Kids are the ones who are so native AI.\",\"startTime\":1745508839,\"endTime\":1745508841},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And that we do talk like old folks so much. We''re so embedded in it. And with \",\"startTime\":1745508843,\"endTime\":1745508847},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"the lightspeed of the growth of AI, you''re exactly right. Kids know and we don''t. \",\"startTime\":1745508847,\"endTime\":1745508851},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So just listen to them more, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745508851,\"endTime\":1745508855},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Thank you, Jeff. I''m really excited to meet you, as weird as that is.\",\"startTime\":1745508856,\"endTime\":1745508865},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1745508861,\"endTime\":1745508862},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"In the end of June coming up.\",\"startTime\":1745508863,\"endTime\":1745508865},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"End of June and here it sounds like Mike might come too.\",\"startTime\":1745508866,\"endTime\":1745508868},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Yeah. Not sure exactly on travel. He''s either going to be in Spokane the \",\"startTime\":1745508869,\"endTime\":1745508874},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"week before with me with our Washington Principals Association or in Seattle at the BTC. And I think BTC is better, but I don''t know about his schedule and \",\"startTime\":1745508874,\"endTime\":1745508883},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"plans. So we''ll see. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745508883,\"endTime\":1745508888},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"OK, then. Yeah. I mean, Chase will be there, Monique will be there.\",\"startTime\":1745508887,\"endTime\":1745508891},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Why wouldn''t he be there? Duh.\",\"startTime\":1745508892,\"endTime\":1745508895},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I mean, it''s like the dream team, the Fab 5. Is that all 5? Erica. Erica won''t \",\"startTime\":1745508895,\"endTime\":1745508897},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"come. \",\"startTime\":1745508897,\"endTime\":1745508900},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Erica won''t be there this time. No, she''s still doing part time work with \",\"startTime\":1745508900,\"endTime\":1745508904},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"her consultant and and other things. \",\"startTime\":1745508904,\"endTime\":1745508907},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So not until I think it''s right about then or her stuff be going away and then next year we''ll be able to join together. \",\"startTime\":1745508907,\"endTime\":1745508914},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"No thanks.\",\"startTime\":1745508912,\"endTime\":1745508912},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"That''s amazing. Well, we''ll have the we''ll have the Fab 5 back together for \",\"startTime\":1745508915,\"endTime\":1745508917},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''m looking forward to when, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508915,\"endTime\":1745508916},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"the first time. \",\"startTime\":1745508917,\"endTime\":1745508919},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, they''ll be there.\",\"startTime\":1745508919,\"endTime\":1745508920},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"That''s cool. All right, Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1745508921,\"endTime\":1745508923},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah Oh no, but it''s so good to see you in chat uh keep doing what you''re doing and my encouragement for you uh BTC or whatever the school remember that there''s two parts to it there''s the me part and there''s the US part. \",\"startTime\":1745508922,\"endTime\":1745508937},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The ME part is all about Nova. How does Nova grow through it?\",\"startTime\":1745508937,\"endTime\":1745508940},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Selfishly don''t think it''s bad but.\",\"startTime\":1745508940,\"endTime\":1745508943},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"But just like how do I nurture Nova and.\",\"startTime\":1745508943,\"endTime\":1745508946},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Add officers for that series. Yeah, Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1745508945,\"endTime\":1745508948},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And get out of it everything.\",\"startTime\":1745508946,\"endTime\":1745508948},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That Nova wants to get, so if you want to join the BTC train for a couple years in Europe. \",\"startTime\":1745508948,\"endTime\":1745508954},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Think about how you want to grow to be a coordinator or a facilitator of of facilitators. Your heartbeat is you want to work with instructional coaches, \",\"startTime\":1745508954,\"endTime\":1745508962},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"you want to work with teachers. \",\"startTime\":1745508962,\"endTime\":1745508965},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Why not work with the BTC, learn a lot about that, and then be the one who''s, oh, I''m the lead. \",\"startTime\":1745508967,\"endTime\":1745508972},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Or the manager of all facilitators of BTC across Europe. And my job is I have \",\"startTime\":1745508974,\"endTime\":1745508977},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"to talk to all of the facilitators and see how they''re doing and talk to them about getting better in their craft. \",\"startTime\":1745508977,\"endTime\":1745508983},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Epic. That''s it right there. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508984,\"endTime\":1745508987},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Like, I don''t know where your journey is, but there''s so many things. So think \",\"startTime\":1745508985,\"endTime\":1745508989},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"about the US, what has to be done for the school or the org that you''re working with? That''s the checklist and and you know that your skills that fit or don''t \",\"startTime\":1745508989,\"endTime\":1745508996},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508989,\"endTime\":1745508990},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"fit, but keep thinking about the the story you want to tell about Nova. Where \",\"startTime\":1745508996,\"endTime\":1745509000},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"does Nova want to go? And then these are opportunities for you to to. \",\"startTime\":1745509000,\"endTime\":1745509004},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Piece together in your story. But there''s those two sides always. There''s the \",\"startTime\":1745509005,\"endTime\":1745509007},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"me and the. \",\"startTime\":1745509007,\"endTime\":1745509009},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And don''t, don''t, don''t forget about that, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745509009,\"endTime\":1745509011},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, thank you, Jeff. And let me know what I can do to, I''m sorry, I keep those \",\"startTime\":1745509009,\"endTime\":1745509013},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like all these Amazon deliveries all of a sudden and let me know what I can do to help build side by like I want to, I want to support you guys and I, you know, I''m always your #1 fan and they''re able to just drop it over there. Is \",\"startTime\":1745509013,\"endTime\":1745509023},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"that OK? Thank you. So just let me know what I can do to support you and you \",\"startTime\":1745509023,\"endTime\":1745509027},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1745509025,\"endTime\":1745509025},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"guys like if I need to get the word out if we want to post about it in the BTC math coaches group if we want to. \",\"startTime\":1745509027,\"endTime\":1745509034},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Let''s do that and I''m going to reach out specifically to you. Like let''s have \",\"startTime\":1745509035,\"endTime\":1745509039},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"a thread going on where we can be reaching out to people strategically to to really leverage that. But yes. \",\"startTime\":1745509039,\"endTime\":1745509046},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"It''s free for anybody.\",\"startTime\":1745509047,\"endTime\":1745509048},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The tools working now, we have notifications so people can know when they have a match with somebody else or know when they''re getting an artifact or know when stuff''s happening. And then we get them in there and get them scheduled \",\"startTime\":1745509048,\"endTime\":1745509060},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"out to get a cadence so that they''re talking regularly with another educator. \",\"startTime\":1745509060,\"endTime\":1745509064},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s awesome. That''s awesome. Cool.\",\"startTime\":1745509063,\"endTime\":1745509067},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Let''s, let''s get the word out. And it''s free right now. Free for individuals, \",\"startTime\":1745509064,\"endTime\":1745509066},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745509066,\"endTime\":1745509069},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745509068,\"endTime\":1745509069},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So I love it.\",\"startTime\":1745509070,\"endTime\":1745509072},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"You are awesome, I am so excited to see you live in the dream.\",\"startTime\":1745509072,\"endTime\":1745509076},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Thanks.\",\"startTime\":1745509073,\"endTime\":1745509075},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"It''s scary and fun all at the same time, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745509078,\"endTime\":1745509081},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Alright, I''ll see you later. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1745509080,\"endTime\":1745509082},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"All right, have a great day. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1745509081,\"endTime\":1745509083}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.458046+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.458046+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 2279, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.430Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('07ce1bf9-a6c2-4a02-bcb4-f5836a7f2d2d', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '137229', '"[{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Hello.\",\"startTime\":1740420068,\"endTime\":1740420068},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Can you see my video? I can''t see it. I''m gonna hit res.\",\"startTime\":1740420068,\"endTime\":1740420071},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"There I am. Hello.\",\"startTime\":1740420074,\"endTime\":1740420075},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Can you, can you hear me now?\",\"startTime\":1740420076,\"endTime\":1740420078},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Hello. Yes, I can hear you. I can see you.\",\"startTime\":1740420077,\"endTime\":1740420081},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Great. That was weird. It was a blank screen, but somebody showed me up on the \",\"startTime\":1740420080,\"endTime\":1740420083},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"top there was a three little dots and then you click on that and you can restart video if you ever need to, and audio. \",\"startTime\":1740420083,\"endTime\":1740420090},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh awesome.\",\"startTime\":1740420090,\"endTime\":1740420091},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Happy Monday.\",\"startTime\":1740420091,\"endTime\":1740420092},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Happy Monday.\",\"startTime\":1740420093,\"endTime\":1740420094},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"The Oh, there''s an icebreaker. Oh, if you could have a.\",\"startTime\":1740420097,\"endTime\":1740420100},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"There is.\",\"startTime\":1740420098,\"endTime\":1740420099},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Superpower related to AI? What would it be and why?\",\"startTime\":1740420100,\"endTime\":1740420104},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s a good one.\",\"startTime\":1740420105,\"endTime\":1740420108},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Hmm, I think I''ve got one, but I want I want yours first. That''s OK.\",\"startTime\":1740420113,\"endTime\":1740420118},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"I think absolutely. I think I would go with.\",\"startTime\":1740420118,\"endTime\":1740420121},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Always being able to craft a prompt that will get me what I need.\",\"startTime\":1740420121,\"endTime\":1740420126},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh like what kind of prompts? Like in in like in an AI assistant or something? \",\"startTime\":1740420130,\"endTime\":1740420133},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Or a ChatGPT? \",\"startTime\":1740420133,\"endTime\":1740420137},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Like, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740420135,\"endTime\":1740420137},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah, just being able to.\",\"startTime\":1740420137,\"endTime\":1740420139},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Have that magic formula of icon.\",\"startTime\":1740420140,\"endTime\":1740420143},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Be specific enough yet vague enough to get exactly what I''m looking for and what''s going to help me the best, and be able to have those follow up prompts of like hey. \",\"startTime\":1740420145,\"endTime\":1740420156},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Without having to think about it.\",\"startTime\":1740420156,\"endTime\":1740420158},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, yeah, I totally hear you. And Allison, I''m trying to remember what''s \",\"startTime\":1740420159,\"endTime\":1740420162},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"your what''s your role again? \",\"startTime\":1740420162,\"endTime\":1740420164},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"I''m an MTSS coordinator at the elementary school in my district.\",\"startTime\":1740420164,\"endTime\":1740420169},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s right. Yeah. Oh, I can''t wait to hear more about that. And then I want \",\"startTime\":1740420169,\"endTime\":1740420173},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"to connect with some people who are totally in the same role, and some of them are across the country. And I''m like, oh, there''s so many special Ed and MTSS \",\"startTime\":1740420173,\"endTime\":1740420181},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh, sleep.\",\"startTime\":1740420179,\"endTime\":1740420180},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"coordinators and specialists. It''ll be fun to hear you chat about it because \",\"startTime\":1740420181,\"endTime\":1740420185},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I wonder about, like, your prompt when you''re saying that. Like, I''m imagining \",\"startTime\":1740420185,\"endTime\":1740420189},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"hearing from Dale about his prompts that he was asking for doing Ieps or modifying or adapting the lessons and things. \",\"startTime\":1740420189,\"endTime\":1740420197},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh absolutely. It helps with like behavior interventions, helps with academic \",\"startTime\":1740420196,\"endTime\":1740420201},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And I''m imagining for you, there''s gotta be so many different ways that you''re asking these tools to help and support you. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1740420197,\"endTime\":1740420204},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"interventions, creating tools for teachers. One project I have been working \",\"startTime\":1740420201,\"endTime\":1740420206},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"on is creating a Bank of like social stories that are that''s searchable. \",\"startTime\":1740420206,\"endTime\":1740420211},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"For our disciplinarian to use with kids who are having.\",\"startTime\":1740420220,\"endTime\":1740420224},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Trouble making good choices or who are struggling at recess. Just having something \",\"startTime\":1740420224,\"endTime\":1740420229},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"that they can refer to that''s already there, already kid friendly. \",\"startTime\":1740420229,\"endTime\":1740420233},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Has pictures and they can just engage with it without having to.\",\"startTime\":1740420233,\"endTime\":1740420238