r words of, of you''re using it and how easy it was. So I just \",\"startTime\":1740420602,\"endTime\":1740420606},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"need the time and sit down and do it and hopefully be able to bring that to people like you and the rest of the crew so that you don''t have to do it. I \",\"startTime\":1740420606,\"endTime\":1740420614},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"want you to have rich conversation with other people and get into it and hear from Dale and others and like, oh, wow. And then out of it, the notes were taken \",\"startTime\":1740420614,\"endTime\":1740420622},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1740420614,\"endTime\":1740420614},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"and then here''s all of your stuff. \",\"startTime\":1740420622,\"endTime\":1740420626},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And whatever that might look like. And and I''m not gonna share all of the fun, \",\"startTime\":1740420627,\"endTime\":1740420630},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"CS GO.\",\"startTime\":1740420627,\"endTime\":1740420628},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"but I have so many cool ideas of what would go on your. \",\"startTime\":1740420630,\"endTime\":1740420633},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Cool portfolio page, like even things like, hey, Dale said he could share this and here''s his share with you or or Allison said she could share this to other people of her learning and how she''s using it. Little blurb. So you just be \",\"startTime\":1740420634,\"endTime\":1740420646},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740420645,\"endTime\":1740420645},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"able to go, oh, this is my feed and I could get things or cool podcasts. I mean, \",\"startTime\":1740420646,\"endTime\":1740420650},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that''s where my mind envisions it at least. \",\"startTime\":1740420650,\"endTime\":1740420654},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740420653,\"endTim