hen I try. \",\"startTime\":1740421358,\"endTime\":1740421362},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We went back and forth and we recorded. \",\"startTime\":1740421362,\"endTime\":1740421366},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Conversation and dumped the transcript into ChatGPT and said hey give us what''s like next level. \",\"startTime\":1740421367,\"endTime\":1740421374},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Iterate it one more time and it was like our words but better. Like just took \",\"startTime\":1740421375,\"endTime\":1740421379},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740421376,\"endTime\":1740421377},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"all of our words and put them together like that was so slick. So I''m thinking \",\"startTime\":1740421379,\"endTime\":1740421384},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that same idea. We already have words that were already put together, so why \",\"startTime\":1740421384,\"endTime\":1740421388},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yes.\",\"startTime\":1740421384,\"endTime\":1740421387},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"not let it help generate it and then still feel like. \",\"startTime\":1740421388,\"endTime\":1740421393},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"How do I do? But right now I''m focusing on learning the new tool. Hey Jim. So \",\"startTime\":1740421393,\"endTime\":1740421396},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m not gonna do all the other stuff. I''m just gonna get something that works. \",\"startTime\":1740421396,\"endTime\":1740421399},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1740421402,\"endTime\":1740421402},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Well, I''m excited to explore using Hey Jen, particularly for our multilingual families and students being able to translate anything into home languages. \",\"startTime\":1740421403,\"endTime\":1740421412},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"I know it''s not. \",\"startTime\":1740421412,\"endTime\":1740421416},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"I don''t think it has as many like indigenous languages as would be as helpful for my school district, but as long as it keeps moving forward and gaining more languages I''m like Sky''s the limit here. \",\"startTime\":1740421418,\"endTime\":1740421432},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Uh, yeah, that''s why I need the AI superpower to know all of the tools and I can just grab the right one instantly. My other superpower is it would be like \",\"startTime\":1740421435,\"endTime\":1740421445},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740421442,\"endTime\":1740421443},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"from the matrix where I could download all of the how to usage of it and I''ll be just like fluent in it already. So I''ll just grab hey, Jen real quick and \",\"startTime\":1740421445,\"endTime\":1740421454},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740421453,\"endTime\":1740421455},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"then I''ll grab ChatGPT and I''ll be like 5 windows open and use them all like oh, and here''s your video. I''m gonna go for a walk. \",\"startTime\":1740421454,\"endTime\":1740421463},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''d be amazing.\",\"startTime\":1740421461,\"endTime\":1740421463},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"It''s like AI is great for those generative pieces. It''d be fun if when we get \",\"startTime\":1740421465,\"endTime\":1740421470},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"to the point where we can have it run actions for us, which is kind of why I like trying to make it generate code for Google Scripts, because then I can have it send things out or not necessarily send things out yet, but have it. \",\"startTime\":1740421470,\"endTime\":1740421487},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740421486,\"endTime\":1740421487},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Not just generate it, but make it happen.\",\"startTime\":1740421495,\"endTime\":1740421498},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\"