xt\":\"A lot more than 5 minutes of playing.\",\"startTime\":1738088449,\"endTime\":1738088453},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"But yeah, and I''ve, I''ve done a little bit of investigation and I believe it''s possible, but I, I am yet to really. \",\"startTime\":1738088454,\"endTime\":1738088462},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Spend, uh, any sort of block of time to to start working on it.\",\"startTime\":1738088463,\"endTime\":1738088469},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, give me again if you could in like.\",\"startTime\":1738088469,\"endTime\":1738088473},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Input output. What do you want the input to be? What do you want that output \",\"startTime\":1738088475,\"endTime\":1738088477},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"to be? \",\"startTime\":1738088477,\"endTime\":1738088480},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I want the input to be a.\",\"startTime\":1738088482,\"endTime\":1738088485},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"A list of meetings.\",\"startTime\":1738088487,\"endTime\":1738088488},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Like a spreadsheet for example with dates.\",\"startTime\":1738088488,\"endTime\":1738088491},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And I want.\",\"startTime\":1738088493,\"endTime\":1738088494},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I want to train a GPT to analyse that attachment.\",\"startTime\":1738088495,\"endTime\":1738088501},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And send out meeting requests a certain time in advance based on an IEP.\",\"startTime\":1738088503,\"endTime\":1738088510},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Meeting date.\",\"startTime\":1738088512,\"endTime\":1738088513},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And I want to.\",\"startTime\":1738088515,\"endTime\":1738088516},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Give the person options to to book a time.\",\"startTime\":1738088518,\"endTime\":1738088523},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And if they don''t respond, I want a certain I want to wait a certain period of time, send out an e-mail, wait a certain amount of time, send out an e-mail. \",\"startTime\":1738088524,\"endTime\":1738088532},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"If it doesn''t, if I don''t get a response after the third time, I then receive a message that I need to make phone calls, that type of thing. \",\"startTime\":1738088532,\"endTime\":1738088540},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Umm uh, so yeah, I guess like putting in a data set that allows AGPT to connect to my calendar. \",\"startTime\":1738088540,\"endTime\":1738088549},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And then automate.\",\"startTime\":1738088550,\"endTime\":1738088552},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Or with my e-mail. Basically like connecting with parents.\",\"startTime\":1738088554,\"endTime\":1738088559},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And still keep all of the data secure.\",\"startTime\":1738088561,\"endTime\":1738088563},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1738088563,\"endTime\":1738088564},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like the names of the students?\",\"startTime\":1738088564,\"endTime\":1738088567},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Emails and all of that, because these are students.\",\"startTime\":1738088568,\"endTime\":1738088571},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"That''s right.\",\"startTime\":1738088571,\"endTime\":1738088572},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m asking the GPT to get us a plan.\",\"startTime\":1738088577,\"endTime\":1738088580},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s what I''m doing. Not that we would do it, but that we would start by making \",\"startTime\":1738088581,\"endTime\":1738088584},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Nice. Oh well.\",\"startTime\":1738088583,\"endTime\":1738088585},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"a plan because. \",\"startTime\":1738088584,\"endTime\":1738088586},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Oh, I like, I like that question a lot.\",\"startTime\":1738088587,\"endTime\":1738088589},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"How do I make a plan for this?\",\"startTime\":1738088589,\"endTime\":1738088591},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''m just reading after I''m typing here.\",\"startTime\":1738088592,\"endTime\":1738088595},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We''re building a GPT.\",\"startTime\":1738088595,\"endTime\":1738088596},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And should build a plan special Ed students.\",\"startTime\":1738088598,\"endTime\":1738088600},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Uh, would you say they''re in a spreadsheet with dates? Uh.\",\"startTime\":1738088603,\"endTime\":1738088608},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Well, I I will create one for this purpose. Yep.\",\"startTime\":1738088607,\"endTime\":1738088611},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, do you know what you want to put in for details?\",\"startTime\":1738088612,\"endTime\":1738088614},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"It would be.\",\"startTime\":1738088615,\"endTime\":1738088616},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"It would be family name.\",\"startTime\":1738088617,\"endTime\":1738088620},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"It would be like initials of student. It would be.\",\"startTime\":1738088621,\"endTime\":1738088625},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"IEP end date.\",\"startTime\":1738088627,\"endTime\":1738088628},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"It would be.\",\"startTime\":1738088631,\"endTime\":1738088633},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Umm, the type of meeting.\",\"startTime\":1738088635,\"endTime\":1738088637},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"So a blurb you know that there would be like set.\",\"startTime\":1738088638,\"endTime\":1738088641},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I would have multiple.\",\"startTime\":1738088642,\"endTime\":1738088644},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Blurbs based on what type of meeting it is. What''s the ask?\",\"startTime\":1738088646,\"endTime\":1738088650},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And then?\",\"startTime\":1738088651,\"endTime\":1738088652},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"It would be like meeting.\",\"startTime\":1738088654,\"endTime\":1738088656},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Uh, what else would be in that?\",\"startTime\":1738088659,\"endTime\":1738088660},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"It would be options to connect, so it would be like.\",\"startTime\":1738088662,\"endTime\":1738088666},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"You know Google meet a in person over the phone? Yeah. So options to connect. \",\"startTime\":1738088666,\"endTime\":1738088673},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I like this. It sounds to me like it''s almost about using the tools that you \",\"startTime\":1738088676,\"endTime\":1738088681},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"have available, like a spreadsheet and what you can do on your own and even the Google connections. I know some Google well, some tools that aren''t necessarily \",\"startTime\":1738088681,\"endTime\":1738088691},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"even Google, a lot of connect to Google for doing. \",\"startTime\":1738088691,\"endTime\":1738088695},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Your calendaring like pick a date that works for you so they can see open dates and then they can just claim it that you''re looking at how do you get back to \",\"startTime\":1738088697,\"endTime\":1738088703},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1738088698,\"endTime\":1738088699},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738088703,\"endTime\":1738088703},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, now that we want we want to verify that they''re actually signing up and that they''re that they''re on my calendar so I know that they''re going to be meeting. \",\"startTime\":1738088703,\"endTime\":1738088713},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"That''s right.\",\"startTime\":1738088714,\"endTime\":1738088714},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Just just curious, why do you want to do all this?\",\"startTime\":1738088715,\"endTime\":1738088717},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Because I spent a long a lot of time doing this and and if I, if I review and I I have reviewed what I''m doing in terms of time wise I''m spending. \",\"startTime\":1738088718,\"endTime\":1738088730},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"A lot of time navigating the IEP process and that includes.\",\"startTime\":1738088731,\"endTime\":1738088737},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Chasing parent meetings. Reschedule parent meetings. Reaching out to parents. \",\"startTime\":1738088740,\"endTime\":1738088745},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Phoning again. OK, you didn''t come to this meeting. When are you available?\",\"startTime\":1738088745,\"endTime\":1738088748},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"All of those peace.\",\"startTime\":1738088748,\"endTime\":1738088749},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And you would you would love to have some of the district hire an assistant \",\"startTime\":1738088751,\"endTime\":1738088754},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"to work with you to take care of that ''cause that would free you up to do the other work that you really want to do. \",\"startTime\":1738088754,\"endTime\":1738088759},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"That''s right.\",\"startTime\":1738088760,\"endTime\":1738088761},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Oh, I love it.\",\"startTime\":1738088761,\"endTime\":1738088762},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, I don''t have it built yet, but I''m going to get the plan here. I''m not hitting \",\"startTime\":1738088763,\"endTime\":1738088767},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"enter yet, and I did start a new thread because I didn''t want it to be confused. \",\"startTime\":1738088767,\"endTime\":1738088770},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''m just curious. \",\"startTime\":1738088770,\"endTime\":1738088774},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I appreciate you doing that, Jeff. Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1738088772,\"endTime\":1738088774},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK date.\",\"startTime\":1738088778,\"endTime\":1738088780},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1738088781,\"endTime\":1738088781},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I was hacking in different ways and I gotta make sure it makes sense to the GPT before I hit enter. \",\"startTime\":1738088784,\"endTime\":1738088788},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m just going to hit enter and see what happens.\",\"startTime\":1738088796,\"endTime\":1738088799},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Something went wrong.\",\"startTime\":1738088801,\"endTime\":1738088802},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"It seems to be that.\",\"startTime\":1738088804,\"endTime\":1738088805},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We are overloading the GPTS at times of late. Maybe it''s middle of the day like \",\"startTime\":1738088806,\"endTime\":1738088811},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"this or we''re doing it OK, something went wrong, it''s a problem persists come. \",\"startTime\":1738088811,\"endTime\":1738088815},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Also found that I can edit my messages and sometimes just re editing it umm and then entering it again gets me action uh. But I do know we''ve got this going \",\"startTime\":1738088818,\"endTime\":1738088828},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738088826,\"endTime\":1738088826},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"so I''m loving this idea to to plan for it. \",\"startTime\":1738088828,\"endTime\":1738088832},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Something went wrong. I''m just gonna copy this.\",\"startTime\":1738088836,\"endTime\":1738088839},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And try it in a different GPT.\",\"startTime\":1738088840,\"endTime\":1738088842},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''ve never thought about using GPT like Claude.\",\"startTime\":1738088845,\"endTime\":1738088849},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"To plan for how to build a open AI GPT.\",\"startTime\":1738088851,\"endTime\":1738088856},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m really liking this idea now and it''s hurting my brain in a good way. Kinda \",\"startTime\":1738088859,\"endTime\":1738088862},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"reminds me of, of, of hiring somebody from Microsoft to come work with you at, uh, Apple, because they have different perspectives and it''s really helped do that, Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1738088862,\"endTime\":1738088873},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738088872,\"endTime\":1738088872},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m signing into. Claude copied it.\",\"startTime\":1738088875,\"endTime\":1738088877},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"No worries. And Jeff, just for time. I''ve got about 3 or 4 more minutes before \",\"startTime\":1738088878,\"endTime\":1738088881},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I have to be somewhere. \",\"startTime\":1738088881,\"endTime\":1738088884},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1738088883,\"endTime\":1738088883},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I get lost in this. That was more than 5 minutes. I''m looking at it now. Yeah, \",\"startTime\":1738088884,\"endTime\":1738088887},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m going to give that a thumbs up and I will send this to you when I get anything. \",\"startTime\":1738088887,\"endTime\":1738088893},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh boy, it''s doing something cool, but I''ll share it with you and we''ll check in for sure tomorrow. Let me see the challenge we got the more. \",\"startTime\":1738088894,\"endTime\":1738088903},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1738088900,\"endTime\":1738088901},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Awesome. And oh.\",\"startTime\":1738088905,\"endTime\":1738088907},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Thanks. And I, I, I learned that I need to remember that. Thanks for the time. \",\"startTime\":1738088909,\"endTime\":1738088913},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And I learned from you that funny things that are stupid are just still human. \",\"startTime\":1738088913,\"endTime\":1738088917},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And that''s OK. Whatever we call them stupid or not, they still are part of life. \",\"startTime\":1738088917,\"endTime\":1738088921},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And there''s no, no reason to even call them maybe stupid and just enjoy them a little bit more. For me. That''s what that''s what I''m learning today. \",\"startTime\":1738088921,\"endTime\":1738088929},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah. Nice mate. There''s fun in it. I learned that if it doesn''t \",\"startTime\":1738088926,\"endTime\":1738088931},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"work in one way, try something else. Try. Try a different GPT, try a different \",\"startTime\":1738088931,\"endTime\":1738088936},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"window. \",\"startTime\":1738088936,\"endTime\":1738088940},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yeah, ask a different question. Change the question words like.\",\"startTime\":1738088942,\"endTime\":1738088947},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yeah, just.\",\"startTime\":1738088948,\"endTime\":1738088949},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Try something different.\",\"startTime\":1738088950,\"endTime\":1738088951},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738088952,\"endTime\":1738088953},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, well, I feel charged and ready for the day, even though I''m overcoming my viral infection of some zombie infection that I picked up. But I''m coming \",\"startTime\":1738088953,\"endTime\":1738088963},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"back from the dead and and I''ll be all ready for next week. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1738088963,\"endTime\":1738088967},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"No, I''m glad, mate. OK, let''s go tomorrow so we can talk a bit about our presentation \",\"startTime\":1738088965,\"endTime\":1738088968},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"too. \",\"startTime\":1738088968,\"endTime\":1738088971},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, OK. Sounds good. Sounds good. Cheers, mate.\",\"startTime\":1738088971,\"endTime\":1738088976},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"OK. Cheers. Thanks.\",\"startTime\":1738088975,\"endTime\":1738088976},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Later, bye.\",\"startTime\":1738088976,\"endTime\":1738088977}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.51597+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.51597+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1684, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:28.226Z", "session_title": "Understanding and Utilizing GPT and AI Threads", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "197", "name": "Understanding and Utilizing GPT and AI Threads", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('99a3fbcb-01ef-4bca-8d3b-e90bbc155577', '86f608d8-be4a-47b2-9c8a-b0b3fb52dabb', '134638', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"How are you?\",\"startTime\":1732054754,\"endTime\":1732054755},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Good morning.\",\"startTime\":1732054754,\"endTime\":1732054755},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"So it''s asking me to tell you, ask you to share a fun fact about yourself.\",\"startTime\":1732054757,\"endTime\":1732054761},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"I don''t like cheese. I don''t know, but I don''t like cheese, all right?\",\"startTime\":1732054764,\"endTime\":1732054770},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1732054767,\"endTime\":1732054767},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Perfect.\",\"startTime\":1732054771,\"endTime\":1732054771},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"So, Sherry, a fun fact about yourself.\",\"startTime\":1732054774,\"endTime\":1732054777},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I do like cheese.\",\"startTime\":1732054778,\"endTime\":1732054779},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"There we go. Fair enough. OK, how do how do we? That is a big one. I''m a real \",\"startTime\":1732054780,\"endTime\":1732054788},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"What makes you an effective leader? Oh, that''s a bigger one.\",\"startTime\":1732054787,\"endTime\":1732054790},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"big believer in team. Everything that I do is centered around team. It''s we. \",\"startTime\":1732054788,\"endTime\":1732054795},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Everything is we and I think that inclusiveness helps move things forward. So \",\"startTime\":1732054802,\"endTime\":1732054807},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"same question for you. \",\"startTime\":1732054807,\"endTime\":1732054812},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1732054810,\"endTime\":1732054810},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I''m still learning that I''m, you know, three years deep in being an assistant principal. But I think the ability to form relationships and listen to people \",\"startTime\":1732054816,\"endTime\":1732054824},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"is, is really a good start in doing that. And a teacher the other day said, \",\"startTime\":1732054824,\"endTime\":1732054828},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"thank you for saying yes. And I said, what do you mean by that? She goes, you''re \",\"startTime\":1732054828,\"endTime\":1732054832},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"always open to new ideas. I said, oh, cool, OK. I didn''t know what she meant. \",\"startTime\":1732054832,\"endTime\":1732054836},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"So that was cool to hear that. \",\"startTime\":1732054836,\"endTime\":1732054840},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. OK, let''s see.\",\"startTime\":1732054841,\"endTime\":1732054844},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"All right, what''s the next goal in your leadership journey?\",\"startTime\":1732054846,\"endTime\":1732054850},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"I want to be principal either at a junior high or an elementary school.\",\"startTime\":1732054852,\"endTime\":1732054855},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Perfect.\",\"startTime\":1732054859,\"endTime\":1732054859},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"So same. Oh, I''m sorry. Let''s go back because I was supposed to ask you that \",\"startTime\":1732054859,\"endTime\":1732054864},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"question. Yeah. What''s the next goal of your leadership? Right. OK, Let''s see \",\"startTime\":1732054864,\"endTime\":1732054868},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Bye bye.\",\"startTime\":1732054865,\"endTime\":1732054866},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I agree. I''m debating whether to, I''m not done at the current school I''m at, \",\"startTime\":1732054868,\"endTime\":1732054873},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"here. There we are. After hearing from your partner, Cher, what is the strength \",\"startTime\":1732054868,\"endTime\":1732054872},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"of your schools? \",\"startTime\":1732054872,\"endTime\":1732054876},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"but I don''t know if you''re ever going to be done right. And so there''s some \",\"startTime\":1732054873,\"endTime\":1732054877},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"things I''m looking at is is it time for me to move on to the next level? Do \",\"startTime\":1732054877,\"endTime\":1732054881},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I go to a new district and become an assistant or do I go up to principal this next level? I don''t know if three years is enough, but I''m in the same boat. \",\"startTime\":1732054881,\"endTime\":1732054890},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I''m like looking for that. What is the next step? So yeah, how old do you think? \",\"startTime\":1732054890,\"endTime\":1732054894},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"What? What?\",\"startTime\":1732054904,\"endTime\":1732054905},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah. So what is the strength of your school''s culture?\",\"startTime\":1732054906,\"endTime\":1732054909},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"We are really, it''s just we became really inclusive. We do the wrong Clark system \",\"startTime\":1732054911,\"endTime\":1732054916},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"where we have house and we build our whole culture around that house site in. \",\"startTime\":1732054916,\"endTime\":1732054921},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1732054918,\"endTime\":1732054918},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"So in two years we really gotten it going and it''s all about us and our houses and how we can better our school. So we''ve done some really good things there. \",\"startTime\":1732054923,\"endTime\":1732054935},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"That''s cool. Yeah, we''re struggling with culture. There''s been a huge influx \",\"startTime\":1732054937,\"endTime\":1732054941},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"of Guatemalan population. We''re at 30% of our school in the last 10 years, so \",\"startTime\":1732054941,\"endTime\":1732054946},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"it''s grown from nothing to 30%. And so really looking at integrating a different \",\"startTime\":1732054946,\"endTime\":1732054950},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"culture and in in a authentic way, not a fake way. So that''s one of the things \",\"startTime\":1732054950,\"endTime\":1732054954},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1732054953,\"endTime\":1732054953},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"we''ve been struggling with. \",\"startTime\":1732054954,\"endTime\":1732054959},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Are you guys have got a ton? We''ve got some, but it''s about 30%.\",\"startTime\":1732054959,\"endTime\":1732054965},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s 30% and growing. So yeah, it''s been crazy.\",\"startTime\":1732054964,\"endTime\":1732054968},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1732054967,\"endTime\":1732054967},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"What do we have next?\",\"startTime\":1732054970,\"endTime\":1732054971},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"What is an area of work for you in regard to schools culture?\",\"startTime\":1732054972,\"endTime\":1732054976},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"We need to. We got the kids aboard. We need to really do a better job of getting \",\"startTime\":1732054979,\"endTime\":1732054983},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"the parents involved as well on a more consistent basis. I get them to start \",\"startTime\":1732054983,\"endTime\":1732054987},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"living part of our school with their kids. \",\"startTime\":1732054987,\"endTime\":1732054991},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Right now. Perfect. Yeah. Because your middle level as well, right? Yeah. And \",\"startTime\":1732054993,\"endTime\":1732054998},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"so I think the elementary, we''re talking about this last night at either dinner or drinks, I don''t remember which one, but about how you go into middle school and getting that parent involvement is a super big challenge. It''s not a big \",\"startTime\":1732054998,\"endTime\":1732055012},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1732054999,\"endTime\":1732054999},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"deal in elementary school. And then it''s like middle school comes like you''re \",\"startTime\":1732055012,\"endTime\":1732055017},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"on your own. We''re good. And so that''s what we''re looking at too, is. \",\"startTime\":1732055017,\"endTime\":1732055019},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Is really getting parents and and and getting student by and especially when even people in their own culture, it takes them about four years to learn how to trust school officials. So that''s. Yeah, right. Yeah, yeah. They don''t understand \",\"startTime\":1732055019,\"endTime\":1732055038},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well, seeing the parents get this idea that it''s secondary, so they don''t need them as much, They need you more. \",\"startTime\":1732055033,\"endTime\":1732055039},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"that, but that''s OK All right. So go ahead. Yeah. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1732055038,\"endTime\":1732055044},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we''ll get there.\",\"startTime\":1732055043,\"endTime\":1732055043},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Well, thank you, Kevin. I appreciate your time. I learned that we share a lot \",\"startTime\":1732055050,\"endTime\":1732055055},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"of the same direction, a lot of the same wants, you know, same improvement efforts. \",\"startTime\":1732055055,\"endTime\":1732055060},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Agreed.\",\"startTime\":1732055060,\"endTime\":1732055060}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.606906+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.606906+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 320, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:40.395Z", "session_title": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1416", "name": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "tags": [{"name": "BEL"}, {"name": "LSL"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
