	('8151d28c-49ed-4e4a-936b-c16f8e14d6e5', 'a978d068-04bc-45ac-b24c-f6e367bb9007', '136122', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Oh, this is recording OK. This is oh.\",\"startTime\":1736467285,\"endTime\":1736467287},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Hello.\",\"startTime\":1736467287,\"endTime\":1736467287},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"One second.\",\"startTime\":1736467293,\"endTime\":1736467295},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Hi.\",\"startTime\":1736467296,\"endTime\":1736467296},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Are you there? I''m not sure if this is recording something or if we''re having \",\"startTime\":1736467301,\"endTime\":1736467305},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"a live conversation. I''m going to read the icebreaker. I don''t know if you can \",\"startTime\":1736467305,\"endTime\":1736467308},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"see me. \",\"startTime\":1736467308,\"endTime\":1736467311},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Share a fun fact about something you were involved in during high school that helped shape your career pathway. \",\"startTime\":1736467319,\"endTime\":1736467325},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"I was oh hey, how you doing? Good, This is my first time using this I have to \",\"startTime\":1736467327,\"endTime\":1736467331},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Oh, there you are. Are you there? Oh, good. How are you?\",\"startTime\":1736467328,\"endTime\":1736467331},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"admit. \",\"startTime\":1736467331,\"endTime\":1736467335},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Where? What school are you at? I used to live in Edmonds a million years ago. \",\"startTime\":1736467339,\"endTime\":1736467344},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"I''m out at Kingston High School. How about you?\",\"startTime\":1736467340,\"endTime\":1736467342},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"What? Hey, cool.\",\"startTime\":1736467346,\"endTime\":1736467348},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, now I''m in Kennewick, WA. Kennewick.\",\"startTime\":1736467349,\"endTime\":1736467352},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Nice Ray.\",\"startTime\":1736467349,\"endTime\":1736467350},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Where you at now? Very cool. Nice. Have you have you used the a lot? I''m afraid \",\"startTime\":1736467350,\"endTime\":1736467356},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"to hit more like I can''t quite see you there, but every time I I''m afraid to touch anything on the screen, ''cause I don''t know what''s gonna happen. Oh, Yep. \",\"startTime\":1736467356,\"endTime\":1736467368},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Oh no, if you click more it tells you the icebreaker.\",\"startTime\":1736467365,\"endTime\":1736467368},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah. OK, OK. I wasn''t sure if yeah that it was recording my response \",\"startTime\":1736467368,\"endTime\":1736467374},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Share a fun fact about something you''re involved in during high school that helps shape your career pathway. \",\"startTime\":1736467370,\"endTime\":1736467374},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"or what was how this works. So yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736467374,\"endTime\":1736467380},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. Well, for a while, I, I''m in the Tuesday morning group and for like \",\"startTime\":1736467387,\"endTime\":1736467392},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"3 Tuesdays in a row, I got the same person. I think we''re the only two that \",\"startTime\":1736467392,\"endTime\":1736467396},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Got it. Yeah. Yeah. I''ve wanted to join in the mornings, but I''m usually at \",\"startTime\":1736467396,\"endTime\":1736467401},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"sign in Tuesday morning. I think. I think that would be frowned upon to have \",\"startTime\":1736467396,\"endTime\":1736467401},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"the gym and I''m in the locker room, so I feel like people would frown upon that. \",\"startTime\":1736467401,\"endTime\":1736467405},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"a recording device with a camera on it. Yeah, I I agree. Yeah. I would encourage \",\"startTime\":1736467401,\"endTime\":1736467405},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"you that you don''t want to end up on the front page of the Everett Herald. \",\"startTime\":1736467405,\"endTime\":1736467409},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, there''s, yeah, there''s signs up that say don''t do that.\",\"startTime\":1736467411,\"endTime\":1736467415},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. Not for that.\",\"startTime\":1736467420,\"endTime\":1736467422},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so something I was involved in in high school.\",\"startTime\":1736467424,\"endTime\":1736467427},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"How long have you been at Kingston? How long have you been at Kingston? Third \",\"startTime\":1736467426,\"endTime\":1736467430},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"This is my third year. Third year, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467429,\"endTime\":1736467432},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"year. OK. Who was there before you? I think I knew them from Leavenworth. \",\"startTime\":1736467430,\"endTime\":1736467435},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"For Jack Simonson right before me and then Christy Cole.\",\"startTime\":1736467435,\"endTime\":1736467439},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK. I think Jack Simonton came from Leavenworth also.\",\"startTime\":1736467440,\"endTime\":1736467445},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Was he? Was he? Well, he was. He was in North for a long time. Oh, but you and \",\"startTime\":1736467443,\"endTime\":1736467446},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"I met in Leavenworth, right, I think. \",\"startTime\":1736467446,\"endTime\":1736467450},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"No, no, no. He was in North. He was an assistant principal. Yeah, but maybe \",\"startTime\":1736467454,\"endTime\":1736467460},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"he spent some time out there. Yeah, I could be wrong. Yep, I could be wrong. \",\"startTime\":1736467460,\"endTime\":1736467465},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yes, that''s fact. \",\"startTime\":1736467465,\"endTime\":1736467470},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Oh, I''m going to Google it because Google has everything. Yeah. Oh well.\",\"startTime\":1736467470,\"endTime\":1736467475},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"I could be wrong, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467476,\"endTime\":1736467478},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK. What was what did you do when you were in high school that made you want \",\"startTime\":1736467481,\"endTime\":1736467483},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"to be a principal? \",\"startTime\":1736467483,\"endTime\":1736467486},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Well, I had AI didn''t want to be a principal, but I I was in theater and.\",\"startTime\":1736467487,\"endTime\":1736467494},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"My theater teacher was the one who told me that I was going to be a teacher. \",\"startTime\":1736467495,\"endTime\":1736467503},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"And I definitely, I admired her so much. So I I definitely, you know, wanted \",\"startTime\":1736467503,\"endTime\":1736467511},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"What? What high school?\",\"startTime\":1736467509,\"endTime\":1736467512},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"to North kids app Yeah. And yeah, yeah. How about you? Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736467511,\"endTime\":1736467520},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1736467515,\"endTime\":1736467516},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Very cool. I did a lot of leadership in high school. ASV, leadership, athletics. \",\"startTime\":1736467517,\"endTime\":1736467521},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I was in one play. \",\"startTime\":1736467521,\"endTime\":1736467525},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, just the normal stuff. I had good teachers. I wanted to be a teacher, \",\"startTime\":1736467531,\"endTime\":1736467536},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I did not want to be a principal. And here I am 25 years later, still principally. \",\"startTime\":1736467536,\"endTime\":1736467540},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah, same.\",\"startTime\":1736467536,\"endTime\":1736467538},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. How long, how long have you been at your current school?\",\"startTime\":1736467542,\"endTime\":1736467545},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Hi, 20 years.\",\"startTime\":1736467545,\"endTime\":1736467547},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Nice. Oh, I love it. So, so many folks that don''t stay that long. I really, \",\"startTime\":1736467550,\"endTime\":1736467556},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"I hope that I can stay at Kingston for a long time. That''s great. That''s inspiring. \",\"startTime\":1736467556,\"endTime\":1736467562},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s a grind. It''s a grind. Yep.\",\"startTime\":1736467564,\"endTime\":1736467568},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1736467566,\"endTime\":1736467567},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467568,\"endTime\":1736467568},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK, click on Next.\",\"startTime\":1736467572,\"endTime\":1736467573},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"All right, what system? Yeah, I see that and and I see the next share. What \",\"startTime\":1736467572,\"endTime\":1736467575},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"systems do you have in place to help students pursue post secondary education? \",\"startTime\":1736467575,\"endTime\":1736467579},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"OK. \",\"startTime\":1736467579,\"endTime\":1736467583},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"So this is actually something that.\",\"startTime\":1736467585,\"endTime\":1736467587},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So we psat every thought. Go ahead. OK, so we psat in a very software and junior. \",\"startTime\":1736467586,\"endTime\":1736467596},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"No, you go for it.\",\"startTime\":1736467593,\"endTime\":1736467593},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"All thousand of them. We do a massive push for AP, for college readiness. We''re \",\"startTime\":1736467605,\"endTime\":1736467609},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"doing school day SAT this year. We do college visits. I mean, we do a ton that \",\"startTime\":1736467609,\"endTime\":1736467614},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"that''s what we do. \",\"startTime\":1736467614,\"endTime\":1736467619},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Nice.\",\"startTime\":1736467626,\"endTime\":1736467627},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"We.\",\"startTime\":1736467630,\"endTime\":1736467630},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"We are not at that point. I would not say that that is our culture.\",\"startTime\":1736467632,\"endTime\":1736467636},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"We one one thing that I that I put in place this year, we.\",\"startTime\":1736467638,\"endTime\":1736467644},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Didn''t have our like career and our guidance counseling together, so we created a guidance and career counseling office. Our team went to an avid session together \",\"startTime\":1736467647,\"endTime\":1736467656},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"last summer because I really wanted to. \",\"startTime\":1736467656,\"endTime\":1736467661},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"We''re we''re in.\",\"startTime\":1736467663,\"endTime\":1736467665},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Year, this is my third year in the district. I forget maybe fifth year of implementation \",\"startTime\":1736467666,\"endTime\":1736467670},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"of AVID, but still in the very, very early stages, but I wanted to capitalize on. \",\"startTime\":1736467670,\"endTime\":1736467677},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"On that framework and and culture to start building in robust more robust systems because. \",\"startTime\":1736467679,\"endTime\":1736467684},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"That that is not there for us, you know, especially to to that level that you have we. \",\"startTime\":1736467688,\"endTime\":1736467693},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Umm, we don''t have umm, an SAT day like that that you offer. Uh, we do some \",\"startTime\":1736467695,\"endTime\":1736467701},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"PSAT testing. Umm, we do have several. \",\"startTime\":1736467701,\"endTime\":1736467707},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So we''re going to.\",\"startTime\":1736467705,\"endTime\":1736467707},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"I was going to say, we have several AP classes for such a small school. We''re \",\"startTime\":1736467709,\"endTime\":1736467713},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"a really small high school, but we''re also our district is really shifting more into the college and the high school programs. \",\"startTime\":1736467713,\"endTime\":1736467720},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"As a focus. And so I''m curious to see how the way of of AP is going to go for \",\"startTime\":1736467722,\"endTime\":1736467725},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"us. \",\"startTime\":1736467725,\"endTime\":1736467728},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Are you offering OK?\",\"startTime\":1736467730,\"endTime\":1736467732},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So I have fought College in the high school. We don''t you can''t serve 2 masters. \",\"startTime\":1736467730,\"endTime\":1736467734},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So we don''t do any College in the high school. We a little bit with CTE but \",\"startTime\":1736467734,\"endTime\":1736467739},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"that''s it. You can do your school day SAT on the same day. Are you guys doing \",\"startTime\":1736467739,\"endTime\":1736467744},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467740,\"endTime\":1736467744},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Smarter Balance coming up? So do your school day SAT for your juniors and seniors \",\"startTime\":1736467744,\"endTime\":1736467749},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"who have passed the smarter Balance assessment. \",\"startTime\":1736467749,\"endTime\":1736467754},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467749,\"endTime\":1736467749},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1736467758,\"endTime\":1736467760},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"And just do it within that same day. OK. Thank you. Yeah, Bernice, very cool. \",\"startTime\":1736467762,\"endTime\":1736467766},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. That''s how we''re doing ours, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467765,\"endTime\":1736467769},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we do a lot of we do a lot of invitations of we have a lot of college visits on the campus. \",\"startTime\":1736467766,\"endTime\":1736467775},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"All right, ready next?\",\"startTime\":1736467774,\"endTime\":1736467775},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"We don''t get a we, we do. We have some visits out, but we find very few of our \",\"startTime\":1736467782,\"endTime\":1736467787},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467783,\"endTime\":1736467783},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"students are able to to make the travel happen. So. \",\"startTime\":1736467787,\"endTime\":1736467792},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"It''s just a short little ferry ride.\",\"startTime\":1736467797,\"endTime\":1736467799},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467800,\"endTime\":1736467800},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Right at Edmonds Community College at $35 a trip. All right click on Next.\",\"startTime\":1736467804,\"endTime\":1736467809},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467805,\"endTime\":1736467806},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Oh, oh, OK. I don''t have a next. I''m gonna have a partner ready next. OK, OK. \",\"startTime\":1736467811,\"endTime\":1736467818},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"And then I read what''s on here or can you see this also, OK?\",\"startTime\":1736467822,\"endTime\":1736467826},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I see it also.\",\"startTime\":1736467830,\"endTime\":1736467832},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"OK, let''s see.\",\"startTime\":1736467832,\"endTime\":1736467834},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So what are your biggest challenges in sporting students to accept post secondary? \",\"startTime\":1736467847,\"endTime\":1736467851},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I think society for a while has been sending a message that post secondary is not important. So it''s combating that social message that''s out there. And then \",\"startTime\":1736467851,\"endTime\":1736467861},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"like we track through National Student Clearinghouse. \",\"startTime\":1736467861,\"endTime\":1736467866},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467865,\"endTime\":1736467866},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467872,\"endTime\":1736467873},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"What? What do you track in there? Yeah, I think so. I think so.\",\"startTime\":1736467891,\"endTime\":1736467895},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Are we glitching?\",\"startTime\":1736467895,\"endTime\":1736467896},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Oh, we track post secondary resiliency. So how many kids at the end of their \",\"startTime\":1736467898,\"endTime\":1736467904},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1736467902,\"endTime\":1736467903},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"first year college come back for a second? We track that not bigs, no post COVID \",\"startTime\":1736467904,\"endTime\":1736467910},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah, Yeah. Have have you seen any notice trends going up or down recently? \",\"startTime\":1736467908,\"endTime\":1736467913},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"a little bit for us. We put more kids to schools in Arizona now than we do. \",\"startTime\":1736467910,\"endTime\":1736467915},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736467913,\"endTime\":1736467918},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"We we had a huge whitwork contingency for a couple years W was Whitworth, WSU eastern. We almost had nobody to eastern now and GCU is taking a huge. \",\"startTime\":1736467915,\"endTime\":1736467927},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Of our kids.\",\"startTime\":1736467940,\"endTime\":1736467941},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Have you heard of the I just learned yesterday of the Read Promise? Did you \",\"startTime\":1736467941,\"endTime\":1736467945},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"hear about that? I had not heard about that until yesterday. \",\"startTime\":1736467945,\"endTime\":1736467949},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep, it''s really it''s really just marketing though. It''s just guaranteed admission \",\"startTime\":1736467949,\"endTime\":1736467953},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"and all the colleges want kids so bad anyways. \",\"startTime\":1736467953,\"endTime\":1736467958},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, isn''t it? It''s not, it''s not as.\",\"startTime\":1736467958,\"endTime\":1736467962},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Impactful as it sounds for the tuition, oh, it says 100% tuition covered for the families making less than $100,000. \",\"startTime\":1736467965,\"endTime\":1736467975},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"No, I don''t think so. Right. But they would get that anyways through FAFSA, \",\"startTime\":1736467967,\"endTime\":1736467970},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736467970,\"endTime\":1736467974},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1736467984,\"endTime\":1736467986},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Got it. I guess times have changed since I applied for college ''cause my family \",\"startTime\":1736467988,\"endTime\":1736467992},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"definitely made less than 100,000 but I did not have that type of a financial aid package offered to me. \",\"startTime\":1736467992,\"endTime\":1736467999},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I think it''s a family of four, yeah. It''s kind of like when you go to Whitworth, \",\"startTime\":1736468000,\"endTime\":1736468005},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1736468003,\"endTime\":1736468003},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"the starting tag is 68,000 and then they get it down to 35,000. Then they increase \",\"startTime\":1736468005,\"endTime\":1736468011},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468007,\"endTime\":1736468011},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"it 10% a year every year there, but they don''t increase your financial aid package. \",\"startTime\":1736468011,\"endTime\":1736468016},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but but this one would be your tuition would be zero. Yeah, OK. Yeah, \",\"startTime\":1736468018,\"endTime\":1736468023},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"I don''t that seemed to be. Yeah, again, I don''t have a next. I''ll hit more, \",\"startTime\":1736468023,\"endTime\":1736468028},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I just Googled it. Yeah, all right. Click on next.\",\"startTime\":1736468025,\"endTime\":1736468029},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"see what happens. \",\"startTime\":1736468028,\"endTime\":1736468033},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Underneath more There you go. What do you hear from students is the greatest \",\"startTime\":1736468041,\"endTime\":1736468044},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1736468043,\"endTime\":1736468043},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"reason they''re not pursuing or thinking about? \",\"startTime\":1736468044,\"endTime\":1736468047},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"What what I hear from from our students who aren''t planning to go to school. \",\"startTime\":1736468052,\"endTime\":1736468058},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Is that?\",\"startTime\":1736468060,\"endTime\":1736468060},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"They just, they have other plans already that they don''t see the purpose of going to college. And so it''s similar to like what you had shared for. \",\"startTime\":1736468063,\"endTime\":1736468075},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"That cultural messaging, I think it''s connected to that.\",\"startTime\":1736468077,\"endTime\":1736468081},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"We.\",\"startTime\":1736468083,\"endTime\":1736468084},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Are in a high poverty community and I think that there is that''s that''s part of the culture. \",\"startTime\":1736468086,\"endTime\":1736468094},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Of it''s almost like a.\",\"startTime\":1736468096,\"endTime\":1736468097},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"It seems elitist, you know, to go to college and so.\",\"startTime\":1736468102,\"endTime\":1736468106},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Umm, there''s like a, an anathema to that. Umm, and I don''t, I don''t need it. \",\"startTime\":1736468108,\"endTime\":1736468113},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Umm, I''m gonna be fine without it. I''ve got, I''ve already, I already know what \",\"startTime\":1736468113,\"endTime\":1736468117},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"I wanna do and I, I kinda just, I wanna get on with my life. I''m done. Like \",\"startTime\":1736468117,\"endTime\":1736468122},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"school is such a negative experience that I''m just done with it. Umm, and the \",\"startTime\":1736468122,\"endTime\":1736468127},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"students who are enjoying their experience in school. \",\"startTime\":1736468127,\"endTime\":1736468131},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"It''s a different conversation and so it''s a lot of climate and culture related also. \",\"startTime\":1736468132,\"endTime\":1736468137},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"So I think that''s a that''s a big reason. Another reason is just students who \",\"startTime\":1736468141,\"endTime\":1736468147},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"are not wanting their, they''re very committed to their, their caretakers within their families. And they do they have a lot of responsibilities and they don''t \",\"startTime\":1736468147,\"endTime\":1736468159},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"feel. \",\"startTime\":1736468159,\"endTime\":1736468165},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"That that is an option for them to leave home.\",\"startTime\":1736468167,\"endTime\":1736468170},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"And go to school and so umm, it''s not a, it''s just not a reality for them that they see UMM as an option. \",\"startTime\":1736468170,\"endTime\":1736468179},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"All right, next.\",\"startTime\":1736468186,\"endTime\":1736468193},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"What do you hear similar things from your students who are who aren''t pursuing it? Sounds like you''ve really probably a strong read. Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736468190,\"endTime\":1736468196},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Basically, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468194,\"endTime\":1736468196},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we we kind of have the the haves and the have nots. Our biggest one is \",\"startTime\":1736468198,\"endTime\":1736468203},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"trying to push more specifically male, Hispanic, male Hispanic poverty into post secondary, but we''re not having good luck with that yet. But I said yeah, \",\"startTime\":1736468203,\"endTime\":1736468212},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468205,\"endTime\":1736468206},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1736468211,\"endTime\":1736468212},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468212,\"endTime\":1736468216},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"because I have a growth mindset. \",\"startTime\":1736468212,\"endTime\":1736468216},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Yeah. Well, thank you for sharing. I am going to look into, I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1736468222,\"endTime\":1736468226},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"look into this, the schedule of the SBA and and doing a school day SAT to see if it''s not too late for us to organize something like that with our counseling team. \",\"startTime\":1736468226,\"endTime\":1736468239},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it well on paper you can still do it the school day SAT, we did one in the fall on the PSAT date and then we''re doing one in the spring and we''re doing it on the math SBA date if you pass the Math SBA as a sophomore. \",\"startTime\":1736468243,\"endTime\":1736468256},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Then as a junior, you get to test for free. So we''re using that to motivate, \",\"startTime\":1736468257,\"endTime\":1736468262},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"kind of to dangle that carrot in front to motivate kids to do well on it. Yep. \",\"startTime\":1736468262,\"endTime\":1736468267},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yep. Oh.\",\"startTime\":1736468263,\"endTime\":1736468264},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Oh, I was that was going to be a question I had is how do you, does the does your district support paying for the tests at all? But if you pass the math \",\"startTime\":1736468267,\"endTime\":1736468276},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"as a sophomore, it''s free. \",\"startTime\":1736468276,\"endTime\":1736468281},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"What?\",\"startTime\":1736468284,\"endTime\":1736468284},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"I did not know that. Oh, OK. I thought that was a program. That''s your district \",\"startTime\":1736468285,\"endTime\":1736468290},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Well, we''re going to do it for free for them.\",\"startTime\":1736468285,\"endTime\":1736468286},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"offers that. OK. \",\"startTime\":1736468290,\"endTime\":1736468295},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no.\",\"startTime\":1736468294,\"endTime\":1736468296},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Just your school.\",\"startTime\":1736468296,\"endTime\":1736468297},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And then you can also offer it though, because that becomes the SAT is \",\"startTime\":1736468297,\"endTime\":1736468301},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"a pathway. So you can offer it as the pathway on a school day. \",\"startTime\":1736468301,\"endTime\":1736468306},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And then have your talk your district into paying for it or gear up into paying for it because that counts as one of the 9 pathways now. \",\"startTime\":1736468311,\"endTime\":1736468318},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"For a student.\",\"startTime\":1736468312,\"endTime\":1736468312},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Right, Right. Yeah, True, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468321,\"endTime\":1736468326},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Well, thank you, Chris.\",\"startTime\":1736468331,\"endTime\":1736468332},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"That''s weird.\",\"startTime\":1736468337,\"endTime\":1736468338},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Oh, you''re cutting out? What''s that? I know you too. Kingston has really bad. \",\"startTime\":1736468337,\"endTime\":1736468341},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, sorry. \",\"startTime\":1736468341,\"endTime\":1736468345},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So I said that''s weird ''cause you keep cutting in and out.\",\"startTime\":1736468342,\"endTime\":1736468344},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"No worries.\",\"startTime\":1736468346,\"endTime\":1736468346},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Go back Pirates, right? Kingston Pirates? Do you all yourselves the box or what \",\"startTime\":1736468354,\"endTime\":1736468357},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Go Bucks.\",\"startTime\":1736468354,\"endTime\":1736468355},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"do you go by? \",\"startTime\":1736468357,\"endTime\":1736468360},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Yep. Yep. Yeah. We''re the Bucks. Yeah. How about you?\",\"startTime\":1736468357,\"endTime\":1736468362},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, go back. We''re the Braves.\",\"startTime\":1736468364,\"endTime\":1736468367},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"Yep, Yep. How about you, Brave? It''s cool. Nice.\",\"startTime\":1736468366,\"endTime\":1736468371},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Kamiak and Braves.\",\"startTime\":1736468370,\"endTime\":1736468371},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"What''s the tribe?\",\"startTime\":1736468375,\"endTime\":1736468376},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Right, it is 420. We do not need to be at work anymore.\",\"startTime\":1736468377,\"endTime\":1736468380},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"OK, bye.\",\"startTime\":1736468381,\"endTime\":1736468383},{\"speaker\":\"11519\",\"text\":\"See you later. You too. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1736468385,\"endTime\":1736468387},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Have a great day, bye bye.\",\"startTime\":1736468385,\"endTime\":1736468386}]"', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.229712+00', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.229712+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1107, "created_at": "2025-05-08T03:17:44.201Z", "session_title": "Uncovering Student Post-Secondary Access Realities", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1323", "name": "Uncovering Student Post-Secondary Access Realities", "tags": [{"name": "HSLC"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('b6a0d695-3ce7-4813-b939-1835fbbe7ac9', 'a978d068-04bc-45ac-b24c-f6e367bb9007', '135456', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Good morning. Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1733237203,\"endTime\":1733237204},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I can hear you. Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1733237205,\"endTime\":1733237206},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Amazingly, yes.\",\"startTime\":1733237206,\"endTime\":1733237208},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"All right. Well, good morning, Chris, the Red Bull.\",\"startTime\":1733237213,\"endTime\":1733237217},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Good morning, House, Peter Crest High School, home of the Is it the wolves?\",\"startTime\":1733237215,\"endTime\":1733237219},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Red walls.\",\"startTime\":1733237223,\"endTime\":1733237223},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Oh, yeah, good. This morning I''m already here. So I was just kind of shocked. \",\"startTime\":1733237223,\"endTime\":1733237228},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I wasn''t sure about my reception in this in the office, but we''re good. All \",\"startTime\":1733237228,\"endTime\":1733237232},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"right, I''m going to press more. \",\"startTime\":1733237232,\"endTime\":1733237236},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Are you driving right now or you just got in your truck?\",\"startTime\":1733237242,\"endTime\":1733237245},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I just got in my truck. You''re going to see an authentic principal morning routine. \",\"startTime\":1733237246,\"endTime\":1733237249},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I was working to try to like get in the building before 6:45 so.\",\"startTime\":1733237252,\"endTime\":1733237256},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"The first question says what''s something non work related that you''re learning or teaching about? \",\"startTime\":1733237257,\"endTime\":1733237261},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I lead.\",\"startTime\":1733237264,\"endTime\":1733237265},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"A small group at church or through church.\",\"startTime\":1733237267,\"endTime\":1733237270},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And our current 12 week session is on biblical theories of leadership as they apply in the world. \",\"startTime\":1733237274,\"endTime\":1733237279},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"That sounds super interesting.\",\"startTime\":1733237281,\"endTime\":1733237282},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237284,\"endTime\":1733237284},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Well, that''s very cool.\",\"startTime\":1733237286,\"endTime\":1733237287},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Let''s see something that I am learning about. Well, I''ve been learning to play \",\"startTime\":1733237289,\"endTime\":1733237292},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"pickleball recently and that''s been really fun. \",\"startTime\":1733237292,\"endTime\":1733237296},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I love pickleball.\",\"startTime\":1733237296,\"endTime\":1733237297},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"As well. Yeah, it''s been really fun. What what you.\",\"startTime\":1733237300,\"endTime\":1733237303},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"We play we well, when the weather is nice, we play a couple times a week. And \",\"startTime\":1733237303,\"endTime\":1733237307},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"they''re just now building right around from where I''m at right now. 18 Court \",\"startTime\":1733237307,\"endTime\":1733237312},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Indoor Oak and pickle or pizza and pickle. I don''t know the name of the business \",\"startTime\":1733237312,\"endTime\":1733237317},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"complex with, like, couches. They''ll serve breakfast, lunch and dinner. 18 quarts. \",\"startTime\":1733237317,\"endTime\":1733237321},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1733237321,\"endTime\":1733237326},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Well, that sounds super fun. And where are you, Chris? What school?\",\"startTime\":1733237328,\"endTime\":1733237332},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Tri-cities. Kennewick, WA.\",\"startTime\":1733237333,\"endTime\":1733237335},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"OK. OK. So you''re a little further away. All right. Well, that''s very cool. \",\"startTime\":1733237335,\"endTime\":1733237341},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"A little further, I''m on the true East side, not Issaquah.\",\"startTime\":1733237339,\"endTime\":1733237343},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"That''s right. That''s right. OK, I hit next. I think you have to hit next. \",\"startTime\":1733237341,\"endTime\":1733237348},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1733237350,\"endTime\":1733237351},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Partner ready more. Oh, OK, mind the timer. I already did that. That did that \",\"startTime\":1733237356,\"endTime\":1733237361},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"more. Greet your partner. Hello. More. \",\"startTime\":1733237361,\"endTime\":1733237365},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Partner Ready. How did you end up becoming an educator? Go.\",\"startTime\":1733237370,\"endTime\":1733237374},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"There we go.\",\"startTime\":1733237373,\"endTime\":1733237374},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Umm, well, I, I went to Western Washington University and it''s pretty well known for its education department. And I was one of those people that like every \",\"startTime\":1733237377,\"endTime\":1733237388},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"class I took, I was just like, oh, this is interesting. Oh, this is interesting. \",\"startTime\":1733237388,\"endTime\":1733237393},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Oh, this is interesting. But I had an opportunity to go observe in a classroom. \",\"startTime\":1733237393,\"endTime\":1733237398},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"And it was just a really great experience. So I shifted into education.\",\"startTime\":1733237400,\"endTime\":1733237406},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"How about you? Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733237413,\"endTime\":1733237415},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Can you hear me now? Oh, where did you? Where did you grow up at?\",\"startTime\":1733237414,\"endTime\":1733237418},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I grew up first in California and then my dad got transferred up when I think I was in second grade, and so we lived in Kirkland and the Woodinville areas. \",\"startTime\":1733237421,\"endTime\":1733237432},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So did you go to Woodinville, Monroe, Bothell, home of the Falcons? Yeah. Yep. \",\"startTime\":1733237434,\"endTime\":1733237443},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I went to Woodinville high school.\",\"startTime\":1733237437,\"endTime\":1733237439},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Omar Hawkins, you seem to You seem to know all the mascots.\",\"startTime\":1733237443,\"endTime\":1733237447},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I''m really, really old and I''ve been around for a really, really long time.\",\"startTime\":1733237449,\"endTime\":1733237453},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"So all right.\",\"startTime\":1733237458,\"endTime\":1733237459},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Why are you laughing?\",\"startTime\":1733237458,\"endTime\":1733237460},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"That was a funny response.\",\"startTime\":1733237462,\"endTime\":1733237463},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"So how about you? How did you get into teaching?\",\"startTime\":1733237466,\"endTime\":1733237469},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"No, I knew I wanted to be a teacher when my 8th grade ELA teacher motivated and inspired and cajoled and needled me to high achievement. And then ever since \",\"startTime\":1733237470,\"endTime\":1733237484},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"So all the way.\",\"startTime\":1733237483,\"endTime\":1733237484},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"then I wanted to be a teacher coach. So I had great teachers all the way through. \",\"startTime\":1733237484,\"endTime\":1733237490},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"My coaches that invested in me, helped me, club advisors, all of those kind of pay it forward ideals. \",\"startTime\":1733237491,\"endTime\":1733237500},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. And where? Where was your first teaching job?\",\"startTime\":1733237503,\"endTime\":1733237507},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733237506,\"endTime\":1733237506},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"My first teaching job was in Quincy, WA.\",\"startTime\":1733237508,\"endTime\":1733237511},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1733237512,\"endTime\":1733237513},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Little small, then it was A1A school.\",\"startTime\":1733237513,\"endTime\":1733237516},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Kind of by the gorge.\",\"startTime\":1733237518,\"endTime\":1733237519},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237520,\"endTime\":1733237521},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"My first teaching job was up in Blaine. Do you know their mascot?\",\"startTime\":1733237524,\"endTime\":1733237530},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733237525,\"endTime\":1733237525},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I know them well, the border rights.\",\"startTime\":1733237531,\"endTime\":1733237536},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Orange and black. I think at one time there''s been a couple new schools. At \",\"startTime\":1733237537,\"endTime\":1733237542},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yep, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733237539,\"endTime\":1733237540},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"one time I could do every school in the state of Washington because I was, I grew up in the Seattle area and then I coached and taught at Quincy, which was small school that I''ve been at Moses Lake and Kamiakin for the last 25 years. \",\"startTime\":1733237542,\"endTime\":1733237556},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So I know the smalls, the middles and the bakes. \",\"startTime\":1733237556,\"endTime\":1733237561},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"In the big S, well, it''s definitely a superpower. No, not many people that know \",\"startTime\":1733237564,\"endTime\":1733237567},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"all the baskets. \",\"startTime\":1733237567,\"endTime\":1733237570},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Well, I, I, I remember when Cedar Crest was actually told. That''s how old I \",\"startTime\":1733237569,\"endTime\":1733237571},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"am. \",\"startTime\":1733237571,\"endTime\":1733237573},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Oh my word. Yep. Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733237574,\"endTime\":1733237576},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"And they were the Tolt double s, I think first. Well, then they were, then they \",\"startTime\":1733237577,\"endTime\":1733237583},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"No, not well. Maybe back in the day they were silver and Blue Devils. Doesn''t \",\"startTime\":1733237582,\"endTime\":1733237585},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"were the totems, and then they were. Now they''re the bears. Yeah. Oh, very cool. \",\"startTime\":1733237583,\"endTime\":1733237588},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"sound right though. \",\"startTime\":1733237585,\"endTime\":1733237589},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK, One of my teachers opened Cedar Crest as an administrator. Yeah, in the \",\"startTime\":1733237597,\"endTime\":1733237601},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"would that be the mid 90s? \",\"startTime\":1733237601,\"endTime\":1733237606},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yep, I think it was in the 90s.\",\"startTime\":1733237608,\"endTime\":1733237610},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, early mid 90s.\",\"startTime\":1733237612,\"endTime\":1733237613},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733237615,\"endTime\":1733237615},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"All right. I hit next and then I think you have to hit next too.\",\"startTime\":1733237616,\"endTime\":1733237620},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK, trying to drive. Where did you teach for Stone? Already did these.\",\"startTime\":1733237621,\"endTime\":1733237625},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237626,\"endTime\":1733237626},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"More How did you end up becoming it? Oh, we did that one right.\",\"startTime\":1733237634,\"endTime\":1733237639},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I think so. I just hit. Did you hit next down at the bottom? There it goes.\",\"startTime\":1733237639,\"endTime\":1733237643},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Partner ready, I got it.\",\"startTime\":1733237643,\"endTime\":1733237646},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"What do you hope to learn or achieve? What do you hope to learn or achieve?\",\"startTime\":1733237647,\"endTime\":1733237651},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I just think it''s nice to connect with other people that are in a similar role. \",\"startTime\":1733237653,\"endTime\":1733237657},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I feel like sometimes like I like what I take away is something I wasn''t even expecting, if that makes sense. \",\"startTime\":1733237657,\"endTime\":1733237664},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"How many years have you been principal?\",\"startTime\":1733237667,\"endTime\":1733237668},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"So what this is, I''m an assistant principal and this is my second year.\",\"startTime\":1733237669,\"endTime\":1733237672},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1733237675,\"endTime\":1733237676},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"So yeah, how about you?\",\"startTime\":1733237677,\"endTime\":1733237679},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I think both the collegiality and the congeniality help sharpen the sword. Nobody \",\"startTime\":1733237682,\"endTime\":1733237688},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"knows or understands what we do. Like if you go to a dinner party and you''re \",\"startTime\":1733237688,\"endTime\":1733237694},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"a policeman, you get to tell everybody all your cool stories. Or if you''re a \",\"startTime\":1733237694,\"endTime\":1733237700},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"doctor, you can tell everybody your cool stories if you''re a teacher or principal. \",\"startTime\":1733237700,\"endTime\":1733237705},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Your stories just aren''t that cool, so it''s nice to talk to other people.\",\"startTime\":1733237708,\"endTime\":1733237712},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Who walk the same life as you, both collegially, who understand the challenges, the parents, the district office, curriculum, budget, all of those things, as well as congenial. Just the opportunity to meet people, be a positive influence \",\"startTime\":1733237714,\"endTime\":1733237726},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"on their lives. \",\"startTime\":1733237726,\"endTime\":1733237731},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that definitely makes sense. And I was just thinking because you''ve you''ve \",\"startTime\":1733237731,\"endTime\":1733237736},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"been in so many different schools, you might know my principal, Jeanette Siemers. \",\"startTime\":1733237736,\"endTime\":1733237741},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I probably know the name, but I''ve been at, I''ve been at Kamiak in the last 20 years. \",\"startTime\":1733237744,\"endTime\":1733237750},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I see. OK. She, she seems to know everyone everywhere we go. She was at Monroe \",\"startTime\":1733237749,\"endTime\":1733237754},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"for a long time and then at Cascade, and now she''s here. So. \",\"startTime\":1733237754,\"endTime\":1733237759},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"All right, I''m heading next just because I''m cognizant of the time here. All \",\"startTime\":1733237762,\"endTime\":1733237766},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"right, it says read this scenario. \",\"startTime\":1733237766,\"endTime\":1733237769},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Ah.\",\"startTime\":1733237767,\"endTime\":1733237767},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"No, I''m still driving, so you''re fine.\",\"startTime\":1733237768,\"endTime\":1733237770},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"And problem solve with your partner. Let''s see.\",\"startTime\":1733237774,\"endTime\":1733237776},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"You''ve been asked to ensure teachers across your district become good at one thing you''re great at good at one thing you''re great at OK. \",\"startTime\":1733237776,\"endTime\":1733237783},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Well, I mean, I was a teacher for a really long time. And then I did, I was \",\"startTime\":1733237785,\"endTime\":1733237789},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"like, they called us a professional learning leader. I did all the new teacher \",\"startTime\":1733237789,\"endTime\":1733237792},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"mentoring and all the professional learning for staff. \",\"startTime\":1733237792,\"endTime\":1733237795},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I''m really good at building student centered learner centered lessons learning experiences. \",\"startTime\":1733237798,\"endTime\":1733237804},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1733237808,\"endTime\":1733237808},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"So at working at a high school, I have some teachers that are there and some teachers that are still lecturing, you know, bell to bell. \",\"startTime\":1733237810,\"endTime\":1733237818},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So it''s interesting you say that one Hattie actually shows direct instruction as greater than a .41 impact on student achievement. \",\"startTime\":1733237817,\"endTime\":1733237825},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"In in snippets.\",\"startTime\":1733237828,\"endTime\":1733237830},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"In what? Oh, in snippets.\",\"startTime\":1733237832,\"endTime\":1733237834},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"In moderate, In moderation, yes. Not bell to bell.\",\"startTime\":1733237834,\"endTime\":1733237837},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Well, a good teacher is using discussion and other strategies integrated in, not just a monologue. \",\"startTime\":1733237838,\"endTime\":1733237844},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1733237842,\"endTime\":1733237843},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"That''s right. That''s right.\",\"startTime\":1733237844,\"endTime\":1733237845},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"How about you? What''s one thing that you''re great at that you would want your \",\"startTime\":1733237847,\"endTime\":1733237850},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"teachers to also be good at? \",\"startTime\":1733237850,\"endTime\":1733237852},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I''m old, so it it''s we have a different challenge because.\",\"startTime\":1733237853,\"endTime\":1733237858},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I''ve hired all but probably, I think there''s probably 8 or 9 that I haven''t hired in my time at Kemayakan. \",\"startTime\":1733237862,\"endTime\":1733237870},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So we have done life together for so long. They all know and are part of who \",\"startTime\":1733237871,\"endTime\":1733237876},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"we are and what we do and we do the OR we believe in the the good to great Collins, good to great hedgehog concept. We''re going to do these things ABC and D better \",\"startTime\":1733237876,\"endTime\":1733237884},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"than anybody else in the world. So we really go after, I don''t know if it''s \",\"startTime\":1733237884,\"endTime\":1733237889},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"instructionally, but we really go after freshman, smaller class size, freshman pass rate. \",\"startTime\":1733237889,\"endTime\":1733237898},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237899,\"endTime\":1733237899},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Rigor and instruction rigor in classes.\",\"startTime\":1733237900,\"endTime\":1733237902},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Building relationships, but we''ve been doing it for so long, it''s just part of who we are and what we do. \",\"startTime\":1733237903,\"endTime\":1733237909},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And it''s kind of a natural flow, but if you''re at Kamiakin, these are the things that we do better than anybody else in the world. \",\"startTime\":1733237912,\"endTime\":1733237919},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"That''s nice. I mean, I think they say it like takes a high school principal \",\"startTime\":1733237921,\"endTime\":1733237924},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"like 7 to 10 years to make like really big impact in the building. So sounds \",\"startTime\":1733237924,\"endTime\":1733237927},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"like. \",\"startTime\":1733237927,\"endTime\":1733237930},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And the and the average tenure of a high school principal is less than three. \",\"startTime\":1733237930,\"endTime\":1733237934},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1733237934,\"endTime\":1733237937},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So, yeah, I feel like here at Cedar Crest, like they, they pride them. \",\"startTime\":1733237935,\"endTime\":1733237938},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"They''ve always prided themselves on having really strong relationships with kids. \",\"startTime\":1733237938,\"endTime\":1733237944},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Instructionally it would be build relationships, but that''s such a glib response. \",\"startTime\":1733237946,\"endTime\":1733237951},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Now. 100 years ago when Ruby Payne was brand new, that was one that everybody \",\"startTime\":1733237951,\"endTime\":1733237957},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"did. And now it''s, well, the kids misbehaving because you don''t have a relationship, \",\"startTime\":1733237957,\"endTime\":1733237962},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"which is such a Jack wagon answer. So yeah, I mean. \",\"startTime\":1733237962,\"endTime\":1733237967},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I think like after the pandemic.\",\"startTime\":1733237975,\"endTime\":1733237977},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"We definitely, I mean, we''re trying to get back to.\",\"startTime\":1733237980,\"endTime\":1733237984},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Rigor and things like like that that were kind of lost during the pandemic.\",\"startTime\":1733237985,\"endTime\":1733237990},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep, yeah, that''s that natural pendulum has swung from the SEL kinder, softer, gentler. Just glad you''re here to now. It''s definitely leveraging for OK. Now \",\"startTime\":1733237989,\"endTime\":1733237999},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"we need you to have we need to have you prepared for your post secondary goals and plans. We''ve definitely made that switch. \",\"startTime\":1733237999,\"endTime\":1733238009},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Intentionally.\",\"startTime\":1733238011,\"endTime\":1733238011},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And so are your, are your build, is your building, are your teachers working \",\"startTime\":1733238017,\"endTime\":1733238021},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"in place? \",\"startTime\":1733238021,\"endTime\":1733238024},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"They have de facto PLCS.\",\"startTime\":1733238025,\"endTime\":1733238026},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"We don''t have a system in place to give them enough common time to have authentic PLCS. \",\"startTime\":1733238028,\"endTime\":1733238035},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So some departments, ELA has really strong de facto ones.\",\"startTime\":1733238038,\"endTime\":1733238043},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"We have teachers who are really good at collaborating with teachers are really good at collaborating. So kind of a kind of a mix, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1733238044,\"endTime\":1733238052},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Next, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733238054,\"endTime\":1733238055},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Well, this is our district''s third attempt to roll out PLC, so I will say we go ahead. \",\"startTime\":1733238055,\"endTime\":1733238064},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and.\",\"startTime\":1733238065,\"endTime\":1733238066},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"No.\",\"startTime\":1733238068,\"endTime\":1733238068},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I just as the way, yeah, I mean, at least this time around, I feel like there''s way more intention behind training and. \",\"startTime\":1733238070,\"endTime\":1733238077},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Your third attempt to roll them out.\",\"startTime\":1733238070,\"endTime\":1733238072},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Where before it was just.\",\"startTime\":1733238081,\"endTime\":1733238082},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Go.\",\"startTime\":1733238084,\"endTime\":1733238084},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we''ve had a couple formal pushes back in like 06 when we were at Gate School. We pushed it really hard, but then it went away, the funding went away. \",\"startTime\":1733238087,\"endTime\":1733238097},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"We have What''s your early release schedule?\",\"startTime\":1733238099,\"endTime\":1733238101},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"We''re out. We have 90 minutes on Fridays, every Friday. But there''s a little \",\"startTime\":1733238102,\"endTime\":1733238106},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Every Friday.\",\"startTime\":1733238106,\"endTime\":1733238106},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"caveat because there''s some that are building in district directed, but the great majority are have been contracted as teacher directed. So teachers can \",\"startTime\":1733238106,\"endTime\":1733238115},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"choose to meet in place or they can choose not. \",\"startTime\":1733238115,\"endTime\":1733238120},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733238117,\"endTime\":1733238117},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Exactly. Isn''t that wonderful?\",\"startTime\":1733238123,\"endTime\":1733238125},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"In our buildings as a district, the high schools don''t have it, but the middle and elementaries have. Every Wednesday early release and principals control \",\"startTime\":1733238126,\"endTime\":1733238134},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"one a month. The rest are teacher controlled. \",\"startTime\":1733238134,\"endTime\":1733238138},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733238136,\"endTime\":1733238136},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah, makes it challenging, so.\",\"startTime\":1733238138,\"endTime\":1733238140},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Well, we don''t even have that. We have, we have one early release a month total. \",\"startTime\":1733238141,\"endTime\":1733238145},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"That''s interesting that that the high school is different than the middle and the elementaries. Yeah. So all right, Chris, I''m going to have to. We''re about \",\"startTime\":1733238147,\"endTime\":1733238153},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1733238152,\"endTime\":1733238153},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"to open the doors and stuff, so I''m going to have to get going. But it was nice \",\"startTime\":1733238153,\"endTime\":1733238156},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"to meet you. \",\"startTime\":1733238156,\"endTime\":1733238159},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733238157,\"endTime\":1733238158},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Nice to meet you, have a very happy holidays. I''m at Dutch Brothers already. \",\"startTime\":1733238162,\"endTime\":1733238167},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"You too hope you have a safe drive into work. OK, well it''s about to get better \",\"startTime\":1733238164,\"endTime\":1733238167},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"then already today. \",\"startTime\":1733238167,\"endTime\":1733238170},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Have a great day.\",\"startTime\":1733238173,\"endTime\":1733238174},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Hey, good.\",\"startTime\":1733238176,\"endTime\":1733238177}]"', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.30261+00', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.30261+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 977, "created_at": "2025-05-08T03:17:44.279Z", "session_title": "#learning_to_human", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "33", "name": "#learning_to_human", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "Inclusion"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('13418ce9-98df-48e8-add9-f0d689338a4d', '57be074b-d837-43b9-a5a1-6f3959cdea53', '137088', '"[{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Can you hear me, Diego?\",\"startTime\":1739566845,\"endTime\":1739566847},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Hey, Erica.\",\"startTime\":1739566846,\"endTime\":1739566846},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I can hear you. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1739566846,\"endTime\":1739566847},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Richard Burton, Air Press More.\",\"startTime\":1739566849,\"endTime\":1739566851},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Icebreaker. What''s the scale besides a influence? OK, I love it.\",\"startTime\":1739566851,\"endTime\":1739566855},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"So this is the app, the updo app that initially we were working just with this. \",\"startTime\":1739566856,\"endTime\":1739566860},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Then this company got acquired and we''re still using the app just in the education space because they''re not really wanting to use it in the education space. So \",\"startTime\":1739566860,\"endTime\":1739566868},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"this is you''ve navigated the very messy beginnings, which I I''m. \",\"startTime\":1739566868,\"endTime\":1739566873},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1739566870,\"endTime\":1739566872},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Glad in many ways, but wanted you to see the reality of it. So yeah, you this \",\"startTime\":1739566874,\"endTime\":1739566877},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"is how it would start with someone where you get your little icebreaker. So \",\"startTime\":1739566877,\"endTime\":1739566880},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"yeah, what''s the skill besides AI fluency that you''re working to improve right now? \",\"startTime\":1739566880,\"endTime\":1739566886},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Uh, English.\",\"startTime\":1739566889,\"endTime\":1739566891},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"English.\",\"startTime\":1739566891,\"endTime\":1739566892},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Like, umm, I''m really good at umm, talking in in public, in Spanish of course. \",\"startTime\":1739566894,\"endTime\":1739566901},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739566899,\"endTime\":1739566899},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"But yeah, right now I''m like learning to speak English, basically.\",\"startTime\":1739566902,\"endTime\":1739566909},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Yeah. Well.\",\"startTime\":1739566908,\"endTime\":1739566911},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"It''s such a strength and it''s so incredible to be able to speak multiple languages. \",\"startTime\":1739566912,\"endTime\":1739566916},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"So I had I I''m very impressed by it. It''s definitely not a skill that I have \",\"startTime\":1739566916,\"endTime\":1739566920},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"been able to develop yet, even with a lot of Spanish class. \",\"startTime\":1739566920,\"endTime\":1739566925},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Not something that I''m strong in, so deeply impressive.\",\"startTime\":1739566927,\"endTime\":1739566930},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1739566927,\"endTime\":1739566928},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"The thing is, The thing is you can learn until until certain level and then you need to be fully exposed to the environment. \",\"startTime\":1739566929,\"endTime\":1739566939},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"My first weeks here, uh, it was so stressful because my brain was like.\",\"startTime\":1739566940,\"endTime\":1739566947},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739566948,\"endTime\":1739566952},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Heavy and tired, but yeah, so that''s that''s the skill that I want because like I am in the other aspect is my personality, so. \",\"startTime\":1739566949,\"endTime\":1739566961},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739566963,\"endTime\":1739566964},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Because my the the way I communicate with my very limited sets of words that I am able to manage also defines my personality, my language. So as my personality, \",\"startTime\":1739566963,\"endTime\":1739566975},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"it''s tied to my code base, let''s say. \",\"startTime\":1739566975,\"endTime\":1739566980},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well, we have.\",\"startTime\":1739566983,\"endTime\":1739566985},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"A Spanish teacher who he spoke 4 languages and he could joke in each one and he had exceptional timing. And sometimes the students would, you know, their \",\"startTime\":1739566985,\"endTime\":1739566993},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"high school students, they''re like, why just did not respect sometimes this skill. And, and we just were talking about how incredible it is to learn from \",\"startTime\":1739566993,\"endTime\":1739567001},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"someone who understands that in multiple languages because that''s, yeah, you, you can''t end up getting your full personality across. \",\"startTime\":1739567001,\"endTime\":1739567009},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And what about you?\",\"startTime\":1739567011,\"endTime\":1739567013},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, a skill that I''m working on right now I''m still working on. I''m doing \",\"startTime\":1739567014,\"endTime\":1739567018},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"a lot of gravel biking and in the winter it''s more inside. But the skill, the \",\"startTime\":1739567018,\"endTime\":1739567023},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"some of the bikes handling skills because I can go for a long time. \",\"startTime\":1739567023,\"endTime\":1739567028},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"But the, and I did some mountain biking, but like all the little pieces of where the bike feels like it''s a part of you. I don''t have that yet. So sometimes \",\"startTime\":1739567029,\"endTime\":1739567036},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"my body will make the choice like, oh, I need to like hop up this and it just and then boop. I just fall over. So it''s building the like fluency with a bike \",\"startTime\":1739567036,\"endTime\":1739567043},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"in the same way I have with running or swimming. And it''s such a good challenge \",\"startTime\":1739567043,\"endTime\":1739567047},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"because I''ll think about it, but sometimes you overthink it and then by overthinking it, your foot stays locked in and you fall over instead of just like I should just. \",\"startTime\":1739567047,\"endTime\":1739567058},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739567049,\"endTime\":1739567050},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739567060,\"endTime\":1739567061},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"It would have been not on the ground.\",\"startTime\":1739567061,\"endTime\":1739567063},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I I know what you mean because when when you start thinking.\",\"startTime\":1739567063,\"endTime\":1739567066},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"You you let your cortex, umm the brain cortex to take control of the all the thought processing and you lose the flow state. \",\"startTime\":1739567067,\"endTime\":1739567078},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yes, yeah. Then it''s like, Oh yeah, that''s a great way to put it. Nice. All \",\"startTime\":1739567077,\"endTime\":1739567081},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"right, well, so we''ve done this part and for the rest of the slides, we''ll see how they. OK, ask Diego how has I think we''ll just move through these. But this \",\"startTime\":1739567081,\"endTime\":1739567089},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"is also if you have questions throughout, feel free to ask ''cause this is kind of how folks connect in the app. So it''s a little too for here. So it says OK, \",\"startTime\":1739567089,\"endTime\":1739567098},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"wait, S Diego, how has I I changed your work. \",\"startTime\":1739567098,\"endTime\":1739567102},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"As an educator or leader of educators. And for you, it''s less directed to being \",\"startTime\":1739567102,\"endTime\":1739567107},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"an educator right now, but yeah. So how has AI changed your work? \",\"startTime\":1739567107,\"endTime\":1739567112},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Oh, it speeds me up. \",\"startTime\":1739567113,\"endTime\":1739567120},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Like it multiplies my. \",\"startTime\":1739567120,\"endTime\":1739567120},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"By shipping time.\",\"startTime\":1739567120,\"endTime\":1739567121},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"But 10 times, so one order of magnitude.\",\"startTime\":1739567122,\"endTime\":1739567127},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Um, if in the past I had to spend, let''s say.\",\"startTime\":1739567128,\"endTime\":1739567133},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"One day fixing a problem.\",\"startTime\":1739567133,\"endTime\":1739567135},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Now I can spend, I don''t know, sometimes 20 minutes. So that''s, that''s how it \",\"startTime\":1739567135,\"endTime\":1739567140},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"has impacted me in such a way that I''m like. \",\"startTime\":1739567140,\"endTime\":1739567145},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739567141,\"endTime\":1739567144},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, like.\",\"startTime\":1739567146,\"endTime\":1739567147},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I mean, of course there there is.\",\"startTime\":1739567147,\"endTime\":1739567149},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"There is the human part of which is creativity, which is connecting the dots. \",\"startTime\":1739567150,\"endTime\":1739567155},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"But sometimes it''s like, oh. \",\"startTime\":1739567155,\"endTime\":1739567160},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I''m super tired. I don''t know, I had a rough day.\",\"startTime\":1739567162,\"endTime\":1739567165},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And suddenly I''m like stuck in a problem and I can''t solve it. I can''t see the \",\"startTime\":1739567166,\"endTime\":1739567171},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"light. I open that GPT, contextualize the prompts, put my my code, put my error. \",\"startTime\":1739567171,\"endTime\":1739567176},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And it''s like, oh, you forgot. I don''t know this tiny little thing that you \",\"startTime\":1739567176,\"endTime\":1739567180},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"oversaw, right? \",\"startTime\":1739567180,\"endTime\":1739567185},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So yeah, that''s that''s how it has impacted me. Yeah. I love it.\",\"startTime\":1739567187,\"endTime\":1739567191},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, that.\",\"startTime\":1739567193,\"endTime\":1739567195},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I think about it like I''ve always wanted.\",\"startTime\":1739567195,\"endTime\":1739567197},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Intern, you know, I''ve talked about like an assistant, an intern in this way and then thinking about when it doesn''t work, I think about, well, I''m not doing a good job leading it. So it''s definitely made me more effective at like the, \",\"startTime\":1739567199,\"endTime\":1739567212},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"the direct prompts, the actually knowing what I''m asking. I''m not using it for \",\"startTime\":1739567212,\"endTime\":1739567216},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"coding or engaging in that technical side. I''m using it more for organizational \",\"startTime\":1739567216,\"endTime\":1739567221},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"development or even as a professor. It''s like getting being more clear with \",\"startTime\":1739567221,\"endTime\":1739567225},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"students and feedback and if the feedback''s truly aligned to the rubric, so. \",\"startTime\":1739567225,\"endTime\":1739567229},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I think about it''s just really helped me get clear on what am I actually asking and then what am I trying to say and am I saying it? \",\"startTime\":1739567229,\"endTime\":1739567236},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And being able to have a like a, hey, can you do this research for me? Or Hey, \",\"startTime\":1739567238,\"endTime\":1739567240},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"what about this and. \",\"startTime\":1739567240,\"endTime\":1739567243},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"It''s assuming that it has some.\",\"startTime\":1739567244,\"endTime\":1739567246},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Helpful elements. And also I have a critical eye. I''m not just taking what my \",\"startTime\":1739567246,\"endTime\":1739567251},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"intern says and says, great, let''s do that. That''s not what I would do, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739567251,\"endTime\":1739567255},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s awesome. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739567256,\"endTime\":1739567258},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Alright, OK, next, there we go. Then it''ll say waiting for. OK.\",\"startTime\":1739567258,\"endTime\":1739567263},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Take turns. How do you think AI will change the role of learners in the future? \",\"startTime\":1739567264,\"endTime\":1739567268},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And we''ve got some prompts. Consider personalized learning. Think about tutors. \",\"startTime\":1739567268,\"endTime\":1739567272},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Fucking how? Learning analytics, Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739567272,\"endTime\":1739567276},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1739567275,\"endTime\":1739567276},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so.\",\"startTime\":1739567281,\"endTime\":1739567282},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I have.\",\"startTime\":1739567283,\"endTime\":1739567285},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"A controversy, kind of a controversial.\",\"startTime\":1739567286,\"endTime\":1739567289},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Point of view.\",\"startTime\":1739567291,\"endTime\":1739567291},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Because it speeds up in in my case, in software development it speeds me up. \",\"startTime\":1739567295,\"endTime\":1739567301},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739567300,\"endTime\":1739567304},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"But I think at some point you reach the plateau.\",\"startTime\":1739567304,\"endTime\":1739567310},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"The plateau of knowledge because.\",\"startTime\":1739567312,\"endTime\":1739567314},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"OK, so let let''s see, let''s put it this way. Let me think a little bit about \",\"startTime\":1739567315,\"endTime\":1739567318},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"it. So let''s put it wait. \",\"startTime\":1739567318,\"endTime\":1739567322},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Uh, I can, I can nor. I only learn what I what I want first.\",\"startTime\":1739567324,\"endTime\":1739567329},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"An opinion. I only learned what whatever I want, what I desire to learn.\",\"startTime\":1739567331,\"endTime\":1739567336},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I only, and I only learned by creating. That''s how I personally learned. So \",\"startTime\":1739567337,\"endTime\":1739567341},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I create right so. \",\"startTime\":1739567341,\"endTime\":1739567345},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"But if I contextualize this as a as a like traditional learning like.\",\"startTime\":1739567349,\"endTime\":1739567356},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Sometimes where knowledge is very.\",\"startTime\":1739567357,\"endTime\":1739567361},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Highly, it''s not so highly ranked anymore, but like knowing stuff, remember like probably. \",\"startTime\":1739567363,\"endTime\":1739567369},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yep, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1739567369,\"endTime\":1739567370},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Capital of the of the state.\",\"startTime\":1739567370,\"endTime\":1739567373},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739567372,\"endTime\":1739567373},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"State I there were like.\",\"startTime\":1739567374,\"endTime\":1739567376},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Stuff like kiddos like who answer faster.\",\"startTime\":1739567377,\"endTime\":1739567381},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"When I was in high school and, and, and somebody, not me, but somebody were like, Hey, teacher, when are we going to use this? And the teacher like, Hey, \",\"startTime\":1739567383,\"endTime\":1739567392},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739567391,\"endTime\":1739567392},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"you, you will never going to have like a calculator. You need to do use your \",\"startTime\":1739567392,\"endTime\":1739567397},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"mind. And now we have all those things now, right? So it''s like right. Or even \",\"startTime\":1739567397,\"endTime\":1739567402},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739567401,\"endTime\":1739567402},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"searching, remembering. \",\"startTime\":1739567402,\"endTime\":1739567407},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"What''s the name of this movie right that is super easily accessible right now, so. \",\"startTime\":1739567407,\"endTime\":1739567413},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"With AI, sometimes I, I even like enter like a quick prompt and it''s right there. \",\"startTime\":1739567414,\"endTime\":1739567420},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I, I found it. I don''t even need to think about it, right? So maybe we''re going \",\"st