ike why it was created in that way, But right now it is a little clunky to say like, oh, actually get on this app. But then what we''re hoping is after \",\"startTime\":1739568193,\"endTime\":1739568200},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"this conversation, the transcript will then get analyzed and in our profiles, we''ll be able to see information about the chat. So the, that''s the idea is \",\"startTime\":1739568200,\"endTime\":1739568207},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"that like, OK, we come in, we make our profile, then we have conversations, then come back and then this is going to help in our, our next match can be determined based on. \",\"startTime\":1739568207,\"endTime\":1739568218},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Ah, OK.\",\"startTime\":1739568212,\"endTime\":1739568213},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"What we''re talking about now and what we are showing that we''re learning or want to learn, Yeah, yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739568218,\"endTime\":1739568223},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So you''re connected to the like an API, so up to API some sort.\",\"startTime\":1739568224,\"endTime\":1739568230},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And it''s going to be directed to side by and side by, it''s going to summarize this summaries of of all the interactions and hopefully we''re going to match up with other educator we''re going to give them. \",\"startTime\":1739568231,\"endTime\":1739568246},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739568236,\"endTime\":1739568236},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739568247,\"endTime\":1739568247},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Text about E every interactions and like, uh, some sort of bio are you?\",\"startTime\":1739568247,\"endTime\":1739568254},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. So that and then it''s it can be. Hey, you know, you had this really \",\"startTime\":1739568253,\"endTime\":1739568256},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"interesting thought. \",\"startTime\":1739568256,\"endTime\":1739568259},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Want us to help you make it into a LinkedIn post or this, you know, do you want to share this? Do you want us to help you make this into a blog post when you \",\"startTime\":1739568260,\"endTime\":1739568267},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"were talking about this? And so trying to help people with what they get from \",\"startTime\":1739568267,\"endTime\":1739568270},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"the transcript. And then both parties can give approval of like, I want to share \",\"startTime\":1739568270,\"endTime\":1739568274},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"this or not or so we''re playing with all of that of like, we don''t want it to just be another Slack. Like, oh, and then we chat back and forth. It''s like \",\"startTime\":1739568274,\"endTime\":1739568281},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Slack exists. But this idea that the, the conversations lead to improvements \",\"startTime\":1739568281,\"endTime\":1739568285},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"in your profile that get you clearer. \",\"startTime\":1739568285,\"endTime\":1739568289},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And and show your learning, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568289,\"endTime\":1739568291},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. Yeah. No, I I love it, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568291,\"endTime\":1739568294},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Cool. Umm, how many users umm.\",\"startTime\":1739568296,\"endTime\":1739568298},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Are you expecting or do you like, it''s not necessarily like what, what, what are you like your road map like for the first year, how many users you want? \",\"startTime\":1739568299,\"endTime\":1739568311},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568301,\"endTime\":1739568302},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568306,\"endTime\":1739568306},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. We''re hoping by the end of 2026 to have 100,000, right. Like we''ve said, \",\"startTime\":1739568311,\"endTime\":1739568317},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"like let''s go, let''s go big right now. We have in our closed communities. \",\"startTime\":1739568317,\"endTime\":1739568322},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Probably about 400, but they''re just using the up Duo app because last year we were in an education vertical that was like just get on Up Duo and connect with people. And then we have about 140 that were got in line like you did and \",\"startTime\":1739568322,\"endTime\":1739568335},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"then are getting into the app right now into side by itself. So we''ll see. But \",\"startTime\":1739568335,\"endTime\":1739568339},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"the plan is to be to use this spring to really make it work like minimum viable products so that people can come in and have conversations, info goes back like it, it can work. \",\"startTime\":1739568339,\"endTime\":1739568352},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And then just really go after where the space in place that you can learn AI from colleagues. We''re for educators by educators. We''re not sit and get and \",\"startTime\":1739568355,\"endTime\":1739568363},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"we''ll actually help you move forward and then also help you advocate to your school to have a better policy or get better tools or this or that. So the road \",\"startTime\":1739568363,\"endTime\":1739568370},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"map is ambitious. And some of that is we had to say to Google, like, what''s \",\"startTime\":1739568370,\"endTime\":1739568374},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"your 4 year plan around? \",\"startTime\":1739568374,\"endTime\":1739568378},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Applying for their AI accelerator. And so we''re thinking like it''s not that \",\"startTime\":1739568378,\"endTime\":1739568382},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"hard if we''re positioning ourselves well and if we''re improving based on user feedback. So not going not over developing as we go, but really thinking like, \",\"startTime\":1739568382,\"endTime\":1739568389},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"what are our users telling us? \",\"startTime\":1739568389,\"endTime\":1739568393},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568393,\"endTime\":1739568394},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah. Awesome. Yeah. Thank you. Thank you for for that, Umm.\",\"startTime\":1739568393,\"endTime\":1739568398},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Would you mind if I ask you umm, about funding?\",\"startTime\":1739568398,\"endTime\":1739568401},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568401,\"endTime\":1739568401},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, sure. So we''re, we have precede round basically like Angel investors to \",\"startTime\":1739568402,\"endTime\":1739568406},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739568404,\"endTime\":1739568404},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"start and we''re looking for about 2 million and we''re in the 700,000 range or we''re in the 800,000 range right now. \",\"startTime\":1739568406,\"endTime\":1739568415},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Of our 2 million initial precede and then we''ve applied for 1.5 million from \",\"startTime\":1739568416,\"endTime\":1739568421},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"the Google accelerator will apply for other grants like that, like big. \",\"startTime\":1739568421,\"endTime\":1739568426},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Accelerator slash.\",\"startTime\":1739568426,\"endTime\":1739568427},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Grant elements especially aligned to AI and education. So like Google''s was \",\"startTime\":1739568430,\"endTime\":1739568434},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"like, how are people going to learn AI? And that''s where we felt like this was \",\"startTime\":1739568434,\"endTime\":1739568438},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"deeply aligned once we finish up February. \",\"startTime\":1739568438,\"endTime\":1739568442},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"The Google we won''t know about Google for a bit, but they''re there. They closed \",\"startTime\":1739568442,\"endTime\":1739568444},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"this this week. \",\"startTime\":1739568444,\"endTime\":1739568447},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"But we''ll probably move into.\",\"startTime\":1739568447,\"endTime\":1739568449},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Looking at VC firms for the next round and then just continuing with grants and accelerators and seeing where that might land. So we feel really good and \",\"startTime\":1739568451,\"endTime\":1739568458},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739568452,\"endTime\":1739568458},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"confident and at the same time we know that we don''t have enough to say we''re good for three years, so. \",\"startTime\":1739568458,\"endTime\":1739568465},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah. No, of course. No, I, I, I am with you in that aspect.\",\"startTime\":1739568465,\"endTime\":1739568468},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568467,\"endTime\":1739568469},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, good news about Google, because they.\",\"startTime\":1739568470,\"endTime\":1739568473},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568474,\"endTime\":1739568475},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Their Gemini 2.0 flash like 2 days ago. I''m already exploring it.\",\"startTime\":1739568476,\"endTime\":1739568481},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And it''s so cheap, so cheap. It''s like I''m going to send you.\",\"startTime\":1739568481,\"endTime\":1739568486},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well, and it''s so much better. And because we have a business account, \",\"startTime\":1739568487,\"endTime\":1739568491},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"It''s like incredible cheap.\",\"startTime\":1739568487,\"endTime\":1739568489},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"it''s so much better. It just, it''s it Google''s just getting like now they have \",\"startTime\":1739568491,\"endTime\":1739568494},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"the calendaring app, now they have the ability to take notes in the meeting. \",\"startTime\":1739568494,\"endTime\":1739568498},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Now they''re just sucking up all these external tools you needed to have. And \",\"startTime\":1739568498,\"endTime\":1739568501},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"then Gemini, who who knows you better than Google. So if Gemini can know your \",\"startTime\":1739568501,\"endTime\":1739568505},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"real ecosystem, that''s going to know you much better even if you''re training a GPT, so. \",\"startTime\":1739568505,\"endTime\":1739568511},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that feels exciting.\",\"startTime\":1739568513,\"endTime\":1739568515},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"That that''s awesome. Yeah. No, thank you for Yeah. Oh, that''s awesome. I''m I''m, \",\"startTime\":1739568515,\"endTime\":1739568519},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I''m in. I''m in. Like if you''re in, I''m in. \",\"startTime\":1739568519,\"endTime\":1739568524},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568521,\"endTime\":1739568523},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ll talk to Mike next when I hop off. And then potential next step would \",\"startTime\":1739568523,\"endTime\":1739568527},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"be that you''d schedule with Mike and I for probably like an hour long check in on Google Meet that would come from my e-mail. And then we''ll also see what \",\"startTime\":1739568527,\"endTime\":1739568536},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"came out of this conversation of like what''s on our profiles. But you should \",\"startTime\":1739568536,\"endTime\":1739568540},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"still have access to that and see that. But I''ll check in with Mike next and \",\"startTime\":1739568540,\"endTime\":1739568544},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"then you''ll get, and yeah, I''ll just tell you, well, you''ll definitely get an e-mail that says OK. \",\"startTime\":1739568544,\"endTime\":1739568553},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"We want to check in with you and I''ll send my our scheduler and we''ll just make sure that we connect next week. \",\"startTime\":1739568554,\"endTime\":1739568560},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"With and Michael also check out this conversation and he''s been, you know, a part of it throughout. So yeah, yeah, I, I appreciate your time. I appreciate \",\"startTime\":1739568561,\"endTime\":1739568568},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Also also.\",\"startTime\":1739568567,\"endTime\":1739568568},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"your like patience and getting into the app and also great questions and playing in it because we just want to be honest about where we are that it''s not perfectly smooth yet. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739568568,\"endTime\":1739568579},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no, I love it. Yeah. And and I.\",\"startTime\":1739568579,\"endTime\":1739568581},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"We resonated around the same vibe. So cool, cool, cool. With that, I would be, \",\"startTime\":1739568583,\"endTime\":1739568587},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah. All right.\",\"startTime\":1739568586,\"endTime\":1739568587},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I would be glad to be part of the team. \",\"startTime\":1739568587,\"endTime\":1739568591},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so. Well, you''ll hear from me soon with next steps. But really appreciate \",\"startTime\":1739568591,\"endTime\":1739568594},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"your time, Diego. Thank you. Bye. \",\"startTime\":1739568594,\"endTime\":1739568597},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Thank you. Have a good one.\",\"startTime\":1739568596,\"endTime\":1739568599}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.5228+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.5228+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1759, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:28.386Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('ee4301d4-780a-4c5b-bb0b-6ef59f10bb8f', 'a978d068-04bc-45ac-b24c-f6e367bb9007', '135714', '"[{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Good morning.\",\"startTime\":1734446849,\"endTime\":1734446850},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Are you and I the only ones that sign in in the morning?\",\"startTime\":1734446851,\"endTime\":1734446853},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"It can''t be. It can''t be. And of course I''m driving. I am. I''m running late \",\"startTime\":1734446855,\"endTime\":1734446859},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"today. \",\"startTime\":1734446859,\"endTime\":1734446863},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I see you''re driving this morning also.\",\"startTime\":1734446859,\"endTime\":1734446861},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"So so anyway, so we get started, then what do we got? Ice Breakers share conversation \",\"startTime\":1734446868,\"endTime\":1734446873},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Sure.\",\"startTime\":1734446872,\"endTime\":1734446873},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"you''ve had lately. \",\"startTime\":1734446873,\"endTime\":1734446879},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"What''s the same? OK.\",\"startTime\":1734446886,\"endTime\":1734446888},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Foster trust and psychological safety during data conversations.\",\"startTime\":1734446893,\"endTime\":1734446897},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"I use a protocol from a watch. What''s that website?\",\"startTime\":1734446904,\"endTime\":1734446908},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"I can never remember the name of it. Like learning forward or something like \",\"startTime\":1734446913,\"endTime\":1734446915},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"that. \",\"startTime\":1734446915,\"endTime\":1734446917},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"It''s the Atlas protocol. Do you ever do that one? The Atlas Data protocol?\",\"startTime\":1734446920,\"endTime\":1734446923},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Tell me what it is. I don''t know it by that name.\",\"startTime\":1734446927,\"endTime\":1734446929},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"It''s the Atlas data analysis protocol. When you divide up into groups and there''s \",\"startTime\":1734446932,\"endTime\":1734446937},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"a couple of steps to the first step is that you simply list the facts that you see in the data and you spend about 10 minutes just listing the facts. And the \",\"startTime\":1734446937,\"endTime\":1734446946},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734446946,\"endTime\":1734446946},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"next step is interpretation of the data and then. \",\"startTime\":1734446946,\"endTime\":1734446951},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"The third step is.\",\"startTime\":1734446954,\"endTime\":1734446955},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"What you know that implications of the data. So by dividing up and pulling out \",\"startTime\":1734446957,\"endTime\":1734446962},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"that the interpretation of the data from the facts of the data, you, you kind of separate out the the blame, the shame and blame part of it, which I think helps. How about you? \",\"startTime\":1734446962,\"endTime\":1734446976},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1734446979,\"endTime\":1734446979},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s hard. We use a ton of different ones.\",\"startTime\":1734446981,\"endTime\":1734446985},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I had a teacher get mad at me yesterday because she had emailed me questions and I talked to her and emailed me questions. So she said she was you never \",\"startTime\":1734446989,\"endTime\":1734446996},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"tell me it was on great distribution pattern broken down by class and by teacher. \",\"startTime\":1734446996,\"endTime\":1734447000},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"She''s like, it''s not fair that you''re counting kids with absence is against me. And then she put in her e-mail, They''re wasting my time and I''m wasting \",\"startTime\":1734447000,\"endTime\":1734447008},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"their time. So then I. \",\"startTime\":1734447008,\"endTime\":1734447012},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Replied back with a trebuchet of Hattie''s research on teacher efficacy and belief in students and Pygmalion effect, and she didn''t like that at all. \",\"startTime\":1734447014,\"endTime\":1734447027},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I''m like all you do is complain about your kids. So we''re not going to desegregate \",\"startTime\":1734447033,\"endTime\":1734447038},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"I''ve had to do well, and at some point in time she has to say, OK, you can only work with what you have control over and which is your behavior. So what is \",\"startTime\":1734447033,\"endTime\":1734447039},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"out our gifted kids from our 504 kids from our eel kids from our kids who aren''t there. Kids are kids now. It''s not fair to compare English 3 to pre AP or American \",\"startTime\":1734447038,\"endTime\":1734447049},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"it about your behavior that might be contributing to whatever it is you''re talking about, right? \",\"startTime\":1734447039,\"endTime\":1734447045},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"lit to AP lit. That''s not a fair comparison. But. \",\"startTime\":1734447049,\"endTime\":1734447054},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1734447069,\"endTime\":1734447069},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"But she doesn''t see that she''s doing anything less than perfection. She''s a \",\"startTime\":1734447071,\"endTime\":1734447075},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"veteran teacher. She''s fine. She''s just in that 24th year, 23rd year. Kids have \",\"startTime\":1734447075,\"endTime\":1734447079},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"changed. \",\"startTime\":1734447079,\"endTime\":1734447082},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734447085,\"endTime\":1734447085},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"We got old. All right, next one.\",\"startTime\":1734447091,\"endTime\":1734447094},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"That''s alright.\",\"startTime\":1734447097,\"endTime\":1734447099},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Just so you know, I''m going to go through this part where I lose cell service for about 15 seconds. What strategies do you enjoy to foster trust? Consider \",\"startTime\":1734447100,\"endTime\":1734447110},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1734447107,\"endTime\":1734447108},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"examples like using growth mindset language. \",\"startTime\":1734447110,\"endTime\":1734447115},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Sharing clear next step importance of listening Reflect on you''ve done to foster trust in your school''s data processes. \",\"startTime\":1734447124,\"endTime\":1734447135},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"All right, what have you done, friends?\",\"startTime\":1734447139,\"endTime\":1734447141},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I think one of the key ones, I think one of the key ones is making sure you have accurate data and we struggle with that sometimes. \",\"startTime\":1734447140,\"endTime\":1734447149},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Because like when we turn in our graduate to the district, they don''t always fix the P210. We had it happen in the class of 23 where the district put the \",\"startTime\":1734447153,\"endTime\":1734447166},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"wrong grad date in the system. So one of our schools had a 0% graduate. \",\"startTime\":1734447166,\"endTime\":1734447172},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And there''s some some little things like that that are super frustrating outside our control, so we shouldn''t complain about them, but still super frustrating. \",\"startTime\":1734447178,\"endTime\":1734447187},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734447192,\"endTime\":1734447192},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Pretend to be the expert with it our graduates have been riding around.\",\"startTime\":1734447199,\"endTime\":1734447204},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Like what did you come in for your graduate?\",\"startTime\":1734447200,\"endTime\":1734447202},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1734447212,\"endTime\":1734447213},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734447216,\"endTime\":1734447216},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Yeah, around 87%, it''s down.\",\"startTime\":1734447216,\"endTime\":1734447219},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"But we spent a lot of time talking about what what? What is included in that \",\"startTime\":1734447222,\"endTime\":1734447226},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"graduation rate. I might lose you. Did I lose you? \",\"startTime\":1734447226,\"endTime\":1734447230},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I can still hear you.\",\"startTime\":1734447234,\"endTime\":1734447235},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"OK, because of course they include.\",\"startTime\":1734447237,\"endTime\":1734447240},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Degree, but not a high school diploma. And the kids who go off to our transition \",\"startTime\":1734447248,\"endTime\":1734447252},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"outreach program are are. And so I when I disaggregate the data that way and \",\"startTime\":1734447252,\"endTime\":1734447256},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"show them these other parts to it, they appreciate that and that builds trust as well. \",\"startTime\":1734447256,\"endTime\":1734447265},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"And, and I also think it really stress when I learn alongside of them that I don''t always have to be the expert. \",\"startTime\":1734447269,\"endTime\":1734447277},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"They can learn with and a lot of time on that data though, because give me one second in my backyard, my back, OK, I don''t spend a whole, OK, I don''t spend a whole lot of time on my graduation rate data. I spend more time on what I \",\"startTime\":1734447279,\"endTime\":1734447299},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we did our grad presentation last week to our site council and we had I think 46 total non grads. \",\"startTime\":1734447285,\"endTime\":1734447292},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Class of 24.\",\"startTime\":1734447294,\"endTime\":1734447295},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"think is more actionable data like I ready data and. \",\"startTime\":1734447299,\"endTime\":1734447306},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I lost you.\",\"startTime\":1734447304,\"endTime\":1734447305},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Oh, really?\",\"startTime\":1734447310,\"endTime\":1734447311},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"You''re back. You''re back.\",\"startTime\":1734447315,\"endTime\":1734447317},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Attendance data and things like that. And so I think the type of data that you \",\"startTime\":1734447334,\"endTime\":1734447336},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"choose. \",\"startTime\":1734447336,\"endTime\":1734447338},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Also helps build trust.\",\"startTime\":1734447338,\"endTime\":1734447340},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"What is I ready data OK?\",\"startTime\":1734447342,\"endTime\":1734447345},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"It''s our reading data we have and you know they can do things with that data versus post mortem data. \",\"startTime\":1734447345,\"endTime\":1734447352},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I always we start, we kind of do reverse engineering. So we start with \",\"startTime\":1734447355,\"endTime\":1734447358},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"the grad rate and work backwards because really your grad rate is set your freshman year. \",\"startTime\":1734447358,\"endTime\":1734447365},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So we know if we can get our freshman passing classes, they''ll walk across stage and our great distribution pattern for freshmen we''re sitting well at quarter, we''re at 93% pass rate which is pre COVID numbers for us which was nice. \",\"startTime\":1734447367,\"endTime\":1734447386},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I just, I just don''t see the any good, umm, looking at SBA data that just tells you, you know, you suck doesn''t help us. \",\"startTime\":1734447390,\"endTime\":1734447399},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I worry for SBA data because the test is no longer required and high schoolers aren''t going to give best effort or even take the junior year test that isn''t required. \",\"startTime\":1734447403,\"endTime\":1734447414},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Exactly. Exactly.\",\"startTime\":1734447416,\"endTime\":1734447418},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And the the state needs to take ownership of that. Again, I''m complaining about \",\"startTime\":1734447419,\"endTime\":1734447423},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"things outside my control, but the state needs to take ownership that if they''ve made nine different pathways, and some of the pathways are pretty freaking easy. \",\"startTime\":1734447423,\"endTime\":1734447432},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Why would kids come on? We do a late start. Why would kids come and or give \",\"startTime\":1734447433,\"endTime\":1734447438},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"best effort when they know they can get it a different way? \",\"startTime\":1734447438,\"endTime\":1734447443},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Exactly. Exactly.\",\"startTime\":1734447445,\"endTime\":1734447446},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"All right. Do we have more questions this morning?\",\"startTime\":1734447451,\"endTime\":1734447453},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I don''t know, I''m pulling in to get my coffee.\",\"startTime\":1734447456,\"endTime\":1734447462},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Hold on.\",\"startTime\":1734447462,\"endTime\":1734447463},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep. How do you reframe data to focus on improvement rather than blame?\",\"startTime\":1734447468,\"endTime\":1734447473},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"List of the norm. I mean, first of all, when we look at data, I, I flat out \",\"startTime\":1734447472,\"endTime\":1734447476},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"say that we''re not about shame or blame. That doesn''t help anyone. So I actually \",\"startTime\":1734447476,\"endTime\":1734447480},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"put that out there as one of our norms. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1734447480,\"endTime\":1734447484},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Although sometimes a little peer pressure if you''re the outlier isn''t a bad thing. \",\"startTime\":1734447501,\"endTime\":1734447505},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Why do kids fail your class at just partially high rates?\",\"startTime\":1734447510,\"endTime\":1734447512},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I put that pressure on though, in terms of how I disseminate the data, whether I''m going to attach names to it or not attach names to it. And so being \",\"startTime\":1734447515,\"endTime\":1734447524},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"strategic in the data that I put out and how I how I put it out into what groups I put it out and what groups teachers are in when I put it out, I think all of those pieces are very strategic. Am I going to give the data to the teachers \",\"startTime\":1734447524,\"endTime\":1734447537},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"in their place? \",\"startTime\":1734447537,\"endTime\":1734447542},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Who''s going to facilitate the discussion?\",\"startTime\":1734447544,\"endTime\":1734447546},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Is it have all of that helps, you know, frame what I''m going to do. So I''ll \",\"startTime\":1734447547,\"endTime\":1734447551},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"give great, great distribution data out, but I''ll give that to the PLCS and I''ll have the place the department lead facilitate the discussion so that the \",\"startTime\":1734447551,\"endTime\":1734447559},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"safe environment which for them to discuss the data and I won''t have supervisors present, but they still report back to me with the discussion is like and I''ve given them. \",\"startTime\":1734447559,\"endTime\":1734447571},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep, same.\",\"startTime\":1734447565,\"endTime\":1734447566},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Discussion questions to help them frame it.\",\"startTime\":1734447575,\"endTime\":1734447578},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"But that''s a safe environment for them to discuss it. But but they still get \",\"startTime\":1734447580,\"endTime\":1734447584},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"to engage in that conversation that they need to have. How about any anything? \",\"startTime\":1734447584,\"endTime\":1734447588},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Yeah, absolutely. Teachers, I mean, we''ve I''m sure like you, we have data that \",\"startTime\":1734447588,\"endTime\":1734447592},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1734447589,\"endTime\":1734447590},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"we look at in other parts of our system and our tier one, we look at school wide data in my E Wisconsin, which is my tier two team, we just aggregate the data in different ways and it''s a different team of teachers. I mean, we look \",\"startTime\":1734447592,\"endTime\":1734447605},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Thank, Janice. The other thing I would add is I think data in a large system \",\"startTime\":1734447596,\"endTime\":1734447599},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"like your school and my school is even more important than a small system because it makes sure nobody''s slipping through the cracks. \",\"startTime\":1734447599,\"endTime\":1734447605},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"at data. \",\"startTime\":1734447605,\"endTime\":1734447609},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"So many different ways. I think I lost you out there. I''m back alright. I got \",\"startTime\":1734447627,\"endTime\":1734447632},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"a meeting in 5 minutes. Should we go to the next question? \",\"startTime\":1734447632,\"endTime\":1734447637},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Are you back?\",\"startTime\":1734447637,\"endTime\":1734447637},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Sure.\",\"startTime\":1734447646,\"endTime\":1734447647},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Read the scenario under more and problem solve with your partner. The scenario \",\"startTime\":1734447649,\"endTime\":1734447651},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"is. \",\"startTime\":1734447651,\"endTime\":1734447653},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And Kenny, Kenny, I made the drink, right?\",\"startTime\":1734447652,\"endTime\":1734447655},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"In a team meeting, interim assessment data shows a drop in performance on a key standard. Some staff become defensive while other disengaged, selling progress \",\"startTime\":1734447657,\"endTime\":1734447667},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And 3:53 left.\",\"startTime\":1734447660,\"endTime\":1734447661},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"details for discussion. How can you engage reluctant participants and reduces \",\"startTime\":1734447667,\"endTime\":1734447672},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"the group? What norms would help shift the conversation towards collaboration? \",\"startTime\":1734447672,\"endTime\":1734447676},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Was it Christmas tree?\",\"startTime\":1734447677,\"endTime\":1734447680},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"How can you guide the team towards actionable solutions? Yeah, I think you also \",\"startTime\":1734447679,\"endTime\":1734447684},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"name the behavior that you''re seeing. I see that we''re becoming defensive. Let''s \",\"startTime\":1734447684,\"endTime\":1734447689},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I think that''s just.\",\"startTime\":1734447685,\"endTime\":1734447688},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"What norms? Thank you have to make sure what you''re putting in front of them \",\"startTime\":1734447689,\"endTime\":1734447692},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"listen to that. Why are we feeling stuff about it? Talk about. \",\"startTime\":1734447689,\"endTime\":1734447695},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"is relative. \",\"startTime\":1734447692,\"endTime\":1734447694},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So SBA scores to your PE department probably aren''t as meaningful.\",\"startTime\":1734447697,\"endTime\":1734447700},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"What is the reason for feeling defensive? Step this back and let''s see if there''s \",\"startTime\":1734447722,\"endTime\":1734447726},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734447726,\"endTime\":1734447726},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"a different way that we can respond away from this conversation. \",\"startTime\":1734447726,\"endTime\":1734447730},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Well, and I think I think having an action item.\",\"startTime\":1734447735,\"endTime\":1734447737},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"I have a tendency to handle it that way. Yeah, sometimes I think when teachers \",\"startTime\":1734447735,\"endTime\":1734447740},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"are getting defensive is sometimes it''s just getting too close to home. They \",\"startTime\":1734447740,\"endTime\":1734447744},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Having an action item, I''m going to change my practice after looking at this reflecting I''m going to change or one thing I''m going to try. \",\"startTime\":1734447740,\"endTime\":1734447747},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"do. They''re trying their best. They want to do good work. And this is just, \",\"startTime\":1734447744,\"endTime\":1734447749},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"they just feel like, oh, I''m, I''m not, I''m failing. And. \",\"startTime\":1734447749,\"endTime\":1734447753},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734447769,\"endTime\":1734447769},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"You just have to build their confidence and then it''s also a sign that maybe you need to to think about how you might take an asset based approach to with this particular situation. What strategies do we know are working? How do we \",\"startTime\":1734447772,\"endTime\":1734447786},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"do more of that and reframe it to an asset based approach? Another another way \",\"startTime\":1734447786,\"endTime\":1734447791},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"of dealing with that. Go ahead. \",\"startTime\":1734447791,\"endTime\":1734447795},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I I haven''t there''s one.\",\"startTime\":1734447802,\"endTime\":1734447803}]"', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.36087+00', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.36087+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 977, "created_at": "2025-05-08T03:17:44.335Z", "session_title": "Creating Space for Data-Driven Dialogue", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1441", "name": "Creating Space for Data-Driven Dialogue", "tags": [{"name": "HSLC"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('d1271290-c7dd-46a9-ac4f-0eaa8086bae3', 'ab5e9538-da2c-466a-9418-2acca3c546af', '68549', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:40:30.932087+00', '2025-05-06 19:40:30.932087+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 421, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:40:30.881Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('eff59503-b1e7-4577-a390-d8e272eeb07a', '72766e2f-2bb1-4be6-85a2-718e55325f8a', '134587', '"[]"', '2025-05-08 03:17:46.56274+00', '2025-05-08 03:17:46.56274+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 36, "created_at": "2025-05-08T03:17:46.527Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('0f6ace73-1f36-4c6b-8950-da4d3af7f0a7', '4c3a7dc1-10fb-45d6-a20e-f89f0e73af73', '137093', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"My name is Allison and I work at an elementary school. I am an MTSS coordinator \",\"startTime\":1739809399,\"endTime\":1739809404},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"for grades pre-K through 4th grade. I''m really excited to learn about new AI \",\"startTime\":1739809404,\"endTime\":1739809410},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"tools and how I can use them to better support my role as an MTSS coordinator. \",\"startTime\":1739809410,\"endTime\":1739809415},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"I were to describe my stance with respect to teaching and learning. I might \",\"startTime\":1739809435,\"endTime\":1739809439},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"say that teaching and learning is an ongoing process teachers are learners and learners can be teachers it''s all about just putting in effort and. \",\"startTime\":1739809439,\"endTime\":1739809446},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Being open to new ideas.\",\"startTime\":1739809446,\"endTime\":1739809448},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"A lot of stuff for fun. I love to dance. I take hip hop and tap dancing classes. \",\"startTime\":1739809466,\"endTime\":1739809470},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"And then I also love to do art. I love painting, I love drawing, I love coloring, \",\"startTime\":1739809470,\"endTime\":1739809473},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"all sorts of things. I''m also a big music fan. I love just sitting down and \",\"startTime\":1739809473,\"endTime\":1739809477},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"listening to music or dancing and all that jazz. Reading is also a favorite \",\"startTime\":1739809477,\"endTime\":1739809480},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"of mine. \",\"startTime\":1739809480,\"endTime\":1739809484}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:27.82378+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:27.82378+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 62, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:27.765Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('13b9c160-114a-4824-95b2-b54602c902d8', '4734e9cf-74b7-4e89-b92c-8dc6f49c5b2a', '136643', '"[{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Good morning, Jennifer.\",\"startTime\":1738075551,\"endTime\":1738075552},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Hi, good morning.\",\"startTime\":1738075553,\"endTime\":1738075553},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Hey, great to see you.\",\"startTime\":1738075553,\"endTime\":1738075555},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Good to see you.\",\"startTime\":1738075555,\"endTime\":1738075556},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, love it. But uh, go ahead.\",\"startTime\":1738075558,\"endTime\":1738075562},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"This is good, OK.\",\"startTime\":1738075561,\"endTime\":1738075561},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Nope, I''m just good morning and just happened to happy to have somebody to chat with this week. I usually get a recording. \",\"startTime\":1738075561,\"endTime\":1738075567},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh, shoot, shoot.\",\"startTime\":1738075568,\"endTime\":1738075569},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I don''t think.\",\"startTime\":1738075569,\"endTime\":1738075570},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I''m glad to have you as well.\",\"startTime\":1738075570,\"endTime\":1738075571},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I don''t think any other elementary are up this early.\",\"startTime\":1738075571,\"endTime\":1738075574},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"And so I think I don''t. I don''t find someone to to match with.\",\"startTime\":1738075578,\"endTime\":1738075582},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Because again, we don''t start for a while, but I can''t drive and get there, so I do it from home. \",\"startTime\":1738075584,\"endTime\":1738075589},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah, No, no worries whatsoever. No worries whatsoever. So I''m tracking \",\"startTime\":1738075589,\"endTime\":1738075593},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"down the road here, but that''s all right. So how was I know it''s like almost \",\"startTime\":1738075593,\"endTime\":1738075597},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"the end of January, which is crazy, but came back, all right, Had a great new year and all that good stuff. \",\"startTime\":1738075597,\"endTime\":1738075605},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Well, good.\",\"startTime\":1738075599,\"endTime\":1738075599},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes, everybody came back refreshed of course and so.\",\"startTime\":1738075606,\"endTime\":1738075611},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"It was nice to see everybody relaxed and ready to start again this month. So \",\"startTime\":1738075612,\"endTime\":1738075616},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"it just seems so busy already when I look at the calendar and you put things on like your newsletters and things, it''s. \",\"startTime\":1738075616,\"endTime\":1738075624},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Is it? Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075618,\"endTime\":1738075619},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh my gosh, I''m already putting, you know, mid February dates because we have to be ready for like testing and we have. \",\"startTime\":1738075625,\"endTime\":1738075633},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075629,\"endTime\":1738075630},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"ML testing and I don''t know, it''s just crazy. I got caught.\",\"startTime\":1738075633,\"endTime\":1738075637},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075636,\"endTime\":1738075637},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"My husband, Mark Knight, Yeah, I was like, I got Scott.\",\"startTime\":1738075639,\"endTime\":1738075643},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh, perfect.\",\"startTime\":1738075641,\"endTime\":1738075643},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Perfect, Scott. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075644,\"endTime\":1738075645},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1738075648,\"endTime\":1738075649},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"All right, let''s hop in here.\",\"startTime\":1738075649,\"endTime\":1738075651},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, let''s see. Do we hit next? OK.\",\"startTime\":1738075651,\"endTime\":1738075653},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Next. Yep, hit next.\",\"startTime\":1738075654,\"endTime\":1738075655},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Certain already OK partner.\",\"startTime\":1738075656,\"endTime\":1738075658},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And I''ll let, I''ll let, I''ll let you read the questions.\",\"startTime\":1738075658,\"endTime\":1738075660},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, ask your partner what makes you an effective leader.\",\"startTime\":1738075660,\"endTime\":1738075664},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You know, as I, as I reflect back over time, I think it, it took me a while to figure figure it out. And, and I, I''ll, I''ll. \",\"startTime\":1738075671,\"endTime\":1738075678},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Think about the school leader paradigm for a second. My first few years I was, \",\"startTime\":1738075679,\"endTime\":1738075682},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I didn''t understand the buckets like around culture, systems and learning, but I knew I was probably more focused on the doing that I was leaning into who I was and what I was becoming and. \",\"startTime\":1738075682,\"endTime\":1738075693},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1738075682,\"endTime\":1738075683},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And it wasn''t until, you know, a few years in where you finally get your, your feet underneath you, per se, where I was like, you know what? I need to really, \",\"startTime\":1738075696,\"endTime\":1738075702},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I need to start listening more to people and, and bringing them together and becoming. \",\"startTime\":1738075702,\"endTime\":1738075709},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Working that way as a as a leader and allowing more space for conversations. \",\"startTime\":1738075711,\"endTime\":1738075716},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1738075713,\"endTime\":1738075714},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And so I think that then combined with me just getting stuff done, you know? \",\"startTime\":1738075716,\"endTime\":1738075721},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Umm, kind of help me turn the curve with that to make some, to assist in making some pretty big changes at school. So it wasn''t till I realized that that I \",\"startTime\":1738075724,\"endTime\":1738075731},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"recognized that I should say and the importance of that, that I became more effective. \",\"startTime\":1738075731,\"endTime\":1738075738},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1738075738,\"endTime\":1738075738},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''d agree with that because this is only going into my third year with my own building. \",\"startTime\":1738075739,\"endTime\":1738075744},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I feel super busy all the time but it''s when I start to think about.\",\"startTime\":1738075746,\"endTime\":1738075752},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"When I''m like listening to a podcast or reflecting on some of these questions too, it''s like, but am I doing the work? Like am I actually getting any work \",\"startTime\":1738075753,\"endTime\":1738075764},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"done? And so that''s I think more reflecting that I do is what''s next? Like what? \",\"startTime\":1738075764,\"endTime\":1738075770},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Have they seen my my leadership or who I want to be yet and so.\",\"startTime\":1738075773,\"endTime\":1738075778},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I don''t know. I mean, listening like you said is what I''m trying to do, trying \",\"startTime\":1738075780,\"endTime\":1738075784},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"to get more of my staff involved because the building is only, they''ve been together seven years and we have of course, you start with only like 10 staff members and now we''re to, you know, 35 certificated and 35 pairs. So we''ve grown \",\"startTime\":1738075784,\"endTime\":1738075798},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1738075794,\"endTime\":1738075794},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"and they went through COVID and I mean it just hasn''t been a regular year and so. \",\"startTime\":1738075798,\"endTime\":1738075808},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right, right.\",\"startTime\":1738075804,\"endTime\":1738075805},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"They''re considering this their first normal year. And I''m like, OK, OK. So yeah, \",\"startTime\":1738075810,\"endTime\":1738075813},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"what does that look like as we move forward, As I move forward? Because right \",\"startTime\":1738075813,\"endTime\":1738075817},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075817,\"endTime\":1738075818},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"now I feel like I put out a lot of fires. \",\"startTime\":1738075817,\"endTime\":1738075821},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I''m getting better at preparing for things and you know what''s coming up and what do we need to be doing? But I''m not yet. I mean, I''m still still figuring \",\"startTime\":1738075821,\"endTime\":1738075827},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"things out. It''s. \",\"startTime\":1738075827,\"endTime\":1738075830},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I mean, it''s, it''s hard in the moment. And again, where do we I, you know, I \",\"startTime\":1738075831,\"endTime\":1738075835},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"have a direction of where we want to go and things. But yeah, bringing everybody \",\"startTime\":1738075835,\"endTime\":1738075839},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075835,\"endTime\":1738075837},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"on board and then we just keep adding staff members. I mean, I just. \",\"startTime\":1738075839,\"endTime\":1738075843},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"There and it''s like.\",\"startTime\":1738075846,\"endTime\":1738075847},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"So it''s, it''s good to hear that I don''t, I don''t have to have it figured out right now. I''ll just say that when I take it. Oh, thank God. Oh my God. \",\"startTime\":1738075851,\"endTime\":1738075858},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"No, no, Hell no, no, no. Yeah, I''d, I''d actually, I''d actually be more worried \",\"startTime\":1738075855,\"endTime\":1738075859},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"if you thought you had it figured out. I''d be like, oh. \",\"startTime\":1738075859,\"endTime\":1738075862},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I don''t think so.\",\"startTime\":1738075864,\"endTime\":1738075865},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"No, I don''t have that figured out at all.\",\"startTime\":1738075865,\"endTime\":1738075867},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Alright, what''s that?\",\"startTime\":1738075870,\"endTime\":1738075872},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Here, no more and more. Each year I know more and more.\",\"startTime\":1738075870,\"endTime\":1738075873},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075874,\"endTime\":1738075875},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"So I''m trying to grow on that, but no, I don''t have it figured out.\",\"startTime\":1738075874,\"endTime\":1738075877},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Good, good, good.\",\"startTime\":1738075878,\"endTime\":1738075880},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"All right, I''m going to do our next.\",\"startTime\":1738075879,\"endTime\":1738075881},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Take turns, OK Describe the next goal in your leadership journey.\",\"startTime\":1738075885,\"endTime\":1738075889},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh wait, it says more. What does that mean? Oh, what has been?\",\"startTime\":1738075892,\"endTime\":1738075895},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ll just, it''ll just give you some tips, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075894,\"endTime\":1738075897},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Notable, but strategies OK. Are there any unexpected benefits?\",\"startTime\":1738075896,\"endTime\":1738075901},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"The next goal for my journey.\",\"startTime\":1738075902,\"endTime\":1738075906},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"And I''ve kind of started it this year is the.\",\"startTime\":1738075906,\"endTime\":1738075910},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"The growing other leaders in the building, they weren''t used to anybody really asking them to like step up or offering, hey, what are you interested in? Or \",\"startTime\":1738075913,\"endTime\":1738075925},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"you know, math seems to be really something you dive into. Would you like to \",\"startTime\":1738075925,\"endTime\":1738075931},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"do some of the leadership? So I''ve been slowly finding each. \",\"startTime\":1738075931,\"endTime\":1738075937},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Person''s strengths and just opening that door for them if they''re interested or not. And so I mean, I shared leadership like I can''t do it all. And so just \",\"startTime\":1738075939,\"endTime\":1738075948},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"trying to just like starting to show them where they have strengths and tapping into it. So that''s what I''ve been really working on this year. \",\"startTime\":1738075948,\"endTime\":1738075958},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075955,\"endTime\":1738075957},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"It''s great to hear and it actually really aligns with what you said in the first \",\"startTime\":1738075959,\"endTime\":1738075962},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"question about, you know, I''m busy, busy, busy, but I got to find others to, to help me, you know, and, and, and they''re in your building and we, we forget about that a lot of times. That was great to hear. \",\"startTime\":1738075962,\"endTime\":1738075972},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075967,\"endTime\":1738075968},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I think, you know, my journey is obviously I think a little more different than than being in a building. \",\"startTime\":1738075974,\"endTime\":1738075979},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075978,\"endTime\":1738075979},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"So I think I''m gonna, I''m gonna lean into I''ve got, we''re working extremely hard right now. And after our board meeting last weekend where we can meet a \",\"startTime\":1738075979,\"endTime\":1738075987},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"bunch of stakeholders and others, we need to figure out the, the system wide preparation in our state for school leaders because it doesn''t match the realities of what''s going on in buildings right now. And so we''re, we''re preparing people \",\"startTime\":1738075987,\"endTime\":1738075999},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"for leadership that doesn''t exist because it''s what was and not what is and what will be. And so I need my leadership journey. \",\"startTime\":1738075999,\"endTime\":1738076006},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Is really inserting myself and being that leader at the state level with a variety of stakeholder groups? \",\"startTime\":1738076010,\"endTime\":1738076014},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"To get them to understand and recognize and realize the importance of that and that we as a WSP with a mighty team of, you know, 5 or 6 people, we need you to help us with this. \",\"startTime\":1738076016,\"endTime\":1738076027},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076024,\"endTime\":1738076024},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And recognize, recognize our statewide problem of practice that''s right in front of us and we understand it adds more to your plate. And I guess I would say \",\"startTime\":1738076029,\"endTime\":1738076036},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076034,\"endTime\":1738076036},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"it doesn''t add more to their plates. They have to change the work that they \",\"startTime\":1738076036,\"endTime\":1738076039},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"do to reflect the times that we''re in. And so anyway, so that''s when I think \",\"startTime\":1738076039,\"endTime\":1738076043},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Agreed.\",\"startTime\":1738076042,\"endTime\":1738076043},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"about my leadership journey, it''s not obviously building based, it''s more, it''s more in that realm. \",\"startTime\":1738076043,\"endTime\":1738076050},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"With other stakeholder groups to make the systemic changes so we can have people like you be extremely successful, you know? \",\"startTime\":1738076051,\"endTime\":1738076058},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"That''s so good to hear ''cause I mean, I''ve got.\",\"startTime\":1738076059,\"endTime\":1738076062},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"9 or 10 years, I mean, and I want to stay in education and more and more it''s like I''m out, you know, and we hear teachers, I''m out like this is horrible, all these things. And I''m like, but you can''t because you''re one of the good \",\"startTime\":1738076062,\"endTime\":1738076074},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"ones If we just let all the good ones, like leave the profession and they go do other things and we''re stuck with the crappy ones, you know? And so, yeah, \",\"startTime\":1738076074,\"endTime\":1738076082},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"they need the change. We need people to, you know, hang in there. And we know \",\"startTime\":1738076082,\"endTime\":1738076086},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076084,\"endTime\":1738076085},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"that education swings from one end to the next, but. \",\"startTime\":1738076086,\"endTime\":1738076090},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I mean, since listening to UMM and spending more time with AWSP, it''s exciting that that work is being done. \",\"startTime\":1738076092,\"endTime\":1738076101},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"That we do have people like you who are looking out for us and wanting to help us and be successful because education isn''t like it was five years ago, 10 years ago, 20 years ago. I mean, we have to do something. And like you said, \",\"startTime\":1738076101,\"endTime\":1738076113},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"more and more on our plate, like how are we handling some, what are some systems that help us with that? So that''s exciting to hear. \",\"startTime\":1738076113,\"endTime\":1738076121},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076122,\"endTime\":1738076123},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Now stay tuned. It''s not going to be an easy, easy climb, but we''re digging \",\"startTime\":1738076123,\"endTime\":1738076126},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"in. We''re digging in so. \",\"startTime\":1738076126,\"endTime\":1738076129},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh, not all.\",\"startTime\":1738076127,\"endTime\":1738076128},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I love it. All right, next. Let''s see.\",\"startTime\":1738076129,\"endTime\":1738076132},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Share with your partner what is the strength of your school''s culture.\",\"startTime\":1738076134,\"endTime\":1738076139},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1738076142,\"endTime\":1738076142},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Umm, our school.\",\"startTime\":1738076145,\"endTime\":1738076147},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"The the dedication and the heart for kids. They get so passionate.\",\"startTime\":1738076150,\"endTime\":1738076155},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"For the their kids, we''re working on all kids, which is interesting, but ''cause I have two, well, I''ve, I''ve 3 self-contained classes. But man, they have a \",\"startTime\":1738076158,\"endTime\":1738076168},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"heart for kids and they get so passionate and sometimes I have to help them with that passion and tone it down a little bit, which I think is a good problem to have, but it''s the passion it is. \",\"startTime\":1738076168,\"endTime\":1738076183},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076178,\"endTime\":1738076179},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"They really do. It''s, you know, the safety and the belonging and the well-being \",\"startTime\":1738076184,\"endTime\":1738076188},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"of our kids and I''m super proud of that. \",\"startTime\":1738076188,\"endTime\":1738076192},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s cool. That''s cool. Umm, it''s great to hear too, ''cause it remember \",\"startTime\":1738076194,\"endTime\":1738076198},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"the last building I was in, I, I recognized it was more, way more adult centered than student centered. Decisions were made for adults convenience rather than \",\"startTime\":1738076198,\"endTime\":1738076208},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"students convenience and what was right. And so slowly over time, I, I just \",\"startTime\":1738076208,\"endTime\":1738076212},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"leaned into that and, and you know, I remember after I left. \",\"startTime\":1738076212,\"endTime\":1738076217},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"The the the phrase the phrase in the building became.\",\"startTime\":1738076221,\"endTime\":1738076223},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Is that adult centered or student centered?\",\"startTime\":1738076224,\"endTime\":1738076226},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"For SH yeah, yeah. And there''s times we have to remind and then it''s like, Oh \",\"startTime\":1738076227,\"endTime\":1738076231},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"yeah, it''s like we''re going to do what''s best for kids. \",\"startTime\":1738076231,\"endTime\":1738076235},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076233,\"endTime\":1738076234},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"And they''re like, you''re right. And so we try to remind each other of that, \",\"startTime\":1738076235,\"endTime\":1738076237},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"but. \",\"startTime\":1738076237,\"endTime\":1738076239},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I''d have to say probably, you know, 98% of the time they''ve already thought about what''s good for kids or, you know, even just the act of if we''re doing small groups and you have a larger group that you know, that group stays in the classroom, whether it''s a paraeducator or a teacher. I mean, it''s the small \",\"startTime\":1738076240,\"endTime\":1738076259},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"things because some like, well, it''s my classroom and I''m staying and it''s like. \",\"startTime\":1738076259,\"endTime\":1738076263},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076261,\"endTime\":1738076263},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"You can''t. I mean, it''s the small things like comfortable, a place to teach, \",\"startTime\":1738076266,\"endTime\":1738076269},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"a place to where kids can, you know, stretch out and learn. And so, you know, \",\"startTime\":1738076269,\"endTime\":1738076273},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"even those things and we''re in a crowded building, like I don''t have any more room. \",\"startTime\":1738076273,\"endTime\":1738076279},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076280,\"endTime\":1738076281},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"You know, they start to think about.\",\"startTime\":1738076281,\"endTime\":1738076283},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Doubling up and they''re like OK yeah I can be out of my office all day or I''ll just share an office and we''ll work out schedule so. \",\"startTime\":1738076283,\"endTime\":1738076291},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"They''re, they''re, they''re good. They''re, I''m proud of them.\",\"startTime\":1738076292,\"endTime\":1738076295},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Cool. Wow, that sounds awesome and it''s been hard work for you to make that \",\"startTime\":1738076295,\"endTime\":1738076298},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"happen. But way to go. Way to go. \",\"startTime\":1738076298,\"endTime\":1738076302},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Hey, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1738076301,\"endTime\":1738076302},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Alright, let''s go next.\",\"startTime\":1738076304,\"endTime\":1738076305},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, share with me what is an area of work for you in regards to your school''s culture. Oh my goodness all I mean. \",\"startTime\":1738076306,\"endTime\":1738076314},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"There''s, I think it''s just the same thing. I think it''s just inclusion and that \",\"startTime\":1738076315,\"endTime\":1738076318},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"sense of belonging. \",\"startTime\":1738076318,\"endTime\":1738076321},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I think you have to always work at it. So it''s it''s not anything that we can \",\"startTime\":1738076321,\"endTime\":1738076324},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"say check we''ve done it. \",\"startTime\":1738076324,\"endTime\":1738076326},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right, right.\",\"startTime\":1738076327,\"endTime\":1738076328},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"No, it''s always there every single day. And and since combinative is Pi recognize \",\"startTime\":1738076328,\"endTime\":1738076331},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"the importance of that. And I''ve as I''ve been out and about facilitating stuff, \",\"startTime\":1738076331,\"endTime\":1738076335},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I''ve been asking a lot of questions around what are the like the NASA command center. You know that that and and you are you''re you''re taking all this data \",\"startTime\":1738076335,\"endTime\":1738076342},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"in like the flight. \",\"startTime\":1738076342,\"endTime\":1738076345},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Operator guru, I don''t know who that is, you know, the, the main person that says tweak this or tweak that. But so you''re gathering all of this information \",\"startTime\":1738076347,\"endTime\":1738076356},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076350,\"endTime\":1738076352},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"and, and it all related to culture and or climate, which we know are two different things. But you know, what are the, what are the gauges that you have to take \",\"startTime\":1738076356,\"endTime\":1738076366},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076357,\"endTime\":1738076357},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"information in on a regular basis to inform you whether the culture is being is, is is remaining solid or you know, I got to work on this because. \",\"startTime\":1738076366,\"endTime\":1738076375},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Cultures by design.\",\"startTime\":1738076378,\"endTime\":1738076378},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Been able to go by default if you let it, you know. So that''s what I''ve been \",\"startTime\":1738076379,\"endTime\":1738076383},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076382,\"endTime\":1738076383},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"asking a lot of people like what are the what are the gauges around culture? \",\"startTime\":1738076383,\"endTime\":1738076386},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You take the pulse of your building on a daily basis. Who do you, who do you \",\"startTime\":1738076387,\"endTime\":1738076391},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"talk to to gauge that? Like is it always the people that are always with you \",\"startTime\":1738076391,\"endTime\":1738076395},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"and all in before you or do you or do you, you know, is that is that gauge and that pulse? You know, the person that''s the the jerk head that you know, why \",\"startTime\":1738076395,\"endTime\":1738076403},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Right, right.\",\"startTime\":1738076398,\"endTime\":1738076399},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"are they in education? They don''t even like kids, you know. \",\"startTime\":1738076403,\"endTime\":1738076407},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Exactly. Exactly.\",\"startTime\":1738076408,\"endTime\":1738076410},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So those are anyway those if I was in a building, those are the things \",\"startTime\":1738076410,\"endTime\":1738076413},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"that I would I would try and figure out to to. \",\"startTime\":1738076413,\"endTime\":1738076416},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Stay on top of culture, I guess.\",\"startTime\":1738076417,\"endTime\":1738076419},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ve been.\",\"startTime\":1738076419,\"endTime\":1738076420},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Talking with our kids more, our students and, and not just like get them together on a panel or anything, but just like in conversations and, and finding that, you know, it''s not always just checking in with our fifth graders. I mean, they''re \",\"startTime\":1738076422,\"endTime\":1738076434},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076424,\"endTime\":1738076425},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"on their way out, but like our third and 4th and it''s like, you guys have a couple more years. So what is it about our school? What don''t you like? What \",\"startTime\":1738076434,\"endTime\":1738076442},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"do you want to change? And I mean, I''ve had a couple. \",\"startTime\":1738076442,\"endTime\":1738076446},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076443,\"endTime\":1738076444},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Who, you know, they''ll send me emails and they''re like, hey, you know, Mrs. \",\"startTime\":1738076446,\"endTime\":1738076450},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Knight, can can we talk? Can we? And I''m like, yeah, let''s I want to hear what \",\"startTime\":1738076450,\"endTime\":1738076454},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"you have to say. And, and a lot of it''s kind of like around recess and and some \",\"startTime\":1738076454,\"endTime\":1738076458},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"things and issues that happen, but it''s their school. And so, you know, trying \",\"startTime\":1738076458,\"endTime\":1738076462},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"to have more conversations with students I''m finding is really, I mean, they know everything about what goes at that school. And so and they''ll tell you. \",\"startTime\":1738076462,\"endTime\":1738076470},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, yeah. And they''ll tell you and they''ll tell you. Yeah. So I''m glad \",\"startTime\":1738076467,\"endTime\":1738076471},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"you brought up the student voice piece because that''s a part of the pulse as well in terms of checking in with them. So awesome. \",\"startTime\":1738076471,\"endTime\":1738076479},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah. Alright. OK.\",\"startTime\":1738076479,\"endTime\":1738076480},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1738076479,\"endTime\":1738076480},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Got one more? Let''s see.\",\"startTime\":1738076480,\"endTime\":1738076482},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh, thank you, partner, and thank.\",\"startTime\":1738076483,\"endTime\":1738076485},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Thank you, partner.\",\"startTime\":1738076485,\"endTime\":1738076486},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"And it is nice to hear that.\",\"startTime\":1738076490,\"endTime\":1738076492},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"You don''t have it all figured out either. And I don''t need that. We always work \",\"startTime\":1738076492,\"endTime\":1738076496},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"CS GO.\",\"startTime\":1738076496,\"endTime\":1738076498},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"on it. So I appreciate that where it''s like it took me a few years because. \",\"startTime\":1738076496,\"endTime\":1738076499},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"That''s nice to hear, ''cause I''m still in those few years and I''m like, uh, not ever gonna get this. \",\"startTime\":1738076500,\"endTime\":1738076505},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Well, we, we may not, we may not fully, fully arrive, but we keep striving \",\"startTime\":1738076505,\"endTime\":1738076510},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"to get there. So, all right. \",\"startTime\":1738076510,\"endTime\":1738076514},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I do. I do.\",\"startTime\":1738076511,\"endTime\":1738076512},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Well, thank you.\",\"startTime\":1738076515,\"endTime\":1738076516},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Well, enjoy your day, Jennifer. What''s that?\",\"startTime\":1738076516,\"endTime\":1738076518},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, you too. Well, thank you for your time. It was nice to chat with somebody. \",\"startTime\":1738076517,\"endTime\":1738076521},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh heck yes. Yeah, no, I love I I''m just absolutely enjoyed hopping on these \",\"startTime\":1738076520,\"endTime\":1738076524},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"and meeting the different people and having some pretty focused conversations. \",\"startTime\":1738076524,\"endTime\":1738076527},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s been good. Even my reflections when I record, I do try to, you know, \",\"startTime\":1738076528,\"endTime\":1738076531},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"like, OK, really think it through. Like there''s a reason. \",\"startTime\":1738076531,\"endTime\":1738076534},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. And.\",\"startTime\":1738076534,\"endTime\":1738076536},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"So yeah, I''ve been trying to embrace all and and learn.\",\"startTime\":1738076535,\"endTime\":1738076538},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Cool. Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1738076539,\"endTime\":1738076540},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Awesome. We''ll go get him today, OK.\",\"startTime\":1738076540,\"endTime\":1738076542},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, you too. I''ll see you in March if we don''t connect again.\",\"startTime\":1738076542,\"endTime\":1738076545},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"We''ll be there. All right. We''ll see you, Jennifer. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1738076546,\"endTime\":1738076548},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, bye.\",\"startTime\":1738076548,\"endTime\":1738076549}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.343228+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.343228+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1003, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:28.105Z", "session_title": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1416", "name": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "tags": [{"name": "BEL"}, {"name": "LSL"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('17149a60-a86a-4146-ae49-a28e8504ab86', '760ebb56-9a35-4b72-8b73-bc98a5f056a3', '135453', '"[{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Morning. Good. How are you? I just got to school.\",\"startTime\":1733237106,\"endTime\":1733237110},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"How are you?\",\"startTime\":1733237107,\"endTime\":1733237107},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Are you driving?\",\"startTime\":1733237107,\"endTime\":1733237108},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Well, wouldn''t you love to talk about uncovering student post secondary pathways right now? Is that what this. \",\"startTime\":1733237112,\"endTime\":1733237120},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"100%.\",\"startTime\":1733237118,\"endTime\":1733237119},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"OK hello, this is my first time doing this. Oh we have a nice breaker.\",\"startTime\":1733237123,\"endTime\":1733237128},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"I guess me as well, I guess. Oh wait, here''s the an icebreaker share of fun. \",\"startTime\":1733237124,\"endTime\":1733237129},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Share a fun fact about all of it during high school that helps shape your career path in high school. \",\"startTime\":1733237129,\"endTime\":1733237139},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"I.\",\"startTime\":1733237145,\"endTime\":1733237145},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"I did Spanish all four years of high school and my 4th year we didn''t have a a Spanish 4 so my teacher like set me up with a like an eld classroom at an elementary school and I went and worked there an hour a day and. \",\"startTime\":1733237148,\"endTime\":1733237164},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"That was pretty cool. I think that would probably influenced my decision to \",\"startTime\":1733237165,\"endTime\":1733237168},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"work in the classroom, but I don''t know. \",\"startTime\":1733237168,\"endTime\":1733237171},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"That''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1733237172,\"endTime\":1733237173},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"I had, like most teenagers, had no freaking clue on what I wanted to do.\",\"startTime\":1733237175,\"endTime\":1733237181},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"So it would have been just outside of high school my first year or second year of college, I decided to be a girls golf coach or got lucky to be hired on to be a girls golf coach. And just teaching the game of golf really instilled a \",\"startTime\":1733237183,\"endTime\":1733237196},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Oh, fine.\",\"startTime\":1733237192,\"endTime\":1733237192},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"love and a passion for connecting with youth and teaching youth. And my wife \",\"startTime\":1733237196,\"endTime\":1733237200},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"was like, why don''t you like go get your teaching credentials? And I was like, \",\"startTime\":1733237200,\"endTime\":1733237204},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"oh, that''s a great idea. So then I did and that''s all she wrote. And it was, \",\"startTime\":1733237204,\"endTime\":1733237208},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"it was such a great. \",\"startTime\":1733237208,\"endTime\":1733237213},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"There you go. Yeah, I know. It''s funny when you think back on the pathways, \",\"startTime\":1733237212,\"endTime\":1733237219},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Experience for me and who knows, who knows what I would be doing if I didn''t do that. So. \",\"startTime\":1733237213,\"endTime\":1733237217},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"like, yeah, so you are at a tiny school, right? Am I wrong? Mid, mid size school. \",\"startTime\":1733237219,\"endTime\":1733237227},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I would say yeah, we''re, we''re small. You know, we''re, we''re a single \",\"startTime\":1733237229,\"endTime\":1733237234},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"high school district, right. So we have our last P223 for October, we''re at \",\"startTime\":1733237234,\"endTime\":1733237239},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"9099 through 12. So pretty, pretty small in comparison to to many of the like \",\"startTime\":1733237239,\"endTime\":1733237244},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"That''s kind of nice, yeah, Yeah. Do you have do a lot of your students out there \",\"startTime\":1733237244,\"endTime\":1733237249},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"3A or 4A high schools. \",\"startTime\":1733237244,\"endTime\":1733237249},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"access running start programs? \",\"startTime\":1733237249,\"endTime\":1733237253},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"We do. It''s gone down significantly. I would say from about two years ago, we \",\"startTime\":1733237257,\"endTime\":1733237263},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"had upwards of 90 students that would go to running start. Now this year we''re \",\"startTime\":1733237263,\"endTime\":1733237269},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"down to 30. So it''s gone down significantly, partly because we''ve added so many \",\"startTime\":1733237269,\"endTime\":1733237275},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237274,\"endTime\":1733237275},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"colleges in the high school classes, which has been a super, super big lifesaver. \",\"startTime\":1733237275,\"endTime\":1733237282},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Because kids are accessing college level content but also passing the classes which is super big. Or as running start they don''t. \",\"startTime\":1733237283,\"endTime\":1733237290},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"So it''s, it''s been, it''s been a huge headache relief. I''m sure the community \",\"startTime\":1733237291,\"endTime\":1733237294},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"colleges of Spokane doesn''t really appreciate it, but that''s where we''re at. \",\"startTime\":1733237294,\"endTime\":1733237298},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"How about you? \",\"startTime\":1733237298,\"endTime\":1733237302},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Too bad. Yeah, we have. So we in a budget cut shifted from a four period AB \",\"startTime\":1733237302,\"endTime\":1733237307},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"rotation schedule that we''ve been in for like 8 years. \",\"startTime\":1733237307,\"endTime\":1733237312},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"To a just traditional six period day this year and we had a huge we already have a lot of kids accessing Wenatchee Valley College is a pretty robust system and just proximity wise so close. \",\"startTime\":1733237313,\"endTime\":1733237326},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Inaccessible so this year we have almost 400 students in running start out of our 2000 sorry my dog wants in and and next year projected to be closer to almost 500 if the if we continue on that trend. So we actually are right in the works \",\"startTime\":1733237328,\"endTime\":1733237344},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1733237335,\"endTime\":1733237336},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"of creating a high school through central. \",\"startTime\":1733237344,\"endTime\":1733237349},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Come on, let''s go an A A program with college and the high school like we''re almost matriculated to where we can do it within the next year. So we''re really. \",\"startTime\":1733237352,\"endTime\":1733237360},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Working to pull that back and the state is now saying that you can offer one full credit for a semester class at college and the high school semester class. \",\"startTime\":1733237361,\"endTime\":1733237371},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"So we are actually offering next year an opportunity for kids to come to our campus and take 3 college and the high school courses and then have release for the rest of the day, which only is going to give us only going to give us half half an FTE for them but it''s. \",\"startTime\":1733237371,\"endTime\":1733237390},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, it''s something, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237387,\"endTime\":1733237391},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"We feel like the offset will be good. And Sam, and just like what you said, \",\"startTime\":1733237392,\"endTime\":1733237396},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"families are kids are gonna be more supportive. I mean most of the community \",\"startTime\":1733237396,\"endTime\":1733237400},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"classes, college classes that we have are online still. So it''s it''s just not \",\"startTime\":1733237400,\"endTime\":1733237404},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"a great way for our kids to be learning at at least at high levels for the 1st 17 year, 1617 year old. I don''t think so. Yeah. So we''re kind of in the process \",\"startTime\":1733237404,\"endTime\":1733237412},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"of figuring out that and that I have nothing to do with that. It''s all our CTE \",\"startTime\":1733237412,\"endTime\":1733237416},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"director, but. \",\"startTime\":1733237416,\"endTime\":1733237420},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"That''s cool. I would say, I would say as you''re as you''re going into it, I know, \",\"startTime\":1733237420,\"endTime\":1733237426},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"It''s been pretty cool.\",\"startTime\":1733237421,\"endTime\":1733237422},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"I know Zilla doesn''t does a really good job, right. They were like kind of the \",\"startTime\":1733237426,\"endTime\":1733237431},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"the sort of first people to do it as far as giving a as we, we partner with Eastern Washington University, Central Washington University and UW. \",\"startTime\":1733237431,\"endTime\":1733237442},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"I would say by far, Eastern Washington University is 10 out of 10.\",\"startTime\":1733237444,\"endTime\":1733237449},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"As far as course offerings making it accessible for teachers, it doesn''t feel like such a heavy lift. \",\"startTime\":1733237450,\"endTime\":1733237456},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237456,\"endTime\":1733237459},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"And the application process was super simple. All they, all they do is like \",\"startTime\":1733237457,\"endTime\":1733237461},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"verify any supplemental curriculum that''s being used and syllabi and all those things. And outside of that, it''s pretty easy. And our teachers have been loving \",\"startTime\":1733237461,\"endTime\":1733237470},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"it. And I mean, even our leadership class, our ASB leadership class is called \",\"startTime\":1733237470,\"endTime\":1733237475},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237471,\"endTime\":1733237471},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"the high school this year. It''s communicate, it''s communication studies 2O1, \",\"startTime\":1733237475,\"endTime\":1733237479},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237478,\"endTime\":1733237479},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"which OK, I love that, but. \",\"startTime\":1733237479,\"endTime\":1733237484},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237482,\"endTime\":1733237483},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"They''re they''re learning about leadership styles and they get college credit for being a leader in the school. \",\"startTime\":1733237484,\"endTime\":1733237487},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, that''s cool. Ours is, yeah, we just got our CTE certified, so that''s \",\"startTime\":1733237488,\"endTime\":1733237492},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Super cool.\",\"startTime\":1733237489,\"endTime\":1733237490},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"what her next year plan is to, to get that. Yeah. I think if it''s weird, Eastern \",\"startTime\":1733237492,\"endTime\":1733237495},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"is feels like they accept instructors a lot more easily than Central does. Like \",\"startTime\":1733237495,\"endTime\":1733237499},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Central''s pushed back on some of my teachers and then we just go to Eastern, but. \",\"startTime\":1733237499,\"endTime\":1733237506},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1733237504,\"endTime\":1733237505},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"I don''t know.\",\"startTime\":1733237510,\"endTime\":1733237511},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"I have not, I have not had the best experience with, with central and, and part of me, I don''t know if you''ve ever experienced or felt this, but you know, Zilla does a great job of, of offering all these courses. But then part of me wonders, \",\"startTime\":1733237511,\"endTime\":1733237525},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"you know, the populations of families that I serve aren''t necessarily high functioning to the point where if their child had six different college transcripts that they would be able to navigate all of that. \",\"startTime\":1733237525,\"endTime\":1733237539},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237539,\"endTime\":1733237542},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Umm, you know, in in an equitable fashion, and that''s a that''s a challenge for us because even having like 3 separate has proven to be a challenge for families. \",\"startTime\":1733237542,\"endTime\":1733237551},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"So part of me wonders. Part of me wonders is like, you know, are we doing what''s \",\"startTime\":1733237551,\"endTime\":1733237556},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Totally. Yeah. Yes, I agree. Yeah. Cool. Well, did we accomplish the task today? \",\"startTime\":1733237552,\"endTime\":1733237558},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"best for families? Are we just doing what''s best for like retaining running \",\"startTime\":1733237556,\"endTime\":1733237560},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"I don''t know. Mine says waiting for partner. It''s spinning. Do you have to? \",\"startTime\":1733237558,\"endTime\":1733237564},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"stars, shooting? So like, that''s what that''s what I I worry about, but I don''t \",\"startTime\":1733237560,\"endTime\":1733237565},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Oh, wait. Oh, no. OK. \",\"startTime\":1733237564,\"endTime\":1733237570},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"know, it''d be nice to just have it through 1 college. \",\"startTime\":1733237565,\"endTime\":1733237569},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"But I know that''s a pie in the sky. That''s a pie in the sky idea, but it''d be \",\"startTime\":1733237570,\"endTime\":1733237572},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"great. \",\"startTime\":1733237572,\"endTime\":1733237574},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Sweet. I think I don''t know. What does partner ready mean? Is that is that what \",\"startTime\":1733237580,\"endTime\":1733237584},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"it says on yours? Oh, I I had AI had. OK. What''s this one do you currently have \",\"startTime\":1733237584,\"endTime\":1733237588},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"in place to help students pursue? Yeah, we did that. \",\"startTime\":1733237588,\"endTime\":1733237592},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"I think we did that OK switch.\",\"startTime\":1733237597,\"endTime\":1733237599},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"I think we did that. I agree with you. It''s we same thing like we have so many \",\"startTime\":1733237606,\"endTime\":1733237610},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"families and students that we, we want them to continue on, but we don''t want to make it harder than it needs to be on them. So. \",\"startTime\":1733237610,\"endTime\":1733237618},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Here we go.\",\"startTime\":1733237621,\"endTime\":1733237621},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"My card is shut off so I was like oh OK.\",\"startTime\":1733237623,\"endTime\":1733237626},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Alright, next I''m going to four out of five.\",\"startTime\":1733237626,\"endTime\":1733237630},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Greatest reason?\",\"startTime\":1733237638,\"endTime\":1733237639},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"I think just, well, relevancy, right? They have to feel like it''s relevant.\",\"startTime\":1733237642,\"endTime\":1733237648},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"To to them and they have to feel like it''s doable. I mean, we have such a large \",\"startTime\":1733237650,\"endTime\":1733237655},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733237650,\"endTime\":1733237651},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"population of students who live in multi generational households that and contribute that that kind of is hard for them. Sometimes they think they just need to go \",\"startTime\":1733237655,\"endTime\":1733237665},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"to work and going to work is like going to the orchards. \",\"startTime\":1733237665,\"endTime\":1733237671},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I would, I would say another thing too is from our families, the conversations of post secondary efforts aren''t happening at home like at all. So yeah, they \",\"startTime\":1733237672,\"endTime\":1733237681},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"get it through advisory once a week and they have any access to our college and career readiness or our future ready counselor. But aside from that, if \",\"startTime\":1733237681,\"endTime\":1733237690},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"they''re only getting it, you know, 6 hours a day. \",\"startTime\":1733237690,\"endTime\":1733237694},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"It can be a lot for a kid, especially if they''re already dealing with like mental health struggles. So I think it''s it''s. \",\"startTime\":1733237695,\"endTime\":1733237701},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1733237700,\"endTime\":1733237702},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"The goal of, I would say of the district that I''m in, but also of the building is to start creating more like financial aid nights and more like, like future \",\"startTime\":1733237703,\"endTime\":1733237713},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"ready nights where we''re getting families in, giving them food, like having these intentional conversations so that we can get parents excited about what their kids teachers are going to look like. Because it''s just not happening. \",\"startTime\":1733237713,\"endTime\":1733237727},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah, I agree. I agree for sure. You remind me what your high school \",\"startTime\":1733237726,\"endTime\":1733237732},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"No, it''s East Valley Spokane. Yeah. So we''re we are. \",\"startTime\":1733237727,\"endTime\":1733237732},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"is. It''s not Central Valley, is it? Oh, East Valley, E Drive. OK, Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1733237732,\"endTime\":1733237738},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"OK, OK.\",\"startTime\":1733237746,\"endTime\":1733237748},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"The poorest district in like Spokane proper, I would say. So just the high school \",\"startTime\":1733237749,\"endTime\":1733237756},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"right now we are at 62.7% reported for reduced lunch. If I were to if I were \",\"startTime\":1733237756,\"endTime\":1733237762},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"to bet based upon what I see every day, we''re we''re probably close to more like 75. It''s just we have families that don''t fill it out so but. \",\"startTime\":1733237762,\"endTime\":1733237768},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1733237763,\"endTime\":1733237763},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237767,\"endTime\":1733237769},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"We have, we have lots of, lots of struggles. So.\",\"startTime\":1733237768,\"endTime\":1733237771},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Well, carry on my friend. Have a great have a great rest of your time before \",\"startTime\":1733237774,\"endTime\":1733237778},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Likewise, likewise. OK, sounds good. Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1733237776,\"endTime\":1733237780},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"your break and. \",\"startTime\":1733237778,\"endTime\":1733237782},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"We''ll catch you on the flip side, I don''t know if we''re done. I acted like we \",\"startTime\":1733237783,\"endTime\":1733237785},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"were signing off, but I don''t know if that''s what happens. Oh, thank you. I \",\"startTime\":1733237785,\"endTime\":1733237788},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"already did that. \",\"startTime\":1733237788,\"endTime\":1733237790},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, we used to see. We''re so good at this is insane.\",\"startTime\":1733237790,\"endTime\":1733237793}]"', '2025-05-08 03:17:46.306751+00', '2025-05-08 03:17:46.306751+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 691, "created_at": "2025-05-08T03:17:46.276Z", "session_title": "Uncovering Student Post-Secondary Access Realities", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1323", "name": "Uncovering Student Post-Secondary Access Realities", "tags": [{"name": "HSLC"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
